(254, 499932, 'The Devil All the Time', 'Antonio Campos', 'Tom Holland, Robert Pattinson, Bill Skarsgård, Riley Keough, Jason Clarke, Sebastian Stan', 'Antonio Campos, Paulo Campos', 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 2020, 'Nine Stories Productions, BorderLine Films, Bronx Moving Co.', '138', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVL7LGq528h3KzeNI90HOVbV5uW.jpg', 'In Knockemstiff, Ohio and its neighboring backwoods, sinister characters converge around young Arvin Russell as he fights the evil forces that threaten him and his family.'),
(255, 619264, 'The Platform', 'Galder Gaztelu-Urrutia', 'Ivan Massagué, Antonia San Juan, Zorion Eguileor, Emilio Buale, Alexandra Masangkay, Zihara Llana', 'Pedro Rivero, David Desola', 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 2019, 'Basque Films, Mr. Miyagi, EiTB, TVE', '95', 3.5, 'ES', 'Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXvQnzy6JCAx1PiQEKXuTY04ZHl.jpg', 'A slab of food descends down a vertical facility. The residents above eat heartily, leaving those below starving and desperate. A rebellion is imminent.'),
