(269, 62213, 'Dark Shadows', 'Tim Burton', 'Johnny Depp, Michelle Pfeiffer, Eva Green, Helena Bonham Carter, Chloë Grace Moretz, Bella Heathcote', 'Seth Grahame-Smith', 'Comedy, Fantasy', 2012, 'Village Roadshow Pictures, Infinitum Nihil, GK Films, The Zanuck Company, Warner Bros. Pictures', '113', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fd9Ck4cxVlmtXsbeGtQW7WFuUFI.jpg', 'Vampire Barnabas Collins is inadvertently freed from his tomb and emerges into the very changed world of 1972. He returns to Collinwood Manor to find that his once-grand estate and family have fallen into ruin.'),
(270, 8275, 'American Pie Presents: The Naked Mile', 'Joe Nussbaum', 'John White, Jessy Schram, Steve Talley, Christopher McDonald, Eugene Levy, Ross Thomas', 'Joe Nussbaum', 'Comedy', 2006, 'Rogue Pictures, Neo Art & Logic', '97', 2.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CPJVJrqVjibP5Uub8yCg4FKtJi.jpg', 'When Erik Stifler realizes that he\'s the only Stifler family member who might graduate high school a virgin, he decides to live up to his legacy. After some well-meaning advice from Jim\'s dad, Erik\'s ready to take his chances at the annual and infamous Naked Mile race, where his devoted friends and some uninhibited sorority girls will create the most outrageous weekend ever.'),
(271, 8277, 'American Pie Presents: Beta House', 'Andrew Waller', 'John White, Jake Siegel, Steve Talley, Christopher McDonald, Eugene Levy, Meghan Heffern', 'Andrew Waller', 'Comedy', 2007, 'Rogue Pictures, Neo Art & Logic', '89', 2.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7eGbwVb9hTaRFWMlSa7C1OYp3T.jpg', 'Erik, Ryan, and Cooze start college and pledge the Beta House fraternity, presided over by none other than legendary Dwight Stifler. But chaos ensues when a fraternity of geeks threatens to stop the debauchery and the Betas have to make a stand for their right to party.'),
(272, 8274, 'American Pie Presents: Band Camp', 'Steve Rash', 'Tad Hilgenbrink, Arielle Kebbel, Jason Earles, Crystle Lightning, Jun Hee Lee, Omar Benson Miller', 'Steve Rash', 'Comedy', 2005, 'Rogue Pictures, Universal Pictures', '94', 2.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BgKeWEGROpWwEWvpw7vwfTCr9C.jpg', 'Everyone has \'moved on\', except for Sherman and Jim Levenstein\'s still understanding father. Little Matt Stiffler wants to join his older brother Steve\'s business and, after everything Matt has heard from Jim\'s band-geek wife, he plans to go back to band camp and make a video of his own.'),
(273, 223702, 'Sausage Party', 'Greg Tiernan', 'Seth Rogen, Kristen Wiig, Jonah Hill, Bill Hader, Michael Cera, James Franco', 'Seth Rogen, Kyle Hunter, Ariel Shaffir', 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 2016, 'Columbia Pictures, Annapurna Pictures, Point Grey Pictures, Nitrogen Studios Canada', '89', 2.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNgdPJQ5CI60oEiiHLKRNrsDhMy.jpg', 'Hot dog Frank leads a group of supermarket products on a quest to discover the truth about their existence and what really happens when they\'re chosen to leave the grocery store.'),
(274, 301337, 'Downsizing', 'Alexander Payne', 'Matt Damon, Christoph Waltz, Hong Chau, Kristen Wiig, Rolf Lassgård, Ingjerd Egeberg', 'Jim Taylor, Alexander Payne', 'Drama, Science Fiction, Comedy', 2017, 'Ad Hominem Enterprises, Gran Via Productions, Paramount Pictures', '135', 2.7, 'US', 'Norsk, English, Español, Tiếng Việt, Íslenska', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bNzInSSAXfr0MFlHfb4IoQePVx.jpg', 'A kindly occupational therapist undergoes a new procedure to be shrunken to four inches tall so that he and his wife can help save the planet and afford a nice lifestyle at the same time.'),
(275, 1954, 'The Butterfly Effect', 'Eric Bress', 'Ashton Kutcher, Amy Smart, Melora Walters, Elden Henson, William Lee Scott, Eric Stoltz', 'J. Mackye Gruber, Eric Bress', 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 2004, 'FilmEngine, Katalyst Films, BenderSpink, New Line Cinema', '113', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ea5iv7TWMh18fOKoRGgmtcg85Gx.jpg', 'A young man struggles to access sublimated childhood memories. He finds a technique that allows him to travel back into the past, to occupy his childhood body and change history. However, he soon finds that every change he makes has unexpected consequences.'),
(276, 181812, 'Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker', 'J.J. Abrams', 'Carrie Fisher, Mark Hamill, Daisy Ridley, Adam Driver, John Boyega, Oscar Isaac', 'Chris Terrio, J.J. Abrams', 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 2019, 'Lucasfilm Ltd., Bad Robot', '142', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/db32LaOibwEliAmSL2jjDF6oDdj.jpg', 'The surviving Resistance faces the First Order once again as the journey of Rey, Finn and Poe Dameron continues. With the power and knowledge of generations behind them, the final battle begins.'),
(277, 433, 'Mary Poppins', 'Robert Stevenson', 'Julie Andrews, Dick Van Dyke, David Tomlinson, Glynis Johns, Hermione Baddeley, Karen Dotrice', 'Don DaGradi, Bill Walsh', 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 1964, 'Walt Disney Productions', '139', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4Wsby4ydIXhWmtmfvb451D5Np1.jpg', 'In turn of the century London, a magical nanny employs music and adventure to help two neglected children become closer to their father.'),
(278, 9502, 'Kung Fu Panda', 'Mark Osborne', 'Jack Black, Dustin Hoffman, Angelina Jolie, Ian McShane, Seth Rogen, Lucy Liu', 'Glenn Berger, Jonathan Aibel', 'Action, Animation, Comedy, Family', 2008, 'DreamWorks Animation', '90', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWt4JYXTg5Wr3xBW2phBrMKgp3x.jpg', 'Chosen by prophecy but doubted by all, Po is an unlikely choice for the mystical title of the Dragon Warrior—a clumsy panda thrust into the world of kung fu as a deadly enemy threatens the Valley of Peace. Under reluctant guidance by Master Shifu and the Furious Five, Po must embrace who he is to unlock the power that no scroll can teach.'),
(279, 121734, 'Tad, the Lost Explorer', 'Enrique Gato', 'Óscar Barberán, Michelle Jenner, José Mota, Pep Anton Muñoz, Miguel Ángel Jenner, Luis Posada', 'Verónica Fernández, Jordi Gasull, Javier López Barreira', 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 2012, 'StudioCanal, Lightbox Entertainment, Ikiru Films, Telefónica Studios, El Toro Pictures, Canal+, ICEC, Telecinco Cinema', '92', 3.2, 'ES', 'Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmysxjUJkYmp6CmjNOKOeHMOzFA.jpg', 'Tad is a celebrity archaeologist and adventurer just like his hero Max Mordon... in his dreams! In reality, Tad is a Chicago construction worker. One day, however, he is mistaken for a real professor and takes his place on a flight to Peru in search of the lost city of Paititi.'),
(280, 530915, '1917', 'Sam Mendes', 'George MacKay, Dean-Charles Chapman, Mark Strong, Andrew Scott, Richard Madden, Claire Duburcq', 'Sam Mendes', 'War, Drama, History', 2019, 'DreamWorks Pictures, Reliance Entertainment, New Republic Pictures, Neal Street Productions, Mogambo Films', '119', 4.0, 'US', 'English, Français, Deutsch', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZf0KyrE25z1sage4SYFLCCrMi9.jpg', 'At the height of the First World War, two young British soldiers must cross enemy territory and deliver a message that will stop a deadly attack on hundreds of soldiers.'),
(281, 417859, 'Puss in Boots', 'Chris Miller', 'Antonio Banderas, Salma Hayek Pinault, Zach Galifianakis, Billy Bob Thornton, Amy Sedaris, Constance Marie', 'Tom Wheeler', 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 2011, 'DreamWorks Animation', '90', 3.3, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7a5Jzjr9TmffGy76y1SZhn3sCiz.jpg', 'Long before he even met Shrek, the notorious fighter, lover and outlaw Puss in Boots becomes a hero when he sets off on an adventure with the tough and street smart Kitty Softpaws and the mastermind Humpty Dumpty to save his town. This is the true story of The Cat, The Myth, The Legend... The Boots.'),
(282, 374720, 'Dunkirk', 'Christopher Nolan', 'Fionn Whitehead, Tom Hardy, Mark Rylance, Kenneth Branagh, Cillian Murphy, Barry Keoghan', 'Christopher Nolan', 'War, Action, Drama', 2017, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Syncopy, RatPac Entertainment', '107', 3.7, 'US', 'English, Français, Deutsch', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4Oe15CGLL61Ped0RAS9JpqdmCt.jpg', 'The story of the miraculous evacuation of Allied soldiers from Belgium, Britain, Canada and France, who were cut off and surrounded by the German army from the beaches and harbour of Dunkirk between May 26th and June 4th 1940 during World War II.'),
(283, 44896, 'Rango', 'Gore Verbinski', 'Johnny Depp, Isla Fisher, Ned Beatty, Bill Nighy, Abigail Breslin, Alfred Molina', 'Gore Verbinski', 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Western, Adventure', 2011, 'Paramount Pictures, Blind Wink, Nickelodeon Movies, GK Films', '107', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5MP1guV8pbruieG0tnpPIbaJtt.jpg', 'When Rango, a lost family pet, accidentally winds up in the gritty, gun-slinging Western town of Dirt, the theater-loving lizard suddenly finds himself the newly appointed sheriff. Welcomed as the last hope the town has been waiting for, Rango is forced to play his new role to the hilt and uncover the truth behind a looming water crisis—before his act catches up with him.'),
(284, 14306, 'Marley & Me', 'David Frankel', 'Owen Wilson, Jennifer Aniston, Eric Dane, Kathleen Turner, Alan Arkin, Nathan Gamble', 'Scott Frank, Don Roos', 'Comedy, Family', 2008, 'Sunswept Entertainment, Dune Entertainment III', '115', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnB6hjTKylb0Ve2nUWt16gzkErr.jpg', 'A newly married couple, in the process of starting a family, learn many of life\'s important lessons from their trouble-loving retriever, Marley. Packed with plenty of laughs to lighten the load, the film explores the highs and lows of marriage, maturity and confronting one\'s own mortality, as seen through the lens of family life with a dog.'),
(285, 109439, 'The Hangover Part III', 'Todd Phillips', 'Bradley Cooper, Ed Helms, Zach Galifianakis, Justin Bartha, Ken Jeong, John Goodman', 'Todd Phillips', 'Comedy', 2013, 'Green Hat Films, Legendary Pictures, BenderSpink', '100', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtxuPWkdllLNLVyGjKYa267ntuH.jpg', 'This time, there\'s no wedding. No bachelor party. What could go wrong, right? But when the Wolfpack hits the road, all bets are off.'),
(286, 179538, 'Witching & Bitching', 'Álex de la Iglesia', 'Hugo Silva, Gabriel Ángel Delgado, Mario Casas, Carmen Maura, Javier Botet, Carolina Bang', 'Jorge Guerricaechevarría, Álex de la Iglesia', 'Comedy, Horror', 2013, 'Canal+ España, Enrique Cerezo, La Ferme! Productions, TeleMadrid, ARTE France Cinéma, TVE', '109', 3.2, 'ES', 'Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7w6vghlbz8xDUZRayOXma3Ax96.jpg', 'A gang of gold thieves land in a coven of witches who are preparing for an ancient ritual... and in need of a sacrifice.'),
(287, 10567, 'Dinosaur', 'Ralph Zondag', 'D. B. Sweeney, Alfre Woodard, Ossie Davis, Max Casella, Hayden Panettiere, Samuel E. Wright', 'Robert Nelson Jacobs, John Harrison', 'Adventure, Animation, Drama, Family', 2000, 'Walt Disney Feature Animation, The Secret Lab, Walt Disney Pictures', '82', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSje3FS7ycJSglowlngjsvDt7vO.jpg', 'An orphaned dinosaur raised by lemurs joins an arduous trek to a sancturary after a meteorite shower destroys his family home.'),
(288, 353491, 'The Dark Tower', 'Nikolaj Arcel', 'Idris Elba, Matthew McConaughey, Tom Taylor, Claudia Kim, Fran Kranz, Abbey Lee', 'Nikolaj Arcel, Anders Thomas Jensen, Akiva Goldsman', 'Fantasy, Action, Science Fiction', 2017, 'Columbia Pictures, MRC, Imagine Entertainment, Weed Road Pictures', '95', 2.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9GUSgddIqrroubiLsvvMRYyRy0.jpg', 'A boy haunted by visions of a parallel world aids its disillusioned guardian in preventing the destruction of the nexus of universes known as the Dark Tower.'),
(289, 384521, 'The Cloverfield Paradox', 'Julius Onah', 'Gugu Mbatha-Raw, Daniel Brühl, Chris O\'Dowd, David Oyelowo, John Ortiz, Elizabeth Debicki', 'Oren Uziel, Doug Jung', 'Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 2018, 'Paramount Pictures, Bad Robot', '102', 2.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJi2ExTcWdJR3150VPKqqtdGxsT.jpg', 'Orbiting above a planet on the brink of war, scientists test a device to solve an energy crisis and end up face-to-face with a dark alternate reality.'),
(290, 18360, 'Night at the Museum: Battle of the Smithsonian', 'Shawn Levy', 'Ben Stiller, Amy Adams, Owen Wilson, Hank Azaria, Robin Williams, Christopher Guest', 'Shawn Levy', 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action, Comedy, Family', 2009, '21 Laps Entertainment, 1492 Pictures, Dune Entertainment, 20th Century Fox', '105', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9yAQn6TyrA3gv5xZZkiMMoZsiw.jpg', 'Hapless museum night watchman Larry Daley must help his living, breathing exhibit friends out of a pickle now that they\'ve been transferred to the archives at the Smithsonian Institution. Larry\'s (mis)adventures this time include close encounters with Amelia Earhart, Abe Lincoln and Ivan the Terrible.'),
(291, 1865, 'Pirates of the Caribbean: On Stranger Tides', 'Rob Marshall', 'Johnny Depp, Penélope Cruz, Geoffrey Rush, Ian McShane, Kevin McNally, Sam Claflin', 'Terry Rossio, Ted Elliott', 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 2011, 'Walt Disney Pictures, Jerry Bruckheimer Films, Moving Picture Company', '136', 3.3, 'US, GB', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keGfSvCmYj7CvdRx36OdVrAEibE.jpg', 'When Jack crosses paths with a woman from his past, he\'s not sure if it\'s love...or if she\'s a ruthless con artist using him to find the fabled Fountain of Youth.'),
(292, 10674, 'Mulan', 'Tony Bancroft', 'Ming-Na Wen, Eddie Murphy, BD Wong, Miguel Ferrer, Harvey Fierstein, Freda Foh Shen', 'Raymond Singer, Chris Sanders, Eugenia Bostwick-Singer', 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 1998, 'Walt Disney Feature Animation, Walt Disney Pictures', '88', 4.0, 'US', 'English, 普通话', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAbexAtB0aSfP5Ay4TpWHARyVnG.jpg', 'When Imperial China calls one man from every family to defend the empire from invading Huns, a young woman disguises herself as a soldier to take her ailing father’s place. Facing ruthless invaders, brutal training, and the risk of execution if discovered, she must decide who she truly is— and what she’s willing to fight for.'),
(293, 420648, 'The Bar', 'Álex de la Iglesia', 'Blanca Suárez, Mario Casas, Carmen Machi, Secun de la Rosa, Jaime Ordóñez, Terele Pávez', 'Álex de la Iglesia', 'Horror, Thriller, Comedy', 2017, 'Nadie es Perfecto, Pokeepsie Films, Pampa Films', '102', 3.2, 'ES', 'Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYyALnKnzHLv4PoU2b447GYT8R9.jpg', 'In downtown Madrid, a series of mysterious gunshots trap a motley assortment of people in a decrepit bar.'),
(294, 583, 'Life of Brian', 'Terry Jones', 'Graham Chapman, John Cleese, Terry Gilliam, Eric Idle, Terry Jones, Michael Palin', 'Graham Chapman, John Cleese, Terry Gilliam', 'Comedy', 1979, 'Handmade Films, Python (Monty) Pictures', '94', 3.9, 'GB', 'English, Latin', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSSA64WF0M0BXnjwr2quMh6shCl.jpg', 'Brian Cohen is an average young Jewish man, but through a series of ridiculous events, he gains a reputation as the Messiah. When he\'s not dodging his followers or being scolded by his shrill mother, the hapless Brian has to contend with the pompous Pontius Pilate and acronym-obsessed members of a separatist movement. Rife with Monty Python\'s signature absurdity, the tale finds Brian\'s life paralleling Biblical lore, albeit with many more laughs.'),
(295, 1735, 'The Mummy: Tomb of the Dragon Emperor', 'Rob Cohen', 'Brendan Fraser, Maria Bello, John Hannah, Luke Ford, Isabella Leong Lok-Sze, Jet Li', 'Rob Cohen', 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 2008, 'Universal Pictures, Relativity Media, The Sommers Company, Alphaville Films, Beijing Happy Pictures, Shanghai Film Group, Internationale Filmproduktion Blackbird Erste', '112', 2.8, 'US', 'English, 普通话, ', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3acM1lX5PNWQa6r5qeMAJOxbnT.jpg', 'Archaeologist Rick O\'Connell travels to China, pitting him against an emperor from the 2,000-year-old Han dynasty who\'s returned from the dead to pursue a quest for world domination. This time, O\'Connell enlists the help of his wife and son to quash the so-called \'Dragon Emperor\' and his abuse of supernatural power.'),
(296, 57165, 'Wrath of the Titans', 'Jonathan Liebesman', 'Sam Worthington, Liam Neeson, Ralph Fiennes, Rosamund Pike, Bill Nighy, Edgar Ramírez', 'Dan Mazeau, David Leslie Johnson-McGoldrick', 'Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 2012, 'Thunder Road, Legendary Pictures, Cott Productions, Furia de Titanes II, A.I.E., Warner Bros. Pictures', '99', 2.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9n2R3xZWQ8MVZgndQoV34stS0h.jpg', 'Perseus tries to live a quieter life as a village fisherman while – dangerously weakened by humanity\'s lack of devotion – the gods are losing control of the long-imprisoned Titans and their ferocious leader, Kronos.'),
(297, 857, 'Saving Private Ryan', 'Steven Spielberg', 'Tom Hanks, Tom Sizemore, Edward Burns, Barry Pepper, Adam Goldberg, Vin Diesel', 'Steven Spielberg', 'War, Drama, History', 1998, 'DreamWorks Pictures, Paramount Pictures, Amblin Entertainment, Mutual Film Company', '169', 4.1, 'US', 'Český, Deutsch, English, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqx37cS8cpHg8U35f9U5IBlrCV3.jpg', 'As U.S. troops storm the beaches of Normandy, three brothers lie dead on the battlefield, with a fourth trapped behind enemy lines. Ranger captain John Miller and seven men are tasked with penetrating German-held territory and bringing the boy home.'),
(298, 559907, 'The Green Knight', 'David Lowery', 'Dev Patel, Alicia Vikander, Joel Edgerton, Sarita Choudhury, Sean Harris, Kate Dickie', 'David Lowery', 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 2021, 'A24, Bron Studios, Sailor Bear, Ley Line Entertainment, Wild Atlantic Pictures', '130', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/if4hw3Ou5Sav9Em7WWHj66mnywp.jpg', 'An epic fantasy adventure based on the timeless Arthurian legend, The Green Knight tells the story of Sir Gawain, King Arthur\'s reckless and headstrong nephew, who embarks on a daring quest to confront the eponymous Green Knight, a gigantic emerald-skinned stranger and tester of men.'),
(299, 315162, 'Puss in Boots: The Last Wish', 'Joel Crawford', 'Antonio Banderas, Salma Hayek Pinault, Harvey Guillén, Wagner Moura, Florence Pugh, Olivia Colman', 'Paul Fisher, Tommy Swerdlow', 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 2022, 'DreamWorks Animation', '103', 4.1, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuf6dutpsT0vSVehic3EZIqkOBt.jpg', 'Puss in Boots discovers that his passion for adventure has taken its toll: He has burned through eight of his nine lives, leaving him with only one life left. Puss sets out on an epic journey to find the mythical Last Wish and restore his nine lives.'),
(300, 9598, 'Babe', 'Chris Noonan', 'Christine Cavanaugh, Miriam Margolyes, Danny Mann, Hugo Weaving, Miriam Flynn, James Cromwell', 'George Miller, Chris Noonan', 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy, Family', 1995, 'Universal Pictures, Kennedy Miller Productions', '92', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKuQMtnbVTz9DsOnOJmlW71v4qH.jpg', 'Babe is a little pig who doesn\'t quite know his place in the world. With a bunch of odd friends, like Ferdinand the duck who thinks he is a rooster and Fly the dog he calls mum, Babe realises that he has the makings to become the greatest sheep pig of all time, and Farmer Hoggett knows it. With the help of the sheep dogs, Babe learns that a pig can be anything that he wants to be.'),
(301, 9759, 'Cellular', 'David R. Ellis', 'Kim Basinger, Chris Evans, Jason Statham, William H. Macy, Noah Emmerich, Valerie Cruz', 'Chris Morgan', 'Action, Thriller, Drama, Crime', 2004, 'Electric Entertainment', '94', 3.2, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AhD3qVfVmxz5CXDxctXwK5nmrOp.jpg', 'A young man receives an emergency phone call on his cell phone from an older woman. She claims to have been kidnapped – and the kidnappers have targeted her husband and child next.'),
(302, 26428, 'Agora', 'Alejandro Amenábar', 'Rachel Weisz, Max Minghella, Oscar Isaac, Ashraf Barhom, Michael Lonsdale, Rupert Evans', 'Alejandro Amenábar', 'Adventure, Drama, History', 2009, 'Mod Producciones, Himenóptero, Telecinco Cinema', '127', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xsFa6I5vDd2UI1AJ1tsW7BUChv.jpg', 'A historical drama set in Roman Egypt, concerning philosopher Hypatia of Alexandria and her relationship with her slave Davus, who is torn between his love for her and the possibility of gaining his freedom by joining the rising tide of Christianity.'),
(303, 423, 'The Pianist', 'Roman Polanski', 'Adrien Brody, Thomas Kretschmann, Frank Finlay, Maureen Lipman, Emilia Fox, Ed Stoppard', 'Ronald Harwood', 'Drama, War', 2002, 'R.P. Productions, Heritage Films, Studio Babelsberg, Runteam, StudioCanal', '150', 4.2, 'GB, FR, DE', 'English, Deutsch, Polski, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2hFvxCCWrTmCYwfy7yum0GKRi3Y.jpg', 'The true story of pianist Władysław Szpilman\'s experiences in Warsaw during the Nazi occupation. When the Jews of the city find themselves forced into a ghetto, Szpilman finds work playing in a café; and when his family is deported in 1942, he stays behind, works for a while as a laborer, and eventually goes into hiding in the ruins of the war-torn city.'),
(304, 210577, 'Gone Girl', 'David Fincher', 'Ben Affleck, Rosamund Pike, Neil Patrick Harris, Tyler Perry, Carrie Coon, Kim Dickens', 'Gillian Flynn', 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 2014, '20th Century Fox, Regency Enterprises, TSG Entertainment', '149', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ts996lKsxvjkO2yiYG0ht4qAicO.jpg', 'With his wife\'s disappearance having become the focus of an intense media circus, a man sees the spotlight turned on him when it\'s suspected that he may not be innocent.'),
(305, 10386, 'The Iron Giant', 'Brad Bird', 'Jennifer Aniston, Harry Connick Jr., Vin Diesel, James Gammon, Cloris Leachman, Christopher McDonald', 'Tim McCanlies, Brad Bird', 'Animation, Drama, Family, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 1999, 'Warner Bros. Feature Animation', '86', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ct04FCFLPImNG5thcPLRnVsZlmS.jpg', 'In the small town of Rockwell, Maine in October 1957, a giant metal machine befriends a nine-year-old boy and ultimately finds its humanity by unselfishly saving people from their own fears and prejudices.'),
(306, 804095, 'The Fabelmans', 'Steven Spielberg', 'Michelle Williams, Paul Dano, Seth Rogen, Gabriel LaBelle, Mateo Zoryan Francis-DeFord, Keeley Karsten', 'Steven Spielberg', 'Drama', 2022, 'Amblin Entertainment, Reliance Entertainment', '151', 3.8, 'US', 'English, עִבְרִית, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7llKkqkkJtJrTOaDLuVeUYDQ7I.jpg', 'Growing up in post-World War II era Arizona, young Sammy Fabelman aspires to become a filmmaker as he reaches adolescence, but soon discovers a shattering family secret and explores how the power of films can help him see the truth.'),
(307, 515001, 'Jojo Rabbit', 'Taika Waititi', 'Roman Griffin Davis, Thomasin McKenzie, Scarlett Johansson, Taika Waititi, Sam Rockwell, Rebel Wilson', 'Taika Waititi', 'Comedy, War, Drama', 2019, 'Fox Searchlight Pictures, Defender Films, Piki Films, TSG Entertainment', '108', 4.0, 'US', 'English, Deutsch', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mqL7VG4Ix8wmxwypmCA1HTHBky.jpg', 'Jojo, a lonely German boy during World War II has his world shaken when he learns that his single mother is hiding a Jewish girl in their home. Influenced by a buffoonish imaginary version of Adolf Hitler, he begins to question his beliefs and confront the conflict between propaganda and his own humanity.');
INSERT INTO `peliculas` (`idPelicula`, `idApi`, `nombrePelicula`, `directorPelicula`, `actorPelicula`, `guionistaPelicula`, `generoPelicula`, `anoPelicula`, `companiaPelicula`, `duracionPelicula`, `ratingAvgPelicula`, `paisPelicula`, `idiomaPelicula`, `posterPelicula`, `sinopsisPelicula`) VALUES
(308, 49046, 'All Quiet on the Western Front', 'Edward Berger', 'Felix Kammerer, Albrecht Schuch, Aaron Hilmer, Moritz Klaus, Adrian Grünewald, Edin Hasanović', 'Lesley Paterson, Ian Stokell, Edward Berger', 'War, Drama', 2022, 'Amusement Park Films, Gunpowder Films', '147', 3.9, 'DE', 'Français, English, Deutsch', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IRjbi9cADuDMKmHdLK7LaqQDKA.jpg', 'Paul Baumer and his friends Albert and Muller, egged on by romantic dreams of heroism, voluntarily enlist in the German army. Full of excitement and patriotic fervour, the boys enthusiastically march into a war they believe in. But once on the Western Front, they discover the soul-destroying horror of World War I.'),
(309, 447332, 'A Quiet Place', 'John Krasinski', 'Emily Blunt, John Krasinski, Millicent Simmonds, Noah Jupe, Cade Woodward, Leon Russom', 'Bryan Woods, Scott Beck, John Krasinski', 'Horror, Drama, Science Fiction', 2018, 'Paramount Pictures, Platinum Dunes, Sunday Night Productions', '91', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAU74GmpUk7t5iklEp3bufwDq4n.jpg', 'A family is forced to live in silence while hiding from creatures that hunt by sound.'),
(310, 57201, 'The Lone Ranger', 'Gore Verbinski', 'Johnny Depp, Armie Hammer, Tom Wilkinson, William Fichtner, Helena Bonham Carter, Barry Pepper', 'Justin Haythe, Ted Elliott, Terry Rossio', 'Action, Adventure, Western', 2013, 'Walt Disney Pictures, Jerry Bruckheimer Films, Infinitum Nihil, Blind Wink', '149', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDuJGq8biNMW7zM3w95UaDJv0KG.jpg', 'The Texas Rangers chase down a gang of outlaws led by Butch Cavendish, but the gang ambushes the Rangers, seemingly killing them all. One survivor is found, however, by an American Indian named Tonto, who nurses him back to health. The Ranger, donning a mask and riding a white stallion named Silver, teams up with Tonto to bring the unscrupulous gang and others of that ilk to justice.'),
(311, 359940, 'Three Billboards Outside Ebbing, Missouri', 'Martin McDonagh', 'Frances McDormand, Woody Harrelson, Sam Rockwell, Abbie Cornish, Lucas Hedges, Željko Ivanek', 'Martin McDonagh', 'Crime, Drama', 2017, 'Blueprint Pictures, Fox Searchlight Pictures, Film4 Productions, TSG Entertainment', '115', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRYLt8fV82tdVoDppSFTZIcJiLN.jpg', 'After seven months have passed without a culprit in her daughter\'s murder case, Mildred Hayes makes a bold move, painting three signs leading into her town with a controversial message directed at Bill Willoughby, the town\'s revered chief of police. When his second-in-command Officer Jason Dixon, an immature mother\'s boy with a penchant for violence, gets involved, the battle between Mildred and Ebbing\'s law enforcement is only exacerbated.'),
(312, 64690, 'Drive', 'Nicolas Winding Refn', 'Ryan Gosling, Carey Mulligan, Bryan Cranston, Albert Brooks, Oscar Isaac, Christina Hendricks', 'Hossein Amini', 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 2011, 'FilmDistrict, Bold Films, Marc Platt Productions, OddLot Entertainment, Motel Movies, Newbridge Film Capital', '100', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/602vevIURmpDfzbnv5Ubi6wIkQm.jpg', 'Driver is a skilled Hollywood stuntman who moonlights as a getaway driver for criminals. Though he projects an icy exterior, lately he\'s been warming up to a pretty neighbor named Irene and her young son, Benicio. When Irene\'s husband gets out of jail, he enlists Driver\'s help in a million-dollar heist. The job goes horribly wrong, and Driver must risk his life to protect Irene and Benicio from the vengeful masterminds behind the robbery.'),
(313, 141883, 'The Beasts', 'Dennis Yu Wan-Kwong', 'Eddie Chen, Patricia Chong Jing-Yee, Wong Ching, Kent Cheng Jak-Si, Chan Sing, Paul Chung Biu-Law', 'Dang Lee, Eddie Fong Ling-Ching', 'Horror, Crime', 1980, 'Pearl City Film Production Ltd.', '90', 2.4, 'HK', '广州话 / 廣州話', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uuM4eRICCix2niNH05CXgUkYTY.jpg', 'A father seeks revenge from a gang of thugs who raped his daughter and murdered his son.'),
(314, 725201, 'The Gray Man', 'Joe Russo', 'Ryan Gosling, Chris Evans, Ana de Armas, Billy Bob Thornton, Jessica Henwick, Dhanush', 'Joe Russo, Stephen McFeely, Christopher Markus', 'Action, Thriller', 2022, 'AGBO, Roth-Kirschenbaum Films', '128', 3.5, 'US', 'Český, English, Français, Deutsch, ภาษาไทย', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cXbitsS6dWQ5gfMTZdorpAAzEH.jpg', 'When a shadowy CIA agent uncovers damning agency secrets, he\'s hunted across the globe by a sociopathic rogue operative who\'s put a bounty on his head.'),
(315, 458423, 'Mamma Mia! Here We Go Again', 'Ol Parker', 'Amanda Seyfried, Lily James, Pierce Brosnan, Colin Firth, Stellan Skarsgård, Christine Baranski', 'Ol Parker', 'Comedy, Romance', 2018, 'Littlestar, Playtone', '114', 3.5, 'GB, US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWicerX4Y7n7tUwRAVHsVcBBpj2.jpg', 'Five years after meeting her three fathers, Sophie Sheridan prepares to open her mother’s hotel. In 1979, young Donna Sheridan meets the men who each could be Sophie’s biological father.'),
(316, 9800, 'Philadelphia', 'Jonathan Demme', 'Tom Hanks, Denzel Washington, Jason Robards, Mary Steenburgen, Antonio Banderas, Ron Vawter', 'Jonathan Demme', 'Drama', 1993, 'TriStar Pictures, Clinica Estetico, A Luta Continua', '126', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFe5Yoo5zT495okA49bq1vPPkiV.jpg', 'Two competing lawyers join forces to sue a prestigious law firm for AIDS discrimination. As their unlikely friendship develops, their courage overcomes the prejudice and corruption of their powerful adversaries.'),
(317, 361743, 'Top Gun: Maverick', 'Joseph Kosinski', 'Tom Cruise, Miles Teller, Jennifer Connelly, Bashir Salahuddin, Jon Hamm, Charles Parnell', 'Eric Warren Singer, Ehren Kruger, Christopher McQuarrie', 'Action, Drama', 2022, 'Skydance Media, Don Simpson/Jerry Bruckheimer Films, Paramount Pictures', '131', 4.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0YuM4f5lvGAP6MAW2kBIzugXnc.jpg', 'After more than thirty years of service as one of the Navy’s top aviators, and dodging the advancement in rank that would ground him, Pete “Maverick” Mitchell finds himself training a detachment of TOP GUN graduates for a specialized mission the likes of which no living pilot has ever seen.'),
(318, 49026, 'The Dark Knight Rises', 'Christopher Nolan', 'Christian Bale, Gary Oldman, Tom Hardy, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Anne Hathaway, Marion Cotillard', 'Jonathan Nolan, Christopher Nolan', 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 2012, 'Syncopy, Legendary Pictures, Warner Bros. Pictures, DC', '165', 3.9, 'GB, US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hr0L2aueqlP2BYUblTTjmtn0hw4.jpg', 'Following the death of District Attorney Harvey Dent, Batman assumes responsibility for Dent\'s crimes to protect the late attorney\'s reputation and is subsequently hunted by the Gotham City Police Department. Eight years later, Batman encounters the mysterious Selina Kyle and the villainous Bane, a new terrorist leader who overwhelms Gotham\'s finest. The Dark Knight resurfaces to protect a city that has branded him an enemy.'),
(319, 436969, 'The Suicide Squad', 'James Gunn', 'Margot Robbie, Idris Elba, John Cena, Joel Kinnaman, Sylvester Stallone, Viola Davis', 'James Gunn', 'Action, Comedy, Adventure', 2021, 'DC Films, Atlas Entertainment, The Safran Company, Warner Bros. Pictures', '132', 3.7, 'US', 'English, Français, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q61qEyssk2ku3okWICKArlAdhBn.jpg', 'Supervillains Harley Quinn, Bloodsport, Peacemaker and a collection of nutty cons at Belle Reve prison join the super-secret, super-shady Task Force X as they are dropped off at the remote, enemy-infused island of Corto Maltese.'),
(320, 10947, 'High School Musical', 'Kenny Ortega', 'Zac Efron, Vanessa Hudgens, Ashley French, Lucas Grabeel, Corbin Bleu, Monique Coleman', 'Peter Barsocchini', 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie, Music, Romance', 2006, 'Salty Pictures, First Street Films', '98', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DGmWZjUJPeKGFRHGCA6VPFUBML.jpg', 'A popular high school athlete and an academically gifted girl get roles in the school musical and develop a friendship that threatens East High\'s social order.'),
(321, 209112, 'Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice', 'Zack Snyder', 'Ben Affleck, Henry Cavill, Jesse Eisenberg, Gal Gadot, Amy Adams, Diane Lane', 'David S. Goyer, Chris Terrio', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 2016, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, RatPac Entertainment, Atlas Entertainment, Cruel & Unusual Films, DC', '152', 3.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UsK3grJvtQrtzEgqNlDljJW96w.jpg', 'Fearing the actions of a god-like Super Hero left unchecked, Gotham City’s own formidable, forceful vigilante takes on Metropolis’s most revered, modern-day savior, while the world wrestles with what sort of hero it really needs. And with Batman and Superman at war with one another, a new threat quickly arises, putting mankind in greater danger than it’s ever known before.'),
(322, 475557, 'Joker', 'Todd Phillips', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Robert De Niro, Zazie Beetz, Frances Conroy, Brett Cullen, Shea Whigham', 'Todd Phillips', 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 2019, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Joint Effort, Village Roadshow Pictures, Bron Studios, DC Films', '122', 4.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udDclJoHjfjb8Ekgsd4FDteOkCU.jpg', 'During the 1980s, a failed stand-up comedian is driven insane and turns to a life of crime and chaos in Gotham City while becoming an infamous psychopathic crime figure.'),
(323, 667216, 'Infinity Pool', 'Brandon Cronenberg', 'Alexander Skarsgård, Mia Goth, Cleopatra Coleman, Jalil Lespert, Adam Boncz, Amanda Brugel', 'Brandon Cronenberg', 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 2023, 'Topic Studios, Elevation Pictures, Film Forge Productions, Hero Squared, Celluloid Dreams, NEON, Téléfilm Canada, Eurimages', '118', 3.0, 'CA', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQKyNm0Nz6KWiDBQF9w4aZAmOfC.jpg', 'While staying at an isolated island resort, James and Em are enjoying a perfect vacation of pristine beaches, exceptional staff, and soaking up the sun. But guided by the seductive and mysterious Gabi, they venture outside the resort grounds and find themselves in a culture filled with violence, hedonism, and untold horror. A tragic accident leaves them facing a zero tolerance policy for crime: either you\'ll be executed, or, if you’re rich enough to afford it, you can watch yourself die instead.'),
(324, 583406, 'Judas and the Black Messiah', 'Shaka King', 'Daniel Kaluuya, LaKeith Stanfield, Jesse Plemons, Dominique Fishback, Ashton Sanders, Algee Smith', 'Will Berson, Shaka King', 'Drama, History', 2021, 'MACRO, Bron Studios, Participant, Proximity Media', '125', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIgr75GoqFxe1X5Wz9siOODGe9u.jpg', 'Bill O\'Neal infiltrates the Black Panthers on the orders of FBI Agent Mitchell and J. Edgar Hoover. As Black Panther Chairman Fred Hampton ascends—falling for a fellow revolutionary en route—a battle wages for O’Neal’s soul.'),
(325, 188403, 'Doraemon: Nobita\'s Dorabian Nights', 'Tsutomu Shibayama', 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kazuya Tatekabe, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Sachiko Chijimatsu', 'Fujiko F. Fujio', 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Family, Science Fiction', 1991, 'Shogakukan, TV Asahi, Shin-Ei Animation', '91', 3.5, 'JP', '日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJL5GgPWOvtcGo8ozEXCkFv3ub0.jpg', 'Shizuka ends up in the fantasy world of the \'Arabian Nights\' story. However, Doraemon, Nobita, Suneo, and Jyaian must find her from the imaginary Middle East and bring her back to the real life.'),
(326, 106164, 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Galaxy Super-express', 'Tsutomu Shibayama', 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Kazuya Tatekabe, Sachiko Chijimatsu', 'Fujiko F. Fujio', 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 1996, 'TOHO, Shin-Ei Animation, TV Asahi, Shogakukan', '97', 3.7, 'JP', '日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/moqO24uCB0k6q4qPyAwb7O0xeWM.jpg', 'Doraemon went missing for 3 days. But it turns out later that he went to the 22nd century to buy a mystery galactic express train ticket whose destination is a secret until the passengers arrive there and see for themselves.'),
(327, 8920, 'Garfield', 'Peter Hewitt', 'Bill Murray, Breckin Meyer, Jennifer Love Hewitt, Stephen Tobolowsky, Evan Arnold, Mark Christopher Lawrence', 'Alec Sokolow, Joel Cohen', 'Comedy, Family', 2004, 'Davis Entertainment, 20th Century Fox', '80', 2.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqwTSWNLyH55g8kBT61s2DgNYEp.jpg', 'Garfield, the fat, lazy, lasagna lover, has everything a cat could want. But when Jon, in an effort to impress the Liz - the vet and an old high-school crush - adopts a dog named Odie and brings him home, Garfield gets the one thing he doesn\'t want. Competition.'),
(328, 1584, 'The School of Rock', 'Richard Linklater', 'Jack Black, Joan Cusack, Mike White, Sarah Silverman, Miranda Cosgrove, Joey Gaydos Jr.', 'Mike White', 'Comedy, Family, Music', 2003, 'Paramount Pictures, Scott Rudin Productions, MFP Munich Film Partners New Century GmbH & Co. SOR Productions KG', '110', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXLXaepIBvFVLU25DH3wv4IPSbe.jpg', 'Fired from his band and hard up for cash, guitarist and vocalist Dewey Finn finagles his way into a job as a fifth-grade substitute teacher at a private school, where he secretly begins teaching his straight-A students the finer points of rock \'n\' roll and the power of sticking it to the man. But as the school’s stern principal closes in and the Battle of the Bands looms, Dewey must risk everything to prove that rock \'n\' roll can change lives.'),
(329, 377, 'A Nightmare on Elm Street', 'Wes Craven', 'Heather Langenkamp, Johnny Depp, Robert Englund, Amanda Wyss, Jsu Garcia, John Saxon', 'Wes Craven', 'Horror', 1984, 'New Line Cinema, Smart Egg Pictures, Media Home Entertainment, Cinema 84, The Elm Street Venture', '91', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9rMHAAKISRmIonaQd9Cccx0S4X.jpg', 'Teenagers in a small town are dropping like flies, apparently in the grip of mass hysteria causing their suicides. A cop\'s daughter, Nancy Thompson, traces the cause to child molester Fred Krueger, who was burned alive by angry parents many years before. Krueger has now come back in the dreams of his killers\' children, claiming their lives as his revenge. Nancy and her boyfriend, Glen, must devise a plan to lure the monster out of the realm of nightmares and into the real world...'),
(330, 300668, 'Annihilation', 'Alex Garland', 'Natalie Portman, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Gina Rodriguez, Tessa Thompson, Tuva Novotny, Oscar Isaac', 'Alex Garland', 'Science Fiction, Horror', 2018, 'Paramount Pictures, Skydance Media, DNA Films, Scott Rudin Productions', '115', 3.2, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YRplSk6BhH6PRuE9gfyw9byUJ6.jpg', 'A biologist signs up for a dangerous, secret expedition into a mysterious zone where the laws of nature don\'t apply.'),
(331, 569547, 'Black Mirror: Bandersnatch', 'David Slade', 'Fionn Whitehead, Craig Parkinson, Alice Lowe, Asim Chaudhry, Will Poulter, Tallulah Haddon', 'David Slade', 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Mystery', 2018, 'House of Tomorrow', '90', 3.4, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fR0VZ0VE598zl1lrYf7IfBqEwQ2.jpg', 'In 1984, a young programmer begins to question reality as he adapts a dark fantasy novel into a video game. A mind-bending tale with multiple endings.'),
(332, 1372, 'Blood Diamond', 'Edward Zwick', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Djimon Hounsou, Jennifer Connelly, Kagiso Kuypers, Arnold Vosloo, Antony Coleman', 'Charles Leavitt', 'Drama, Thriller, Action', 2006, 'Virtual Studios, Spring Creek Pictures, Bedford Falls Productions, Initial Entertainment Group, Lonely Film Productions, Warner Bros. Pictures, Liberty Pictures', '143', 3.8, 'US', 'Afrikaans, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnLxPpajkbVdbQl5B9CuD7sSpz9.jpg', 'An ex-mercenary turned smuggler. A Mende fisherman. Amid the explosive civil war overtaking 1999 Sierra Leone, these men join for two desperate missions: recovering a rare pink diamond of immense value and rescuing the fisherman\'s son, conscripted as a child soldier into the brutal rebel forces ripping a swath of torture and bloodshed countrywide.'),
(333, 473033, 'Uncut Gems', 'Benny Safdie', 'Adam Sandler, LaKeith Stanfield, Julia Fox, Kevin Garnett, Idina Menzel, Eric Bogosian', 'Josh Safdie, Benny Safdie', 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 2019, 'A24, Elara Pictures', '136', 3.6, 'US', 'English, עִבְרִית', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XN1vxHc7kUSqNWtaQKN45J5x2v.jpg', 'A charismatic New York City jeweler always on the lookout for the next big score makes a series of high-stakes bets that could lead to the windfall of a lifetime. Howard must perform a precarious high-wire act, balancing business, family, and encroaching adversaries on all sides in his relentless pursuit of the ultimate win.'),
(334, 1930, 'The Amazing Spider-Man', 'Marc Webb', 'Andrew Garfield, Emma Stone, Rhys Ifans, Denis Leary, Martin Sheen, Sally Field', 'James Vanderbilt, Alvin Sargent, Steve Kloves', 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 2012, 'Marvel Entertainment, Laura Ziskin Productions, Columbia Pictures, Matt Tolmach Productions, Arad Productions', '136', 3.4, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jexoNYnPd6vVrmygwF6QZmWPFdu.jpg', 'A teenage Peter Parker grapples with both high school and amazing super-human crises as his alter-ego Spider-Man.'),
(335, 1927, 'Hulk', 'Ang Lee', 'Eric Bana, Jennifer Connelly, Sam Elliott, Josh Lucas, Nick Nolte, Paul Kersey', 'James Schamus, John Turman, Michael France', 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action, Drama', 2003, 'Marvel Enterprises, Universal Pictures, Good Machine, Valhalla Motion Pictures', '138', 2.8, 'US', 'Español, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UllIft2jLSBaay3zQyMV4GNdfy.jpg', 'Bruce Banner, a genetics researcher with a tragic past, suffers massive radiation exposure in his laboratory that causes him to transform into a raging green monster when he gets angry.'),
(336, 138832, 'We\'re the Millers', 'Rawson Marshall Thurber', 'Jennifer Aniston, Jason Sudeikis, Emma Roberts, Will Poulter, Ed Helms, Nick Offerman', 'Bob Fisher, Steve Faber, Sean Anders', 'Comedy, Crime', 2013, 'New Line Cinema, Newman/Tooley Films, Bad Version, Slap Happy Productions, Heyday Films, BenderSpink', '110', 3.4, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qF2LJ0jwWrtXSuT4AFD5OS2IqaT.jpg', 'A veteran pot dealer creates a fake family as part of his plan to move a huge shipment of weed into the U.S. from Mexico.'),
(337, 640146, 'Ant-Man and the Wasp: Quantumania', 'Peyton Reed', 'Paul Rudd, Evangeline Lilly, Michael Douglas, Michelle Pfeiffer, Jonathan Majors, Kathryn Newton', 'Peyton Reed', 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 2023, 'Marvel Studios, Kevin Feige Productions', '125', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnqGbB22YJ7dSs4o6M7exTpNxPz.jpg', 'Super-Hero partners Scott Lang and Hope van Dyne, along with with Hope\'s parents Janet van Dyne and Hank Pym, and Scott\'s daughter Cassie Lang, find themselves exploring the Quantum Realm, interacting with strange new creatures and embarking on an adventure that will push them beyond the limits of what they thought possible.'),
(338, 236737, 'Spanish Affair', 'Emilio Martínez Lázaro', 'Clara Lago, Dani Rovira, Carmen Machi, Karra Elejalde, Alberto López, Alfonso Sánchez', 'Borja Cobeaga, Diego San José', 'Comedy, Romance', 2014, 'LAZONA, Kowalski Films, Snow Films', '98', 3.3, 'ES', 'euskera, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUbn2Dy9qWWV8VnktvuGn9YiCRL.jpg', 'Rafael, a Seville citizen who has never left the Spanish region of Andalucia, decides to leave his homeland to follow Amaia, a Basque girl unlike other women he has known.'),
(339, 254869, 'Torrente 5: Operation Eurovegas', 'Santiago Segura', 'Santiago Segura, Julián López, Jesulín de Ubrique, Fernando Esteso, Carlos Areces, Angy Fernández', 'Santiago Segura', 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 2014, 'Amiguetes Entertainment, Telefónica Studios, Atresmedia Cine, Canal+ España, ONO', '102', 2.8, 'ES', 'Español, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpx29IrhD5R7Zjg53Uw8CCb00Mc.jpg', 'Crooked cop Torrente gets out of jail in the year 2018 to find a different Spain from the one he knew.'),
(340, 399566, 'Godzilla vs. Kong', 'Adam Wingard', 'Alexander Skarsgård, Rebecca Hall, Kaylee Hottle, Brian Tyree Henry, Millie Bobby Brown, Julian Dennison', 'Max Borenstein, Eric Pearson', 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 2021, 'Legendary Pictures', '114', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pgqgaUx1cJb5oZQQ5v0tNARCeBp.jpg', 'In a time when monsters walk the Earth, humanity’s fight for its future sets Godzilla and Kong on a collision course that will see the two most powerful forces of nature on the planet collide in a spectacular battle for the ages.'),
(341, 447404, 'Pokémon Detective Pikachu', 'Rob Letterman', 'Ryan Reynolds, Justice Smith, Kathryn Newton, Bill Nighy, Ken Watanabe, Chris Geere', 'Dan Hernandez, Derek Connolly, Rob Letterman', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 2019, 'Legendary Pictures, The Pokémon Company, TOHO', '105', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhWvnFgg3BNlcUz0Re1HfQqIcCD.jpg', 'In a world where people collect pocket-size monsters (Pokémon) to do battle, a boy comes across an intelligent monster who seeks to be a detective.'),
(343, 10949, 'Oliver Twist', 'David Lean', 'John Howard Davies, Robert Newton, Alec Guinness, Kay Walsh, Francis L. Sullivan, Henry Stephenson', 'Stanley Haynes, David Lean', 'Drama, Adventure, Crime, Comedy', 1948, 'Cineguild, J. Arthur Rank Organisation', '121', 3.8, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkMdDqXI58MuW99wi9kotC8kCVM.jpg', 'When 9-year-old orphan Oliver Twist dares to ask his cruel taskmaster, Mr. Bumble, for a second serving of gruel, he\'s hired out as an apprentice. Escaping that dismal fate, young Oliver falls in with the street urchin known as the Artful Dodger and his criminal mentor, Fagin. When kindly Mr. Brownlow takes Oliver in, Fagin\'s evil henchman Bill Sikes plots to kidnap the boy.'),
(344, 287947, 'Shazam!', 'David F. Sandberg', 'Zachary Levi, Mark Strong, Asher Angel, Jack Dylan Grazer, Adam Brody, Djimon Hounsou', 'Henry Gayden', 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy', 2019, 'New Line Cinema, The Safran Company, Seven Bucks Productions, DC Films', '132', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnopI5Xtky18MPhK40cZAGAOVeV.jpg', 'A boy is given the ability to become an adult superhero in times of need with a single magic word.'),
(345, 13680, 'The Game Plan', 'Andy Fickman', 'Dwayne Johnson, Madison Pettis, Kyra Sedgwick, Roselyn Sánchez, Morris Chestnut, Hayes MacArthur', 'Nichole Millard, Kathryn Price', 'Comedy, Family', 2007, 'Monkey Dance Productions, Walt Disney Pictures, Mayhem Pictures', '110', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcLFvIqCUrhY96mkSmr3okxaMEw.jpg', 'Bachelor football star Joe Kingman seems to have it all. He is wealthy and carefree, and his team is on the way to capturing a championship. Suddenly, he is tackled by some unexpected news: He has a young daughter, the result of a last fling with his ex-wife. Joe must learn to balance his personal and professional lives with the needs of his child.'),
(346, 49047, 'Gravity', 'Alfonso Cuarón', 'Sandra Bullock, George Clooney, Ed Harris, Orto Ignatiussen, Phaldut Sharma, Amy Warren', 'Alfonso Cuarón', 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama', 2013, 'Esperanto Filmoj, Warner Bros. Pictures, Heyday Films', '91', 3.6, 'US, GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZ2nZw8D681aphje8NJi8EfbL1U.jpg', 'Dr Ryan Stone, an engineer on her first space mission, and Matt Kowalski, an astronaut on his final expedition, have to survive in space after they are hit by debris while spacewalking.'),
(347, 11007, 'Cheaper by the Dozen', 'Shawn Levy', 'Steve Martin, Bonnie Hunt, Hilary Duff, Tom Welling, Piper Perabo, Kevin G. Schmidt', 'Joel Cohen, Sam Harper, Alec Sokolow', 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 2003, '20th Century Fox, Robert Simonds Productions', '98', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afclGGoQslTYFTnyW1LRMtJMiBp.jpg', 'The Baker brood moves to Chicago after patriarch Tom gets a job coaching football at Northwestern University, forcing his writer wife, Kate, and the couple\'s 12 children to make a major adjustment. The transition works well until work demands pull the parents away from home, leaving the kids bored -- and increasingly mischievous.'),
(348, 1949, 'Zodiac', 'David Fincher', 'Jake Gyllenhaal, Mark Ruffalo, Anthony Edwards, Robert Downey Jr., Chloë Sevigny, Elias Koteas', 'James Vanderbilt', 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 2007, 'Paramount Pictures, Warner Bros. Pictures, Phoenix Pictures', '157', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6YmeO4pB7XTh8P8F960O1uA14JO.jpg', 'Over the course of a decade, editors of the San Francisco Chronicle entice themselves in the murders of the Zodiac Killer. However, as time runs its course, interest in the case dwindles in the eyes of the professionals. The Killer stops interacting with the public. However, believing he has the answers, an amateur cartoonist from the initial sightings races against time to prevent what he believes is another murder.'),
(349, 777245, 'Women Talking', 'Sarah Polley', 'Rooney Mara, Claire Foy, Jessie Buckley, Judith Ivey, Ben Whishaw, Sheila McCarthy', 'Sarah Polley', 'Drama', 2022, 'Plan B Entertainment, Hear/Say Productions, Orion Pictures', '104', 3.4, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcTc9GveMMjAdHSlzdE0FaRCtqi.jpg', 'A group of women in an isolated religious colony struggle to reconcile their faith with a series of sexual assaults committed by the colony\'s men.'),
(350, 12233, 'Oliver & Company', 'George Scribner', 'Joey Lawrence, Billy Joel, Cheech Marin, Richard Mulligan, Roscoe Lee Browne, Sheryl Lee Ralph', 'Jim Cox, James Mangold, Tim Disney', 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 1988, 'Walt Disney Pictures, Silver Screen Partners III, Walt Disney Feature Animation', '74', 3.4, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgaSqUHjm4CLOdiiJJJstVdreEe.jpg', 'Putting its own \'twist\' on the story of Oliver Twist, the orange runt of a litter of kittens must fight for survival on the rough streets on New York City, finding unlikely friends in the dogs owned by a down-on-his luck man named Fagin. Soon, Oliver and his new band of comrades must fight for survival when Fagin is unable to pay his debts.'),
(351, 58233, 'Johnny English Reborn', 'Oliver Parker', 'Rowan Atkinson, Gillian Anderson, Dominic West, Rosamund Pike, Daniel Kaluuya, Tim McInnerny', 'Hamish McColl', 'Crime, Action, Comedy', 2011, 'Working Title Films, Working Title Films', '101', 3.1, 'GB', 'Deutsch, 广州话 / 廣州話, English, 普通话, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDbrU0eSnRGh5gHc1iqTACTNNyT.jpg', 'The most prominent heads of state in the world begin gathering for a conference that could have a major impact on global politics. When MI-7 receives word that the Chinese premier has become the target of some high-powered killers, it falls on Johnny English to save the day. Armed with the latest high-tech weaponry and gadgets that would make even James Bond jealous, the once-disgraced agent uncovers evidence of a massive conspiracy involving some of the world\'s most powerful organisations, and vows to redeem his tarnished reputation by stopping the killers before they can strike.'),
(352, 11024, 'Scooby-Doo 2: Monsters Unleashed', 'Raja Gosnell', 'Freddie Prinze Jr., Sarah Michelle Gellar, Matthew Lillard, Linda Cardellini, Neil Fanning, Seth Green', 'Raja Gosnell', 'Mystery, Adventure, Comedy', 2004, 'Mosaic Media Group, Warner Bros. Pictures', '93', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BrXCJrs22bR5KR6mLHluYo6y4m.jpg', 'A masked villain wreaks mayhem on the city of Coolsville with a monster machine that creates real-life versions of Mystery Inc.\'s former foes like The 10,000 Volt Ghost, The Cotton Candy Glob, The Skelemen and The Pterodactyl Ghost. Fred, Daphne, Shaggy, Velma and Scooby-Doo launch an investigation into the monster outbreak that leaves Shaggy and Scooby questioning their roles in Mystery Inc. Eager to prove their detective skills, the ever-ravenous duo comes up with a secret plan to solve the mystery all by themselves. Can the gang unravel their most challenging case?'),
(353, 14560, 'Paul Blart: Mall Cop', 'Steve Carr', 'Kevin James, Keir O\'Donnell, Jayma Mays, Raini Rodriguez, Shirley Knight, Stephen Rannazzisi', 'Kevin James, Nick Bakay', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 2009, 'Hey Eddie, Columbia Pictures, Relativity Media, Happy Madison Productions', '91', 2.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4zZv0Q1VKURFZFEl2vwjaE2q0g.jpg', 'When a shopping mall is taken over by a gang of organized crooks, it\'s up to a mild-mannered security guard to save the day.'),
(354, 691422, 'When You Finish Saving the World', 'Jesse Eisenberg', 'Julianne Moore, Finn Wolfhard, Billy Bryk, Alisha Boe, Jack Justice, Jay O. Sanders', 'Jesse Eisenberg', 'Drama, Comedy', 2023, 'Fruit Tree, A24', '88', 2.9, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZyeoBDQJFPGfd0Mu8XIElGBjZz.jpg', 'Evelyn and her oblivious son Ziggy seek out replacements for each other. As Evelyn tries to parent an unassuming teenager at her shelter, Ziggy fumbles through his pursuit of a brilliant young woman at school.'),
(355, 615777, 'Babylon', 'Damien Chazelle', 'Diego Calva, Margot Robbie, Brad Pitt, Jovan Adepo, Jean Smart, J.C. Currais', 'Damien Chazelle', 'Drama, Comedy', 2022, 'Paramount Pictures, Marc Platt Productions, C2 Motion Picture Group, Organism Pictures, Wild Chickens Productions', '189', 3.7, 'US', '广州话 / 廣州話, English, Deutsch, Italiano, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjOHjWCUE0YzDiEzKv8AfqHj3ir.jpg', 'A tale of outsized ambition and outrageous excess, tracing the rise and fall of multiple characters in an era of unbridled decadence and depravity during Hollywood\'s transition from silent films to sound films in the late 1920s.'),
(356, 965150, 'Aftersun', 'Charlotte Wells', 'Paul Mescal, Frankie Corio, Brooklyn Toulson, Celia Rowlson-Hall, Sally Messham, Ayşe Parlak', 'Charlotte Wells', 'Drama', 2022, 'PASTEL, BBC Film, Tango Entertainment, Unified Theory, Screen Scotland, BFI', '101', 3.8, 'US', 'Türkçe, English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evKz85EKouVbIr51zy5fOtpNRPg.jpg', 'Sophie reflects on the shared joy and private melancholy of a holiday she took with her father twenty years earlier. Memories fill the gaps between camcorder footages as she tries to reconcile the father she knew with the troubled man she didn\'t.'),
(357, 76, 'Before Sunrise', 'Richard Linklater', 'Ethan Hawke, Julie Delpy, Andrea Eckert, Hanno Pöschl, Karl Bruckschwaiger, Tex Rubinowitz', 'Richard Linklater', 'Drama, Romance', 1995, 'Castle Rock Entertainment, Detour Filmproduction, Filmhaus Films', '101', 4.0, 'US', 'English, Deutsch, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kf1Jb1c2JAOqjuzA3H4oDM263uB.jpg', 'An unexpected meeting on a train leads two travelers to spend an evening wandering through Vienna. As the night unfolds, they share stories and conversations about life and love, exploring new ideas while a quiet intimacy grows between them, knowing it may be their only night together.'),
(358, 414906, 'The Batman', 'Matt Reeves', 'Robert Pattinson, Zoë Kravitz, Jeffrey Wright, Colin Farrell, Paul Dano, John Turturro', 'Matt Reeves', 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 2022, '6th & Idaho Motion Picture Company, Dylan Clark Productions, DC Films, Warner Bros. Pictures', '177', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74xTEgt7R36Fpooo50r9T25onhq.jpg', 'In his second year of fighting crime, Batman uncovers corruption in Gotham City that connects to his own family while facing a serial killer known as the Riddler.'),
(359, 9806, 'The Incredibles', 'Brad Bird', 'Craig T. Nelson, Holly Hunter, Sarah Vowell, Spencer Fox, Jason Lee, Samuel L. Jackson', 'Brad Bird', 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Family', 2004, 'Pixar', '115', 3.9, 'US', 'Français, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LqaLgk4Z226KkgPJuiOQ58wvrm.jpg', 'Bob Parr has given up his superhero days to log in time as an insurance adjuster and raise his three children with his formerly heroic wife in suburbia. But when he receives a mysterious assignment, it\'s time to get back into costume.'),
(360, 281957, 'The Revenant', 'Alejandro G. Iñárritu', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Tom Hardy, Domhnall Gleeson, Will Poulter, Forrest Goodluck, Duane Howard', 'Mark L. Smith, Alejandro G. Iñárritu', 'Western, Drama, Adventure', 2015, 'Monarchy Enterprises S.a.r.l., Regency Enterprises, Appian Way, CatchPlay, Anonymous Content, New Regency Pictures, Hong Kong Alpha Motion Pictures Co., M Productions, RatPac Entertainment', '157', 3.8, 'US', 'English, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ji3ecJphATlVgWNY0B0RVXZizdf.jpg', 'In the 1820s, a frontiersman, Hugh Glass, sets out on a path of vengeance against those who left him for dead after a bear mauling.'),
(361, 524434, 'Eternals', 'Chloé Zhao', 'Gemma Chan, Richard Madden, Angelina Jolie, Salma Hayek Pinault, Kumail Nanjiani, Lia McHugh', 'Patrick Burleigh, Ryan Firpo, Kaz Firpo', 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 2021, 'Marvel Studios', '156', 3.4, 'US', 'العربية, English, हिन्दी, Latin, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFByFSLV5WDJEv3KabbdAF959F2.jpg', 'The Eternals are a team of ancient aliens who have been living on Earth in secret for thousands of years. When an unexpected tragedy forces them out of the shadows, they are forced to reunite against mankind’s most ancient enemy, the Deviants.'),
(362, 595586, 'Causeway', 'Lila Neugebauer', 'Jennifer Lawrence, Brian Tyree Henry, Linda Emond, Jayne Houdyshell, Stephen McKinley Henderson, Russell Harvard', 'Lila Neugebauer', 'Drama', 2022, 'Excellent Cadaver, IAC Films, A24, IPR.VC', '94', 3.2, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUzKIqFIS05Ss31zRTfZfHJIgDP.jpg', 'A US soldier suffers a traumatic brain injury while fighting in Afghanistan and struggles to adjust to life back home in New Orleans. When she meets local mechanic James, the pair begin to forge an unexpected bond.'),
(363, 500840, 'I\'m Thinking of Ending Things', 'Charlie Kaufman', 'Jesse Plemons, Jessie Buckley, Toni Collette, David Thewlis, Guy Boyd, Hadley Robinson', 'Charlie Kaufman', 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 2020, 'Likely Story, Projective Testing Service', '135', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ynWWapdl45hJXUh0KIevxSG9JQ.jpg', 'Nothing is as it seems when a woman experiencing misgivings about her new boyfriend joins him on a road trip to meet his parents at their remote farm.'),
(364, 38757, 'Tangled', 'Nathan Greno', 'Mandy Moore, Zachary Levi, Donna Murphy, Ron Perlman, M.C. Gainey, Jeffrey Tambor', 'Dan Fogelman', 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 2010, 'Walt Disney Animation Studios, Walt Disney Pictures', '100', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ym7Kst6a4uodryxqbGOxmewF235.jpg', 'Feisty teenager Rapunzel, who has long and magical hair, wants to go and see sky lanterns on her eighteenth birthday, but she\'s bound to a tower by her overprotective mother. She strikes a deal with Flynn Rider, a charming wanted thief, and the duo set off on an action-packed escapade.'),
(365, 293660, 'Deadpool', 'Tim Miller', 'Ryan Reynolds, Morena Baccarin, Ed Skrein, T.J. Miller, Gina Carano, Leslie Uggams', 'Tim Miller', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 2016, '20th Century Fox, The Donners\' Company, Genre Films, Marvel Entertainment', '108', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3E53WEZJqP6aM84D8CckXx4pIHw.jpg', 'The origin story of former Special Forces operative turned mercenary Wade Wilson, who, after being subjected to a rogue experiment that leaves him with accelerated healing powers, adopts the alter ego Deadpool. Armed with his new abilities and a dark, twisted sense of humor, Deadpool hunts down the man who nearly destroyed his life.'),
(366, 283995, 'Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 2', 'James Gunn', 'Chris Pratt, Zoe Saldaña, Dave Bautista, Vin Diesel, Bradley Cooper, Kurt Russell', 'James Gunn', 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 2017, 'Marvel Studios', '137', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4MBh0EjBlMuOzv9axM4qJlmhzz.jpg', 'The Guardians must fight to keep their newfound family together as they unravel the mysteries of Peter Quill\'s true parentage.'),
(367, 458723, 'Us', 'Jordan Peele', 'Lupita Nyong\'o, Winston Duke, Elisabeth Moss, Tim Heidecker, Shahadi Wright Joseph, Evan Alex', 'Jordan Peele', 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 2019, 'Monkeypaw Productions, Universal Pictures, Perfect World Pictures, Blumhouse Productions, QC Entertainment', '116', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ux2dU1jQ2ACIMShzB3yP93Udpzc.jpg', 'Husband and wife Gabe and Adelaide Wilson take their kids to their beach house expecting to unplug and unwind with friends. But as night descends, their serenity turns to tension and chaos when some shocking visitors arrive uninvited.'),
(368, 335984, 'Blade Runner 2049', 'Denis Villeneuve', 'Ryan Gosling, Harrison Ford, Ana de Armas, Dave Bautista, Robin Wright, Sylvia Hoeks', 'Hampton Fancher, Michael Green', 'Science Fiction, Drama', 2017, 'Alcon Entertainment, Columbia Pictures, Scott Free Productions, Bud Yorkin Productions, Torridon Films, 16:14 Entertainment', '164', 3.8, 'US', 'English, suomi, Magyar, 日本語, Pусский, Somali, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gajva2L0rPYkEWjzgFlBXCAVBE5.jpg', 'Thirty years after the events of the first film, a new blade runner, LAPD Officer K, unearths a long-buried secret that has the potential to plunge what\'s left of society into chaos. K\'s discovery leads him on a quest to find Rick Deckard, a former LAPD blade runner who has been missing for 30 years.'),
(369, 593643, 'The Menu', 'Mark Mylod', 'Anya Taylor-Joy, Ralph Fiennes, Nicholas Hoult, Janet McTeer, Paul Adelstein, Rob Yang', 'Mark Mylod', 'Comedy, Horror', 2022, 'Hyperobject Industries, Searchlight Pictures, Gary Sanchez Productions, TSG Entertainment', '107', 3.6, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPtUgMcLIboqlTlPrq0bQpKK8eq.jpg', 'A young couple travels to a remote island to eat at an exclusive restaurant where the chef has prepared a lavish menu, with some shocking surprises.'),
(370, 346364, 'It', 'Andy Muschietti', 'Jaeden Martell, Jeremy Ray Taylor, Sophia Lillis, Finn Wolfhard, Chosen Jacobs, Jack Dylan Grazer', 'Cary Joji Fukunaga, Chase Palmer, Gary Dauberman', 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 2017, 'New Line Cinema, Vertigo Entertainment, Lin Pictures, KatzSmith Productions', '135', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9E2y5Q7WlCVNEhP5GiVTjhEhx1o.jpg', 'In a small town in Maine, seven children known as The Losers Club come face to face with life problems, bullies and a monster that takes the shape of a clown called Pennywise.'),
(371, 284052, 'Doctor Strange', 'Scott Derrickson', 'Benedict Cumberbatch, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Rachel McAdams, Benedict Wong, Mads Mikkelsen, Tilda Swinton', 'Scott Derrickson', 'Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 2016, 'Marvel Studios', '115', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGBVj3bEbCoZbDjjl9wTxcygko1.jpg', 'After his career is destroyed, a brilliant but arrogant surgeon gets a new lease on life when a sorcerer takes him under her wing and trains him to defend the world against evil.'),
(372, 315635, 'Spider-Man: Homecoming', 'Jon Watts', 'Tom Holland, Michael Keaton, Robert Downey Jr., Marisa Tomei, Jon Favreau, Gwyneth Paltrow', 'Jonathan Goldstein, John Francis Daley, Jon Watts', 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 2017, 'Marvel Studios, Pascal Pictures, LStar Capital, Columbia Pictures', '133', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c24sv2weTHPsmDa7jEMN0m2P3RT.jpg', 'Following the events of Captain America: Civil War, Peter Parker, with the help of his mentor Tony Stark, tries to balance his life as an ordinary high school student in Queens, New York City, with fighting crime as his superhero alter ego Spider-Man as a new threat, the Vulture, emerges.'),
(373, 348350, 'Solo: A Star Wars Story', 'Ron Howard', 'Alden Ehrenreich, Joonas Suotamo, Woody Harrelson, Emilia Clarke, Donald Glover, Thandiwe Newton', 'Ron Howard', 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 2018, 'Lucasfilm Ltd.', '135', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oD6VEccFkorEBTEDXtpLAaz0Rl.jpg', 'Through a series of daring escapades deep within a dark and dangerous criminal underworld, Han Solo meets his mighty future copilot Chewbacca and encounters the notorious gambler Lando Calrissian.'),
(374, 12, 'Finding Nemo', 'Andrew Stanton', 'Albert Brooks, Ellen DeGeneres, Alexander Gould, Willem Dafoe, Geoffrey Rush, Brad Garrett', 'Andrew Stanton, Bob Peterson, David Reynolds', 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 2003, 'Pixar', '100', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lc6nQc0VhWFYFbNv016xze8Jvy.jpg', 'Nemo, an adventurous young clownfish, is unexpectedly taken from his Great Barrier Reef home to a dentist\'s office aquarium. It\'s up to his worrisome father Marlin and a friendly but forgetful fish Dory to bring Nemo home -- meeting vegetarian sharks, surfer dude turtles, hypnotic jellyfish, hungry seagulls, and more along the way.'),
(375, 101299, 'The Hunger Games: Catching Fire', 'Francis Lawrence', 'Jennifer Lawrence, Josh Hutcherson, Liam Hemsworth, Woody Harrelson, Elizabeth Banks, Donald Sutherland', 'Simon Beaufoy, Michael Arndt', 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 2013, 'Lionsgate, Color Force', '146', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrQHDXjVmbYzadOXQ0UaObunoy2.jpg', 'After surviving the Hunger Games, Katniss and Peeta struggle with the consequences of their victory as unrest spreads across Panem. Forced back into the spotlight, they become symbols of hope and resistance while the Capitol prepares a new and deadly challenge that will change the future of the nation forever.'),
(376, 558, 'Spider-Man 2', 'Sam Raimi', 'Tobey Maguire, Kirsten Dunst, James Franco, Alfred Molina, Rosemary Harris, J.K. Simmons', 'Alvin Sargent', 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 2004, 'Marvel Enterprises, Laura Ziskin Productions, Columbia Pictures', '127', 3.7, 'US', 'English, Pусский, 普通话', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGuvNAaaZuWXYQQ6N2v7DeuP6mB.jpg', 'Peter Parker is going through a major identity crisis. Burned out from being Spider-Man, he decides to shelve his superhero alter ego, which leaves the city suffering in the wake of carnage left by the evil Doc Ock. In the meantime, Parker still can\'t act on his feelings for Mary Jane Watson, a girl he\'s loved since childhood. A certain anger begins to brew in his best friend Harry Osborn as well...'),
(377, 27205, 'Inception', 'Christopher Nolan', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Ken Watanabe, Tom Hardy, Elliot Page, Dileep Rao', 'Christopher Nolan', 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 2010, 'Legendary Pictures, Syncopy, Warner Bros. Pictures', '148', 4.2, 'US, GB', 'English, Français, 日本語, Kiswahili', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlaY2zyzMfkhk0HSC5VUwzoZPU1.jpg', 'Cobb, a skilled thief who commits corporate espionage by infiltrating the subconscious of his targets is offered a chance to regain his old life as payment for a task considered to be impossible: \"inception\", the implantation of another person\'s idea into a target\'s subconscious.'),
(378, 205596, 'The Imitation Game', 'Morten Tyldum', 'Benedict Cumberbatch, Keira Knightley, Matthew Goode, Rory Kinnear, Allen Leech, Matthew Beard', 'Morten Tyldum', 'History, Drama, Thriller, War', 2014, 'Bristol Automotive, Black Bear Pictures, FilmNation Entertainment', '113', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSqJ1qFq8NXFfi7JeIYMlzyR0dx.jpg', 'Based on the real life story of legendary cryptanalyst Alan Turing, the film portrays the nail-biting race against time by Turing and his brilliant team of code-breakers at Britain\'s top-secret Government Code and Cypher School at Bletchley Park, during the darkest days of World War II.'),
(379, 631842, 'Knock at the Cabin', 'M. Night Shyamalan', 'Dave Bautista, Jonathan Groff, Ben Aldridge, Nikki Amuka-Bird, Rupert Grint, Abby Quinn', 'Michael Sherman, Steve Desmond, M. Night Shyamalan', 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 2023, 'Blinding Edge Pictures, FilmNation Entertainment, Wishmore, Universal Pictures', '100', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dm06L9pxDOL9jNSK4Cb6y139rrG.jpg', 'While vacationing at a remote cabin, a young girl and her two fathers are taken hostage by four armed strangers who demand that the family make an unthinkable choice to avert the apocalypse. With limited access to the outside world, the family must decide what they believe before all is lost.'),
(380, 559, 'Spider-Man 3', 'Sam Raimi', 'Tobey Maguire, Kirsten Dunst, James Franco, Thomas Haden Church, Topher Grace, Bryce Dallas Howard', 'Alvin Sargent, Sam Raimi, Ivan Raimi', 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 2007, 'Laura Ziskin Productions, Marvel Studios, Columbia Pictures', '139', 3.2, 'US', 'English, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJMTTGjtjvrMZ7G0oP9D13wNUum.jpg', 'The seemingly invincible Spider-Man goes up against an all-new crop of villains—including the shape-shifting Sandman. While Spider-Man’s superpowers are altered by an alien organism, his alter ego, Peter Parker, deals with nemesis Eddie Brock and also gets caught up in a love triangle.'),
(381, 11631, 'Mamma Mia!', 'Phyllida Lloyd', 'Amanda Seyfried, Meryl Streep, Pierce Brosnan, Colin Firth, Stellan Skarsgård, Christine Baranski', 'Catherine Johnson', 'Comedy, Romance', 2008, 'Littlestar, Playtone, Internationale Filmproduktion Richter', '108', 3.5, 'US, GB', 'English, ελληνικά', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdUA4FNHbXPadzVOJiU0Rgn6cHR.jpg', 'A spirited young bride-to-be living with her single mother on a small Greek island secretly invites three of her mother\'s ex-boyfriends in hope of finding her biological father to walk her down the aisle.'),
(382, 6479, 'I Am Legend', 'Francis Lawrence', 'Will Smith, Alice Braga, Charlie Tahan, Dash Mihok, Salli Richardson-Whitfield, Willow Smith', 'Mark Protosevich, Akiva Goldsman', 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 2007, 'Village Roadshow Pictures, Weed Road Pictures, Overbrook Entertainment, Warner Bros. Pictures, Heyday Films, Original Film', '101', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPDkaSdKk2jRLTM65UOEoKtsIZ8.jpg', 'Robert Neville is a scientist who was unable to stop the spread of the terrible virus that was incurable and man-made. Immune, Neville is now the last human survivor in what is left of New York City and perhaps the world. For three years, Neville has faithfully sent out daily radio messages, desperate to find any other survivors who might be out there. But he is not alone.'),
(383, 10501, 'The Road to El Dorado', 'Bibo Bergeron', 'Kenneth Branagh, Kevin Kline, Rosie Perez, Armand Assante, Edward James Olmos, Jim Cummings', 'Terry Rossio, Ted Elliott', 'Family, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 2000, 'DreamWorks Pictures, DreamWorks Animation', '90', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQuqhUBACMcGqCvliHxpJreBfXC.jpg', 'Stowing away after a failed con, a pair of swindlers end up on El Dorado, the fabled \"city of gold\", where they quickly get in over their heads when they are mistaken as gods by the inhabitants.'),
(384, 639933, 'The Northman', 'Robert Eggers', 'Alexander Skarsgård, Nicole Kidman, Claes Bang, Ethan Hawke, Anya Taylor-Joy, Gustav Lindh', 'Robert Eggers', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 2022, 'Regency Enterprises, New Regency Pictures, Square Peg, Focus Features', '137', 3.5, 'US', 'English, Íslenska', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSSJMnHknzKjlZ6zybwD7eyJ4Po.jpg', 'Prince Amleth is on the verge of becoming a man when his father is brutally murdered by his uncle, who kidnaps the boy\'s mother. Two decades later, Amleth is now a Viking who\'s on a mission to save his mother, kill his uncle and avenge his father.'),
(385, 2048, 'I, Robot', 'Alex Proyas', 'Will Smith, Bridget Moynahan, Alan Tudyk, James Cromwell, Bruce Greenwood, Adrian Ricard', 'Jeff Vintar, Akiva Goldsman', 'Action, Science Fiction', 2004, 'Davis Entertainment, Laurence Mark Productions, Canlaws Productions, 20th Century Fox, Overbrook Entertainment, Mediastream Vierte Film', '115', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efwv6F2lGaghjPpBRSINHtoEiZB.jpg', 'In 2035, where robots are commonplace and abide by the three laws of robotics, a technophobic cop investigates an apparent suicide. Suspecting that a robot may be responsible for the death, his investigation leads him to believe that humanity may be in danger.');
INSERT INTO `peliculas` (`idPelicula`, `idApi`, `nombrePelicula`, `directorPelicula`, `actorPelicula`, `guionistaPelicula`, `generoPelicula`, `anoPelicula`, `companiaPelicula`, `duracionPelicula`, `ratingAvgPelicula`, `paisPelicula`, `idiomaPelicula`, `posterPelicula`, `sinopsisPelicula`) VALUES
(386, 429617, 'Spider-Man: Far From Home', 'Jon Watts', 'Tom Holland, Jake Gyllenhaal, Samuel L. Jackson, Marisa Tomei, Jon Favreau, Zendaya', 'Erik Sommers', 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 2019, 'Marvel Studios, Pascal Pictures, Columbia Pictures', '129', 3.7, 'US', 'Český, Nederlands, English, Deutsch, Italiano', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4q2NNj4S5dG2RLF9CpXsej7yXl.jpg', 'Peter Parker and his friends go on a summer trip to Europe. However, they will hardly be able to rest - Peter will have to agree to help Nick Fury uncover the mystery of creatures that cause natural disasters and destruction throughout the continent.'),
(387, 76203, '12 Years a Slave', 'Steve McQueen', 'Chiwetel Ejiofor, Michael Fassbender, Lupita Nyong\'o, Benedict Cumberbatch, Paul Dano, Sarah Paulson', 'John Ridley', 'Drama, History', 2013, 'New Regency Pictures, Plan B Entertainment, River Road Entertainment, Regency Enterprises, Film4 Productions', '134', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdANQijuNrJaw1HA61rDccME4Tm.jpg', 'In the pre-Civil War United States, Solomon Northup, a free black man from upstate New York, is abducted and sold into slavery. Facing cruelty as well as unexpected kindnesses Solomon struggles not only to stay alive, but to retain his dignity. In the twelfth year of his unforgettable odyssey, Solomon’s chance meeting with a Canadian abolitionist will forever alter his life.'),
(388, 264660, 'Ex Machina', 'Alex Garland', 'Domhnall Gleeson, Alicia Vikander, Oscar Isaac, Sonoya Mizuno, Corey Johnson, Claire Selby', 'Alex Garland', 'Drama, Science Fiction', 2015, 'DNA Films, Film4 Productions, IAC Films, Scott Rudin Productions', '108', 3.8, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmJW8IAKHKxFNiUnoDR7JfsK7Rp.jpg', 'Caleb, a coder at the world\'s largest internet company, wins a competition to spend a week at a private mountain retreat belonging to Nathan, the reclusive CEO of the company. But when Caleb arrives at the remote location he finds that he will have to participate in a strange and fascinating experiment in which he must interact with the world\'s first true artificial intelligence, housed in the body of a beautiful robot girl.'),
(389, 198663, 'The Maze Runner', 'Wes Ball', 'Dylan O\'Brien, Kaya Scodelario, Thomas Brodie-Sangster, Ki Hong Lee, Will Poulter, Aml Ameen', 'Grant Pierce Myers, Noah Oppenheim, T.S. Nowlin', 'Action, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 2014, 'Ingenious Media, The Gotham Group, Dayday Films, Temple Hill Entertainment, TSG Entertainment, 20th Century Fox', '113', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ode14q7WtDugFDp78fo9lCsmay9.jpg', 'A teenager with no memory of his past finds himself among a group of boys living in a walled enclosure surrounded by a massive, ever-changing maze. As he struggles to adapt to their rules and society, he begins to uncover clues that may lead to escape and the truth behind their confinement.'),
(390, 100402, 'Captain America: The Winter Soldier', 'Joe Russo', 'Chris Evans, Samuel L. Jackson, Scarlett Johansson, Robert Redford, Sebastian Stan, Anthony Mackie', 'Christopher Markus, Stephen McFeely', 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 2014, 'Marvel Studios', '136', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVFRpFw3xTedgPGqxW0AOI8Qhh0.jpg', 'After the cataclysmic events in New York with The Avengers, Steve Rogers, aka Captain America is living quietly in Washington, D.C. and trying to adjust to the modern world. But when a S.H.I.E.L.D. colleague comes under attack, Steve becomes embroiled in a web of intrigue that threatens to put the world at risk. Joining forces with the Black Widow, Captain America struggles to expose the ever-widening conspiracy while fighting off professional assassins sent to silence him at every turn. When the full scope of the villainous plot is revealed, Captain America and the Black Widow enlist the help of a new ally, the Falcon. However, they soon find themselves up against an unexpected and formidable enemy—the Winter Soldier.'),
(391, 207703, 'Kingsman: The Secret Service', 'Matthew Vaughn', 'Taron Egerton, Colin Firth, Samuel L. Jackson, Mark Strong, Sophie Cookson, Sofia Boutella', 'Matthew Vaughn', 'Crime, Comedy, Action, Adventure', 2015, '20th Century Fox, Marv, Cloudy Productions, TSG Entertainment', '129', 3.8, 'GB', 'العربية, English, svenska', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17i5YPTfHOjXoieArpATWGRhLj1.jpg', 'The story of a super-secret spy organization that recruits an unrefined but promising street kid into the agency\'s ultra-competitive training program just as a global threat emerges from a twisted tech genius.'),
(392, 4348, 'Pride & Prejudice', 'Joe Wright', 'Keira Knightley, Matthew Macfadyen, Brenda Blethyn, Rosamund Pike, Carey Mulligan, Jena Malone', 'Deborah Moggach', 'Drama, Romance', 2005, 'StudioCanal, Working Title Films, Scion Films, Focus Features', '128', 4.0, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8UhmEbWPHmTUxP0lMuCoqNkbB3.jpg', 'A story of love and life among the landed English gentry during the Georgian era. Mr. Bennet is a gentleman living in Hertfordshire with his overbearing wife and five daughters, but if he dies their house will be inherited by a distant cousin whom they have never met, so the family\'s future happiness and security is dependent on the daughters making good marriages.'),
(393, 58574, 'Sherlock Holmes: A Game of Shadows', 'Guy Ritchie', 'Robert Downey Jr., Jude Law, Noomi Rapace, Jared Harris, Rachel McAdams, Eddie Marsan', 'Kieran Mulroney, Michele Mulroney', 'Action, Adventure, Mystery', 2011, 'Village Roadshow Pictures, Silver Pictures, Wigram Productions, Lin Pictures', '129', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HsHurlnTOyU6yUS14gY6BQCyRs.jpg', 'There is a new criminal mastermind at large (Professor Moriarty) and not only is he Holmes’ intellectual equal, but his capacity for evil and lack of conscience may give him an advantage over the detective.'),
(394, 508442, 'Soul', 'Pete Docter', 'Jamie Foxx, Tina Fey, Graham Norton, Rachel House, Alice Braga, Richard Ayoade', 'Pete Docter, Mike Jones, Kemp Powers', 'Animation, Family, Drama, Music, Fantasy', 2020, 'Pixar', '101', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hm58Jw4Lw8OIeECIq5qyPYhAeRJ.jpg', 'Joe Gardner is a middle school teacher with a love for jazz music. After a successful audition at the Half Note Club, he suddenly gets into an accident that separates his soul from his body and is transported to the You Seminar, a center in which souls develop and gain passions before being transported to a newborn child. Joe must enlist help from the other souls-in-training, like 22, a soul who has spent eons in the You Seminar, in order to get back to Earth.'),
(395, 155, 'The Dark Knight', 'Christopher Nolan', 'Christian Bale, Heath Ledger, Aaron Eckhart, Michael Caine, Maggie Gyllenhaal, Gary Oldman', 'Christopher Nolan, Jonathan Nolan', 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 2008, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Legendary Pictures, Syncopy, DC', '152', 4.3, 'US', 'English, 普通话', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJ2tW6WMUDux911r6m7haRef0WH.jpg', 'Batman raises the stakes in his war on crime. With the help of Lt. Jim Gordon and District Attorney Harvey Dent, Batman sets out to dismantle the remaining criminal organizations that plague the streets. The partnership proves to be effective, but they soon find themselves prey to a reign of chaos unleashed by a rising criminal mastermind known to the terrified citizens of Gotham as the Joker.'),
(396, 1417, 'Pan\'s Labyrinth', 'Guillermo del Toro', 'Ivana Baquero, Sergi López, Maribel Verdú, Doug Jones, Ariadna Gil, Álex Angulo', 'Guillermo del Toro', 'Fantasy, Drama, War', 2006, 'Estudios Picasso, Esperanto Filmoj, Tequila Gang, Telecinco', '118', 3.9, 'MX, ES', 'Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7xXihu5wHuSMWymq5VAulPVuvg.jpg', 'In post–civil war Spain, 10-year-old Ofelia moves with her pregnant mother to live under the control of her cruel stepfather. Drawn into a mysterious labyrinth, she meets a faun who reveals that she may be a lost princess from an underground kingdom. To return to her true father, she must complete a series of surreal and perilous tasks that blur the line between reality and fantasy.'),
(397, 920, 'Cars', 'John Lasseter', 'Owen Wilson, Paul Newman, Bonnie Hunt, Larry the Cable Guy, Cheech Marin, Tony Shalhoub', 'Dan Fogelman, Joe Ranft, Jørgen Klubien', 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 2006, 'Pixar', '117', 3.5, 'US', 'English, Italiano, 日本語, ', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Touk3m5gzsqr1VsvxypdyHY5ci.jpg', 'Lightning McQueen, a hotshot rookie race car driven to succeed, discovers that life is about the journey, not the finish line, when he finds himself unexpectedly detoured in the sleepy Route 66 town of Radiator Springs. On route across the country to the big Piston Cup Championship in California to compete against two seasoned pros, McQueen gets to know the town\'s offbeat characters.'),
(398, 808, 'Shrek', 'Andrew Adamson', 'Mike Myers, Eddie Murphy, Cameron Diaz, John Lithgow, Vincent Cassel, Peter Dennis', 'Andrew Adamson, Vicky Jenson', 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 2001, 'Pacific Data Images, DreamWorks Animation, DreamWorks Pictures', '90', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iB64vpL3dIObOtMZgX3RqdVdQDc.jpg', 'It ain\'t easy bein\' green -- especially if you\'re a likable (albeit smelly) ogre named Shrek. On a mission to retrieve a gorgeous princess from the clutches of a fire-breathing dragon, Shrek teams up with an unlikely compatriot -- a wisecracking donkey.'),
(399, 77338, 'The Intouchables', 'Éric Toledano', 'François Cluzet, Omar Sy, Anne Le Ny, Audrey Fleurot, Joséphine de Meaux, Clotilde Mollet', 'Éric Toledano, Olivier Nakache', 'Drama, Comedy', 2011, 'Gaumont, Quad Productions, Chaocorp, Ten Films, TF1 Films Production', '113', 4.1, 'FR', 'English, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QU7HKgsQbGpzsJbJK4pAVQV9F5.jpg', 'A true story of two men who should never have met – a quadriplegic aristocrat who was injured in a paragliding accident and a young man from the projects.'),
(400, 106, 'Predator', 'John McTiernan', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Carl Weathers, Kevin Peter Hall, Elpidia Carrillo, Bill Duke, Jesse Ventura', 'John McTiernan', 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 1987, '20th Century Fox, Lawrence Gordon Productions, Silver Pictures, Davis Entertainment, Amercent Films, American Entertainment Partners L.P.', '107', 3.8, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3mW4qfJo6SKqe6laRyNGnbB9n5.jpg', 'A team of elite commandos on a secret mission in a Central American jungle come to find themselves hunted by an extraterrestrial warrior.'),
(401, 9543, 'Prince of Persia: The Sands of Time', 'Mike Newell', 'Jake Gyllenhaal, Gemma Arterton, Ben Kingsley, Alfred Molina, Steve Toussaint, Toby Kebbell', 'Doug Miro, Boaz Yakin, Carlo Bernard', 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 2010, 'Walt Disney Pictures, Jerry Bruckheimer Films', '116', 3.2, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/siNGMLdOUNYLEGtlsnmQcpO2XZX.jpg', 'A rogue prince reluctantly joins forces with a mysterious princess and together, they race against dark forces to safeguard an ancient dagger capable of releasing the Sands of Time – gift from the gods that can reverse time and allow its possessor to rule the world.'),
(402, 35, 'The Simpsons Movie', 'David Silverman', 'Dan Castellaneta, Julie Kavner, Nancy Cartwright, Yeardley Smith, Hank Azaria, Harry Shearer', 'Matt Groening, James L. Brooks, Sam Simon', 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 2007, 'Gracie Films, 20th Century Fox', '87', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3b8TZWwmkYc2KoJ5zk77qB6PzY.jpg', 'After Homer accidentally pollutes the town\'s water supply, Springfield is encased in a gigantic dome by the EPA and the Simpsons are declared fugitives.'),
(403, 597, 'Titanic', 'James Cameron', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Kate Winslet, Billy Zane, Kathy Bates, Frances Fisher, Gloria Stuart', 'James Cameron', 'Drama, Romance', 1997, 'Paramount Pictures, 20th Century Fox, Lightstorm Entertainment', '194', 4.0, 'US', 'English, Français, Deutsch, svenska, Italiano, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xjZS2rlVxm8SFx8kPC3aIGCOYQ.jpg', '101-year-old Rose DeWitt Bukater tells the story of her life aboard the Titanic, 84 years later. A young Rose boards the ship with her mother and fiancé. Meanwhile, Jack Dawson and Fabrizio De Rossi win third-class tickets aboard the ship. Rose tells the whole story from Titanic\'s departure through to its death—on its first and last voyage—on April 15, 1912.'),
(404, 299534, 'Avengers: Endgame', 'Anthony Russo', 'Robert Downey Jr., Chris Evans, Mark Ruffalo, Chris Hemsworth, Scarlett Johansson, Jeremy Renner', 'Stephen McFeely, Christopher Markus', 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Action', 2019, 'Marvel Studios', '181', 4.1, 'US', 'English, 日本語, ', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulzhLuWrPK07P1YkdWQLZnQh1JL.jpg', 'After the devastating events of Avengers: Infinity War, the universe is in ruins due to the efforts of the Mad Titan, Thanos. With the help of remaining allies, the Avengers must assemble once more in order to undo Thanos\' actions and restore order to the universe once and for all, no matter what consequences may be in store.'),
(405, 1771, 'Captain America: The First Avenger', 'Joe Johnston', 'Chris Evans, Hayley Atwell, Sebastian Stan, Tommy Lee Jones, Hugo Weaving, Dominic Cooper', 'Christopher Markus, Stephen McFeely', 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 2011, 'Marvel Studios, Marvel Entertainment', '124', 3.5, 'US', 'Français, Norsk, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSNxAJTlD0r02V9sPYpOjqDZXUK.jpg', 'During World War II, Steve Rogers is a sickly man from Brooklyn who\'s transformed into super-soldier Captain America to aid in the war effort. Rogers must stop the Red Skull – Adolf Hitler\'s ruthless head of weaponry, and the leader of an organization that intends to use a mysterious device of untold powers for world domination.'),
(406, 13223, 'Gran Torino', 'Clint Eastwood', 'Clint Eastwood, Christopher Carley, Bee Vang, Ahney Her, Brian Haley, Geraldine Hughes', 'Nick Schenk', 'Drama', 2008, 'Matten Productions, Double Nickel Entertainment, Gerber Pictures, Malpaso Productions, Village Roadshow Pictures, WV Films IV, Warner Bros. Pictures', '116', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUybYvxWdAJy5hhYovsXtHSWI1l.jpg', 'Disgruntled Korean War veteran Walt Kowalski sets out to reform his neighbor, Thao Lor, a Hmong teenager who tried to steal Kowalski\'s prized possession: a 1972 Gran Torino.'),
(407, 15789, 'A Goofy Movie', 'Kevin Lima', 'Bill Farmer, Jason Marsden, Aaron Lohr, Jim Cummings, Rob Paulsen, Kellie Martin', 'Jymn Magon, Chris Matheson, Brian Pimental', 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance, Animation, Family', 1995, 'Walt Disney Pictures, Walt Disney Animation, Phoenix Animation Studios, Pixibox, Walt Disney Animation, Walt Disney Feature Animation', '78', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bycmMhO3iIoEDzP768sUjq2RV4T.jpg', 'Goofy’s teenage son Max is desperate to impress his crush and fit in at school. After well-meaning but ignorant Goofy suddenly whisks him away on a cross-country road trip—messing up Max’s first date plans in the process—Goofy’s old-school parenting and Max’s desire for independence lead to a vacation of hilarious mishaps, as they both learn to see eye to eye and listen to each other.'),
(408, 1268, 'Mr. Bean\'s Holiday', 'Steve Bendelack', 'Rowan Atkinson, Willem Dafoe, Maxim Baldry, Karel Roden, Emma de Caunes, Steve Pemberton', 'Robin Driscoll, Hamish McColl', 'Family, Comedy', 2007, 'Tiger Aspect, Working Title Films, StudioCanal, Motion Picture Alpha Produktions, Universal Pictures', '90', 3.2, 'GB', 'Français, Pусский, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSSx9Sq6irWwN9NTQmoT9KE8kXn.jpg', 'Mr. Bean wins a trip to Cannes where he unwittingly separates a young boy from his father and must help the two reunite. On the way he discovers France, bicycling and true love, among other things.'),
(409, 351286, 'Jurassic World: Fallen Kingdom', 'J. A. Bayona', 'Chris Pratt, Bryce Dallas Howard, Rafe Spall, Justice Smith, Daniella Pineda, James Cromwell', 'J. A. Bayona', 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Thriller, Action', 2018, 'Amblin Entertainment, Universal Pictures', '129', 3.3, 'US', 'English, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2Us3jR6ToMJjbcPbLimYoxf6xr.jpg', 'Three years after Jurassic World was destroyed, Isla Nublar now sits abandoned. When the island\'s dormant volcano begins roaring to life, Owen and Claire mount a campaign to rescue the remaining dinosaurs from this extinction-level event.'),
(410, 10528, 'Sherlock Holmes', 'Guy Ritchie', 'Robert Downey Jr., Jude Law, Rachel McAdams, Mark Strong, Eddie Marsan, Robert Maillet', 'Michael Robert Johnson, Simon Kinberg, Anthony Peckham', 'Action, Adventure, Mystery', 2009, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Village Roadshow Pictures, Silver Pictures, Wigram Productions', '129', 3.6, 'US, GB', 'English, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/momkKuWburNTqKBF6ez7rvhYVhE.jpg', 'Eccentric consulting detective Sherlock Holmes and Doctor John Watson battle to bring down a new nemesis and unravel a deadly plot that could destroy England.'),
(411, 272, 'Batman Begins', 'Christopher Nolan', 'Christian Bale, Michael Caine, Liam Neeson, Katie Holmes, Gary Oldman, Cillian Murphy', 'Christopher Nolan, David S. Goyer', 'Drama, Crime, Action', 2005, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, DC, Syncopy, Legendary Pictures, Patalex III Productions', '140', 3.9, 'US', 'English, اردو, 普通话', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPX89Td70IDDjVr85jdSBb4rWGr.jpg', 'Driven by tragedy, billionaire Bruce Wayne dedicates his life to uncovering and defeating the corruption that plagues his home, Gotham City.  Unable to work within the system, he instead creates a new identity, a symbol of fear for the criminal underworld - The Batman.'),
(412, 49521, 'Man of Steel', 'Zack Snyder', 'Henry Cavill, Amy Adams, Michael Shannon, Diane Lane, Russell Crowe, Antje Traue', 'David S. Goyer', 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 2013, 'Syncopy, Peters Entertainment, Warner Bros. Pictures, DC', '143', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GFtkImmK0K1VaUChR0n9O61CFU.jpg', 'A young boy learns that he has extraordinary powers and is not of this earth. As a young man, he journeys to discover where he came from and what he was sent here to do. But the hero in him must emerge if he is to save the world from annihilation and become the symbol of hope for all mankind.'),
(413, 135397, 'Jurassic World', 'Colin Trevorrow', 'Chris Pratt, Bryce Dallas Howard, Irrfan Khan, Vincent D\'Onofrio, Ty Simpkins, Nick Robinson', 'Rick Jaffa, Amanda Silver, Derek Connolly', 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Thriller, Action', 2015, 'Amblin Entertainment, Universal Pictures, Legendary Pictures', '124', 3.4, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhr4y79GpxQF9IsfJItRXVaoGs4.jpg', 'Twenty-two years after the events of Jurassic Park, Isla Nublar now features a fully functioning dinosaur theme park, Jurassic World, as originally envisioned by John Hammond.'),
(414, 405774, 'Bird Box', 'Susanne Bier', 'Sandra Bullock, Trevante Rhodes, John Malkovich, Sarah Paulson, Jacki Weaver, Rosa Salazar', 'Eric Heisserer', 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 2018, 'Bluegrass Films, Chris Morgan Productions', '124', 3.4, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGfGfgL2pEPCfhIvqHXieXFn7gp.jpg', 'Five years after an ominous unseen presence drives most of society to suicide, a survivor and her two children make a desperate bid to reach safety.'),
(415, 9992, 'Arthur and the Invisibles', 'Luc Besson', 'Freddie Highmore, Madonna, Mia Farrow, Adam LeFevre, Doug Rand, Penny Balfour', 'Luc Besson', 'Adventure, Fantasy, Animation, Family', 2006, 'EuropaCorp, Avalanche Productions, Apipoulaï Prod', '94', 3.2, 'FR', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gH27K0S7BiZCsNMxzOQTacG9IZp.jpg', 'Ten-year-old Arthur, in a bid to save his grandfather\'s house from being demolished, goes looking for some much-fabled hidden treasure in the land of the Minimoys, tiny people living in harmony with nature.'),
(416, 19908, 'Zombieland', 'Ruben Fleischer', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Woody Harrelson, Emma Stone, Abigail Breslin, Amber Heard, Bill Murray', 'Ruben Fleischer', 'Comedy, Horror', 2009, 'Columbia Pictures, Relativity Media, Pariah', '88', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUkAmAyPVqubSBNRjRqCgHggZcK.jpg', 'Columbus has made a habit of running from what scares him. Tallahassee doesn\'t have fears. If he did, he\'d kick their ever-living ass. In a world overrun by zombies, these two are perfectly evolved survivors. But now, they\'re about to stare down the most terrifying prospect of all: each other.'),
(417, 3170, 'Bambi', 'David Hand', 'Donnie Dunagan, Peter Behn, Stan Alexander, Cammie King, Will Wright, Hardie Albright', 'David Hand', 'Animation, Drama, Family', 1942, 'Walt Disney Productions', '70', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wV9e2y4myJ4KMFsyFfWYcUOawyK.jpg', 'Bambi\'s tale unfolds from season to season as the young prince of the forest learns about life, love, and friends.'),
(418, 251, 'Ghost', 'Jerry Zucker', 'Patrick Swayze, Demi Moore, Whoopi Goldberg, Tony Goldwyn, Vincent Schiavelli, Rick Aviles', 'Jerry Zucker', 'Fantasy, Romance, Thriller', 1990, 'Paramount Pictures, Howard W. Koch Productions', '127', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9RaPHov8oM5cnzeE27isnFMsvS.jpg', 'After a young man is murdered, his spirit stays behind to warn his lover of impending danger, with the help of a reluctant psychic.'),
(419, 102899, 'Ant-Man', 'Peyton Reed', 'Paul Rudd, Michael Douglas, Evangeline Lilly, Corey Stoll, Bobby Cannavale, Anthony Mackie', 'Adam McKay, Paul Rudd, Edgar Wright', 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 2015, 'Marvel Studios', '117', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQRnQfUl3kfp78nCWq8Ks04vnq1.jpg', 'Armed with the astonishing ability to shrink in scale but increase in strength, master thief Scott Lang must embrace his inner-hero and help his mentor, Doctor Hank Pym, protect the secret behind his spectacular Ant-Man suit from a new generation of towering threats. Against seemingly insurmountable obstacles, Pym and Lang must plan and pull off a heist that will save the world.'),
(420, 1726, 'Iron Man', 'Jon Favreau', 'Robert Downey Jr., Terrence Howard, Jeff Bridges, Gwyneth Paltrow, Leslie Bibb, Shaun Toub', 'Mark Fergus, Hawk Ostby, Matt Holloway', 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 2008, 'Marvel Studios, Marvel Entertainment, Fairview Entertainment', '126', 3.8, 'US', 'English, فارسی, اردو, العربية', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78lPtwv72eTNqFW9COBYI0dWDJa.jpg', 'After being held captive in an Afghan cave, billionaire engineer Tony Stark creates a unique weaponized suit of armor to fight evil.'),
(421, 785084, 'The Whale', 'Darren Aronofsky', 'Brendan Fraser, Sadie Sink, Ty Simpkins, Hong Chau, Samantha Morton, Sathya Sridharan', 'Samuel D. Hunter', 'Drama', 2022, 'A24, Protozoa Pictures', '117', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQ0gylJMxWSL490sy0RrPj1Lj7e.jpg', 'A reclusive English teacher suffering from severe obesity attempts to reconnect with his estranged teenage daughter for one last chance at redemption.'),
(422, 674324, 'The Banshees of Inisherin', 'Martin McDonagh', 'Colin Farrell, Brendan Gleeson, Kerry Condon, Barry Keoghan, Gary Lydon, Pat Shortt', 'Martin McDonagh', 'Drama, Comedy', 2022, 'Searchlight Pictures, Blueprint Pictures, Film4 Productions, TSG Entertainment', '114', 3.7, 'GB, US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yFG6cSPaCaPhyJ1vtGOtMD1lgh.jpg', 'Two lifelong friends find themselves at an impasse when one abruptly ends their relationship, with alarming consequences for both of them.'),
(423, 2698, 'Evan Almighty', 'Tom Shadyac', 'Steve Carell, Morgan Freeman, Lauren Graham, Johnny Simmons, Graham Phillips, Jimmy Bennett', 'Steve Oedekerk', 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 2007, 'Universal Pictures, Spyglass Entertainment, Relativity Media, Shady Acres Entertainment, Original Film', '96', 2.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/blI1ioXbgJWOJ3PbcBuSV65Ebwu.jpg', 'God contacts Junior Congressman Evan Baxter and tells him to build an ark in preparation for a great flood.'),
(424, 6282, 'Coyote Ugly', 'David McNally', 'Piper Perabo, Maria Bello, Bridget Moynahan, Tyra Banks, Izabella Miko, John Goodman', 'David McNally', 'Comedy, Drama, Music, Romance', 2000, 'Touchstone Pictures, Jerry Bruckheimer Films', '100', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYM0laKrEqjiRSQNvqRrXPXN3iL.jpg', 'Graced with a velvet voice, 21-year-old Violet Sanford heads to New York to pursue her dream of becoming a songwriter only to find her aspirations sidelined by the accolades and notoriety she receives at her \"day\" job as a barmaid at Coyote Ugly. The \"Coyotes\" as they are affectionately called tantalize customers and the media alike with their outrageous antics, making Coyote Ugly the watering hole for guys on the prowl.'),
(425, 18890, 'We\'re Back! A Dinosaur\'s Story', 'Dick Zondag', 'John Goodman, René Le Vant, Felicity Kendal, Charles Fleischer, Walter Cronkite, Jay Leno', 'John Patrick Shanley', 'Animation, Science Fiction, Family', 1993, 'Amblin Entertainment, Amblimation, Universal Pictures', '71', 3.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyFmhYlioe3PDZjSKWtcIhu5R02.jpg', 'Captain New Eyes travels back in time and feeds dinosaurs his Brain Grain cereal, which makes them intelligent and non-violent. They agree to go to the \"Middle Future\" in order to grant the wishes of children in New York City. They are to meet Dr. Bleeb of the Museum of Natural History, but get sidetracked with their new children friends and run into the Captain\'s evil brother, Professor Screweyes.'),
(426, 8839, 'Casper', 'Brad Silberling', 'Malachi Pearson, Christina Ricci, Bill Pullman, Cathy Moriarty, Eric Idle, Joe Alaskey', 'Brad Silberling', 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 1995, 'The Harvey Entertainment Company, Universal Pictures, Amblin Entertainment', '100', 3.2, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ah8fNJFZVU3vcXhU5xfAYi2eym.jpg', 'Casper is a kind young ghost who peacefully haunts a mansion in Maine. When specialist James Harvey arrives to communicate with Casper and his fellow spirits, he brings along his teenage daughter, Kat. Casper quickly falls in love with Kat, but their budding relationship is complicated not only by his transparent state, but also by his troublemaking apparition uncles and their mischievous antics.'),
(427, 9297, 'Monster House', 'Gil Kenan', 'Mitchel Musso, Sam Lerner, Spencer Locke, Steve Buscemi, Maggie Gyllenhaal, Kevin James', 'Dan Harmon, Rob Schrab, Pamela Pettler', 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 2006, 'ImageMovers, Amblin Entertainment', '91', 3.4, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCRPr4bkO3ae0U1134vJ39xZnAG.jpg', 'Monsters under the bed are scary enough, but what happens when an entire house is out to get you? Three teens aim to find out when they go up against a decrepit neighboring home and unlock its frightening secrets.'),
(428, 9072, 'Little Man', 'Keenen Ivory Wayans', 'Marlon Wayans, Shawn Wayans, Kerry Washington, John Witherspoon, Tracy Morgan, Lochlyn Munro', 'Shawn Wayans, Marlon Wayans, Keenen Ivory Wayans', 'Comedy, Crime', 2006, 'Wayans Bros. Entertainment, Revolution Studios', '98', 3.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KzPw1VN0pMBnq1KIqBaLI8LAB7.jpg', 'After leaving prison, dwarf criminal Calvin Sims joins his moron brother Percy in stealing an expensive huge diamond from a jewelry store for the mobster Walken. They are chased by the police, and Calvin hides the stone in the purse of executive Vanessa Edwards, whose husband Darryl Edwards wants to have a baby. Percy convinces Calvin to dress like a baby and be left in front of the Edwards\' house to get inside the house and retrieve the diamond. Darryl and Vanessa keep Calvin for the weekend and decide to adopt him, while Walken threatens Darryl to get the stone back.'),
(429, 86829, 'Inside Llewyn Davis', 'Joel Coen', 'Oscar Isaac, Carey Mulligan, Justin Timberlake, Ethan Phillips, Robin Bartlett, Max Casella', 'Joel Coen, Ethan Coen', 'Drama, Music', 2013, 'StudioCanal, Anton Capital Entertainment, Mike Zoss Productions', '105', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNxK3pC3DMpPpWKMvo2p3liREVT.jpg', 'In Greenwich Village in the early 1960s, gifted but volatile folk musician Llewyn Davis struggles with money, relationships, and his uncertain future.'),
(430, 9600, 'Big Momma\'s House', 'Raja Gosnell', 'Martin Lawrence, Nia Long, Paul Giamatti, Jascha Washington, Terrence Howard, Anthony Anderson', 'Don Rhymer, Darryl Quarles', 'Crime, Comedy', 2000, 'Regency Enterprises, 20th Century Fox, Taurus Film', '98', 2.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YoSFqpTz5qIxsX61CPMGKONQIY.jpg', 'When a street-smart FBI agent is sent to Georgia to protect a beautiful single mother and her son from an escaped convict, he is forced to impersonate a crass Southern granny known as Big Momma in order to remain incognito.'),
(431, 429200, 'Good Time', 'Josh Safdie', 'Robert Pattinson, Benny Safdie, Buddy Duress, Taliah Webster, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Barkhad Abdi', 'Josh Safdie, Benny Safdie', 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 2017, 'Elara Pictures, Rhea Films, Hercules Film Fund', '102', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yE1c9hj5Hf8a9KplAdRdhADqUro.jpg', 'After a botched bank robbery lands his younger brother in prison, Connie Nikas embarks on a twisted odyssey through New York City\'s underworld to get his brother Nick out of jail.'),
(432, 13649, 'High School Musical 2', 'Kenny Ortega', 'Zac Efron, Vanessa Hudgens, Ashley French, Lucas Grabeel, Corbin Bleu, Olesya Rulin', 'Peter Barsocchini', 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 2007, 'First Street Films, Salty Pictures, Disney Channel', '111', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqImEYXsDIlzPpu0KxyTXIx7smW.jpg', 'The East High Wildcats are gearing up for big fun as they land the coolest summer jobs imaginable. Troy, Gabriella, Chad, and Taylor have scored sweet gigs at the Lava Springs Country Club owned by Sharpay and Ryan\'s family. Sharpay\'s first rule of business: Get Troy. As Troy experiences a life of privilege he\'s never known, will he give up the Wildcats and Gabriella to rise to the top?'),
(433, 11887, 'High School Musical 3: Senior Year', 'Kenny Ortega', 'Zac Efron, Vanessa Hudgens, Ashley French, Lucas Grabeel, Corbin Bleu, Monique Coleman', 'Kenny Ortega', 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 2008, 'Walt Disney Pictures, Borden & Rosenbush Entertainment', '112', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aq2o1wT0crBOTxof36O6KTyjpgE.jpg', 'As seniors in high school, Troy and Gabriella struggle with the idea of being separated from one another as college approaches. Along with the rest of the Wildcats, they stage a spring musical to address their experiences, hopes and fears about their future.'),
(434, 376865, 'High Life', 'Claire Denis', 'Robert Pattinson, Juliette Binoche, Mia Goth, André 3000, Agata Buzek, Lars Eidinger', 'Claire Denis, Jean-Pol Fargeau, Geoff Cox', 'Science Fiction, Drama, Mystery', 2018, 'Andrew Lauren Productions, Pandora Film, Alcatraz Films, The Apocalypse Films, Madants, Match&Spark', '113', 2.9, 'FR', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wElOvH7H6sLElsTOLu1MY6oWRUx.jpg', 'Monte and his daughter are the last survivors of a damned and dangerous mission to deep space. The crew—death-row inmates led by a doctor with sinister motives—has vanished. As the mystery of what happened onboard the ship is unraveled, father and daughter must rely on each other to survive as they hurtle toward the oblivion of a black hole.'),
(435, 10054, 'Spy Kids', 'Robert Rodriguez', 'Alexa PenaVega, Daryl Sabara, Antonio Banderas, Carla Gugino, Alan Cumming, Tony Shalhoub', 'Robert Rodriguez', 'Family, Action, Comedy, Adventure, Science Fiction', 2001, 'Troublemaker Studios, Dimension Films, Miramax', '88', 2.9, 'US', 'Español, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3rUkHIAAoKr6jU30q3Db4fcIF9.jpg', 'Carmen and Juni think their parents are boring. Little do they know that in their day, Gregorio and Ingrid Cortez were the top secret agents from their respective countries. They gave up that life to raise their children. Now, the disappearances of several of their old colleagues forces the Cortez\' return from retirement. What they didn\'t count on was Carmen and Juni joining the \"family business.\"'),
(436, 9488, 'Spy Kids 2: The Island of Lost Dreams', 'Robert Rodriguez', 'Alexa PenaVega, Daryl Sabara, Antonio Banderas, Carla Gugino, Steve Buscemi, Mike Judge', 'Robert Rodriguez', 'Family, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction', 2002, 'Dimension Films, Troublemaker Studios', '100', 2.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8pfWCk6SlxxDLXXQdUHdxF5dwJ.jpg', 'Exploring the further adventures of Carmen and Juni Cortez, who have now joined the family spy business as Level 2 OSS agents. Their new mission is to save the world from a mad scientist living on a volcanic island populated by an imaginative menagerie of creatures. On this bizarre island, none of the Cortez\'s gadgets work and they must rely on their wits--and each other--to survive and save the day.'),
(437, 12279, 'Spy Kids 3-D: Game Over', 'Robert Rodriguez', 'Daryl Sabara, Ricardo Montalban, Alexa PenaVega, Sylvester Stallone, Courtney Jines, Ryan Pinkston', 'Robert Rodriguez', 'Family, Action, Comedy, Adventure, Science Fiction', 2003, 'Dimension Films, Troublemaker Studios', '84', 2.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buA8dN4zLNr0dYBeKfHfMnEfdLE.jpg', 'Carmen\'s caught in a virtual reality game designed by the Kids\' new nemesis, the Toymaker. It\'s up to Juni to save his sister, and ultimately the world.'),
(438, 1164, 'Babel', 'Alejandro G. Iñárritu', 'Brad Pitt, Rinko Kikuchi, Adriana Barraza, Cate Blanchett, Satoshi Nikaido, Said Tarchani', 'Alejandro G. Iñárritu', 'Drama', 2006, 'Central Films, Zeta Film, Anonymous Content', '143', 3.6, 'US', 'العربية, English, Español, Français, 日本語, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZByZbvU7u14WjoUJERqCRW9saN.jpg', 'Tragedy strikes a married couple vacationing in the Moroccan desert, which jumpstarts an interlocking story involving four different families.'),
(439, 1284041, 'The Last House', 'Louis Leterrier', 'Greta Lee, Wagner Moura, Riley Chung, Noah Alexander Sosnowski, Emma Ho, Gabriel Barbosa', 'Louis Leterrier', 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 2026, 'Chernin Entertainment, 3 Arts Entertainment', '110', 3.4, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JU7E8Vv2M11egkctWVOScxWR75.jpg', 'A family suddenly sealed inside their home must work together to survive against dwindling resources and the ominous threat keeping them trapped.'),
(440, 369972, 'First Man', 'Damien Chazelle', 'Ryan Gosling, Claire Foy, Jason Clarke, Kyle Chandler, Corey Stoll, Patrick Fugit', 'Josh Singer', 'History, Drama', 2018, 'Universal Pictures, DreamWorks Pictures, Temple Hill Entertainment, Perfect World Pictures', '141', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i91mfvFcPPlaegcbOyjGgiWfZzh.jpg', 'A look at the life of the astronaut, Neil Armstrong, and the legendary space mission that led him to become the first man to walk on the Moon on July 20, 1969.'),
(441, 46504, 'Guy and Madeline on a Park Bench', 'Damien Chazelle', 'Jason Palmer, Desiree Garcia, Sandha Khin, Frank Garvin, Bernard Chazelle, Eli Gerstenlauer', 'Damien Chazelle', 'Drama, Music, Romance', 2010, 'Varilight Films, Olive Productions', '83', 2.7, 'US', 'Français, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bu5XiVNVSlJkdihAv7Bnkdah3i.jpg', 'After connecting with the shy Madeline, a jazz trumpeter embarks on a quest for a more gregarious paramour, but through a series of twists and turns punctuated by an original score, the two lovers seem destined to be together.'),
(442, 600354, 'The Father', 'Florian Zeller', 'Anthony Hopkins, Olivia Colman, Mark Gatiss, Olivia Williams, Imogen Poots, Rufus Sewell', 'Florian Zeller, Christopher Hampton', 'Drama', 2020, 'Les Films du Cru, Film4 Productions, F Comme Film, Trademark Films, Ciné-@', '97', 4.0, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pr3bEQ517uMb5loLvjFQi8uLAsp.jpg', 'A man refuses all assistance from his daughter as he ages and, as he tries to make sense of his changing circumstances, he begins to doubt his loved ones, his own mind and even the fabric of his reality.'),
(443, 14574, 'The Boy in the Striped Pyjamas', 'Mark Herman', 'Asa Butterfield, Vera Farmiga, David Thewlis, Jack Scanlon, Amber Beattie, Rupert Friend', 'Mark Herman', 'Drama, War, History', 2008, 'BBC Film, Miramax, Heyday Films', '94', 3.9, 'GB', 'English, Deutsch', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2C8QCXdMlojTxZjfBlINr4FWcb6.jpg', 'When his family moves from their home in Berlin to a strange new house in Poland, young Bruno befriends Shmuel, a boy who lives on the other side of the fence where everyone seems to be wearing striped pajamas. Unaware of Shmuel\'s fate as a Jewish prisoner or the role his own Nazi father plays in his imprisonment, Bruno embarks on a dangerous journey inside the camp\'s walls.'),
(444, 455, 'Bend It Like Beckham', 'Gurinder Chadha', 'Parminder Nagra, Keira Knightley, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Anupam Kher, Shaheen Khan, Archie Panjabi', 'Gurinder Chadha', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 2002, 'Kintop Pictures, Bend It Films, Roc Media, Road Movies', '112', 3.2, 'GB', 'हिन्दी, ਪੰਜਾਬੀ, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dzSBmFWWqt8NbnubJKIWU21Y86.jpg', 'Jess Bhamra, the daughter of a strict Indian couple in London, is not permitted to play organized soccer, even though she is 18. When Jess is playing for fun one day, her impressive skills are seen by Jules Paxton, who then convinces Jess to play for her semi-pro team. Jess uses elaborate excuses to hide her matches from her family while also dealing with her romantic feelings for her coach, Joe.'),
(445, 804150, 'Cocaine Bear', 'Elizabeth Banks', 'Keri Russell, Alden Ehrenreich, O\'Shea Jackson Jr., Ray Liotta, Isiah Whitlock Jr., Brooklynn Prince', 'Elizabeth Banks', 'Thriller, Comedy, Crime', 2023, 'Universal Pictures, Brownstone Productions, Lord Miller, Jurassic Party', '95', 3.0, 'US', 'English, Português', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOnmaxHo0412UVr1QM5Nekv1xPi.jpg', 'Inspired by a true story, an oddball group of cops, criminals, tourists and teens converge in a Georgia forest where a 500-pound black bear goes on a murderous rampage after unintentionally ingesting cocaine.'),
(446, 153, 'Lost in Translation', 'Sofia Coppola', 'Bill Murray, Scarlett Johansson, Giovanni Ribisi, Anna Faris, Akiko Takeshita, Kazuyoshi Minamimagoe', 'Sofia Coppola', 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 2003, 'American Zoetrope, Elemental Films', '102', 3.7, 'US', '日本語, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jCLmYDIIiSMPujbwygNpqdpM8N.jpg', 'Two lost souls visiting Tokyo -- the young, neglected wife of a photographer and a washed-up movie star shooting a TV commercial -- find an odd solace and pensive freedom to be real in each other\'s company, away from their lives in America.'),
(447, 700391, '65', 'Scott Beck', 'Adam Driver, Ariana Greenblatt, Chloe Coleman, Nika King, Brian Dare', 'Scott Beck, Bryan Woods', 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 2023, 'Raimi Productions, Beck/Woods, Bron Studios, Columbia Pictures, TSG Entertainment', '92', 3.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzRb63TldOKdKydCvWJM8B6EkPM.jpg', '65 million years ago, the only 2 survivors of a spaceship from Somaris that crash-landed on Earth, must fend off dinosaurs to reach the escape vessel in time before an imminent asteroid strike threatens to destroy the planet.'),
(448, 421, 'The Life Aquatic with Steve Zissou', 'Wes Anderson', 'Bill Murray, Owen Wilson, Cate Blanchett, Anjelica Huston, Willem Dafoe, Jeff Goldblum', 'Wes Anderson', 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 2004, 'American Empirical Pictures, Touchstone Pictures', '119', 3.5, 'US', 'English, Íslenska, Português, Français, , Deutsch, Italiano', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZoFLNBC78jzboWeDH6Ha0qavF2.jpg', 'Renowned oceanographer Steve Zissou has sworn vengeance upon the rare shark that devoured a member of his crew. In addition to his regular team, he is joined on his boat by Ned, a man who believes Zissou to be his father, and Jane, a journalist pregnant by a married man. They travel the sea, all too often running into pirates and, perhaps more traumatically, various figures from Zissou\'s past, including his estranged wife, Eleanor.'),
(449, 48204, 'Nights and Weekends', 'Joe Swanberg', 'Greta Gerwig, Joe Swanberg, Jay Duplass, Lynn Shelton, Kent Osborne, Elizabeth Donius', 'Joe Swanberg, Greta Gerwig', 'Drama, Romance', 2008, 'filmscience', '80', 2.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFPvD0dxmqrfKu0qqAgzGVEfCn3.jpg', 'A man and woman must face the tension that builds between them during a long-distance relationship.'),
(450, 11545, 'Rushmore', 'Wes Anderson', 'Jason Schwartzman, Bill Murray, Olivia Williams, Seymour Cassel, Brian Cox, Mason Gamble', 'Wes Anderson', 'Comedy, Drama', 1998, 'Touchstone Pictures, American Empirical Pictures', '93', 3.7, 'US', 'Français, English, Latin, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSJ6swahAuZ8wM96lHDTwQPXUvZ.jpg', 'When a beautiful first-grade teacher arrives at a prep school, she soon attracts the attention of an ambitious teenager named Max, who quickly falls in love with her. Max turns to the father of two of his schoolmates for advice on how to woo the teacher. However, the situation soon gets complicated when Max\'s new friend becomes involved with her, setting the two pals against one another in a war for her attention.'),
(451, 83666, 'Moonrise Kingdom', 'Wes Anderson', 'Jared Gilman, Kara Hayward, Bruce Willis, Edward Norton, Bill Murray, Frances McDormand', 'Wes Anderson', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 2012, 'Indian Paintbrush, American Empirical Pictures', '94', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4SXcbNl6CEF2t36icuzuBioj7K.jpg', 'Set on an island off the coast of New England in the summer of 1965, Moonrise Kingdom tells the story of two twelve-year-olds who fall in love, make a secret pact, and run away together into the wilderness. As various authorities try to hunt them down, a violent storm is brewing off-shore – and the peaceful island community is turned upside down in more ways than anyone can handle.'),
(452, 11362, 'The Count of Monte Cristo', 'Kevin Reynolds', 'Jim Caviezel, Guy Pearce, Richard Harris, James Frain, Dagmara Dominczyk, Michael Wincott', 'Jay Wolpert', 'Adventure, Drama, History, Action', 2002, 'Touchstone Pictures, Spyglass Entertainment, World 2000 Entertainment, Count of Monte Cristo Ltd., Epsilon Motion Pictures', '131', 3.8, 'US', 'English, Italiano, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifMgDAUXVQLY4DeOu3VTTi55jSP.jpg', 'Young sailor Edmond Dantès is wrongfully imprisoned, escapes, finds treasure, and reinvents himself as the wealthy Count of Monte Cristo to exact revenge on those who betrayed him.'),
(453, 34584, 'The NeverEnding Story', 'Wolfgang Petersen', 'Noah Hathaway, Barret Oliver, Tami Stronach, Alan Oppenheimer, Sydney Bromley, Patricia Hayes', 'Wolfgang Petersen, Herman Weigel', 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 1984, 'Constantin Film, Bavaria Film', '101', 3.6, 'DE', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddYCa91iDXfJCxaqSYzwi2fjfnl.jpg', 'While hiding from bullies in his school\'s attic, a young boy discovers the extraordinary land of Fantasia, through a magical book called The Neverending Story. The book tells the tale of Atreyu, a young warrior who, with the help of a luck dragon named Falkor, must save Fantasia from the destruction of The Nothing.'),
(454, 8980, 'Mortadelo & Filemon: The Big Adventure', 'Javier Fesser', 'Benito Pocino, Pepe Viyuela, Dominique Pinon, Paco Sagarzazu, Mariano Venancio, Janfri Topera', 'Javier Fesser', 'Action, Comedy', 2003, 'Sogecine, Películas Pendelton, Telecinco, Canal+ España', '103', 3.0, 'ES', 'Català, English, Français, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tiP17WpKYLotQwg4EUs0UfmQq24.jpg', 'In the Headquarters of the T.I.A. (Terminal Intelligence Agency), someone has stolen Professor Bacterio\'s most dangerous invention, the D.O.T. (Demoralizer of Troops), an artifact that ends up in the hands of a very short, wacky dictator who is ready to use it for criminal purposes. The T.I.A Chief, though, is firm in his resolve: if he wants to get the D.O.T. back, he must NOT count on his agents Mortadelo & Filemon. But when the crime fighting duo discover that the T.I.A. has engaged a cocky and slimy detective from outside the agency, they decide to act at their own risk, even if that risk involves all of Humanity.'),
(455, 80446, 'Mortadelo & Filemon: Mission: Save the Planet', 'Miguel Bardem', 'Edu Soto, Pepe Viyuela, Berta Ojea, Janfri Topera, Mariano Venancio, Carlos Santos', 'Miguel Bardem, Carlos Martín, Juan Vicente Pozuelo', 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family', 2008, 'Zeta Studios, Atresmedia', '101', 2.3, 'ES', 'Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKtrg4JyfyYXIMiUH45wjloc9kg.jpg', 'The planet is facing a great threat. During the worst drought ever known, a group of wrongdoers are in the process of finishing all the reserves of water that remain on Earth. The best secret agents in the world meet urgently, but they don\'t even have a clue. To make things even worse, the evil Botijola plans to sabotage the meeting. His intention is to convert the water into a substitute. In order to do this, he also tries to kidnap mad Professor Bacterio and get him to work for him. However, there are two things Botijola wasn\'t expecting. On the one hand, Bacterio, before being kidnapped, hid the parts of his invention in different historical moments, using a time machine. On the other hand, there are two international agents who haven\'t turned up at the sabotaged meeting, two agents who become the world\'s only hope: Mortadelo and Filemón.'),
(456, 15515, 'The 7th Voyage of Sinbad', 'Nathan Juran', 'Kerwin Mathews, Kathryn Grant, Torin Thatcher, Richard Eyer, Alec Mango, Danny Green', 'Nathan Juran', 'Action, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 1958, 'Morningside Productions, Columbia Pictures', '88', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZKfMySjut6QxLNTyMkzrCBZyxP.jpg', 'When a princess is shrunken by an evil wizard, Sinbad must undertake a quest to an island of monsters to cure her and prevent a war.'),
(457, 11551, 'Small Soldiers', 'Joe Dante', 'Gregory Smith, Kirsten Dunst, Denis Leary, Phil Hartman, David Cross, Jay Mohr', 'Gavin Scott, Ted Elliott, Adam Rifkin', 'Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Action', 1998, 'DreamWorks Pictures, Universal Pictures, Amblin Entertainment', '110', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nuUjSzHsoYlRvTPmLo7m7gCQry.jpg', 'When missile technology is used to enhance toy action figures, the toys soon begin to take their battle programming too seriously.'),
(458, 9428, 'The Royal Tenenbaums', 'Wes Anderson', 'Gene Hackman, Anjelica Huston, Ben Stiller, Gwyneth Paltrow, Luke Wilson, Owen Wilson', 'Wes Anderson', 'Comedy, Drama', 2001, 'Touchstone Pictures, American Empirical Pictures', '110', 3.7, 'US', 'English, Italiano', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nG7hZJn7wQTSDCQT39Gy3s3tbrp.jpg', 'Royal Tenenbaum and his wife Etheline had three children and then they separated. All three children are extraordinary --- all geniuses. Virtually all memory of the brilliance of the young Tenenbaums was subsequently erased by two decades of betrayal, failure, and disaster. Most of this was generally considered to be their father\'s fault. \"The Royal Tenenbaums\" is the story of the family\'s sudden, unexpected reunion one recent winter.'),
(459, 576845, 'Last Night in Soho', 'Edgar Wright', 'Thomasin McKenzie, Anya Taylor-Joy, Matt Smith, Rita Tushingham, Michael Ajao, Synnøve Karlsen', 'Krysty Wilson-Cairns, Edgar Wright', 'Horror, Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 2021, 'Focus Features, Film4 Productions, Working Title Films, Complete Fiction, Perfect World Pictures', '117', 3.6, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1ZRmjlk1BJTY7aASqACfPAaLn2.jpg', 'A young girl, passionate about fashion design, is mysteriously able to enter the 1960s where she encounters her idol, a dazzling wannabe singer. But 1960s London is not what it seems, and time seems to be falling apart with shady consequences.');
INSERT INTO `peliculas` (`idPelicula`, `idApi`, `nombrePelicula`, `directorPelicula`, `actorPelicula`, `guionistaPelicula`, `generoPelicula`, `anoPelicula`, `companiaPelicula`, `duracionPelicula`, `ratingAvgPelicula`, `paisPelicula`, `idiomaPelicula`, `posterPelicula`, `sinopsisPelicula`) VALUES
(460, 120467, 'The Grand Budapest Hotel', 'Wes Anderson', 'Ralph Fiennes, F. Murray Abraham, Mathieu Amalric, Adrien Brody, Willem Dafoe, Jeff Goldblum', 'Wes Anderson', 'Comedy, Drama', 2014, 'Fox Searchlight Pictures, Studio Babelsberg, Indian Paintbrush, TSG Entertainment, American Empirical Pictures', '100', 4.0, 'US', 'English, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWdyYQreja6JGCzqHWXpWHDrrPo.jpg', 'The Grand Budapest Hotel tells of a legendary concierge at a famous European hotel between the wars and his friendship with a young employee who becomes his trusted protégé. The story involves the theft and recovery of a priceless Renaissance painting, the battle for an enormous family fortune and the slow and then sudden upheavals that transformed Europe during the first half of the 20th century.'),
(461, 4538, 'The Darjeeling Limited', 'Wes Anderson', 'Owen Wilson, Adrien Brody, Jason Schwartzman, Amara Karan, Wallace Wolodarsky, Waris Ahluwalia', 'Wes Anderson', 'Adventure, Drama, Comedy', 2007, 'Fox Searchlight Pictures, Collage, American Empirical Pictures', '91', 3.6, 'US', 'English, हिन्दी, Deutsch, བོད་སྐད་།', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSW5OVXTulaIXcoNwJAp5YEKpbP.jpg', 'Three American brothers who have not spoken to each other in a year set off on a train voyage across India with a plan to find themselves and bond with each other -- to become brothers again like they used to be. Their \"spiritual quest\", however, veers rapidly off-course (due to events involving over-the-counter pain killers, Indian cough syrup, and pepper spray).'),
(462, 881164, 'Boston Strangler', 'Matt Ruskin', 'Keira Knightley, Carrie Coon, Chris Cooper, Alessandro Nivola, Rory Cochrane, David Dastmalchian', 'Matt Ruskin', 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 2023, '20th Century Studios, LuckyChap Entertainment, Langley Park Productions, Scott Free Productions', '113', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZJfw78ZyPmgNJ0YJ8070nKEF4Y.jpg', 'Reporters Loretta McLaughlin and Jean Cole bravely pursue the story of the Boston Strangler at great personal risk, putting their own lives on the line in their quest to uncover the truth.'),
(463, 391713, 'Lady Bird', 'Greta Gerwig', 'Saoirse Ronan, Laurie Metcalf, Tracy Letts, Lucas Hedges, Timothée Chalamet, Beanie Feldstein', 'Greta Gerwig', 'Drama, Comedy', 2017, 'IAC Films, Scott Rudin Productions, Entertainment 360', '94', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gl66K7zRdtNYGrxyS2YDUP5ASZd.jpg', 'Lady Bird McPherson, a strong willed, deeply opinionated, artistic 17 year old comes of age in Sacramento. Her relationship with her mother and her upbringing are questioned and tested as she plans to head off to college.'),
(464, 809, 'Shrek 2', 'Conrad Vernon', 'Mike Myers, Eddie Murphy, Cameron Diaz, Julie Andrews, Antonio Banderas, John Cleese', 'Andrew Adamson, J. David Stem, Joe Stillman', 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 2004, 'DreamWorks Animation, Pacific Data Images', '92', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yYP0PQjG8zVqturh1BAqu2Tixl.jpg', 'Happily ever after never seemed so far far away when a trip to meet the in-laws turns into a hilariously twisted adventure for Shrek and Fiona. With the help of ever-faithful Donkey, Shrek takes on the potion-brewing Fairy Godmother, pompous Prince Charming, and infamous ogre-killer Puss In Boots.'),
(465, 11970, 'Hercules', 'Ron Clements', 'Tate Donovan, Josh Keaton, Roger Bart, Danny DeVito, James Woods, Susan Egan', 'John Musker, Ron Clements, Don McEnery', 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 1997, 'Walt Disney Feature Animation', '93', 3.7, 'US', 'English, Español, ελληνικά', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dK9rNoC97tgX3xXg5zdxFisdfcp.jpg', 'Bestowed with superhuman strength, a young mortal named Hercules sets out to prove himself a hero in the eyes of his father, the great god Zeus. Along with his friends Pegasus, a flying horse, and Phil, a personal trainer, Hercules is tricked by the hilarious, hotheaded villain Hades, who\'s plotting to take over Mount Olympus!'),
(466, 404368, 'Ralph Breaks the Internet', 'Rich Moore', 'John C. Reilly, Sarah Silverman, Gal Gadot, Taraji P. Henson, Jack McBrayer, Timothy Simons', 'Pamela Ribon, Phil Johnston', 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 2018, 'Walt Disney Animation Studios', '112', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVCrhBcpDaHGvv7CLYbK6PuXZo1.jpg', 'Video game bad guy Ralph and fellow misfit Vanellope von Schweetz must risk it all by traveling to the World Wide Web in search of a replacement part to save Vanellope\'s video game, Sugar Rush. In way over their heads, Ralph and Vanellope rely on the citizens of the internet — the netizens — to help navigate their way, including an entrepreneur named Yesss, who is the head algorithm and the heart and soul of trend-making site BuzzzTube.'),
(467, 11533, 'Jason and the Argonauts', 'Don Chaffey', 'Todd Armstrong, Nancy Kovack, Gary Raymond, Laurence Naismith, Niall MacGinnis, Michael Gwynn', 'Beverley Cross, Jan Read', 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 1963, 'Morningside Productions, Columbia Pictures', '104', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHVxIgqD5CxlOI5GHxvVSt5Zh5Y.jpg', 'Jason, a fearless sailor and explorer, returns to his home land of Thessaly after a long voyage to claim his rightful throne. He learns, however, that he must first find the magical Golden Fleece. To do so, he must embark on an epic quest fraught with fantastic monsters and terrible perils.'),
(468, 10315, 'Fantastic Mr. Fox', 'Wes Anderson', 'George Clooney, Meryl Streep, Jason Schwartzman, Eric Chase Anderson, Wallace Wolodarsky, Willem Dafoe', 'Noah Baumbach, Wes Anderson', 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 2009, 'Regency Enterprises, Indian Paintbrush, American Empirical Pictures', '87', 3.9, 'US', 'English, Français, Latin', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euZyZb6iGreujYKrGyZHRddhUYh.jpg', 'The Fantastic Mr. Fox, bored with his current life, plans a heist against the three local farmers. The farmers, tired of sharing their chickens with the sly fox, seek revenge against him and his family.'),
(469, 13685, 'Bottle Rocket', 'Wes Anderson', 'Luke Wilson, Owen Wilson, Robert Musgrave, Lumi Cavazos, James Caan, Andrew Wilson', 'Wes Anderson', 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 1996, 'Gracie Films, Columbia Pictures, Boyle-Taylor Productions', '91', 3.3, 'US', 'Español, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6E7mJ5wpzTFbYFbJvTzzZ8Til9C.jpg', 'Upon his release from a mental hospital following a nervous breakdown, the directionless Anthony joins his friend Dignan, who seems far less sane than the former. Dignan has hatched a harebrained scheme for an as-yet-unspecified crime spree that somehow involves his former boss, the (supposedly) legendary Mr. Henry.'),
(470, 766475, 'See How They Run', 'Tom George', 'Sam Rockwell, Saoirse Ronan, Adrien Brody, Ruth Wilson, Reece Shearsmith, Harris Dickinson', 'Tom George', 'Mystery, Comedy, Crime', 2022, 'Searchlight Pictures, DJ Films, TSG Entertainment', '99', 3.2, 'GB', 'English, Italiano', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3rpSAi2yukZwr9H2km0WKGODWo.jpg', 'In the West End of 1950s London, plans for a movie version of a smash-hit play come to an abrupt halt after a pivotal member of the crew is murdered. When world-weary Inspector Stoppard and eager rookie Constable Stalker take on the case, the two find themselves thrown into a puzzling whodunit within the glamorously sordid theater underground, investigating the mysterious homicide at their own peril.'),
(471, 800787, 'A Good Person', 'Zach Braff', 'Florence Pugh, Morgan Freeman, Molly Shannon, Celeste O\'Connor, Zoe Lister-Jones, Chinaza Uche', 'Zach Braff', 'Drama, Comedy', 2023, 'Killer Films, Elevation Pictures, RocketScience', '128', 3.5, 'US', 'English, Türkçe', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhejMQdsqPtTTCKIkyoJ5FLfC3F.jpg', 'Allison\'s life falls apart following her involvement in a fatal accident. The unlikely relationship she forms with her would-be father-in-law helps her live a life worth living.'),
(472, 788977, 'Cairo Conspiracy', 'Tarik Saleh', 'Tawfeek Barhom, Fares Fares, Mohammad Bakri, Makram J. Khoury, Mehdi Dehbi, Younes Medhat', 'Tarik Saleh', 'Thriller', 2022, 'Atmo Production, Memento Production, Bufo, ARTE France Cinéma, Final Cut for Real, Mikael Ahlström Films, Haymaker, Film i Väst, SVT', '121', 3.4, 'FR', 'العربية', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDRAA4UJWgQnSFxhJuefnwO74v5.jpg', 'A fisherman\'s son is offered the ultimate privilege to study at the Al-Azhar University in Cairo, the epicenter of power of Sunni Islam. Shortly after his arrival, the university’s highest ranking religious leader, the Grand Imam, dies and the young student becomes a pawn in a ruthless power struggle between Egypt\'s religious and political elite.'),
(473, 760099, 'Living', 'Oliver Hermanus', 'Bill Nighy, Aimee Lou Wood, Alex Sharp, Tom Burke, Adrian Rawlins, Oliver Chris', 'Oliver Hermanus', 'Drama', 2022, 'Number 9 Films, Film4 Productions, County Hall Arts, Lipsync Productions, RocketScience, Kurosawa Production, Filmgate Films, Film i Väst, Woolley/Karlsen Productions', '102', 3.5, 'GB', 'English, Português, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUJcp0rpUqp2GSk7t9jvAiZsXtM.jpg', 'London, 1953. Mr. Williams, a veteran civil servant, is an important cog within the city\'s bureaucracy as it struggles to rebuild in the aftermath of World War II. Buried under paperwork at the office and lonely at home, his life has long felt empty and meaningless. Then a devastating medical diagnosis forces him to take stock, and to try and grasp some fulfilment before it passes permanently beyond reach.'),
(474, 868759, 'Ghosted', 'Dexter Fletcher', 'Chris Evans, Ana de Armas, Adrien Brody, Mike Moh, Amy Sedaris, Tate Donovan', 'Rhett Reese, Paul Wernick, Chris McKenna', 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 2023, 'Skydance Media', '117', 3.4, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liLN69YgoovHVgmlHJ876PKi5Yi.jpg', 'Salt-of-the-earth Cole falls head over heels for enigmatic Sadie—but then makes the shocking discovery that she\'s a secret agent. Before they can decide on a second date, Cole and Sadie are swept away on an international adventure to save the world.'),
(475, 470, '21 Grams', 'Alejandro G. Iñárritu', 'Sean Penn, Naomi Watts, Benicio del Toro, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Danny Huston, Melissa Leo', 'Alejandro G. Iñárritu', 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 2003, 'This is that, Y Productions, Focus Features', '124', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZ0l6or5juuVWqDkLEgaghs4f9l.jpg', 'Paul Rivers, an ailing mathematician lovelessly married to an English émigré; Christina Peck, an upper-middle-class suburban housewife and mother of two girls; and Jack Jordan, a born-again ex-con, are brought together by a terrible accident that changes their lives.'),
(476, 45958, 'Biutiful', 'Alejandro G. Iñárritu', 'Javier Bardem, Maricel Álvarez, Hanaa Bouchaib, Guillermo Estrella, Eduard Fernández, Cheikh Ndiaye', 'Alejandro G. Iñárritu', 'Drama', 2010, 'Menage Atroz, Mod Producciones, Focus Features, Ikiru Films, Cha Cha Chá', '148', 3.6, 'MX', '广州话 / 廣州話, Wolof, 普通话, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BLshBMp8INRDhvfuKwxMlHDIIt.jpg', 'This is a story of a man in free fall. On the road to redemption, darkness lights his way. Connected with the afterlife, Uxbal is a tragic hero and father of two who\'s sensing the danger of death. He struggles with a tainted reality and a fate that works against him in order to forgive, for love, and forever.'),
(477, 10818, 'Water Lilies', 'Céline Sciamma', 'Pauline Acquart, Louise Blachère, Adèle Haenel, Warren Jacquin, Christel Baras, Marie Gili-Pierre', 'Céline Sciamma', 'Drama, Romance', 2007, 'Balthazar Productions, Lilies Films', '85', 3.3, 'FR', 'Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNrs9disgGDtOORToDt5dIqYFBi.jpg', 'Set during a sultry summer in a French suburb, Marie is desperate to join the local pool\'s synchronized swimming team, but is her interest solely for the sake of sport or for a chance to get close to Floriane, the bad girl of the team? Sciamma, and the two leads, capture the uncertainty of teenage sexuality with a sympathetic eye in this delicate drama of the angst of coming-of-age.'),
(478, 798286, 'Beau Is Afraid', 'Ari Aster', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Patti LuPone, Amy Ryan, Nathan Lane, Kylie Rogers, Denis Ménochet', 'Ari Aster', 'Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 2023, 'A24, Square Peg, IPR.VC, Access Entertainment', '179', 3.4, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgVkkjigF31r1nZV80uV0xNIoun.jpg', 'Following the sudden death of his mother, a mild-mannered but anxiety-ridden man confronts his darkest fears as he embarks on an epic odyssey back home.'),
(479, 447365, 'Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 3', 'James Gunn', 'Chris Pratt, Zoe Saldaña, Dave Bautista, Karen Gillan, Pom Klementieff, Vin Diesel', 'James Gunn', 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 2023, 'Marvel Studios, Kevin Feige Productions', '150', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2J02Z2OpNTctfOSN1Ydgii51I3.jpg', 'Peter Quill, still reeling from the loss of Gamora, must rally his team around him to defend the universe along with protecting one of their own. A mission that, if not completed successfully, could quite possibly lead to the end of the Guardians as we know them.'),
(480, 616037, 'Thor: Love and Thunder', 'Taika Waititi', 'Chris Hemsworth, Natalie Portman, Christian Bale, Tessa Thompson, Taika Waititi, Russell Crowe', 'Taika Waititi', 'Fantasy, Action, Comedy', 2022, 'Marvel Studios, Kevin Feige Productions', '119', 3.2, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIkRyD18kl4FhoCNQuWxWu5cBLM.jpg', 'After his retirement is interrupted by Gorr the God Butcher, a galactic killer who seeks the extinction of the gods, Thor Odinson enlists the help of King Valkyrie, Korg, and ex-girlfriend Jane Foster, who now wields Mjolnir as the Mighty Thor. Together they embark upon a harrowing cosmic adventure to uncover the mystery of the God Butcher’s vengeance and stop him before it’s too late.'),
(481, 65229, 'Tomboy', 'Céline Sciamma', 'Zoé Héran, Malonn Lévana, Jeanne Disson, Sophie Cattani, Mathieu Demy, Rayan Boubekri', 'Céline Sciamma', 'Drama', 2011, 'Lilies Films, Hold Up Films, ARTE France Cinéma', '82', 3.7, 'FR', 'Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plEV1Q5u5caYASlG3pq3ON7acN7.jpg', 'Ten-year-old Laure isn\'t like most girls. She prefers football to dolls and sweaters to dresses. When Laure and her family move to a new neighbourhood, local girl Lisa mistakes Laure for a boy. Indulging in this exciting new identity, Laure becomes Mickaël, and so begins a summer of long sunny afternoons, playground games and first kisses. Yet with the school term fast approaching, and with suspicions arising amongst friends and family, Laure must face up to an uncertain future.'),
(482, 8914, 'Deep Blue Sea', 'Renny Harlin', 'Saffron Burrows, Thomas Jane, LL Cool J, Samuel L. Jackson, Jacqueline McKenzie, Michael Rapaport', 'Donna Powers, Duncan Kennedy', 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 1999, 'Riche-Ludwig Productions, Village Roadshow Pictures, Groucho III Film Partnership, Warner Bros. Pictures', '105', 3.0, 'AU, US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyn0zyCI4kIlbDoHH0Hzv09hDC5.jpg', 'Researchers on the undersea lab Aquatica have genetically altered the brains of captive sharks to develop a cure for Alzheimer\'s disease. But there\'s an unexpected side effect: the sharks got smarter, faster, and more dangerous. After a big storm damages their remote research facility, they must fight for their lives.'),
(483, 567609, 'Ready or Not', 'Matt Bettinelli-Olpin', 'Samara Weaving, Adam Brody, Mark O\'Brien, Henry Czerny, Andie MacDowell, Melanie Scrofano', 'Tyler Gillett, Matt Bettinelli-Olpin', 'Horror, Comedy', 2019, 'Mythology Entertainment, Vinson Films, Fox Searchlight Pictures, Radio Silence, TSG Entertainment', '96', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJD9KQFoObZmxAS1je56SIFVNJt.jpg', 'A young bride\'s wedding night turns into her worst nightmare when her ridiculously rich in-laws force her to play a gruesome game of hide-and-seek.'),
(484, 266082, 'Girlhood', 'Céline Sciamma', 'Karidja Touré, Assa Sylla, Lindsay Karamoh, Mariétou Touré, Idrissa Diabaté, Cyril Mendy', 'Céline Sciamma', 'Drama', 2014, 'Hold Up Films, Lilies Films, ARTE France Cinéma', '112', 3.2, 'FR', 'Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZ52DlSVguX0WHYoiOD464IIONd.jpg', 'Oppressed by her family setting, dead-end school prospects and the boys law in the neighborhood, Marieme starts a new life after meeting a group of three free-spirited girls. She changes her name, her dress code, and quits school to be accepted in the gang, hoping that this will be a way to freedom.'),
(485, 749004, 'Petite Maman', 'Céline Sciamma', 'Joséphine Sanz, Gabrielle Sanz, Nina Meurisse, Stéphane Varupenne, Margot Abascal, Florès Cardo', 'Céline Sciamma', 'Drama, Fantasy', 2021, 'Lilies Films, France 3 Cinéma', '72', 3.5, 'FR', 'English, Português, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMghdAE1eRk8PdpDftsA574zs0S.jpg', 'After the death of her beloved grandmother, eight-year-old Nelly meets a strangely familiar girl her own age in the woods. Instantly forming a connection with this mysterious new friend, Nelly embarks on a fantastical journey of discovery which helps her come to terms with this newfound loss.'),
(486, 774752, 'The Guardians of the Galaxy Holiday Special', 'James Gunn', 'Chris Pratt, Dave Bautista, Karen Gillan, Pom Klementieff, Vin Diesel, Bradley Cooper', 'James Gunn', 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Adventure', 2022, 'Marvel Studios, Kevin Feige Productions, Troll Court Entertainment', '45', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dqXyslZ2hv49Oiob9UjlGSHSTR.jpg', 'On a mission to make Christmas unforgettable for Quill, the Guardians head to Earth in search of the perfect present.'),
(487, 245891, 'John Wick', 'Chad Stahelski', 'Keanu Reeves, Michael Nyqvist, Alfie Allen, Willem Dafoe, Dean Winters, Adrianne Palicki', 'Chad Stahelski', 'Action, Thriller', 2014, '87Eleven, DefyNite Films, MJW Films, Thunder Road', '101', 3.7, 'US', 'Magyar, English, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXqWR7dHncNRbxoEGybEy7QTe9h.jpg', 'Ex-hitman John Wick comes out of retirement to track down the gangsters that took everything from him.'),
(488, 324552, 'John Wick: Chapter 2', 'Chad Stahelski', 'Keanu Reeves, Common, Laurence Fishburne, Riccardo Scamarcio, Ruby Rose, Lance Reddick', 'Chad Stahelski', 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 2017, 'Thunder Road, 87Eleven, Summit Entertainment', '122', 3.7, 'US', 'English, עִבְרִית, Italiano, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXWBc0ioZP3cN4zCu6SN3YHXZVO.jpg', 'John Wick is forced out of retirement by a former associate looking to seize control of a shadowy international assassins’ guild. Bound by a blood oath to aid him, Wick travels to Rome and does battle against some of the world’s most dangerous killers.'),
(489, 458156, 'John Wick: Chapter 3 - Parabellum', 'Chad Stahelski', 'Keanu Reeves, Halle Berry, Ian McShane, Laurence Fishburne, Mark Dacascos, Asia Kate Dillon', 'Marc Abrams, Chris Collins, Derek Kolstad', 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 2019, 'Thunder Road, Lionsgate, 87Eleven', '131', 3.7, 'US', 'العربية, 普通话, English, Bahasa indonesia, Italiano, 日本語, Latin, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziEuG1essDuWuC5lpWUaw1uXY2O.jpg', 'Super-assassin John Wick returns with a $14 million price tag on his head and an army of bounty-hunting killers on his trail. After killing a member of the shadowy international assassin’s guild, the High Table, John Wick is excommunicado, but the world’s most ruthless hit men and women await his every turn.'),
(490, 17654, 'District 9', 'Neill Blomkamp', 'Sharlto Copley, Jason Cope, Nathalie Boltt, Sylvaine Strike, Elizabeth Mkandawie, John Sumner', 'Neill Blomkamp', 'Science Fiction', 2009, 'TriStar Pictures, Block / Hanson, WingNut Films, District 9', '112', 3.7, 'US', 'Afrikaans, isiZulu, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tuGlQkqLxnodDSk6mp5c2wvxUEd.jpg', 'Thirty years ago, aliens arrive on Earth. Not to conquer or give aid, but to find refuge from their dying planet. Separated from humans in a South African area called District 9, the aliens are managed by Multi-National United, which is unconcerned with the aliens\' welfare but will do anything to master their advanced technology. When a company field agent contracts a mysterious virus that begins to alter his DNA, there is only one place he can hide: District 9.'),
(491, 603692, 'John Wick: Chapter 4', 'Chad Stahelski', 'Keanu Reeves, Donnie Yen, Bill Skarsgård, Ian McShane, Laurence Fishburne, Lance Reddick', 'Chad Stahelski', 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 2023, 'Thunder Road, 87Eleven, Studio Babelsberg, Lionsgate', '170', 3.9, 'US', 'العربية, 广州话 / 廣州話, English, Français, Deutsch, 日本語, Latin, Pусский, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZloFAK7NmvMGKE7VkF5UHaz0I.jpg', 'With the price on his head ever increasing, John Wick uncovers a path to defeating The High Table. But before he can earn his freedom, Wick must face off against a new enemy with powerful alliances across the globe and forces that turn old friends into foes.'),
(492, 6977, 'No Country for Old Men', 'Joel Coen', 'Javier Bardem, Tommy Lee Jones, Josh Brolin, Woody Harrelson, Kelly Macdonald, Garret Dillahunt', 'Joel Coen, Ethan Coen', 'Crime, Thriller, Western', 2007, 'Miramax, Paramount Vantage, Scott Rudin Productions, Mike Zoss Productions', '122', 4.0, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6d5XOczc226jECq0LIX0siKtgHR.jpg', 'Llewelyn Moss stumbles upon dead bodies, $2 million and a hoard of heroin in a Texas desert, but methodical killer Anton Chigurh comes looking for it, with local sheriff Ed Tom Bell hot on his trail. The roles of prey and predator blur as the violent pursuit of money and justice collide.'),
(493, 275, 'Fargo', 'Joel Coen', 'Frances McDormand, William H. Macy, Steve Buscemi, Peter Stormare, Harve Presnell, John Carroll Lynch', 'Joel Coen, Ethan Coen', 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 1996, 'PolyGram Filmed Entertainment, Working Title Films', '98', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rt7cpEr1uP6RTZykBFhBTcRaKvG.jpg', 'Jerry, a small-town Minnesota car salesman is bursting at the seams with debt... but he\'s got a plan. He\'s going to hire two thugs to kidnap his wife in a scheme to collect a hefty ransom from his wealthy father-in-law. It\'s going to be a snap and nobody\'s going to get hurt... until people start dying. Enter Police Chief Marge, a coffee-drinking, parka-wearing - and extremely pregnant - investigator who\'ll stop at nothing to get her man. And if you think her small-time investigative skills will give the crooks a run for their ransom... you betcha!'),
(494, 399174, 'Isle of Dogs', 'Wes Anderson', 'Bryan Cranston, Koyu Rankin, Bob Balaban, Edward Norton, Bill Murray, Jeff Goldblum', 'Wes Anderson', 'Adventure, Comedy, Animation', 2018, 'Studio Babelsberg, American Empirical Pictures, Indian Paintbrush, Scott Rudin Productions', '101', 3.9, 'US', 'English, 日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0nUX6Q1ZB0P2t1Jo6EeFSVnOGQ.jpg', 'In the future, an outbreak of canine flu leads the mayor of a Japanese city to banish all dogs to an island used as a garbage dump. The outcasts must soon embark on an epic journey when a 12-year-old boy arrives on the island to find his beloved pet.'),
(495, 600583, 'The Power of the Dog', 'Jane Campion', 'Benedict Cumberbatch, Kodi Smit-McPhee, Kirsten Dunst, Jesse Plemons, Thomasin McKenzie, Geneviève Lemon', 'Jane Campion', 'Drama, Western', 2021, 'See-Saw Films, Max Films, Brightstar, New Zealand Film Commission, Cross City Films, BBC Film, Bad Girl Creek', '127', 3.4, 'AU', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEy48iCzGnp0ao1cZbNeWR6yIhC.jpg', 'A domineering but charismatic rancher wages a war of intimidation on his brother\'s new wife and her teen son, until long-hidden secrets come to light.'),
(496, 394117, 'The Florida Project', 'Sean Baker', 'Brooklynn Prince, Bria Vinaite, Willem Dafoe, Christopher Rivera, Valeria Cotto, Mela Murder', 'Sean Baker', 'Drama', 2017, 'Cre Film, Freestyle Picture Company, June Pictures', '112', 3.7, 'US', 'English, Português, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QnDxdJg1fi6uMSkSi4x8tHsltm.jpg', 'The story of a precocious six year-old and her ragtag group of friends whose summer break is filled with childhood wonder, possibility and a sense of adventure while the adults around them struggle with hard times.'),
(497, 718032, 'Licorice Pizza', 'Paul Thomas Anderson', 'Alana Haim, Cooper Hoffman, Sean Penn, Tom Waits, Bradley Cooper, Benny Safdie', 'Paul Thomas Anderson', 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 2021, 'Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer, Focus Features, Bron Studios, Ghoulardi Film Company', '133', 3.5, 'US, CA', 'English, 日本語, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ivXtvzfliGvoJ1DhSHIGyYBToWe.jpg', 'The story of Gary Valentine and Alana Kane growing up, running around and going through the treacherous navigation of first love in the San Fernando Valley, 1973.'),
