(606, 1053600, '20,000 Species of Bees', 'Estibaliz Urresola Solaguren', 'Sofía Otero, Patricia López Arnaiz, Ane Gabarain, Itziar Lazkano, Martxelo Rubio, Sara Cózar', 'Estibaliz Urresola Solaguren', 'Drama', 2023, 'Gariza Films, Inicia Films, Sirimiri Films, Especies de Abejas, EiTB', '127', 3.5, 'ES', 'euskera, Français, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MEEVVyZ1L9Lr8GeSOyFiGM3cmB.jpg', 'Lucía is an eight-year-old girl, who sometimes struggles as the world tries to catch up with the fact that she is trans. As the summer holidays pass, she explores her femininity alongside the women of her family who at the same time reflect on their own femininity.'),
(607, 20770, 'But I\'m a Cheerleader', 'Jamie Babbit', 'Natasha Lyonne, Clea DuVall, Cathy Moriarty, RuPaul, Melanie Lynskey, Katharine Towne', 'Brian Peterson', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 2000, 'Ignite Entertainment, The Kushner-Locke Company, HKM Films', '85', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8huDg3Q0EmcWuN9HgYsO8ylAp9f.jpg', 'Megan is an all-American girl. A cheerleader. She has a boyfriend. But Megan doesn\'t like kissing her boyfriend very much. And she\'s pretty touchy with her cheerleader friends. Her conservative parents worry that she must be a lesbian and send her off to \"sexual redirection\" school, where she must, with other lesbians and gays learn how to be straight.'),
(608, 792307, 'Poor Things', 'Yorgos Lanthimos', 'Emma Stone, Mark Ruffalo, Willem Dafoe, Ramy Youssef, Christopher Abbott, Suzy Bemba', 'Tony McNamara', 'Science Fiction, Romance, Comedy', 2023, 'Searchlight Pictures, Film4 Productions, TSG Entertainment, Element Pictures, Limp, Fruit Tree', '141', 3.8, 'US', 'English, Français, Português', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCGlIMHnOm8JPXq3rXM6c5wMxcT.jpg', 'Brought back to life by an unorthodox scientist, a young woman runs off with a lawyer on a whirlwind adventure across the continents. Free from the prejudices of her times, she grows steadfast in her purpose to stand for equality and liberation.'),
(609, 365620, 'Ferrari', 'Michael Mann', 'Adam Driver, Penélope Cruz, Shailene Woodley, Gabriel Leone, Sarah Gadon, Jack O\'Connell', 'Michael Mann', 'History, Drama', 2023, 'STXfilms, Forward Pass, Storyteller Productions, Ketchup Entertainment, Esme Grace Media, Cecchi Gori USA, Red Sea Fund, Iervolino & Lady Bacardi Entertainment', '131', 3.2, 'IT, US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LyCOcGqOTyTmaXu2TK8LfGveIb.jpg', 'Set during the summer of 1957. Ex-racecar driver, Enzo Ferrari, is in crisis. Bankruptcy stalks the company he and his wife, Laura, built from nothing ten years earlier. Their tempestuous marriage struggles with the mourning for one son and the acknowledgement of another.'),
(610, 335787, 'Uncharted', 'Ruben Fleischer', 'Tom Holland, Mark Wahlberg, Sophia Ali, Tati Gabrielle, Antonio Banderas, Steven Waddington', 'Rafe Judkins, Art Marcum, Matt Holloway', 'Action, Adventure, Mystery', 2022, 'Columbia Pictures, Atlas Entertainment, PlayStation Productions, Arad Productions', '116', 3.4, 'US', 'Español, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJHC1RUORuUhtfNb4Npclx0xnOf.jpg', 'A young street-smart, Nathan Drake and his wisecracking partner Victor “Sully” Sullivan embark on a dangerous pursuit of “the greatest treasure never found” while also tracking clues that may lead to Nathan’s long-lost brother.'),
(611, 664300, 'Shiva Baby', 'Emma Seligman', 'Rachel Sennott, Molly Gordon, Polly Draper, Danny Deferrari, Fred Melamed, Dianna Agron', 'Emma Seligman', 'Comedy, Drama', 2021, 'Neon Heart Productions, Dimbo Pictures, It Doesn\'t Suck Productions, Bad Mensch Productions, Thick Media, Irving Harvey', '78', 3.5, 'US', 'English, עִבְרִית', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sdqVsT6SHqtbCYZS7bhVoEftlL.jpg', 'College student Danielle must cover her tracks when she unexpectedly runs into her sugar daddy at a shiva - with her parents, ex-girlfriend and family friends also in attendance.'),
(612, 615457, 'Nobody', 'Ilya Naishuller', 'Bob Odenkirk, Aleksey Serebryakov, Connie Nielsen, Christopher Lloyd, Michael Ironside, Colin Salmon', 'Derek Kolstad', 'Action, Thriller', 2021, '87North Productions, OPE Partners, Eighty Two Films', '91', 3.9, 'US', 'English, Pусский, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBgWY00bEFeZ9N25wWVyuQddbAo.jpg', 'Hutch Mansell, a suburban dad, overlooked husband, nothing neighbor — a \"nobody.\" When two thieves break into his home one night, Hutch\'s unknown long-simmering rage is ignited and propels him on a brutal path that will uncover dark secrets he fought to leave behind.'),
(613, 1108427, 'Moana', 'Thomas Kail', 'Catherine Lagaʻaia, Dwayne Johnson, Rena Owen, John Tui, Frankie Adams, Jemaine Clement', 'Jared Bush, Dana Ledoux Miller', 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure', 2026, 'Walt Disney Pictures, Seven Bucks Productions, Flynn Picture Company, 5000 Broadway Productions', '115', 3.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKVgiv5qHCvCLT4A2ymJi5QeXDH.jpg', 'Teenage Moana answers the Ocean\'s call and, for the first time, voyages beyond the reef of her island of Motunui with infamous demigod Maui on an unforgettable journey to restore prosperity to her people.'),
(614, 387426, 'Okja', 'Bong Joon Ho', 'An Seo-hyun, Tilda Swinton, Paul Dano, Steven Yeun, Jake Gyllenhaal, Giancarlo Esposito', 'Jon Ronson, Bong Joon Ho', 'Adventure, Drama, Science Fiction, Action', 2017, 'Kate Street Picture Company, Plan B Entertainment, Lewis Pictures', '120', 3.7, 'US', 'English, Español, 한국어/조선말', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHlRr2MfjK77VIIAO7p0R4jhsJI.jpg', 'A young girl named Mija risks everything to prevent a powerful, multi-national company from kidnapping her best friend - a massive animal named Okja.'),
(615, 1056360, 'American Fiction', 'Cord Jefferson', 'Jeffrey Wright, John Ortiz, Erika Alexander, Leslie Uggams, Sterling K. Brown, Skyler Wright', 'Cord Jefferson', 'Comedy, Drama', 2023, 'MRC, T-Street, 3 Arts Entertainment, Almost Infinite', '117', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57MFWGHarg9jid7yfDTka4RmcMU.jpg', 'A novelist fed up with the establishment profiting from \"Black\" entertainment uses a pen name to write a book that propels him into the heart of hypocrisy and the madness he claims to disdain.'),
(616, 615643, 'Minari', 'Lee Isaac Chung', 'Steven Yeun, Han Ye-ri, Youn Yuh-jung, Will Patton, Alan Kim, Noel Kate Cho', 'Lee Isaac Chung', 'Drama', 2021, 'Plan B Entertainment', '115', 3.7, 'US', 'English, 한국어/조선말', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mPNdmjdbVKPITv3LLCmQoKs9Zw.jpg', 'A Korean American family moves to an Arkansas farm in search of its own American dream. Amidst the challenges of this new life in the strange and rugged Ozarks, they discover the undeniable resilience of family and what really makes a home.'),
(617, 169813, 'Short Term 12', 'Destin Daniel Cretton', 'Brie Larson, John Gallagher Jr., Kaitlyn Dever, Rami Malek, LaKeith Stanfield, Kevin Hernandez', 'Destin Daniel Cretton', 'Drama', 2013, 'Traction Media, Animal Kingdom', '96', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRYip0xx8sxM1TvgDQdK2YKV5pw.jpg', 'Grace, a compassionate young supervisor at a foster care facility, helps at-risk teens. But when a new charge dredges up memories of her own troubled past, Grace\'s tough exterior begins eroding.'),
(618, 1014209, 'Suncoast', 'Laura Chinn', 'Nico Parker, Laura Linney, Woody Harrelson, Daniella Taylor, Ella Anderson, Amarr M. Wooten', 'Laura Chinn', 'Drama, Comedy', 2024, 'Searchlight Pictures, Freestyle Picture Company, Seven Deuce Entertainment', '109', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmPLUp5lVMiGomkN3db1WPeNrz3.jpg', 'While caring for her brother along with her audacious mother, a teenager strikes up an unlikely friendship with an eccentric activist who is protesting one of the most landmark medical cases of all time.'),
(619, 320007, 'Victoria', 'Sebastian Schipper', 'Laia Costa, Frederick Lau, Franz Rogowski, Max Mauff, Burak Yiğit, André Hennicke', 'Sebastian Schipper', 'Crime, Thriller, Romance', 2015, 'MonkeyBoy, RadicalMedia, Deutschfilm, WDR, ARTE', '138', 3.8, 'DE', 'Deutsch, Español, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9P8QgfoMcFX7vp2Gj2cYFecHVRZ.jpg', 'A young Spanish woman who has newly moved to Berlin finds her flirtation with a local guy turn potentially deadly as their night out with his friends reveals a dangerous secret.'),
(620, 850165, 'The Iron Claw', 'Sean Durkin', 'Zac Efron, Jeremy Allen White, Harris Dickinson, Stanley Simons, Holt McCallany, Maura Tierney', 'Sean Durkin', 'Drama, History', 2023, 'House Productions, BBC Film, A24, Access Entertainment', '133', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2VLjcykJfwplJNGT5iEeCA0mRx.jpg', 'The true story of the inseparable Von Erich brothers, who made history in the intensely competitive world of professional wrestling in the early 1980s. Through tragedy and triumph, under the shadow of their domineering father and coach, the brothers seek larger-than-life immortality on the biggest stage in sports.'),
(621, 660120, 'The Worst Person in the World', 'Joachim Trier', 'Renate Reinsve, Anders Danielsen Lie, Herbert Nordrum, Hans Olav Brenner, Helene Bjørneby, Vidar Sandem', 'Joachim Trier', 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 2021, 'Oslo Pictures, Film i Väst, Snowglobe, B-Reel Films, ARTE France Cinéma, MK Productions, mk2 Films', '128', 3.7, 'NO', 'Norsk', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NxGNQchGBTHXJ6RShLY1IlZqWn.jpg', 'The chronicles of four years in the life of Julie, a young woman who navigates the troubled waters of her love life and struggles to find her career path, leading her to take a realistic look at who she really is.');
INSERT INTO `peliculas` (`idPelicula`, `idApi`, `nombrePelicula`, `directorPelicula`, `actorPelicula`, `guionistaPelicula`, `generoPelicula`, `anoPelicula`, `companiaPelicula`, `duracionPelicula`, `ratingAvgPelicula`, `paisPelicula`, `idiomaPelicula`, `posterPelicula`, `sinopsisPelicula`) VALUES
(622, 501929, 'The Mitchells vs. the Machines', 'Mike Rianda', 'Abbi Jacobson, Danny McBride, Maya Rudolph, Mike Rianda, Eric André, Olivia Colman', 'Mike Rianda', 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 2021, 'Lord Miller, Columbia Pictures, Sony Pictures Animation, One Cool Films', '110', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mI2Di7HmskQQ34kz0iau6J1vr70.jpg', 'A quirky, dysfunctional family\'s road trip is upended when they find themselves in the middle of the robot apocalypse and suddenly become humanity\'s unlikeliest last hope.'),
(623, 869626, 'Marcel the Shell with Shoes On', 'Dean Fleischer Camp', 'Jenny Slate, Dean Fleischer Camp, Isabella Rossellini, Joe Gabler, Shari Finkelstein, Sam Painter', 'Jenny Slate, Dean Fleischer Camp, Nick Paley', 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Family', 2022, 'Cinereach, Chiodo Bros. Productions, You Want I Should, Human Woman, Sunbeam TV & Films', '90', 3.8, 'US', 'Español, English, Português', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaYmP4Ct8YLnxWAW2oYkUjeXtzm.jpg', 'Marcel is an adorable one-inch-tall shell who ekes out a colorful existence with his grandmother Connie and their pet lint, Alan. Once part of a sprawling community of shells, they now live alone as the sole survivors of a mysterious tragedy. When a documentarian discovers them amongst the clutter of his Airbnb, his resulting short film brings Marcel millions of passionate fans, as well as unprecedented dangers and a new hope at finding his long-lost family.'),
(624, 258480, 'Carol', 'Todd Haynes', 'Cate Blanchett, Rooney Mara, Kyle Chandler, Jake Lacy, Sarah Paulson, John Magaro', 'Phyllis Nagy', 'Romance, Drama', 2015, 'Killer Films, Number 9 Films, Film4 Productions, Dirty Films', '118', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJeled7EyPdur6TnCA5GYg0UVna.jpg', 'In 1950s New York, a department-store clerk who dreams of a better life falls for an older, married woman.'),
(625, 994108, 'All of Us Strangers', 'Andrew Haigh', 'Andrew Scott, Paul Mescal, Carter John Grout, Jamie Bell, Claire Foy, Ami Tredrea', 'Andrew Haigh', 'Romance, Drama, Fantasy', 2023, 'Film4 Productions, Blueprint Pictures, Searchlight Pictures, TSG Entertainment', '105', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aviJMFZSnnCAsCVyJGaPNx4Ef3i.jpg', 'One night in his near-empty tower block in contemporary London, Adam has a chance encounter with a mysterious neighbor, which punctures the rhythm of his everyday life.'),
(626, 791177, 'Bones and All', 'Luca Guadagnino', 'Taylor Russell, Timothée Chalamet, Mark Rylance, Anna Cobb, André Holland, David Gordon Green', 'David Kajganich', 'Horror, Romance, Drama', 2022, 'Frenesy Film, Per Capita Productions, MeMo Films, The Apartment Pictures, 3 Marys Entertainment, Tenderstories, Elafilm', '131', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBQuk2LkHjrDsSjueirPQg96GCc.jpg', 'Abandoned by her father, a young woman embarks on a thousand-mile odyssey through the backroads of America where she meets a disenfranchised drifter. But despite their best efforts, all roads lead back to their terrifying pasts and to a final stand that will determine whether their love can survive their otherness.'),
(627, 635731, 'Pig', 'Michael Sarnoski', 'Nicolas Cage, Alex Wolff, Adam Arkin, Nina Belforte, Gretchen Corbett, Dalene Young', 'Michael Sarnoski', 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 2021, 'AI Film, Pulse Films, Saturn Films, Valparaiso Pictures, BlockBox Entertainment, Endeavor Content', '92', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1InMm4Mbjx8wCKvIy5gglo5i3HN.jpg', 'A truffle hunter who lives alone in the Oregon wilderness must visit Portland to find the mysterious person who stole his beloved foraging pig.'),
(628, 438631, 'Dune', 'Denis Villeneuve', 'Timothée Chalamet, Rebecca Ferguson, Oscar Isaac, Jason Momoa, Stellan Skarsgård, Stephen McKinley Henderson', 'Eric Roth, Denis Villeneuve, Jon Spaihts', 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 2021, 'Legendary Pictures', '155', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1tRXZ4JtD2Iv6fjkPvT4GiwslV.jpg', 'Paul Atreides, a brilliant and gifted young man born into a great destiny beyond his understanding, must travel to the most dangerous planet in the universe to ensure the future of his family and his people. As malevolent forces explode into conflict over the planet\'s exclusive supply of the most precious resource in existence - a commodity capable of unlocking humanity\'s greatest potential - only those who can conquer their fear will survive.'),
(629, 115, 'The Big Lebowski', 'Joel Coen', 'Jeff Bridges, John Goodman, Julianne Moore, Steve Buscemi, David Huddleston, Philip Seymour Hoffman', 'Joel Coen, Ethan Coen', 'Comedy, Crime', 1998, 'PolyGram Filmed Entertainment, Working Title Films', '117', 3.9, 'US', 'English, עִבְרִית, Español, Deutsch', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bv6WAp6BSxxYvB5ozKFUYuRA8C.jpg', 'Jeffrey \'The Dude\' Lebowski, a Los Angeles slacker who only wants to bowl and drink White Russians, is mistaken for another Jeffrey Lebowski, a wheelchair-bound millionaire, and finds himself dragged into a strange series of events involving nihilists, adult film producers, ferrets, errant toes, and large sums of money.'),
(630, 693134, 'Dune: Part Two', 'Denis Villeneuve', 'Timothée Chalamet, Zendaya, Rebecca Ferguson, Javier Bardem, Josh Brolin, Austin Butler', 'Denis Villeneuve, Jon Spaihts', 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 2024, 'Legendary Pictures', '167', 4.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6izwz7rsy95ARzTR3poZ8H6c5pp.jpg', 'Follow the mythic journey of Paul Atreides as he unites with Chani and the Fremen while on a path of revenge against the conspirators who destroyed his family. Facing a choice between the love of his life and the fate of the known universe, Paul endeavors to prevent a terrible future only he can foresee.'),
(631, 823754, 'Bo Burnham: Inside', 'Bo Burnham', 'Bo Burnham', 'Bo Burnham', 'Comedy', 2021, 'Attic Bedroom', '88', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ku1UvTWYvhFQbSesOD6zteY7bXT.jpg', 'Stuck in COVID-19 lockdown, US comedian and musician Bo Burnham attempts to stay sane and happy by writing, shooting and performing a one-man comedy special.'),
(632, 763215, 'Damsel', 'Juan Carlos Fresnadillo', 'Millie Bobby Brown, Brooke Carter, Nick Robinson, Robin Wright, Milo Twomey, Ray Winstone', 'Dan Mazeau', 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 2024, 'PCMA Productions, Roth-Kirschenbaum Films, Palma Pictures', '107', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgHbB9DCE9aE57zkHjSmseszh6e.jpg', 'A young woman\'s marriage to a charming prince turns into a fierce fight for survival when she\'s offered up as a sacrifice to a fire-breathing dragon.'),
(633, 957304, 'Drive-Away Dolls', 'Ethan Coen', 'Margaret Qualley, Geraldine Viswanathan, Beanie Feldstein, Joey Slotnick, C.J. Wilson, Colman Domingo', 'Ethan Coen', 'Comedy, Crime', 2024, 'Focus Features, Working Title Films', '84', 2.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QPKmqntFgLm6sB47AtSelEGGPM.jpg', 'Jamie, an uninhibited free spirit bemoaning yet another breakup with a girlfriend, and her demure friend Marian desperately needs to loosen up. In search of a fresh start, the two embark on an impromptu road trip to Tallahassee, but things quickly go awry when they cross paths with a group of inept criminals along the way.'),
(634, 12573, 'A Serious Man', 'Joel Coen', 'Michael Stuhlbarg, Richard Kind, Fred Melamed, Sari Lennick, Aaron Wolff, Jessica McManus', 'Joel Coen, Ethan Coen', 'Comedy, Drama', 2009, 'Focus Features, StudioCanal, Relativity Media, Working Title Films, Mike Zoss Productions', '106', 3.3, 'US', 'עִבְרִית, , Italiano, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gGxDS8WmrebPlMHexVS8EVehiP.jpg', 'It is 1967, and Larry Gopnik, a physics professor at a quiet Midwestern university, has just been informed by his wife Judith that she is leaving him. She has fallen in love with one of his more pompous acquaintances Sy Ableman.'),
(635, 1541, 'Thelma & Louise', 'Ridley Scott', 'Susan Sarandon, Geena Davis, Harvey Keitel, Michael Madsen, Christopher McDonald, Stephen Tobolowsky', 'Ridley Scott', 'Drama, Crime, Adventure', 1991, 'Scott Free Productions, Star Partners III, MGM-Pathé Communications, Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer', '130', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbRAGLzbC75QfiKD1lKjmnQGuph.jpg', 'Taking a break from their dreary lives, close friends Thelma and Louise embark on a short weekend trip that ends in unforeseen incriminating circumstances. As fugitives, both women rediscover the strength of their bond and their newfound resilience.'),
(636, 916405, 'The Quiet Girl', 'Colm Bairéad', 'Catherine Clinch, Andrew Bennett, Carrie Crowley, Michael Patric, Kate Nic Chonaonaigh, Joan Sheehy', 'Colm Bairéad', 'Drama', 2022, 'Inscéal, Fís Éireann/Screen Ireland, TG4', '95', 3.7, 'IE', 'Gaeilge, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Njyz53N417cgxE0d7cBEWHUEjc.jpg', 'A quiet, neglected girl is sent away from her dysfunctional family to live with relatives for the summer. She blossoms in their care, but in this house where there are meant to be no secrets, she discovers one.'),
(637, 62215, 'Melancholia', 'Lars von Trier', 'Kirsten Dunst, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Kiefer Sutherland, Alexander Skarsgård, Cameron Spurr, Stellan Skarsgård', 'Lars von Trier', 'Drama, Science Fiction', 2011, 'Zentropa Entertainments, Memfis Film, Zentropa International Sweden, Slot Machine, Liberator Productions, Zentropa International Köln, DR, Film i Väst, ARTE France Cinéma', '136', 3.6, 'DK', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMneszMiQuTKY8JUXrGGB5vwqJf.jpg', 'Two sisters find their already strained relationship challenged as a mysterious new planet threatens to collide with Earth.'),
(638, 694, 'The Shining', 'Stanley Kubrick', 'Jack Nicholson, Shelley Duvall, Danny Lloyd, Scatman Crothers, Barry Nelson, Philip Stone', 'Diane Johnson, Stanley Kubrick', 'Horror, Thriller', 1980, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Peregrine, Hawk Films, The Producer Circle Co.', '144', 4.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAR0AWqhQL1hQa69UDEbb2rE5Wx.jpg', 'Jack Torrance accepts a caretaker job at the Overlook Hotel, where he, along with his wife Wendy and their son Danny, must live isolated from the rest of the world for the winter. But they aren\'t prepared for the madness that lurks within.'),
(639, 968441, 'Música', 'Rudy Mancuso', 'Rudy Mancuso, Camila Mendes, Francesca Reale, Maria Mancuso, JB Smoove, Andy Grotelueschen', 'Rudy Mancuso', 'Romance, Comedy, Music', 2024, 'Wonderland Sound and Vision, Shots Studios, Amazon MGM Studios', '91', 3.2, 'US', 'English, Português', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUX5ourGUJDG0yvEeS3uooZS0dS.jpg', 'A young man, plagued by the music in his head, has to come to terms with an uncertain future while balancing love, family and Brazilian culture in Newark, New Jersey.'),
(640, 1008042, 'Talk to Me', 'Danny Philippou', 'Sophie Wilde, Alexandra Jensen, Joe Bird, Otis Dhanji, Miranda Otto, Zoe Terakes', 'Michael Philippou, Danny Philippou', 'Horror, Thriller', 2023, 'Causeway Films, Screen Australia, South Australian Film Corporation, Bankside Films, Head Gear Films, Metrol Technology', '95', 3.6, 'AU', 'Français, ελληνικά, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdPMUMJzyYAc4roD52qavX0nLIC.jpg', 'When a group of friends discover how to conjure spirits using an embalmed hand, they become hooked on the new thrill, until one of them goes too far and unleashes terrifying supernatural forces.'),
(641, 334541, 'Manchester by the Sea', 'Kenneth Lonergan', 'Casey Affleck, Lucas Hedges, Michelle Williams, Kyle Chandler, C.J. Wilson, Gretchen Mol', 'Kenneth Lonergan', 'Drama', 2016, 'Pearl Street Films, K Period Media, B Story, The Affleck/Middleton Project, The Media Farm, Big Indie Pictures', '138', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9VXYOuaJxCEKOxbA86xqtwmqYn.jpg', 'After his older brother passes away, Lee Chandler is forced to return home to care for his 16-year-old nephew. There he is compelled to deal with a tragic past that separated him from his family and the community where he was born and raised.'),
(642, 62, '2001: A Space Odyssey', 'Stanley Kubrick', 'Keir Dullea, Gary Lockwood, William Sylvester, Douglas Rain, Daniel Richter, Leonard Rossiter', 'Stanley Kubrick, Arthur C. Clarke', 'Science Fiction, Mystery, Adventure', 1968, 'Stanley Kubrick Productions, Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer', '149', 4.0, 'US', 'English, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ve72VxNqjGM69Uky4WTo2bK6rfq.jpg', 'Humanity finds a mysterious object buried beneath the lunar surface and sets off to find its origins with the help of HAL 9000, the world\'s most advanced super computer.'),
(643, 520023, 'Bodies Bodies Bodies', 'Halina Reijn', 'Amandla Stenberg, Maria Bakalova, Myha\'la, Rachel Sennott, Chase Sui Wonders, Pete Davidson', 'Sarah DeLappe', 'Comedy, Mystery, Horror', 2022, 'A24, 2AM', '94', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSuTjDmqRdy7Dii8ymnF2WILTeP.jpg', 'In an isolated family mansion, a group of rich 20-somethings decides to play Bodies Bodies Bodies, a game where one of them is secretly a \"killer\" while the rest tries to \"escape\". Things take a turn for the worse when real bodies start turning up, setting off a paranoid and dangerous chain of events.'),
(644, 975773, 'Wicked Little Letters', 'Thea Sharrock', 'Olivia Colman, Jessie Buckley, Anjana Vasan, Timothy Spall, Gemma Jones, Malachi Kirby', 'Thea Sharrock', 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 2024, 'Blueprint Pictures, South of the River Pictures, Film4 Productions, People Person Pictures, StudioCanal UK', '100', 3.5, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scAU7YudKNVeZlOfgSEWntAUSJ.jpg', 'When the denizens of Littlehampton – including conservative Edith – begin receiving letters full of hilarious profanities, rowdy Irish migrant Rose is charged with the crime. Suspecting something amiss, the town\'s women band together to investigate.'),
(645, 554230, 'The Lost Daughter', 'Maggie Gyllenhaal', 'Olivia Colman, Jessie Buckley, Dakota Johnson, Ed Harris, Paul Mescal, Peter Sarsgaard', 'Maggie Gyllenhaal', 'Drama', 2021, 'Endeavor Content, Samuel Marshall Productions, Media Finance Capital, Faliro House Productions, Pie Films', '122', 3.2, 'GB, US', 'English, ελληνικά, Italiano', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1oLNRFixpFOVsyz1HCqCUW3wiW.jpg', 'A woman\'s seaside vacation takes a dark turn when her obsession with a young mother forces her to confront secrets from her past.'),
(646, 929590, 'Civil War', 'Alex Garland', 'Kirsten Dunst, Wagner Moura, Cailee Spaeny, Stephen McKinley Henderson, Nelson Lee, Nick Offerman', 'Alex Garland', 'War, Action, Drama', 2024, 'DNA Films, IPR.VC, A24', '109', 3.4, 'GB, US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sh7Rg8Er3tFcN9BpKIPOMvALgZd.jpg', 'In the near future, a group of war journalists attempt to survive while reporting the truth as the United States stands on the brink of civil war.'),
(647, 938614, 'Late Night with the Devil', 'Cameron Cairnes', 'David Dastmalchian, Laura Gordon, Ian Bliss, Fayssal Bazzi, Ingrid Torelli, Rhys Auteri', 'Cameron Cairnes, Colin Cairnes', 'Horror', 2024, 'Spooky Pictures, Future Pictures, Good Fiend Films, VicScreen, AGC Studios, Image Nation Abu Dhabi', '93', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mu8LRWT9GHkfiyHm7kgxT6YNvMW.jpg', 'A live broadcast of a late-night talk show in 1977 goes horribly wrong, unleashing evil into the nation\'s living rooms.'),
(648, 852247, 'Problemista', 'Julio Torres', 'Julio Torres, Tilda Swinton, RZA, Isabella Rossellini, Catalina Saavedra, James Scully', 'Julio Torres', 'Comedy', 2024, 'A24, Fruit Tree', '104', 3.4, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8R5s0optPNlTncP876bK8gWGkRK.jpg', 'Alejandro is an aspiring toy designer from El Salvador, struggling to bring his unusual ideas to life in New York City. As time on his work visa runs out, a job assisting an erratic art-world outcast becomes his only hope to stay in the country and realize his dream.'),
(649, 934632, 'Rebel Moon - Part Two: The Scargiver', 'Zack Snyder', 'Sofia Boutella, Djimon Hounsou, Ed Skrein, Michiel Huisman, Bae Doona, Staz Nair', 'Kurt Johnstad, Shay Hatten, Zack Snyder', 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 2024, 'The Stone Quarry, Grand Electric', '121', 3.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95gnJZIk2rEkMO0Ch46x5CVjnms.jpg', 'The rebels gear up for battle against the ruthless forces of the Motherworld as unbreakable bonds are forged, heroes emerge — and legends are made.'),
(650, 560016, 'Monkey Man', 'Dev Patel', 'Dev Patel, Sikandar Kher, Makrand Deshpande, Pitobash, Vipin Sharma, Ashwini Kalsekar', 'Paul Angunawela, Dev Patel, John Collee', 'Thriller, Crime, Action', 2024, 'Thunder Road, Bron Studios, Monkeypaw Productions, Minor Realm, Creative Wealth Media Finance, S\'YA Concept, WME Independent', '122', 3.4, 'US', 'हिन्दी, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4lhR4L2vzzjl68P1zJyCH755Oz4.jpg', 'Kid is an anonymous young man who ekes out a meager living in an underground fight club where, night after night, wearing a gorilla mask, he is beaten bloody by more popular fighters for cash. After years of suppressed rage, Kid discovers a way to infiltrate the enclave of the city’s sinister elite. As his childhood trauma boils over, his mysteriously scarred hands unleash an explosive campaign of retribution to settle the score with the men who took everything from him.'),
(651, 578, 'Jaws', 'Steven Spielberg', 'Roy Scheider, Robert Shaw, Richard Dreyfuss, Lorraine Gary, Murray Hamilton, Carl Gottlieb', 'Carl Gottlieb, Peter Benchley', 'Horror, Thriller, Adventure', 1975, 'The Zanuck/Brown Company, Universal Pictures', '124', 3.8, 'AU, US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxM6kqilAdpdhqUl2biYp5frUxE.jpg', 'When the seaside community of Amity finds itself under attack by a dangerous great white shark, the town\'s chief of police, a young marine biologist, and a grizzled shark hunter embark on a desperate quest to kill the beast before it strikes again.'),
(652, 329, 'Jurassic Park', 'Steven Spielberg', 'Sam Neill, Laura Dern, Jeff Goldblum, Richard Attenborough, Bob Peck, Martin Ferrero', 'Michael Crichton, David Koepp', 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 1993, 'Universal Pictures, Amblin Entertainment', '127', 4.0, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63viWuPfYQjRYLSZSZNq7dglJP5.jpg', 'A wealthy entrepreneur secretly creates a theme park featuring living dinosaurs drawn from prehistoric DNA. Before opening day, he invites a team of experts and his two eager grandchildren to experience the park and help calm anxious investors. However, the park is anything but amusing as the security systems go off-line and the dinosaurs escape.'),
(653, 600, 'Full Metal Jacket', 'Stanley Kubrick', 'Matthew Modine, Adam Baldwin, Vincent D\'Onofrio, R. Lee Ermey, Dorian Harewood, Kevyn Major Howard', 'Gustav Hasford, Stanley Kubrick, Michael Herr', 'Drama, War', 1987, 'Natant, Stanley Kubrick Productions, Warner Bros. Pictures', '117', 4.1, 'US', 'English, Tiếng Việt', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMKyx1k8hWWscYFnPbnxxN4Eqo4.jpg', 'A pragmatic U.S. Marine observes the dehumanizing effects the U.S.-Vietnam War has on his fellow recruits from their brutal boot camp training to the bloody street fighting in Hue.'),
(654, 940721, 'Godzilla Minus One', 'Takashi Yamazaki', 'Ryunosuke Kamiki, Minami Hamabe, Yuki Yamada, Munetaka Aoki, Hidetaka Yoshioka, Sakura Ando', 'Takashi Yamazaki', 'Science Fiction, Horror, Action', 2023, 'TOHO, TOHO Studios, Robot Communications', '125', 3.8, 'JP', 'English, 日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2E2WTX0TJEflAged6kzErwqX1kt.jpg', 'In postwar Japan, Godzilla brings new devastation to an already scorched landscape. With no military intervention or government help in sight, the survivors must join together in the face of despair and fight back against an unrelenting horror.'),
(655, 746036, 'The Fall Guy', 'David Leitch', 'Ryan Gosling, Emily Blunt, Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Hannah Waddingham, Teresa Palmer, Stephanie Hsu', 'David Leitch', 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 2024, '87North Productions, Entertainment 360, Universal Pictures, Australian Government', '127', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7olqFmzcIX5c23kX4zSmLPJi8c.jpg', 'Fresh off an almost career-ending accident, stuntman Colt Seavers has to track down a missing movie star, solve a conspiracy and try to win back the love of his life while still doing his day job.'),
(656, 119450, 'Dawn of the Planet of the Apes', 'Matt Reeves', 'Andy Serkis, Jason Clarke, Toby Kebbell, Gary Oldman, Keri Russell, Kodi Smit-McPhee', 'Matt Reeves', 'Science Fiction, Action, Drama, Thriller', 2014, 'TSG Entertainment, Chernin Entertainment, Ingenious Media, 20th Century Fox', '130', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSmAc9G25fhOHH45SLEeagR0qi7.jpg', 'A group of scientists in San Francisco struggle to stay alive in the aftermath of a plague that is wiping out humanity, while Caesar tries to maintain dominance over his community of intelligent apes.'),
(657, 7131, 'Van Helsing', 'Stephen Sommers', 'Hugh Jackman, Kate Beckinsale, Richard Roxburgh, Josie Maran, David Wenham, Shuler Hensley', 'Stephen Sommers', 'Horror, Adventure, Action', 2004, 'Universal Pictures, The Sommers Company, Stillking Films', '132', 3.2, 'US', 'English, Latin', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsFun8nATm52aGHeT8ueAel98nE.jpg', 'Famed monster slayer Gabriel Van Helsing is dispatched to Transylvania to assist the last of the Valerious bloodline in defeating Count Dracula. Anna Valerious reveals that Dracula has formed an unholy alliance with Dr. Frankenstein\'s monster and is hell-bent on exacting a centuries-old curse on her family.'),
(658, 869, 'Planet of the Apes', 'Tim Burton', 'Mark Wahlberg, Tim Roth, Helena Bonham Carter, Michael Clarke Duncan, Paul Giamatti, Estella Warren', 'Lawrence Konner, Mark Rosenthal, William Broyles Jr.', 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 2001, '20th Century Fox, The Zanuck Company', '120', 2.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZWsuP5rExMSji7erxnb1P5SK6F.jpg', 'After a spectacular crash-landing on an uncharted planet, brash astronaut Leo Davidson finds himself trapped in a savage world where talking apes dominate the human race. Desperate to find a way home, Leo must evade the invincible gorilla army led by Ruthless General Thade.'),
(659, 653346, 'Kingdom of the Planet of the Apes', 'Wes Ball', 'Owen Teague, Freya Allan, Kevin Durand, Peter Macon, William H. Macy, Eka Darville', 'Wes Ball', 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 2024, '20th Century Studios, Oddball Entertainment, Jason T. Reed Productions, TSG Entertainment', '145', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKkl37BQuKTanygYQG1pyYgLVgf.jpg', 'Several generations following Caesar\'s reign, apes – now the dominant species – live harmoniously while humans have been reduced to living in the shadows. As a new tyrannical ape leader builds his empire, one young ape undertakes a harrowing journey that will cause him to question all he\'s known about the past and to make choices that will define a future for apes and humans alike.'),
(660, 185, 'A Clockwork Orange', 'Stanley Kubrick', 'Malcolm McDowell, Patrick Magee, Carl Duering, Michael Bates, Warren Clarke, James Marcus', 'Stanley Kubrick', 'Science Fiction, Crime', 1971, 'Polaris Productions Limited, Warner Bros. Pictures, Hawk Films', '137', 4.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sHeTAp65WrSSuc05nRBKddhBxO.jpg', 'In a near-future Britain, young Alexander DeLarge and his pals get their kicks beating and raping anyone they please. When not destroying the lives of others, Alex swoons to the music of Beethoven. The state, eager to crack down on juvenile crime, gives an incarcerated Alex the option to undergo an invasive procedure that\'ll rob him of all personal agency. In a time when conscience is a commodity, can Alex change his tune?'),
(661, 12163, 'The Wrestler', 'Darren Aronofsky', 'Mickey Rourke, Marisa Tomei, Evan Rachel Wood, Mark Margolis, Todd Barry, Wass Stevens', 'Darren Aronofsky', 'Drama, Romance', 2008, 'Wild Bunch, Top Rope, Saturn Films, Protozoa Pictures', '109', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OTR8dSoNGjWohJNo3UhIGd3Tj.jpg', 'Aging wrestler Randy \"The Ram\" Robinson is long past his prime but still ready and rarin\' to go on the pro-wrestling circuit. After a particularly brutal beating, however, Randy hangs up his tights, pursues a serious relationship with a long-in-the-tooth stripper, and tries to reconnect with his estranged daughter. But he can\'t resist the lure of the ring and readies himself for a comeback.'),
(662, 630240, 'Titane', 'Julia Ducournau', 'Vincent Lindon, Agathe Rousselle, Garance Marillier, Laïs Salameh, Mara Cissé, Marin Judas', 'Julia Ducournau', 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 2021, 'Kazak Productions, ARTE France Cinéma, Frakas Productions, VOO, BeTV', '108', 3.2, 'FR', 'Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBlpouG3gqB8WLdP65LCOXb3jFb.jpg', 'A woman with a metal plate in her head from a childhood car accident embarks on a bizarre journey, bringing her into contact with a firefighter who\'s reunited with his missing son after 10 years.'),
(663, 281338, 'War for the Planet of the Apes', 'Matt Reeves', 'Andy Serkis, Woody Harrelson, Karin Konoval, Terry Notary, Steve Zahn, Amiah Miller', 'Matt Reeves', 'Drama, Science Fiction, War', 2017, '20th Century Fox, TSG Entertainment, Chernin Entertainment', '140', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vYhLLxrTtZLysXtIWktmd57Snv.jpg', 'Caesar and his apes are forced into a deadly conflict with an army of humans led by a ruthless Colonel. After the apes suffer unimaginable losses, Caesar wrestles with his darker instincts and begins his own mythic quest to avenge his kind. As the journey finally brings them face to face, Caesar and the Colonel are pitted against each other in an epic battle that will determine the fate of both their species and the future of the planet.'),
(664, 103, 'Taxi Driver', 'Martin Scorsese', 'Robert De Niro, Jodie Foster, Cybill Shepherd, Harvey Keitel, Peter Boyle, Leonard Harris', 'Martin Scorsese', 'Crime, Drama', 1976, 'Bill/Phillips Productions, Columbia Pictures', '114', 4.1, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekstpH614fwDX8DUln1a2Opz0N8.jpg', 'Suffering from insomnia, disturbed loner Travis Bickle takes a job as a New York City cabbie, haunting the streets nightly, growing increasingly detached from reality as he dreams of cleaning up the filthy city.'),
(665, 848326, 'Rebel Moon - Part One: A Child of Fire', 'Zack Snyder', 'Sofia Boutella, Djimon Hounsou, Ed Skrein, Michiel Huisman, Bae Doona, Ray Fisher', 'Zack Snyder, Shay Hatten, Kurt Johnstad', 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 2023, 'The Stone Quarry, Grand Electric', '134', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ui4DrH1cKk2vkHshcUcGt2lKxCm.jpg', 'When the ruthless forces of the Motherworld threaten a quiet farming village on a distant moon, a mysterious outsider becomes its best hope for survival.'),
(666, 28, 'Apocalypse Now', 'Francis Ford Coppola', 'Martin Sheen, Marlon Brando, Frederic Forrest, Albert Hall, Laurence Fishburne, Sam Bottoms', 'Francis Ford Coppola', 'Drama, War', 1979, 'American Zoetrope', '147', 4.1, 'US', 'English, Français, Tiếng Việt', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQB8Y5RCMkv2zwzFHbUJX3kAhvA.jpg', 'At the height of the Vietnam war, Captain Benjamin Willard is sent on a dangerous mission that, officially, \"does not exist, nor will it ever exist.\" His goal is to locate - and eliminate - a mysterious Green Beret Colonel named Walter Kurtz, who has been leading his personal army on illegal guerrilla missions into enemy territory.'),
(667, 948549, 'Love Lies Bleeding', 'Rose Glass', 'Kristen Stewart, Katy O\'Brian, Ed Harris, Dave Franco, Jena Malone, Anna Baryshnikov', 'Rose Glass', 'Crime, Romance, Thriller', 2024, 'Film4 Productions, Escape Plan, A24, Lobo Films', '104', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xImj8RLe39YK0lyVu9kXv7ApN8p.jpg', 'Reclusive gym manager Lou falls hard for Jackie, an ambitious bodybuilder headed through town to Las Vegas in pursuit of her dream. But their love ignites violence, pulling them deep into the web of Lou’s criminal family.'),
(668, 786892, 'Furiosa: A Mad Max Saga', 'George Miller', 'Anya Taylor-Joy, Chris Hemsworth, Tom Burke, Alyla Browne, George Shevtsov, Lachy Hulme', 'George Miller', 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 2024, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Kennedy Miller Mitchell, Domain Entertainment', '149', 3.7, 'AU, US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iADOJ8Zymht2JPMoy3R7xceZprc.jpg', 'As the world falls, young Furiosa is snatched from the Green Place of Many Mothers into the hands of a great biker horde led by the warlord Dementus. Sweeping through the wasteland, they encounter the citadel presided over by Immortan Joe. The two tyrants wage war for dominance, and Furiosa must survive many trials as she puts together the means to find her way home.'),
(669, 769, 'GoodFellas', 'Martin Scorsese', 'Robert De Niro, Ray Liotta, Joe Pesci, Lorraine Bracco, Paul Sorvino, Frank Sivero', 'Nicholas Pileggi, Martin Scorsese', 'Drama, Crime', 1990, 'Winkler Films, Warner Bros. Pictures', '145', 4.2, 'US', 'Italiano, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OkCLM73MIU2CrKZbqiT8Ln1wY2.jpg', 'The true story of Henry Hill, a half-Irish, half-Sicilian Brooklyn kid who is adopted by neighbourhood gangsters at an early age and climbs the ranks of a Mafia family under the guidance of Jimmy Conway.'),
(670, 598, 'City of God', 'Fernando Meirelles', 'Alexandre Rodrigues, Leandro Firmino, Phellipe Haagensen, Douglas Silva, Jonathan Haagensen, Matheus Nachtergaele', 'Bráulio Mantovani', 'Drama, Crime', 2002, 'O2 Filmes, VideoFilmes, Wild Bunch, Hank Levine Film & Music, Globo Filmes, Lumière', '129', 4.2, 'BR', 'Português', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7eYdWvhYQyRQoU2TB2A2Xu2TfD.jpg', 'In the poverty-stricken favelas of Rio de Janeiro in the 1970s, two young men choose different paths. Rocket is a budding photographer who documents the increasing drug-related violence of his neighborhood, while José “Zé” Pequeno is an ambitious drug dealer diving into a dangerous life of crime.'),
(671, 1022789, 'Inside Out 2', 'Kelsey Mann', 'Amy Poehler, Maya Hawke, Kensington Tallman, Liza Lapira, Tony Hale, Lewis Black', 'Meg LeFauve, Dave Holstein', 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 2024, 'Pixar', '97', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpnVM9B6NMmQpWeZvzLvDESb2QY.jpg', 'Teenager Riley\'s mind headquarters is undergoing a sudden demolition to make room for something entirely unexpected: new Emotions! Joy, Sadness, Anger, Fear and Disgust, who’ve long been running a successful operation by all accounts, aren’t sure how to feel when Anxiety shows up. And it looks like she’s not alone.'),
(672, 762441, 'A Quiet Place: Day One', 'Michael Sarnoski', 'Lupita Nyong\'o, Joseph Quinn, Alex Wolff, Djimon Hounsou, Eliane Umuhire, Takunda Khumalo', 'Michael Sarnoski', 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 2024, 'Paramount Pictures, Platinum Dunes, Sunday Night Productions', '100', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JhadBY56wfnGUFfTX1ftPW1nyL.jpg', 'As New York City is invaded by alien creatures who hunt by sound, a woman named Sam fights to survive with her cat.'),
(673, 1008409, 'The Bikeriders', 'Jeff Nichols', 'Austin Butler, Jodie Comer, Tom Hardy, Michael Shannon, Mike Faist, Boyd Holbrook', 'Jeff Nichols', 'Crime, Drama', 2024, 'Tri-State Pictures, New Regency Pictures, Regency Enterprises', '116', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApMuukdDAOR2rgaFDZIcjfigi64.jpg', 'After a chance encounter, headstrong Kathy is drawn to Benny, member of Midwestern motorcycle club the Vandals. As the club transforms into a dangerous underworld of violence, Benny must choose between Kathy and his loyalty to the club.'),
(674, 636706, 'Spaceman', 'Johan Renck', 'Adam Sandler, Paul Dano, Carey Mulligan, Kunal Nayyar, Isabella Rossellini, Lena Olin', 'Colby Day', 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Drama', 2024, 'Free Association, Tango Entertainment, Sinestra', '108', 3.4, 'US', 'Český, English, 한국어/조선말', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f46WvKEsBn98WJbPJcO47ZoKn6B.jpg', 'Six months into a solo mission, a lonely astronaut confronts the cracks in his marriage with help from a mysterious creature he discovers on his ship.'),
(676, 1422, 'The Departed', 'Martin Scorsese', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Matt Damon, Jack Nicholson, Mark Wahlberg, Martin Sheen, Ray Winstone', 'William Monahan', 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 2006, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Plan B Entertainment, Initial Entertainment Group, Vertigo Entertainment, Media Asia Films', '151', 4.1, 'US', 'English, 广州话 / 廣州話', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nT97ifVT2J1yMQmeq20Qblg61T.jpg', 'To take down South Boston\'s Irish Mafia, the police send in one of their own to infiltrate the underworld, not realizing the syndicate has done likewise. While an undercover cop curries favor with the mob kingpin, a career criminal rises through the police ranks. But both sides soon discover there\'s a mole among them.'),
(677, 533535, 'Deadpool & Wolverine', 'Shawn Levy', 'Ryan Reynolds, Hugh Jackman, Emma Corrin, Matthew Macfadyen, Dafne Keen, Jon Favreau', 'Shawn Levy', 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 2024, 'Marvel Studios, Maximum Effort, 21 Laps Entertainment, 20th Century Studios, Kevin Feige Productions, TSG Entertainment', '128', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cdWjvZQUExUUTzyp4t6EDMubfO.jpg', 'A listless Wade Wilson toils away in civilian life with his days as the morally flexible mercenary, Deadpool, behind him. But when his homeworld faces an existential threat, Wade must reluctantly suit-up again with an even more reluctant Wolverine.'),
(678, 787699, 'Wonka', 'Paul King', 'Timothée Chalamet, Calah Lane, Keegan-Michael Key, Hugh Grant, Paterson Joseph, Olivia Colman', 'Simon Farnaby, Paul King', 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 2023, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Village Roadshow Pictures, The Roald Dahl Story Company, Heyday Films, Domain Entertainment', '117', 3.5, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhb1qOilapbapxWQn9jtRCMwXJF.jpg', 'Willy Wonka – chock-full of ideas and determined to change the world one delectable bite at a time – is proof that the best things in life begin with a dream, and if you’re lucky enough to meet Willy Wonka, anything is possible.'),
(679, 858017, 'I Saw the TV Glow', 'Jane Schoenbrun', 'Justice Smith, Jack Haven, Ian Foreman, Helena Howard, Lindsey Jordan, Danielle Deadwyler', 'Jane Schoenbrun', 'Drama, Horror', 2024, 'A24, Fruit Tree, Smudge Films, Hypnic Jerk', '100', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hS4GYkYpN1rfl4GIxyc02sCyfAj.jpg', 'In late-90s suburbia, a lonely teenager meets a girl at school who introduces him to a mysterious late-night T.V. show — a vision of a supernatural world pulsing beneath their own. As time goes on, however, questions begin to arise about why the show sometimes seems more real than their own lives. In the pale glow of the television, their view of reality begins to crack.'),
(680, 1023922, 'MaXXXine', 'Ti West', 'Mia Goth, Elizabeth Debicki, Moses Sumney, Michelle Monaghan, Bobby Cannavale, Halsey', 'Ti West', 'Horror', 2024, 'A24, Motel Mojave, Access Entertainment', '103', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArvoFK6nlouZRxYmtIOUzKIrg90.jpg', 'In 1980s Hollywood, adult film star and aspiring actress Maxine Minx finally gets her big break. But as a mysterious killer stalks the starlets of Hollywood, a trail of blood threatens to reveal her sinister past.'),
(681, 1226578, 'Longlegs', 'Osgood Perkins', 'Maika Monroe, Nicolas Cage, Blair Underwood, Alicia Witt, Michelle Choi-Lee, Dakota Daulby', 'Osgood Perkins', 'Crime, Horror, Mystery', 2024, 'C2 Motion Picture Group, Saturn Films, Oddfellows Entertainment, Traffic., Range Media Partners', '101', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1EwNyiiNFd863H4e8nWEzutnZD7.jpg', 'FBI Agent Lee Harker is a gifted new recruit assigned to the unsolved case of an elusive serial killer. As the case takes complex turns, unearthing evidence of the occult, Harker discovers a personal connection to the merciless killer and must race against time to stop him before he claims the lives of another innocent family.'),
(682, 406, 'La Haine', 'Mathieu Kassovitz', 'Vincent Cassel, Hubert Koundé, Saïd Taghmaoui, Abdel Ahmed Ghili, Solo, Joseph Momo', 'Mathieu Kassovitz', 'Drama', 1995, 'Kasso Productions, La Sept Cinéma, Les Productions Lazennec, Canal+, StudioCanal', '98', 4.0, 'FR', 'Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hY4exng4s29RzDbtQInjx9MA3PZ.jpg', 'After a chaotic night of rioting in a marginal suburb of Paris, three young friends, Vinz, Hubert and Saïd, wander around unoccupied waiting for news about the state of health of a mutual friend who has been seriously injured when confronting the police.'),
(683, 1029955, 'Kinds of Kindness', 'Yorgos Lanthimos', 'Emma Stone, Jesse Plemons, Willem Dafoe, Margaret Qualley, Hong Chau, Mamoudou Athie', 'Yorgos Lanthimos', 'Comedy, Drama, Horror', 2024, 'Searchlight Pictures, Film4 Productions, TSG Entertainment, Element Pictures, Limp', '164', 3.2, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50lPmjIpDs8gKfgK7fPIeKzpllh.jpg', 'A triptych fable following a man without choice who tries to take control of his own life; a policeman who is alarmed that his wife who was missing-at-sea has returned and seems a different person; and a woman determined to find a specific someone with a special ability, who is destined to become a prodigious spiritual leader.'),
(684, 1049638, 'Rye Lane', 'Raine Allen-Miller', 'David Jonsson, Vivian Oparah, Poppy Allen-Quarmby, Simon Manyonda, Benjamin Sarpong-Broni, Karene Peter', 'Raine Allen-Miller', 'Comedy, Romance', 2023, 'Searchlight Pictures, BBC Film, BFI, DJ Films, Turnover Films', '82', 3.5, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/int5eEKNc8g0V5i3XYaPeaC6paD.jpg', 'Two twenty-somethings, both reeling from bad break-ups, connect over the course of an eventful day in South London – helping each other deal with their nightmare exes, and potentially restoring their faith in romance.'),
(685, 8321, 'In Bruges', 'Martin McDonagh', 'Colin Farrell, Brendan Gleeson, Ralph Fiennes, Clémence Poésy, Thekla Reuten, Jordan Prentice', 'Martin McDonagh', 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 2008, 'Twins Financing, Blueprint Pictures, Focus Features, Scion Films, Film4 Productions', '108', 3.8, 'US, GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vz3Vd6nfq9YZrVvyYx5RHFaYKV3.jpg', 'Ray and Ken, two hit men, are in Bruges, Belgium, waiting for their next mission. While they are there they have time to think and discuss their previous assignment. When the mission is revealed to Ken, it is not what he expected.'),
(686, 86838, 'Seven Psychopaths', 'Martin McDonagh', 'Colin Farrell, Sam Rockwell, Woody Harrelson, Christopher Walken, Olga Kurylenko, Tom Waits', 'Martin McDonagh', 'Comedy, Crime', 2012, 'BFI, Blueprint Pictures, Film4 Productions, HanWay Films, CBS Films', '110', 3.4, 'GB', 'English, Tiếng Việt', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ukEYAxlSivFcDG6vLxJB6PjTjg.jpg', 'A struggling screenwriter inadvertently becomes entangled in the Los Angeles criminal underworld after his oddball friends kidnap a gangster\'s beloved Shih Tzu.'),
(687, 240, 'The Godfather Part II', 'Francis Ford Coppola', 'Al Pacino, Robert Duvall, Diane Keaton, Robert De Niro, John Cazale, Talia Shire', 'Mario Puzo, Francis Ford Coppola', 'Drama, Crime', 1974, 'Paramount Pictures, The Coppola Company, American Zoetrope', '202', 4.3, 'US', 'English, Italiano, Latin, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hek3koDUyRQk7FIhPXsa6mT2Zc3.jpg', 'In the continuing saga of the Corleone crime family, a young Vito Corleone grows up in Sicily and in 1910s New York. In the 1950s, Michael Corleone attempts to expand the family business into Las Vegas, Hollywood and Cuba.'),
(688, 121986, 'Frances Ha', 'Noah Baumbach', 'Greta Gerwig, Mickey Sumner, Michael Zegen, Adam Driver, Charlotte d\'Amboise, Patrick Heusinger', 'Noah Baumbach', 'Comedy, Drama', 2013, 'Scott Rudin Productions, RT Features, Pine District Pictures', '86', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrq1NoKvsxWCcffVOjegiYwloFN.jpg', 'An aspiring dancer moves to New York City and becomes caught up in a whirlwind of flighty fair-weather friends, diminishing fortunes and career setbacks.'),
(689, 429, 'The Good, the Bad and the Ugly', 'Sergio Leone', 'Clint Eastwood, Eli Wallach, Lee Van Cleef, Aldo Giuffrè, Luigi Pistilli, Rada Rassimov', 'Luciano Vincenzoni, Sergio Leone, Agenore Incrocci', 'Western', 1966, 'United Artists, PEA, Arturo González PC, Constantin Film', '161', 4.3, 'IT', 'Italiano', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bX2xnavhMYjWDoZp1VM6VnU1xwe.jpg', 'While the Civil War rages on between the Union and the Confederacy, three men – a quiet loner, a ruthless hitman, and a Mexican bandit – comb the American Southwest in search of a strongbox containing $200,000 in stolen gold.'),
(690, 957452, 'The Crow', 'Rupert Sanders', 'Bill Skarsgård, FKA twigs, Danny Huston, Josette Simon, Laura Birn, Sami Bouajila', 'William Josef Schneider, Zach Baylin', 'Action, Fantasy, Horror', 2024, 'Davis Films, Pressman Film, Hassell Free Productions, Electric Shadow Company, 30WEST, Ashland Hill Media Finance, FilmNation Entertainment, Maze Pictures, Occupant Entertainment', '111', 2.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8TbOXrNMuqq7AaKqdvqS2oG4ob.jpg', 'Soulmates Eric and Shelly are brutally murdered when the demons of her dark past catch up with them. Given the chance to save his true love by sacrificing himself, Eric sets out to seek merciless revenge on their killers, traversing the worlds of the living and the dead to put the wrong things right.'),
(691, 238, 'The Godfather', 'Francis Ford Coppola', 'Marlon Brando, Al Pacino, James Caan, Robert Duvall, Richard S. Castellano, Diane Keaton', 'Mario Puzo, Francis Ford Coppola', 'Drama, Crime', 1972, 'Paramount Pictures, Alfran Productions, Albert S. Ruddy Productions', '175', 4.3, 'US', 'English, Italiano, Latin', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bhkrj58Vtu7enYsRolD1fZdja1.jpg', 'Spanning the years 1945 to 1955, a chronicle of the fictional Italian-American Corleone crime family. When organized crime family patriarch, Vito Corleone barely survives an attempt on his life, his youngest son, Michael steps in to take care of the would-be killers, launching a campaign of bloody revenge.'),
(692, 242, 'The Godfather Part III', 'Francis Ford Coppola', 'Al Pacino, Diane Keaton, Talia Shire, Andy Garcia, Eli Wallach, Joe Mantegna', 'Mario Puzo, Francis Ford Coppola', 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 1990, 'Paramount Pictures, American Zoetrope', '162', 3.7, 'US', 'English, Italiano, Deutsch, Latin', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lm3pQ2QoQ16pextRsmnUbG2onES.jpg', 'In the midst of trying to legitimize his business dealings in 1979 New York and Italy, aging mafia don, Michael Corleone seeks forgiveness for his sins while taking a young protege under his wing.'),
(693, 25237, 'Come and See', 'Elem Klimov', 'Aleksei Kravchenko, Olga Mironova, Liubomiras Laucevičius, Vladas Bagdonas, Jüri Lumiste, Viktors Lorencs', 'Elem Klimov, Ales Adamovich', 'Drama, War, Horror, History', 1985, 'Belarusfilm, Mosfilm', '142', 4.1, 'SU', 'беларуская мова, Deutsch, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNbMsKVzigERgJUbwf8pKyZogpb.jpg', 'The invasion of a village in Belarus by German forces sends young Florya into the forest to join the weary Resistance fighters, against his family\'s wishes. There he meets a girl, Glasha, who accompanies him back to his village. On returning home, Florya finds his family and fellow peasants massacred. His continued survival amidst the brutal debris of war becomes increasingly nightmarish, a battle between despair and hope.'),
(694, 11216, 'Cinema Paradiso', 'Giuseppe Tornatore', 'Philippe Noiret, Jacques Perrin, Marco Leonardi, Salvatore Cascio, Agnese Nano, Antonella Attili', 'Giuseppe Tornatore', 'Drama, Romance', 1988, 'Cristaldifilm, Les Films Ariane, Rai 3, TF1 Films Production, Forum Picture', '124', 4.2, 'IT', 'Italiano', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCI2AeMV4IHSewhJkzsur5MEp6R.jpg', 'A filmmaker recalls his childhood, when he fell in love with the movies at his village\'s theater and formed a deep friendship with the theater\'s projectionist.'),
(695, 1091, 'The Thing', 'John Carpenter', 'Kurt Russell, Wilford Brimley, T.K. Carter, David Clennon, Keith David, Richard Dysart', 'Bill Lancaster', 'Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 1982, 'Universal Pictures, The Turman-Foster Company', '109', 4.0, 'US', 'English, Norsk', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzGY49kseSE9QAKk47uuDGwnSCu.jpg', 'A research team in Antarctica is hunted by a shape-shifting alien that assumes the appearance of its victims.'),
(696, 510, 'One Flew Over the Cuckoo\'s Nest', 'Miloš Forman', 'Jack Nicholson, Brad Dourif, Louise Fletcher, Danny DeVito, William Redfield, Scatman Crothers', 'Lawrence Hauben, Bo Goldman', 'Drama', 1975, 'Fantasy Films', '135', 4.2, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjWsMh72V6d8KRLV4EOoSJLT1H7.jpg', 'A petty criminal fakes insanity to serve his sentence in a mental ward rather than prison. He soon finds himself as a leader to the other patients—and an enemy to the cruel, domineering nurse who runs the ward.'),
(697, 389, '12 Angry Men', 'Sidney Lumet', 'Martin Balsam, John Fiedler, Lee J. Cobb, E.G. Marshall, Jack Klugman, Edward Binns', 'Reginald Rose', 'Drama', 1957, 'Orion-Nova Productions', '97', 4.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppd84D2i9W8jXmsyInGyihiSyqz.jpg', 'The defense and the prosecution have rested and the jury is filing into the jury room to decide if a young Spanish-American is guilty or innocent of murdering his father. What begins as an open and shut case soon becomes a mini-drama of each of the jurors\' prejudices and preconceptions about the trial, the accused, and each other.'),
(698, 76341, 'Mad Max: Fury Road', 'George Miller', 'Tom Hardy, Charlize Theron, Nicholas Hoult, Hugh Keays-Byrne, Josh Helman, Nathan Jones', 'George Miller', 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 2015, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Village Roadshow Pictures, Kennedy Miller Mitchell, RatPac Entertainment', '121', 3.8, 'AU, US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulcAi4dKpAjHwYGS08vNyx9H6I9.jpg', 'An apocalyptic story set in the furthest reaches of our planet, in a stark desert landscape where humanity is broken, and most everyone is crazed fighting for the necessities of life. Within this world exist two rebels on the run who just might be able to restore order.'),
(699, 207, 'Dead Poets Society', 'Peter Weir', 'Robin Williams, Robert Sean Leonard, Ethan Hawke, Josh Charles, Gale Hansen, Dylan Kussman', 'Peter Weir', 'Drama', 1989, 'A Steven Haft Production, Witt/Thomas Productions, Silver Screen Partners IV, Touchstone Pictures', '129', 4.1, 'US', 'English, Latin', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNvKkSnnn4Z6RCBThyK1gfCSSvv.jpg', 'At an elite, old-fashioned boarding school in New England, a passionate English teacher inspires his students to rebel against convention and seize the potential of every day, courting the disdain of the stern headmaster.'),
(700, 489, 'Good Will Hunting', 'Gus Van Sant', 'Matt Damon, Robin Williams, Ben Affleck, Stellan Skarsgård, Minnie Driver, Casey Affleck', 'Gus Van Sant', 'Drama', 1997, 'Lawrence Bender Productions, Be Gentlemen Limited Partnership, Miramax', '127', 4.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2FnLKpFi1HPO7BEJxdkv6hpJSU.jpg', 'Will Hunting is a headstrong, working-class genius who is failing the lessons of life. After one too many run-ins with the law, Will\'s last chance is a psychology professor, who might be the only man who can reach him.'),
(701, 101, 'Léon: The Professional', 'Luc Besson', 'Jean Reno, Natalie Portman, Gary Oldman, Danny Aiello, Peter Appel, Michael Badalucco', 'Luc Besson', 'Crime, Drama, Action', 1994, 'Gaumont, Les Films du Dauphin', '111', 4.1, 'FR', 'English, Français, Italiano', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxB2q91nKYp8JNzqE7t7TWBVupB.jpg', 'Léon, the top hit man in New York, has earned a rep as an effective \"cleaner\". But when his next-door neighbors are wiped out by a loose-cannon DEA agent, he becomes the unwilling custodian of 12-year-old Mathilda. Before long, Mathilda\'s thoughts turn to revenge, and she considers following in Léon\'s footsteps.'),
(702, 949, 'Heat', 'Michael Mann', 'Al Pacino, Robert De Niro, Val Kilmer, Jon Voight, Tom Sizemore, Diane Venora', 'Michael Mann', 'Crime, Drama, Action', 1995, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Regency Enterprises, Forward Pass', '170', 4.0, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umSVjVdbVwtx5ryCA2QXL44Durm.jpg', 'Obsessive master thief Neil McCauley leads a top-notch crew on various daring heists throughout Los Angeles while determined detective Vincent Hanna pursues him without rest. Each man recognizes and respects the ability and the dedication of the other even though they are aware their cat-and-mouse game may end in violence.');
INSERT INTO `peliculas` (`idPelicula`, `idApi`, `nombrePelicula`, `directorPelicula`, `actorPelicula`, `guionistaPelicula`, `generoPelicula`, `anoPelicula`, `companiaPelicula`, `duracionPelicula`, `ratingAvgPelicula`, `paisPelicula`, `idiomaPelicula`, `posterPelicula`, `sinopsisPelicula`) VALUES
(703, 3933, 'Corpse Bride', 'Tim Burton', 'Johnny Depp, Helena Bonham Carter, Emily Watson, Tracey Ullman, Paul Whitehouse, Joanna Lumley', 'Pamela Pettler, John August, Caroline Thompson', 'Romance, Fantasy, Animation', 2005, 'Tim Burton Productions, LAIKA, Patalex Productions, Warner Bros. Pictures', '77', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3RAoVTxUk1OzZClscAsynuu670p.jpg', 'In a 19th-century European village, a young man about to be married is whisked away to the underworld and wed to a mysterious corpse bride, while his real bride waits bereft in the land of the living.'),
(704, 837335, 'La Chimera', 'Alice Rohrwacher', 'Josh O\'Connor, Carol Duarte, Alba Rohrwacher, Isabella Rossellini, Vincenzo Nemolato, Lou Roy-Lecollinet', 'Alice Rohrwacher', 'Drama, Fantasy, Comedy', 2023, 'Tempesta, RAI Cinema, Ad Vitam Production, Amka Films, ARTE France Cinéma, RSI, TRT 12 PUNTO', '131', 3.6, 'IT', 'English, Français, Italiano, Português', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dV6SYHmmFLXQU7oKRfK4pOFCX6M.jpg', 'Everyone has their own Chimera, something they try to achieve but never manage to find. For Arthur, the Chimera looks like the woman he lost, Beniamina. In an adventurous journey between the living and the dead, between forests and cities, between celebrations and solitudes, the intertwined destinies of these characters unfold, all in search of the Chimera.'),
(705, 391, 'A Fistful of Dollars', 'Sergio Leone', 'Clint Eastwood, Marianne Koch, Gian Maria Volonté, Wolfgang Lukschy, Sieghardt Rupp, Joseph Egger', 'Jaime Comas Gil, Víctor Andrés Catena, Sergio Leone', 'Western', 1964, 'Jolly Film, Ocean Films, Constantin Film, Taurus Film', '99', 3.9, 'IT', 'Italiano, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBwOEpwVeUAmrmglcstnaGcJq3Y.jpg', 'The Man With No Name enters the Mexican village of San Miguel in the midst of a power struggle among the three Rojo brothers and sheriff John Baxter. When a regiment of Mexican soldiers bearing gold intended to pay for new weapons is waylaid by the Rojo brothers, the stranger inserts himself into the middle of the long-simmering battle, selling false information to both sides for his own benefit.'),
(706, 408, 'Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs', 'David Hand', 'Adriana Caselotti, Lucille La Verne, Harry Stockwell, Roy Atwell, Pinto Colvig, Otis Harlan', 'Dick Rickard, Richard Creedon, Ted Sears', 'Fantasy, Animation, Family', 1938, 'Walt Disney Productions', '83', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VAHfuNb6Z7UiW12iYKANSPBl8m.jpg', 'A beautiful girl, Snow White, takes refuge in the forest in the house of seven dwarfs to hide from her stepmother, the wicked Queen. The Queen is jealous because she wants to be known as \"the fairest in the land,\" and Snow White\'s beauty surpasses her own.'),
(707, 938, 'For a Few Dollars More', 'Sergio Leone', 'Clint Eastwood, Lee Van Cleef, Gian Maria Volonté, Mara Krupp, Luigi Pistilli, Klaus Kinski', 'Sergio Leone, Luciano Vincenzoni', 'Western', 1965, 'PEA, Constantin Film, Arturo González PC, Taurus Film', '132', 4.0, 'IT', 'Italiano', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ooqASvA7qxlTVKL3KwOzBwy57Dh.jpg', 'Two bounty hunters both pursue the brutal and sadistic bandit, El Indio, who has a large bounty on his head.'),
(708, 335, 'Once Upon a Time in the West', 'Sergio Leone', 'Claudia Cardinale, Henry Fonda, Jason Robards, Charles Bronson, Gabriele Ferzetti, Paolo Stoppa', 'Sergio Leone, Sergio Donati', 'Drama, Western', 1968, 'Paramount Pictures, Rafran Cinematografica, San Marco', '166', 4.1, 'US, IT', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbYgqOczabWNn2XKwgMtVrntD6P.jpg', 'As the railroad builders advance unstoppably through the Arizona desert on their way to the sea, Jill arrives in the small town of Flagstone with the intention of starting a new life.'),
(709, 311, 'Once Upon a Time in America', 'Sergio Leone', 'Robert De Niro, James Woods, Elizabeth McGovern, Joe Pesci, Burt Young, Tuesday Weld', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Piero De Bernardi, Enrico Medioli', 'Drama, Crime', 1984, 'Embassy International Pictures, PSO, The Ladd Company, Rafran Cinematografica', '139', 4.2, 'US', 'English, Français, עִבְרִית, Italiano, ', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0enkzsL5dPeneWnjl1fCWm6L7k.jpg', 'A former Prohibition-era Jewish gangster returns to the Lower East Side of Manhattan over thirty years later, where he once again must confront the ghosts and regrets of his old life.'),
(710, 889737, 'Joker: Folie à Deux', 'Todd Phillips', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Lady Gaga, Brendan Gleeson, Catherine Keener, Zazie Beetz, Steve Coogan', 'Todd Phillips', 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 2024, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Joint Effort, Domain Entertainment', '138', 2.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/if8QiqCI7WAGImKcJCfzp6VTyKA.jpg', 'While struggling with his dual identity, Arthur Fleck not only stumbles upon true love, but also finds the music that\'s always been inside him.'),
(711, 273248, 'The Hateful Eight', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Kurt Russell, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Walton Goggins, Demián Bichir, Tim Roth', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Drama, Mystery, Western', 2015, 'The Weinstein Company, Double Feature Films, FilmColony', '188', 3.9, 'US', 'Español, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jIywvdPjia2t3eKYbjVTcwBQlG8.jpg', 'Bounty hunters seek shelter from a raging blizzard and get caught up in a plot of betrayal and deception.'),
(712, 680, 'Pulp Fiction', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'John Travolta, Samuel L. Jackson, Uma Thurman, Bruce Willis, Ving Rhames, Harvey Keitel', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Thriller, Crime, Comedy', 1994, 'Miramax, A Band Apart, Jersey Films', '154', 4.2, 'US', 'English, Español, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQWk5YBFWF4bZaofAbv0tShwBvQ.jpg', 'A burger-loving hit man, his philosophical partner, a drug-addled gangster\'s moll and a washed-up boxer converge in this sprawling, comedic crime caper. Their adventures unfurl in three stories that ingeniously trip back and forth in time.'),
(713, 24, 'Kill Bill: Vol. 1', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Uma Thurman, Lucy Liu, Vivica A. Fox, Daryl Hannah, David Carradine, Michael Madsen', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Action, Crime', 2003, 'Miramax, A Band Apart, Super Cool ManChu', '111', 4.0, 'US', 'English, 日本語, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7TaX8kXMXs5yFFGR41guUDNcnB.jpg', 'An assassin is shot by her ruthless employer, Bill, and other members of their assassination circle – but she lives to plot her vengeance.'),
(714, 393, 'Kill Bill: Vol. 2', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Uma Thurman, David Carradine, Daryl Hannah, Michael Madsen, Gordon Liu, Michael Parks', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 2004, 'Super Cool ManChu, Miramax, A Band Apart', '136', 3.9, 'US', 'English, 普通话, Español, 广州话 / 廣州話', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yhg0mZQMhDyvUQ4rG1IZ4oIA8L.jpg', 'The Bride unwaveringly continues on her roaring rampage of revenge against the band of assassins who had tried to kill her and her unborn child. She visits each of her former associates one-by-one, checking off the victims on her Death List Five until there\'s nothing left to do … but kill Bill.'),
(715, 184, 'Jackie Brown', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Pam Grier, Samuel L. Jackson, Robert De Niro, Bridget Fonda, Michael Keaton, Robert Forster', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 1997, 'Miramax, A Band Apart, Mighty Mighty Afrodite Productions', '154', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOUx7qg4KmEh1juEDwqzbDSL1Nr.jpg', 'Jackie Brown is a flight attendant who gets caught in the middle of smuggling cash into the country for her gunrunner boss. When the cops try to use Jackie to get to her boss, she hatches a plan — with help from a bail bondsman — to keep the money for herself.'),
(716, 68718, 'Django Unchained', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Jamie Foxx, Christoph Waltz, Leonardo DiCaprio, Kerry Washington, Samuel L. Jackson, Walton Goggins', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Drama, Western', 2012, 'The Weinstein Company, Columbia Pictures', '165', 4.1, 'US', 'English, Français, Deutsch', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oWY8VDWW7thTzWh3OKYRkWUlD5.jpg', 'With the help of a German bounty hunter, a freed slave sets out to rescue his wife from a brutal Mississippi plantation owner.'),
(717, 976893, 'Perfect Days', 'Wim Wenders', 'Koji Yakusho, Tokio Emoto, Arisa Nakano, Aoi Yamada, Yumi Aso, Sayuri Ishikawa', 'Wim Wenders, Takuma Takasaki', 'Drama', 2023, 'Master Mind, Wenders Images', '124', 3.9, 'JP', 'English, 日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjEk5Wwx6TYVqw29zSaUHclMIgp.jpg', 'Hirayama is content with his life as a toilet cleaner in Tokyo. Outside of his structured routine, he cherishes music on cassette tapes, books, and taking photos of trees. Through unexpected encounters, he reflects on finding beauty in the world.'),
(718, 933260, 'The Substance', 'Coralie Fargeat', 'Demi Moore, Margaret Qualley, Dennis Quaid, Edward Hamilton-Clark, Gore Abrams, Oscar Lesage', 'Coralie Fargeat', 'Horror, Science Fiction', 2024, 'Working Title Films, Blacksmith, Working Title Films', '141', 3.6, 'GB, US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYJvxMWMb9W4zIY3cbM50sj3dpC.jpg', 'A fading celebrity decides to use a black market drug, a cell-replicating substance that temporarily creates a younger, better version of herself.'),
(719, 1125510, 'The Platform 2', 'Galder Gaztelu-Urrutia', 'Milena Smit, Hovik Keuchkerian, Natalia Tena, Óscar Jaenada, Ivan Massagué, Zorion Eguileor', 'David Desola, Pedro Rivero, Egoitz Moreno', 'Science Fiction, Horror, Thriller', 2024, 'Basque Films', '101', 2.8, 'ES', 'Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvIpBg12IIA5Dr9Sjn38ygS1vQp.jpg', 'After a mysterious leader imposes his law in a brutal system of vertical cells, a new arrival battles against a dubious food distribution method.'),
(720, 500, 'Reservoir Dogs', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Harvey Keitel, Tim Roth, Michael Madsen, Chris Penn, Steve Buscemi, Lawrence Tierney', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Crime, Thriller', 1992, 'Live Entertainment, Dog Eat Dog Productions', '99', 4.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xi8Iu6qyTfyZVDVy60raIOYJJmk.jpg', 'A botched robbery indicates a police informant, and the pressure mounts in the aftermath at a warehouse. Crime begets violence as the survivors -- veteran Mr. White, newcomer Mr. Orange, psychopathic parolee Mr. Blonde, bickering weasel Mr. Pink and Nice Guy Eddie -- unravel.'),
(721, 1184918, 'The Wild Robot', 'Chris Sanders', 'Lupita Nyong\'o, Pedro Pascal, Kit Connor, Bill Nighy, Stephanie Hsu, Matt Berry', 'Chris Sanders', 'Family, Animation, Science Fiction, Adventure', 2024, 'DreamWorks Animation', '102', 4.2, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTnV3PCVW5O92JMrFvvrRcV39RU.jpg', 'After a shipwreck, an intelligent robot called Roz is stranded on an uninhabited island. To survive the harsh environment, Roz bonds with the island\'s animals and cares for an orphaned baby goose.'),
(722, 1154762, 'His Three Daughters', 'Azazel Jacobs', 'Carrie Coon, Natasha Lyonne, Elizabeth Olsen, Jay O. Sanders, Jovan Adepo, Rudy Galvan', 'Azazel Jacobs', 'Drama, Comedy', 2024, 'Tango Entertainment, Animal Pictures, High Frequency Entertainment, Case Study Films, Arts & Sciences, Talkies', '104', 3.4, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yTIHBPLQyzhgz1c2spak3btJxsg.jpg', 'Emotions run high when three estranged sisters reunite in a cramped New York City apartment to watch over their ailing father during his final days.'),
(723, 1026436, 'Miller\'s Girl', 'Jade Halley Bartlett', 'Jenna Ortega, Martin Freeman, Bashir Salahuddin, Gideon Adlon, Dagmara Dominczyk, Christine Adams', 'Jade Halley Bartlett', 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 2024, 'Point Grey Pictures, Lionsgate, Good Universe', '93', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ieU0zUj7WhE0GrgpgofRH0sNjbI.jpg', 'A talented young writer embarks on a creative odyssey when her teacher assigns a project that entangles them both.'),
(724, 1029235, 'Azrael', 'E.L. Katz', 'Samara Weaving, Vic Carmen Sonne, Katariina Unt, Peter Christoffersen, Nathan Stewart-Jarrett, Johhan Rosenberg', 'E.L. Katz', 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 2024, 'C2 Motion Picture Group, Traffic.', '86', 2.9, 'US', '', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpdFKDvJS7oLKTcBLXOaMwUESbs.jpg', 'In a world where no one speaks, a devout female hunts down a young woman who has escaped her imprisonment. Recaptured by its ruthless leaders, Azrael is due to be sacrificed to pacify an ancient evil deep within the surrounding wilderness.'),
(725, 882598, 'Smile', 'Parker Finn', 'Sosie Bacon, Kyle Gallner, Jessie T. Usher, Robin Weigert, Caitlin Stasey, Kal Penn', 'Parker Finn', 'Horror, Mystery', 2022, 'Paramount Players, Paramount Pictures, Temple Hill Entertainment', '115', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPqcQwu4VGEewPhagWNncDbJ9Xp.jpg', 'After witnessing a bizarre, traumatic incident involving a patient, Dr. Rose Cotter starts experiencing frightening occurrences that she can\'t explain.'),
(726, 1088514, 'The Room Next Door', 'Pedro Almodóvar', 'Julianne Moore, Tilda Swinton, John Turturro, Alessandro Nivola, Juan Diego Botto, Raúl Arévalo', 'Pedro Almodóvar', 'Drama, Comedy', 2024, 'El Deseo', '106', 3.4, 'ES', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMibLyArrlBJ87AoqQBeVaFeRXp.jpg', 'Ingrid and Martha were close friends in their youth, when they worked together at the same magazine. Ingrid went on to become an autofiction novelist while Martha became a war reporter, and they were separated by the circumstances of life. After years of being out of touch, they meet again in an extreme but strangely sweet situation.'),
(727, 397805, 'Brothers', 'Robert Eggers', 'Ethan Sailor, Griffin Fox Smith, Beth Brown', 'Robert Eggers', 'Drama', 2015, 'Parts & Labor, Code Red Productions', '11', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CbDY9GIDkFUkS8Bdr254s25JqD.jpg', 'The story of two brothers, Tom and Jake, and their problematic relationship.'),
(728, 98, 'Gladiator', 'Ridley Scott', 'Russell Crowe, Joaquin Phoenix, Connie Nielsen, Oliver Reed, Richard Harris, Derek Jacobi', 'William Nicholson, John Logan, David Franzoni', 'Action, Drama, Adventure', 2000, 'Universal Pictures, Scott Free Productions, Red Wagon Entertainment, Mill Film, DreamWorks Pictures', '155', 4.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wN2xWp1eIwCKOD0BHTcErTBv1Uq.jpg', 'After the death of Emperor Marcus Aurelius, his devious son takes power and demotes Maximus, one of Rome\'s most capable generals who Marcus preferred. Eventually, Maximus is forced to become a gladiator and battle to the death against other men for the amusement of paying audiences.'),
(729, 797, 'Persona', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Bibi Andersson, Liv Ullmann, Margaretha Krook, Gunnar Björnstrand, Jörgen Lindström, Thích Quảng Đức', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Drama', 1966, 'SF Studios', '85', 4.1, 'SE', 'svenska', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hloUDKausII3Zf8ROsEZJHSkXza.jpg', 'A young nurse, Alma, is put in charge of Elisabeth Vogler: an actress who is seemingly healthy in all respects, but will not talk. As they spend time together, Alma speaks to Elisabeth constantly, never receiving any answer.'),
(730, 84892, 'The Perks of Being a Wallflower', 'Stephen Chbosky', 'Logan Lerman, Emma Watson, Ezra Miller, Mae Whitman, Kate Walsh, Dylan McDermott', 'Stephen Chbosky', 'Drama', 2012, 'Mr. Mudd', '103', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKCvdFFF5n80P2VdS7d8YBwbCjh.jpg', 'Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, 1991. High school freshman Charlie is a wallflower, always watching life from the sidelines, until two senior students, Sam and her stepbrother Patrick, become his mentors, helping him discover the joys of friendship, music and love.'),
(731, 33, 'Unforgiven', 'Clint Eastwood', 'Clint Eastwood, Gene Hackman, Morgan Freeman, Jaimz Woolvett, Richard Harris, Saul Rubinek', 'Clint Eastwood', 'Western', 1992, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Malpaso Productions', '130', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54roTwbX9fltg85zjsmrooXAs12.jpg', 'William Munny is a retired, once-ruthless killer turned gentle widower and hog farmer. To help support his two motherless children, he accepts one last bounty-hunter mission to find the men who brutalized a prostitute. Joined by his former partner and a cocky greenhorn, he takes on a corrupt sheriff.'),
(732, 490, 'The Seventh Seal', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Gunnar Björnstrand, Bengt Ekerot, Nils Poppe, Max von Sydow, Bibi Andersson, Inga Gill', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Fantasy, Drama', 1957, 'SF Studios', '96', 4.1, 'SE', 'svenska', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcZ21zrOsy0b52AfAF50XpTiv75.jpg', 'When disillusioned Swedish knight Antonius Block returns home from the Crusades to find his country in the grips of the Black Death, he challenges Death to a chess match for his life. Tormented by the belief that God does not exist, Block sets off on a journey, meeting up with traveling players Jof and his wife, Mia, and becoming determined to evade Death long enough to commit one redemptive act while he still lives.'),
(733, 975, 'Paths of Glory', 'Stanley Kubrick', 'Kirk Douglas, Ralph Meeker, Adolphe Menjou, George Macready, Wayne Morris, Richard Anderson', 'Stanley Kubrick, Jim Thompson, Calder Willingham', 'War, Drama', 1957, 'Bryna Productions, United Artists, Harris-Kubrick Productions', '88', 4.1, 'US', 'English, Latin, Deutsch', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGg1UCQSHlXfv2HI9bDHT2OQBam.jpg', 'A commanding officer defends three scapegoats on trial for a failed offensive that occurred within the French Army in 1916.'),
(734, 3175, 'Barry Lyndon', 'Stanley Kubrick', 'Ryan O\'Neal, Marisa Berenson, Patrick Magee, Hardy Krüger, Steven Berkoff, Gay Hamilton', 'Stanley Kubrick', 'Drama, History', 1975, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Hawk Films, Peregrine', '188', 4.0, 'US, GB', 'Deutsch, Français, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znfLskGQnXYB2xcOGM9eInRHPAV.jpg', 'An Irish rogue uses his cunning and wit to work his way up the social classes of 18th century England, transforming himself from the humble Redmond Barry into the noble Barry Lyndon.'),
(735, 935, 'Dr. Strangelove or: How I Learned to Stop Worrying and Love the Bomb', 'Stanley Kubrick', 'Peter Sellers, George C. Scott, Sterling Hayden, Keenan Wynn, Slim Pickens, Peter Bull', 'Stanley Kubrick, Terry Southern, Peter George', 'Comedy, War', 1964, 'Hawk Films, Columbia Pictures', '95', 4.1, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHm96BRW4GoI339rF1vYoYTB6Qe.jpg', 'After the insane General Jack D. Ripper initiates a nuclear strike on the Soviet Union, a war room full of politicians, generals and a Russian diplomat all frantically try to stop it.'),
(736, 345, 'Eyes Wide Shut', 'Stanley Kubrick', 'Tom Cruise, Nicole Kidman, Sydney Pollack, Marie Richardson, Rade Šerbedžija, Todd Field', 'Frederic Raphael, Stanley Kubrick', 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 1999, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Stanley Kubrick Productions, Pole Star, Hobby Films', '159', 3.7, 'GB, US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knEIz1eNGl5MQDbrEAVWA7iRqF9.jpg', 'After Dr. Bill Harford\'s wife, Alice, admits to having sexual fantasies about a man she met, Bill becomes obsessed with having a sexual encounter. He discovers an underground sexual group and attends one of their meetings -- and quickly discovers that he is in over his head.'),
(737, 1091181, 'Family Pack', 'François Uzan', 'Franck Dubosc, Jean Reno, Suzanne Clément, Lisa Do Couto Texeira, Raphael Romand, Alizée Caugnies', 'François Uzan, Céleste Balin', 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Action, Family', 2024, 'Radar Films, Mediawan, Asmodee', '95', 2.8, 'FR', 'Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uL1dR0L65GZgy3h2gvZcxDu0bRG.jpg', 'When an old card game comes to life, a family jumps back in time to a medieval village where they must unmask werewolves to secure their return home.'),
(738, 158011, 'The Call', 'Brad Anderson', 'Halle Berry, Abigail Breslin, Morris Chestnut, Michael Eklund, David Otunga, Michael Imperioli', 'Richard D\'Ovidio', 'Crime, Thriller', 2013, 'TriStar Pictures, WWE Studios, Troika Pictures, Stage 6 Films, Amasia Entertainment', '96', 3.4, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mG334OlDVJpD8gMfTCM2Mpp0gQH.jpg', 'Jordan Turner is an experienced 911 operator but when she makes an error in judgment and a call ends badly, Jordan is rattled and unsure if she can continue. But when teenager Casey Welson is abducted in the back of a man\'s car and calls 911, Jordan is the one called upon to use all of her experience, insights and quick thinking to help Casey escape, and not just to save her, but to make sure the man is brought to justice.'),
(739, 1058634, 'Mamacruz', 'Patricia Ortega', 'Kiti Mánver, Pepe Quero, Inés Benítez Viñuela, Silvia Acosta, Mari Paz Sayago, María José Mariscal', 'Patricia Ortega', 'Drama', 2023, 'La Cruda Realidad, Pecado Films, Mandrágora Films Zulia, C.A.', '83', 3.5, 'ES', 'Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxkb2U8Z0HVyt5CQZXrCwLFtZNN.jpg', 'Cruz is a grandma who\'s spent years, decades actually, without having an orgasm. Religiously devout, it wasn\'t something that she considered particularly important, or that she\'d even given much thought to... until, one day, while surfing the internet, she again starts to feel those desires and sensations she had believed were long gone. Now she is faced with a dilemma: how can she balance her religious beliefs with this new sexual and sensual awakening that has suddenly come back into her life?'),
(740, 278, 'The Shawshank Redemption', 'Frank Darabont', 'Tim Robbins, Morgan Freeman, Bob Gunton, William Sadler, Clancy Brown, Gil Bellows', 'Frank Darabont', 'Drama, Crime', 1994, 'Castle Rock Entertainment', '142', 4.4, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cqNxx0GxF0bflZmeSMuL5tnGzr.jpg', 'Imprisoned in the 1940s for the double murder of his wife and her lover, upstanding banker Andy Dufresne begins a new life at the Shawshank prison, where he puts his accounting skills to work for an amoral warden. During his long stretch in prison, Dufresne comes to be admired by the other inmates -- including an older prisoner named Red -- for his integrity and unquenchable sense of hope.'),
(741, 109, 'Three Colors: White', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski', 'Zbigniew Zamachowski, Julie Delpy, Janusz Gajos, Jerzy Stuhr, Grzegorz Warchoł, Jerzy Nowak', 'Krzysztof Piesiewicz, Krzysztof Kieślowski', 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 1994, 'mk2 Films, France 3 Cinéma, CAB Productions, Studio Filmowe Tor', '92', 3.7, 'FR', 'Magyar, Polski, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6r09mQLfJmQes0uFD4yTa8NAKPj.jpg', 'Polish immigrant Karol Karol finds himself out of a marriage, a job and a country when his French wife, Dominique, divorces him after six months due to his impotence. Forced to leave France after losing the business they jointly owned, Karol enlists fellow Polish expatriate Mikołaj to smuggle him back to their homeland.'),
(742, 927, 'Gremlins', 'Joe Dante', 'Zach Galligan, Phoebe Cates, Hoyt Axton, Frances Lee McCain, Corey Feldman, Keye Luke', 'Joe Dante', 'Fantasy, Horror, Comedy', 1984, 'Amblin Entertainment, Warner Bros. Pictures', '106', 3.6, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6m0F7fsXjQvUbCZrPWcJNrjvIui.jpg', 'After receiving an exotic small animal as a Christmas gift, a young man inadvertently breaks three important rules concerning his new pet, which unleashes a horde of malevolently mischievous creatures on a small town.'),
(743, 832964, 'Lee', 'Ellen Kuras', 'Kate Winslet, Andy Samberg, Alexander Skarsgård, Marion Cotillard, Andrea Riseborough, Noémie Merlant', 'Marion Hume, John Collee, Liz Hannah', 'History, Drama, War', 2024, 'Brouhaha Entertainment, Brouhaha Entertainment, Juggle Productions, 55 Films, Vogue Studios, RocketScience, MS Participations, Sky Original Productions, Pasaca Entertainment', '117', 3.5, 'GB', 'English, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdNWyuim8gpJHe1LtKaDrs43dWz.jpg', 'The true story of photographer Elizabeth \"Lee\" Miller, a fashion model who became an acclaimed war correspondent for Vogue magazine during World War II.'),
(744, 989662, 'A Different Man', 'Aaron Schimberg', 'Sebastian Stan, Renate Reinsve, Adam Pearson, Miles G. Jackson, Patrick Wang, Neal Davidson', 'Aaron Schimberg', 'Comedy, Drama', 2024, 'A24, Killer Films, Grand Motel Films', '112', 3.4, 'US', 'English, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZZKTEvo92u1J5pm7QoEA5yN3du.jpg', 'Aspiring actor Edward undergoes a radical medical procedure to drastically transform his appearance. But his new dream face quickly turns into a nightmare.'),
(745, 785542, 'The Outrun', 'Nora Fingscheidt', 'Saoirse Ronan, Paapa Essiedu, Nabil Elouahabi, Izuka Hoyle, Lauren Lyle, Stephen Dillane', 'Nora Fingscheidt', 'Drama', 2024, 'BBC Film, Screen Scotland, MBK Productions, Brock Media, Arcade Pictures, Weydemann Bros., StudioCanal, Stage 6 Films', '118', 3.4, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfRR2CkbvYrLuOPQFm8vBaENyMy.jpg', 'Fresh out of rehab, Rona returns to the Orkney Islands—a place both wild and beautiful, right off the Scottish coast. Now 29 and after more than a decade of living life on the edge in London, where she both found and lost love, Rona attempts to come to terms with her troubled past. As she reconnects with the dramatic landscape where she grew up, memories of her traumatic childhood merge with more recent challenging events that have set her on the path to recovery.'),
(746, 1128752, 'Bird', 'Andrea Arnold', 'Nykiya Adams, Franz Rogowski, Barry Keoghan, Jason Buda, Jasmine Jobson, Frankie Box', 'Andrea Arnold', 'Drama', 2024, 'House Productions, Ad Vitam Production, ARTE France Cinéma, BBC Film, BFI, Access Entertainment, Pinky Promise, FirstGen Content', '119', 3.6, 'GB', 'Magyar, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKshd6n8EKrwbE2fLOUqC4TSG6O.jpg', '12-year-old Bailey lives with her single dad Bug and brother Hunter in a squat in North Kent. Bug doesn’t have much time for his kids, and Bailey, who is approaching puberty, seeks attention and adventure elsewhere.'),
(747, 1278263, 'The Seed of the Sacred Fig', 'Mohammad Rasoulof', 'Soheila Golestani, Misagh Zare, Mahsa Rostami, Setareh Maleki, Niousha Akhshi, Reza Akhlaghirad', 'Mohammad Rasoulof', 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 2024, 'Parallel 45, Run Way Pictures, ARTE France Cinéma', '167', 3.8, 'FR', 'فارسی', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifOazNzv2cNJ5CQjMV7cPXG2Lmy.jpg', 'Investigating judge Iman grapples with paranoia amid political unrest in Tehran. When his gun vanishes, he suspects his wife and daughters, imposing draconian measures that strain family ties as societal rules crumble.'),
(748, 823219, 'Flow', 'Gints Zilbalodis', '', 'Matīss Kaža, Gints Zilbalodis', 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Fantasy', 2024, 'Dream Well Studio, Sacrebleu Productions, Take Five, ARTE France Cinéma, RTBF', '85', 4.0, 'LV', 'No Language', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2sG41PxfL1hnL1mHbxzSREUtOf.jpg', 'A solitary cat, displaced by a great flood, finds refuge on a boat with various species and must navigate the challenges of adapting to a transformed world together.'),
(749, 945961, 'Alien: Romulus', 'Fede Álvarez', 'Cailee Spaeny, David Jonsson, Archie Renaux, Isabela Merced, Spike Fearn, Aileen Wu', 'Fede Álvarez', 'Horror, Science Fiction', 2024, '20th Century Studios, Scott Free Productions, Brandywine Productions, TSG Entertainment', '119', 3.6, 'US', 'Dansk, English, Nederlands', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2uSWRTtCG336nuBiG8jOTEUKSy8.jpg', 'While scavenging the deep ends of a derelict space station, a group of young space colonizers come face to face with the most terrifying life form in the universe.'),
(750, 1120911, 'Saturday Night', 'Jason Reitman', 'Gabriel LaBelle, Rachel Sennott, Cory Michael Smith, Ella Hunt, Dylan O\'Brien, Emily Fairn', 'Jason Reitman', 'Comedy, Drama', 2024, 'Columbia Pictures, Right of Way Films, TSG Entertainment', '109', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCf5O6uxooTvRwKVnLHwGqZUifq.jpg', 'At 11:30pm on October 11, 1975, a ferocious troupe of young comedians and writers changed television forever. This is the story of what happened behind the scenes in the 90 minutes leading up to the first broadcast of Saturday Night Live.'),
(751, 1100782, 'Smile 2', 'Parker Finn', 'Naomi Scott, Rosemarie DeWitt, Lukas Gage, Miles Gutierrez-Riley, Peter Jacobson, Ray Nicholson', 'Parker Finn', 'Horror, Mystery', 2024, 'Paramount Pictures, Temple Hill Entertainment, Bad Feeling', '127', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ht8Uv9QPv9y7K0RvUyJIaXOZTfd.jpg', 'About to embark on a new world tour, global pop sensation Skye Riley begins experiencing increasingly terrifying and inexplicable events. Overwhelmed by the escalating horrors and the pressures of fame, Skye is forced to face her dark past to regain control of her life before it spirals out of control.'),
(752, 110, 'Three Colors: Red', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski', 'Irène Jacob, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Frédérique Feder, Jean-Pierre Lorit, Samuel Le Bihan, Marion Stalens', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Krzysztof Piesiewicz', 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 1994, 'mk2 Films, France 3 Cinéma, CAB Productions, Studio Filmowe Tor, TSR', '100', 3.9, 'FR', 'Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JHmsBiX1tjCKqAul1lzC20WcAW.jpg', 'Part-time model Valentine unexpectedly befriends a retired judge after she runs over his dog. At first, the grumpy man shows no concern about the dog, and Valentine decides to keep it. But the two form a bond when she returns to his house and catches him listening to his neighbors’ phone calls.'),
(753, 108, 'Three Colors: Blue', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski', 'Juliette Binoche, Benoît Régent, Florence Pernel, Charlotte Véry, Hélène Vincent, Philippe Volter', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Krzysztof Piesiewicz', 'Drama', 1993, 'mk2 Films, CED Productions, France 3 Cinéma, CAB Productions, Studio Filmowe Tor', '98', 3.8, 'FR', 'Français, Polski', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33wsWxzsNstI8N7dvuwzFmj1qBd.jpg', 'The wife of a famous composer survives a car accident that kills her husband and daughter. Now alone, she shakes off her old identity and explores her newfound freedom but finds that she is unbreakably bound to other humans, including her husband’s mistress, whose existence she never suspected.'),
(754, 1100099, 'We Live in Time', 'John Crowley', 'Andrew Garfield, Florence Pugh, Grace Delaney, Lee Braithwaite, Aoife Hinds, Adam James', 'John Crowley', 'Romance, Drama', 2024, 'Film4 Productions, SunnyMarch, Shoebox Films, StudioCanal UK', '108', 3.6, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeDNBgnlGF6rnyX1P1K8Vl2f3lW.jpg', 'An up-and-coming chef and a recent divorcée find their lives forever changed when a chance encounter brings them together, in a decade-spanning, deeply moving romance.'),
(755, 804406, 'The Piano Lesson', 'Malcolm Washington', 'John David Washington, Danielle Deadwyler, Samuel L. Jackson, Ray Fisher, Michael Potts, Corey Hawkins', 'Malcolm Washington, Virgil Williams', 'Drama', 2024, 'Mundy Lane Entertainment, Escape Artists', '127', 2.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgampq63AqCrza6bnvmWqCcvCzY.jpg', 'A brother and sister\'s battle over a prized heirloom piano unleashes haunting truths about how the past is perceived — and who defines a family legacy.'),
(756, 55846, 'Blitz', 'Elliott Lester', 'Jason Statham, Paddy Considine, Aidan Gillen, Zawe Ashton, Luke Evans, David Morrissey', 'Nathan Parker', 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 2011, 'Lipsync Productions, Kushner/Wyman Productions, Davis Films, Lionsgate, Current Entertainment', '97', 3.1, 'GB, US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjqmhhc7uLub22mhu4V6DjOBwXM.jpg', 'A tough cop is dispatched to take down a serial killer who has been targeting police officers.'),
(757, 974576, 'Conclave', 'Edward Berger', 'Ralph Fiennes, Stanley Tucci, John Lithgow, Isabella Rossellini, Lucian Msamati, Carlos Diehz', 'Peter Straughan', 'Drama, Thriller', 2024, 'FilmNation Entertainment, House Productions, Indian Paintbrush', '120', 3.6, 'US', 'Italiano, Español, Latin, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5x8D0bZ3eKqIVWZ5y7TnZ2oTVg.jpg', 'After the unexpected death of the Pope, Cardinal Lawrence is tasked with managing the covert and ancient ritual of electing a new one. Sequestered in the Vatican with the Catholic Church’s most powerful leaders until the process is complete, Lawrence finds himself at the center of a conspiracy that could lead to its downfall.'),
(758, 402431, 'Wicked', 'Jon M. Chu', 'Cynthia Erivo, Ariana Grande, 楊紫瓊, Jonathan Bailey, Ethan Slater, Marissa Bode', 'Winnie Holzman, Dana Fox', 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 2024, 'Universal Pictures, Marc Platt Productions', '162', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDGbZ0JJ3mYaGKy4Nzd9Kph6M9L.jpg', 'In the land of Oz, ostracized and misunderstood green-skinned Elphaba is forced to share a room with the popular aristocrat Glinda at Shiz University, and the two\'s unlikely friendship is tested as they begin to fulfill their respective destinies as Glinda the Good and the Wicked Witch of the West.'),
(759, 630, 'The Wizard of Oz', 'Victor Fleming', 'Judy Garland, Ray Bolger, Jack Haley, Bert Lahr, Frank Morgan, Margaret Hamilton', 'Florence Ryerson, Edgar Allan Woolf, Noel Langley', 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 1939, 'Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer', '102', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCC3j4pV9eOZwzDUWp2ilbcTf1f.jpg', 'Young Dorothy finds herself in a magical world where she makes friends with a lion, a scarecrow and a tin man as they make their way along the yellow brick road to talk with the Wizard and ask for the things they miss most in their lives. The Wicked Witch of the West is the only thing that could stop them.'),
(760, 1064486, 'Memoir of a Snail', 'Adam Elliot', 'Sarah Snook, Kodi Smit-McPhee, Jacki Weaver, Magda Szubanski, Dominique Pinon, Tony Armstrong', 'Adam Elliot', 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 2024, 'Arenamedia, MIFF Premiere Fund', '94', 4.0, 'AU', 'English, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woaN8CbloH0akyX0E72ayxlJAB4.jpg', 'Forcibly separated from her twin brother when they are orphaned, a melancholic misfit learns how to find confidence within herself amid the clutter of misfortunes and everyday life.'),
(761, 495764, 'Birds of Prey (and the Fantabulous Emancipation of One Harley Quinn)', 'Cathy Yan', 'Margot Robbie, Rosie Perez, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Jurnee Smollett, Ewan McGregor, Ella Jay Basco', 'Christina Hodson', 'Action, Crime', 2020, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, DC Films, LuckyChap Entertainment, Clubhouse Pictures, Kroll & Co Entertainment', '109', 3.4, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4VB6m0RwcicVEZvzftYZyKXs6K.jpg', 'Harley Quinn joins forces with a singer, an assassin and a police detective to help a young girl who had a hit placed on her after she stole a rare diamond from a crime lord.'),
(762, 1106739, 'Juror #2', 'Clint Eastwood', 'Nicholas Hoult, Toni Collette, J.K. Simmons, Chris Messina, Gabriel Basso, Zoey Deutch', 'Clint Eastwood', 'Drama, Thriller', 2024, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Malpaso Productions, Dichotomy Films', '114', 3.4, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugQkpGajKFQ8eyOEhGheR0HfWQ.jpg', 'While serving as a juror in a high profile murder trial, family man Justin Kemp finds himself struggling with a serious moral dilemma…one he could use to sway the jury verdict and potentially convict—or free—the accused killer.'),
(763, 558449, 'Gladiator II', 'Ridley Scott', 'Paul Mescal, Denzel Washington, Pedro Pascal, Connie Nielsen, Joseph Quinn, Fred Hechinger', 'David Scarpa', 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 2024, 'Paramount Pictures, Scott Free Productions, Lucy Fisher/Douglas Wick Productions', '148', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cxhvwyEwRlysAmRH4iodkvo0z5.jpg', 'Years after witnessing the death of the revered hero Maximus at the hands of his uncle, Lucius is forced to enter the Colosseum after his home is conquered by the tyrannical Emperors who now lead Rome with an iron fist. With rage in his heart and the future of the Empire at stake, Lucius must look to his past to find strength and honor to return the glory of Rome to its people.'),
(764, 223, 'Rebecca', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'Laurence Olivier, Joan Fontaine, George Sanders, Judith Anderson, Gladys Cooper, Nigel Bruce', 'Joan Harrison, Robert E. Sherwood', 'Mystery, Romance, Drama', 1940, 'Selznick International Pictures', '130', 3.9, 'US', 'English, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qz3qUOHnVy7dL7M7G8jSErxE4b.jpg', 'Story of a young woman who marries a fascinating widower only to find out that she must live in the shadow of his former wife, Rebecca, who died mysteriously several years earlier. The young wife must come to grips with the terrible secret of her handsome, cold husband, Max De Winter. She must also deal with the jealous, obsessed Mrs. Danvers, the housekeeper, who will not accept her as the mistress of the house.'),
(765, 21734, 'Shadow of a Doubt', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'Teresa Wright, Joseph Cotten, Macdonald Carey, Henry Travers, Patricia Collinge, Hume Cronyn', 'Thornton Wilder, Alma Reville, Sally Benson', 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 1943, 'Universal Pictures, Skirball Productions', '107', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptyWagbWE8jSGyV2tGEzAdVbRCj.jpg', 'In sleepy Santa Rosa, restless young Charlie’s world brightens when her sophisticated Uncle Charlie arrives for a long visit. But as his behavior grows increasingly strange, she begins to suspect that her beloved uncle may be hiding a terrible secret—and that danger has quietly entered her home.'),
(766, 1580, 'Rope', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'James Stewart, John Dall, Farley Granger, Cedric Hardwicke, Constance Collier, Douglas Dick', 'Arthur Laurents', 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 1948, 'Transatlantic Pictures', '81', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ar6rxLDB8kagAnXZKn6h9smscr.jpg', 'Two young men attempt to prove they committed the perfect murder by hosting a dinner party for the family of a classmate they just strangled to death.'),
(767, 303, 'Notorious', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'Cary Grant, Ingrid Bergman, Claude Rains, Louis Calhern, Leopoldine Konstantin, Reinhold Schünzel', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'Romance, Mystery, Drama', 1946, 'RKO Radio Pictures, Vanguard Films', '103', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RERYb1NIQrJHYY5e8nUlYM7t2z.jpg', 'In order to help bring Nazis to justice, U.S. government agent T.R. Devlin recruits Alicia Huberman, the American daughter of a convicted German war criminal, as a spy. As they begin to fall for one another, Alicia is instructed to win the affections of Alexander Sebastian, a Nazi hiding out in Brazil. When Sebastian becomes serious about his relationship with Alicia, the stakes get higher, and Devlin must watch her slip further undercover.'),
(768, 845, 'Strangers on a Train', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'Farley Granger, Ruth Roman, Robert Walker, Leo G. Carroll, Patricia Hitchcock, Kasey Rogers', 'Raymond Chandler, Czenzi Ormonde', 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 1951, 'Warner Bros. Pictures', '101', 3.8, 'US', 'Français, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihC083U7ef56Ui4x0P0dobojrZ1.jpg', 'A charming psychopath tries to coerce a tennis star into his theory that two strangers can commit the perfect crime by exchanging murders—each killing the other’s most-hated person.'),
(769, 521, 'Dial M for Murder', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'Ray Milland, Grace Kelly, Robert Cummings, John Williams, Anthony Dawson, Leo Britt', 'Frederick Knott', 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 1954, 'Warner Bros. Pictures', '105', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gDCAgl2iBQNuJuk6p2xtuS1ewg.jpg', 'When her American lover visits London, a wealthy woman’s jealous husband hatches a plan to murder her and inherit her fortune.'),
(770, 671, 'Harry Potter and the Philosopher\'s Stone', 'Chris Columbus', 'Daniel Radcliffe, Rupert Grint, Emma Watson, Richard Harris, Tom Felton, Alan Rickman', 'Steve Kloves', 'Adventure, Fantasy', 2001, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Heyday Films, 1492 Pictures', '152', 4.0, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuMc08IPKEatf9rnMNXvIDxqP4W.jpg', 'Harry Potter has lived under the stairs at his aunt and uncle\'s house his whole life. But on his 11th birthday, he learns he\'s a powerful wizard—with a place waiting for him at the Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry. As he learns to harness his newfound powers with the help of the school\'s kindly headmaster, Harry uncovers the truth about his parents\' deaths—and about the villain who\'s to blame.'),
(771, 673, 'Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban', 'Alfonso Cuarón', 'Daniel Radcliffe, Rupert Grint, Emma Watson, Robbie Coltrane, Michael Gambon, Gary Oldman', 'Steve Kloves', 'Adventure, Fantasy', 2004, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, 1492 Pictures, Heyday Films, P of A Productions', '141', 4.0, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWxwnYoe8p2d2fcxOqtvAtJ72Rw.jpg', 'Harry Potter\'s life is in danger once more as dangerous wizard Sirius Black has escaped from Azkaban Prison and is heading to Hogwarts.'),
(772, 675, 'Harry Potter and the Order of the Phoenix', 'David Yates', 'Daniel Radcliffe, Rupert Grint, Emma Watson, Imelda Staunton, Helena Bonham Carter, Robbie Coltrane', 'Michael Goldenberg', 'Adventure, Fantasy', 2007, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Heyday Films', '138', 3.8, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aOyriWkPec0zUDxmHFP9qMmBaj.jpg', 'When a new professor\'s methods leave Hogwarts unprepared to fight the rising tide of evil, Harry teaches students how to defend against the dark arts.'),
(773, 259316, 'Fantastic Beasts and Where to Find Them', 'David Yates', 'Eddie Redmayne, Katherine Waterston, Dan Fogler, Alison Sudol, Colin Farrell, Jon Voight', 'David Yates', 'Fantasy, Adventure', 2016, 'Heyday Films, Warner Bros. Pictures', '133', 3.7, 'GB, US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLsaFKExQt05yqjoAvKsmOMYvJR.jpg', 'In 1926, Newt Scamander arrives at the Magical Congress of the United States of America with a magically expanded briefcase, which houses a number of dangerous creatures and their habitats. When the creatures escape from the briefcase, it sends the American wizarding authorities after Newt, and threatens to strain even further the state of magical and non-magical relations.'),
(774, 567, 'Rear Window', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'James Stewart, Grace Kelly, Wendell Corey, Thelma Ritter, Raymond Burr, Judith Evelyn', 'John Michael Hayes', 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 1954, 'Alfred J. Hitchcock Productions', '113', 4.2, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ILVF0eJxHMddjxeQhswFtpMtqx.jpg', 'A wheelchair-bound photographer spies on his neighbors from his apartment window and becomes convinced one of them has committed murder.'),
(775, 381, 'To Catch a Thief', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'Cary Grant, Grace Kelly, Jessie Royce Landis, John Williams, Charles Vanel, Brigitte Auber', 'John Michael Hayes', 'Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 1955, 'Paramount Pictures', '106', 3.6, 'US', 'Français, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cbMRkBGBgo3aLJK2M4MyicvkPLQ.jpg', 'When a string of jewel robberies hits the French Riviera, suspicion falls on retired thief John “The Cat” Robie. To clear his name, he sets out to trap the copycat himself—entangling a wealthy widow and her beguiling daughter in a seductive game of pursuit, deception, and desire.'),
(776, 1138194, 'Heretic', 'Scott Beck', 'Hugh Grant, Sophie Thatcher, Chloe East, Topher Grace, Elle Young, Julie Lynn-Mortensen', 'Scott Beck, Bryan Woods', 'Thriller, Horror', 2024, 'A24, Beck/Woods, Shiny Penny Productions, CatchLight Studios', '111', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fr96XzlzsONrQrGfdLMiwtQjott.jpg', 'Two young missionaries are forced to prove their faith when they knock on the wrong door and are greeted by a diabolical Mr. Reed, becoming ensnared in his deadly game of cat-and-mouse.'),
(777, 426, 'Vertigo', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'James Stewart, Kim Novak, Barbara Bel Geddes, Tom Helmore, Henry Jones, Raymond Bailey', 'Samuel A. Taylor, Alec Coppel', 'Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 1958, 'Paramount Pictures, Alfred J. Hitchcock Productions', '128', 4.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15uOEfqBNTVtDUT7hGBVCka0rZz.jpg', 'A retired San Francisco detective suffering from acrophobia investigates the strange activities of an old friend\'s wife, all the while becoming dangerously obsessed with her.'),
(778, 539, 'Psycho', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'Anthony Perkins, Janet Leigh, Vera Miles, John Gavin, Martin Balsam, John McIntire', 'Joseph Stefano', 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 1960, 'Shamley Productions', '109', 4.2, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yz4QVqPx3h1hD1DfqqQkCq3rmxW.jpg', 'When larcenous real estate clerk Marion Crane goes on the lam with a wad of cash and hopes of starting a new life, she ends up at the notorious Bates Motel, where manager Norman Bates cares for his housebound mother.'),
(779, 1064213, 'Anora', 'Sean Baker', 'Mikey Madison, Mark Eydelshteyn, Yura Borisov, Karren Karagulian, Vache Tovmasyan, Luna Sofía Miranda', 'Sean Baker', 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 2024, 'Cre Film, FilmNation Entertainment', '139', 3.5, 'US', 'English, Pусский, ', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgXk2tNYhJZLXdBDO5DidAVzQ82.jpg', 'A young sex worker from Brooklyn gets her chance at a Cinderella story when she meets and impulsively marries the son of an oligarch. Once the news reaches Russia, her fairytale is threatened as his parents set out to get the marriage annulled.'),
(780, 213, 'North by Northwest', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'Cary Grant, Eva Marie Saint, James Mason, Jessie Royce Landis, Leo G. Carroll, Josephine Hutchinson', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'Thriller, Adventure', 1959, 'Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer', '137', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zAh2tcwxPsAO2AVo0nH5DQ2VQf.jpg', 'Advertising man Roger Thornhill is mistaken for a spy, triggering a deadly cross-country chase.'),
(781, 331482, 'Little Women', 'Greta Gerwig', 'Saoirse Ronan, Emma Watson, Florence Pugh, Eliza Scanlen, Laura Dern, Timothée Chalamet', 'Greta Gerwig', 'Drama, Romance', 2019, 'Columbia Pictures, Regency Enterprises, Pascal Pictures', '135', 3.9, 'US', 'Français, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yn5ihODtZ7ofn8pDYfxCmxh8AXI.jpg', 'Four sisters come of age in America in the aftermath of the Civil War.'),
(782, 571, 'The Birds', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'Tippi Hedren, Rod Taylor, Jessica Tandy, Suzanne Pleshette, Veronica Cartwright, Ethel Griffies', 'Evan Hunter', 'Horror, Thriller', 1963, 'Alfred J. Hitchcock Productions', '119', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eClg8QPg8mwB6INIC4pyR5pAbDr.jpg', 'Thousands of birds flock into a seaside town and terrorize the residents in a series of deadly attacks.'),
(783, 573, 'Frenzy', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'Jon Finch, Barry Foster, Barbara Leigh-Hunt, Anna Massey, Alec McCowen, Vivien Merchant', 'Anthony Shaffer', 'Crime, Thriller, Horror', 1972, 'Universal Pictures UK', '116', 3.5, 'GB', 'English, Italiano, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4SFvqrlSigAt9tnhXFSMyKeJWQk.jpg', 'London is terrorized by a vicious sex killer known as The Necktie Murderer. Following the brutal slaying of his ex-wife, down-on-his-luck Richard Blaney is suspected by the police of being the killer. He goes on the run, determined to prove his innocence.'),
(784, 260, 'The 39 Steps', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'Robert Donat, Madeleine Carroll, Lucie Mannheim, Godfrey Tearle, Peggy Ashcroft, John Laurie', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'Mystery, Thriller', 1935, 'Gaumont-British Picture Corporation', '86', 3.7, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oC81jK6aAug4MA0xzYVngHmjsZS.jpg', 'Richard Hanney has a rude awakening when a glamorous female spy falls into his bed - with a knife in her back. Having a bit of trouble explaining it all to Scotland Yard, he heads for the hills of Scotland to try to clear his name by locating the spy ring known as The 39 Steps.'),
(785, 574, 'The Man Who Knew Too Much', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'James Stewart, Doris Day, Brenda De Banzie, Bernard Miles, Ralph Truman, Daniel Gélin', 'John Michael Hayes', 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 1956, 'Paramount Pictures', '121', 3.7, 'US', 'English, العربية, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gy8YBRjCQRIT9x9G9F5fpnFD4xw.jpg', 'An American doctor and his wife, a former singing star, witness a murder while vacationing in Morocco, and are drawn into a twisting plot of international intrigue when their young son is kidnapped.'),
(786, 1094274, 'Y2K', 'Kyle Mooney', 'Jaeden Martell, Rachel Zegler, Julian Dennison, Daniel Zolghadri, Lachlan Watson, Fred Durst', 'Kyle Mooney', 'Science Fiction, Horror, Comedy', 2024, 'A24, Strong Baby Productions, American Light & Fixture', '91', 2.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qndubIQalyxBJI5EBNZKGXEX74q.jpg', 'Two high school nobodies make the decision to crash the last major celebration before the new millennium on New Year\'s Eve 1999. The night becomes even crazier than they could have ever dreamed when the clock strikes midnight.');
INSERT INTO `peliculas` (`idPelicula`, `idApi`, `nombrePelicula`, `directorPelicula`, `actorPelicula`, `guionistaPelicula`, `generoPelicula`, `anoPelicula`, `companiaPelicula`, `duracionPelicula`, `ratingAvgPelicula`, `paisPelicula`, `idiomaPelicula`, `posterPelicula`, `sinopsisPelicula`) VALUES
(787, 728949, 'Nightbitch', 'Marielle Heller', 'Amy Adams, Scoot McNairy, Arleigh Snowden, Emmett Snowden, Jessica Harper, Zoë Chao', 'Marielle Heller', 'Comedy, Horror', 2024, 'Annapurna Pictures, Bond Group Entertainment, Defiant By Nature, Archer Gray', '98', 2.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h49Pie8gM2jK0UHGFRjfPB3YTd.jpg', 'A woman, thrown into the stay-at-home routine of raising a toddler in the suburbs, slowly embraces the feral power deeply rooted in motherhood, as she becomes increasingly aware of the bizarre and undeniable signs that she may be turning into a dog.'),
(788, 1082195, 'The Order', 'Justin Kurzel', 'Jude Law, Nicholas Hoult, Tye Sheridan, Jurnee Smollett, Alison Oliver, Odessa Young', 'Zach Baylin', 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 2024, 'Riff Raff Entertainment, Chasing Epic Pictures, AGC Studios', '116', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3BPhDb45sy87kNV41Q1TwCL6BS.jpg', 'A string of violent robberies in the Pacific Northwest leads veteran FBI agent Terry Husk into a white supremacist plot to overthrow the federal government.'),
(789, 1013850, 'A Real Pain', 'Jesse Eisenberg', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Kieran Culkin, Will Sharpe, Jennifer Grey, Kurt Egyiawan, Liza Sadovy', 'Jesse Eisenberg', 'Comedy, Drama', 2024, 'Fruit Tree, Topic Studios, Extreme Emotions, Rego Park, Mazowiecki Instytut Kultury', '90', 3.4, 'US', 'English, Polski', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67xRIXm5TxXRT4nV2V4AEJ9yq2d.jpg', 'Mismatched cousins David and Benji reunite for a tour through Poland to honor their beloved grandmother. The adventure takes a turn when the pair\'s old tensions resurface against the backdrop of their family history.'),
(790, 937287, 'Challengers', 'Luca Guadagnino', 'Zendaya, Mike Faist, Josh O\'Connor, Darnell Appling, Bryan Doo, Shane T Harris', 'Luca Guadagnino', 'Drama, Romance', 2024, 'Pascal Pictures, Why Are You Acting? Productions, Frenesy Film, Amazon MGM Studios', '132', 3.5, 'US', 'English, Română', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/H6vke7zGiuLsz4v4RPeReb9rsv.jpg', 'Tennis player turned coach Tashi has taken her husband, Art, and transformed him into a world-famous Major champion. To jolt him out of his recent losing streak, she signs him up for a \"Challenger\" event — close to the lowest level of pro tournament — where he finds himself standing across the net from his former best friend and Tashi\'s former boyfriend.'),
(791, 585, 'Monsters, Inc.', 'Pete Docter', 'John Goodman, Billy Crystal, Mary Gibbs, Steve Buscemi, James Coburn, Jennifer Tilly', 'Andrew Stanton, Daniel Gerson', 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 2001, 'Pixar', '92', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFSpyMsp7H0ttERbxY7Trlv8xry.jpg', 'Lovable Sulley and his wisecracking sidekick Mike Wazowski are the top scare team at Monsters, Inc., the scream-processing factory in Monstropolis. When a little girl named Boo wanders into their world, it\'s the monsters who are scared silly, and it\'s up to Sulley and Mike to keep her out of sight and get her back home.'),
(792, 426063, 'Nosferatu', 'Robert Eggers', 'Lily-Rose Depp, Nicholas Hoult, Bill Skarsgård, Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Willem Dafoe, Emma Corrin', 'Robert Eggers', 'Horror, Fantasy', 2024, 'Focus Features, Studio 8, Maiden Voyage Pictures, Birch Hill Road Entertainment', '133', 3.4, 'US', 'English, Deutsch, Latin, Română, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qGIxdEO841C0tdY8vOdLoRVrr0.jpg', 'A gothic tale of obsession between a haunted young woman and the terrifying vampire infatuated with her, causing untold horror in its wake.'),
(793, 862, 'Toy Story', 'John Lasseter', 'Tom Hanks, Tim Allen, Don Rickles, Jim Varney, Wallace Shawn, John Ratzenberger', 'Joss Whedon, Andrew Stanton, Joel Cohen', 'Family, Comedy, Animation, Adventure', 1995, 'Pixar', '81', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXDfjJbdP4ijW5hWSBrPrlKpxab.jpg', 'Led by Woody, Andy\'s toys live happily in his room until Andy\'s birthday brings Buzz Lightyear onto the scene. Afraid of losing his place in Andy\'s heart, Woody plots against Buzz. But when circumstances separate Buzz and Woody from their owner, the duo eventually learns to put aside their differences.'),
(794, 863, 'Toy Story 2', 'John Lasseter', 'Tom Hanks, Tim Allen, Joan Cusack, Kelsey Grammer, Don Rickles, Jim Varney', 'Doug Chamberlin, Andrew Stanton, Rita Hsiao', 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 1999, 'Pixar', '92', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rbcp3ng8n1MKHjpeqW0L7Fnpzz.jpg', 'Andy heads off to Cowboy Camp, leaving his toys to their own devices. Things shift into high gear when an obsessive toy collector named Al McWhiggen, owner of Al\'s Toy Barn kidnaps Woody. Andy\'s toys mount a daring rescue mission, Buzz Lightyear meets his match and Woody has to decide where he and his heart truly belong.'),
(795, 10193, 'Toy Story 3', 'Lee Unkrich', 'Tom Hanks, Tim Allen, Joan Cusack, Don Rickles, Wallace Shawn, John Ratzenberger', 'Michael Arndt', 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 2010, 'Pixar', '103', 3.9, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbbXspMOwdvwWZgVN0nabZq03Ec.jpg', 'Woody, Buzz, and the rest of Andy\'s toys haven\'t been played with in years. With Andy about to go to college, the gang find themselves accidentally left at a nefarious day care center. The toys must band together to escape and return home to Andy.'),
(796, 301528, 'Toy Story 4', 'Josh Cooley', 'Tom Hanks, Tim Allen, Annie Potts, Tony Hale, Keegan-Michael Key, Madeleine McGraw', 'Stephany Folsom, Andrew Stanton', 'Family, Comedy, Animation, Adventure', 2019, 'Pixar', '100', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9kR8qbmQ01HwnvK4alvnQ2ca0L.jpg', 'Woody has always been confident about his place in the world, devoted to taking care of his kid—whether that\'s Andy or Bonnie. But after Bonnie creates a reluctant new toy called \"Forky\", a road trip adventure alongside old and new friends challenges everything Woody believes about loyalty, purpose, and what it truly means to be a toy.'),
(797, 274, 'The Silence of the Lambs', 'Jonathan Demme', 'Jodie Foster, Anthony Hopkins, Scott Glenn, Ted Levine, Anthony Heald, Brooke Smith', 'Ted Tally', 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 1991, 'Orion Pictures, Strong Heart, A Luta Continua', '119', 4.2, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uS9m8OBk1A8eM9I042bx8XXpqAq.jpg', 'Clarice Starling is a top student at the FBI\'s training academy.  Jack Crawford wants Clarice to interview Dr. Hannibal Lecter, a brilliant psychiatrist who is also a violent psychopath, serving life behind bars for various acts of murder and cannibalism.  Crawford believes that Lecter may have insight into a case and that Starling, as an attractive young woman, may be just the bait to draw him out.'),
(798, 39287, 'Stagecoach', 'Gordon Douglas', 'Ann-Margret, Red Buttons, Mike Connors, Alex Cord, Bing Crosby, Robert Cummings', 'Joseph Landon', 'Western', 1966, '20th Century Fox', '115', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsifrzutFIzt51FLVDbWW5AOTUG.jpg', 'A group of unlikely travelling companions find themselves on the same stagecoach to Cheyenne. They include a drunken doctor, a bar girl who\'s been thrown out of town, a professional gambler, a travelling liquor salesman, a banker who has decided to embezzle money, a gun-slinger out for revenge and a young woman going to join her army captain husband. All have secrets but when they are set upon by an Indian war party and then a family of outlaws, they find they must all work together if they are to stay alive.'),
(799, 9426, 'The Fly', 'David Cronenberg', 'Jeff Goldblum, Geena Davis, John Getz, Joy Boushel, Leslie Carlson, George Chuvalo', 'Charles Edward Pogue, David Cronenberg', 'Horror, Science Fiction', 1986, 'SLM Production Group, Brooksfilms', '96', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gZWMhJHRvaXdXsNhERtqNHYpH3.jpg', 'When brilliant, eccentric scientist Seth Brundle makes a huge technological breakthrough in teleportation, he decides to test it on himself. Unbeknownst to him, a common housefly manages to get inside the device and the two become one.'),
(800, 929204, 'Wallace & Gromit: Vengeance Most Fowl', 'Merlin Crossingham', 'Ben Whitehead, Peter Kay, Lauren Patel, Reece Shearsmith, Diane Morgan, Adjoa Andoh', 'Mark Burton', 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction, Family', 2024, 'Aardman', '79', 3.7, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUWFSBxTOiCinPdTOh3IDUXVemZ.jpg', 'Gromit’s concern that Wallace is becoming too dependent on his inventions proves justified, when Wallace invents a “smart” gnome that seems to develop a mind of its own. When it emerges that a vengeful figure from the past might be masterminding things, it falls to Gromit to battle sinister forces and save his master… or Wallace may never be able to invent again!'),
(801, 93, 'Anatomy of a Murder', 'Otto Preminger', 'James Stewart, Lee Remick, Ben Gazzara, Arthur O\'Connell, Eve Arden, Kathryn Grant', 'Wendell Mayes', 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 1959, 'Carlyle Productions', '161', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2G1QSAwtBv9luhEwErIgSRaU92.jpg', 'Semi-retired Michigan lawyer Paul Biegler takes the case of Army Lt. Manion, who murdered a local innkeeper after his wife claimed that he raped her. Over the course of an extensive trial, Biegler parries with District Attorney Lodwick and out-of-town prosecutor Claude Dancer to set his client free, but his case rests on the victim\'s mysterious business partner, who\'s hiding a dark secret.'),
(802, 10843, 'After Hours', 'Martin Scorsese', 'Griffin Dunne, Rosanna Arquette, Verna Bloom, Tommy Chong, Linda Fiorentino, Teri Garr', 'Martin Scorsese', 'Comedy, Thriller, Drama', 1985, 'Double Play, Geffen Pictures', '97', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eamOBurHBu0MIxohTIVcfxmZ6Z7.jpg', 'Desperate to escape his mind-numbing routine, uptown Manhattan office worker Paul Hackett ventures downtown for a hookup with a mystery woman.'),
(803, 262, 'The King of Comedy', 'Martin Scorsese', 'Robert De Niro, Jerry Lewis, Diahnne Abbott, Sandra Bernhard, Shelley Hack, Frederick de Cordova', 'Martin Scorsese', 'Drama, Comedy', 1982, 'Embassy International Pictures', '109', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m24EbHxT9NGYEkOlu29YcLOgjgK.jpg', 'Aspiring comic Rupert Pupkin attempts to achieve success in show business by stalking his idol, a late night talk-show host who craves his own privacy.'),
(804, 399055, 'The Shape of Water', 'Guillermo del Toro', 'Sally Hawkins, Michael Shannon, Richard Jenkins, Octavia Spencer, Michael Stuhlbarg, Doug Jones', 'Vanessa Taylor, Guillermo del Toro', 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 2017, 'Double Dare You, Fox Searchlight Pictures, Bull Productions, TSG Entertainment', '123', 3.6, 'US', 'English, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zfwPffUXpBrEP26yp0q1ckXDcj.jpg', 'An other-worldly story, set against the backdrop of Cold War era America circa 1962, where a mute janitor working at a lab falls in love with an amphibious man being held captive there and devises a plan to help him escape.'),
(805, 1059128, 'Queer', 'Luca Guadagnino', 'Daniel Craig, Drew Starkey, Jason Schwartzman, Lesley Manville, Henrique Zaga, Drew Droege', 'Justin Kuritzkes', 'Drama, Romance', 2024, 'Fremantle, The Apartment Pictures, Frenesy Film', '138', 3.3, 'US', 'English, Français, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xe4b2TMciLKA1C0JlhWxb4ENLln.jpg', 'In 1950s Mexico City, William Lee, an American ex-pat in his late forties, leads a solitary life amidst a small American community. However, the arrival in town of Eugene Allerton, a young student, stirs William into finally establishing a meaningful connection with someone.'),
(806, 3114, 'The Searchers', 'John Ford', 'John Wayne, Jeffrey Hunter, Vera Miles, Ward Bond, Natalie Wood, John Qualen', 'Frank S. Nugent', 'Western', 1956, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, C.V. Whitney Pictures', '119', 3.8, 'US', 'Español, English, ', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLBmgW0epNzJ1N9uzaVCjbyT94v.jpg', 'As a Civil War veteran spends years searching for a young niece captured by Indians, his motivation becomes increasingly questionable.'),
(807, 854, 'The Mask', 'Chuck Russell', 'Jim Carrey, Peter Riegert, Peter Greene, Amy Yasbeck, Richard Jeni, Orestes Matacena', 'Mike Werb', 'Comedy, Fantasy, Crime, Romance', 1994, 'Dark Horse Entertainment, New Line Cinema', '101', 3.5, 'US', 'svenska, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPC2eYub74zwf2tPGVtzSlBW6Oy.jpg', 'Timid bank clerk Stanley Ipkiss discovers a magical mask infused with the spirit of the Norse god Loki. Donning it transforms him into an unrestrained, green-faced, cartoon-like wild man. While the mask grants him the confidence to woo a local singer, it also makes him the target of a ruthless mobster.'),
(808, 843, 'In the Mood for Love', 'Wong Kar-Wai', 'Maggie Cheung, Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Siu Ping-Lam, Rebecca Pan, Kelly Lai Chen, Joe Cheung Tung-Cho', 'Wong Kar-Wai', 'Drama, Romance', 2000, 'Block 2 Pictures, Paradis Films, Jet Tone Production', '99', 4.0, 'HK', '广州话 / 廣州話, Français, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYypPT4bhqXfq1b6EnmxvRt6b2Y.jpg', 'In 1960s Hong Kong, two neighbors form an intimate bond after making a discovery about their spouses in this visually stunning tale of unrequited love.'),
(809, 11697, 'The Man Who Shot Liberty Valance', 'John Ford', 'John Wayne, James Stewart, Vera Miles, Lee Marvin, Edmond O\'Brien, Andy Devine', 'James Warner Bellah, Willis Goldbeck', 'Western', 1962, 'John Ford Productions, Paramount Pictures', '123', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4C1R0LEivLjbv3swAzJfzh0tzXl.jpg', 'Questions arise when Senator Stoddard attends the funeral of a local man named Tom Doniphon in a small Western town. Flashing back, we learn Doniphon saved Stoddard, then a lawyer, when he was roughed up by a crew of outlaws terrorizing the town, led by Liberty Valance. As the territory\'s safety hung in the balance, Doniphon and Stoddard, two of the only people standing up to him, proved to be very important, but different, foes to Valance.'),
(810, 549509, 'The Brutalist', 'Brady Corbet', 'Adrien Brody, Felicity Jones, Guy Pearce, Joe Alwyn, Raffey Cassidy, Stacy Martin', 'Brady Corbet', 'Drama', 2024, 'Brookstreet Pictures, Kaplan Morrison, Intake Films, Andrew Lauren Productions, Lipsync Productions, Richmond Pictures, Meyohas Studio, Carte Blanche, Pierce Capital Entertainment', '215', 3.5, 'US', 'Pусский, עִבְרִית, Magyar, , Italiano, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vP7Yd6couiAaw9jgMd5cjMRj3hQ.jpg', 'When an innovative modern architect flees post-war Europe, he is given the opportunity to rebuild his legacy. Set during the dawn of the modern United States (in Pennsylvania), his wife joins him, and their lives are forever changed by a demanding, wealthy patron.'),
(811, 3580, 'Changeling', 'Clint Eastwood', 'Angelina Jolie, John Malkovich, Jeffrey Donovan, Michael Kelly, Colm Feore, Jason Butler Harner', 'Clint Eastwood', 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 2008, 'Universal Pictures, Imagine Entertainment, Relativity Media, Malpaso Productions', '142', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9Qi39dL3PceGCH8afyC7QrhbhI.jpg', 'Los Angeles, 1928. When single mother Christine Collins leaves for work, her son vanishes without a trace. Five months later, the police reunite mother and son. But when Christine suspects that the boy returned to her isn\'t her child, her quest for truth exposes a world of corruption.'),
(812, 524, 'Casino', 'Martin Scorsese', 'Robert De Niro, Sharon Stone, Joe Pesci, James Woods, Don Rickles, Alan King', 'Martin Scorsese, Nicholas Pileggi', 'Crime, Drama', 1995, 'Universal Pictures, Syalis DA, Légende Films, Cappa/De Fina Productions', '179', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gziIkUSnYuj9ChCi8qOu2ZunpSC.jpg', 'In Las Vegas, two best friends--a casino executive and a Mafia enforcer--compete for a gambling empire and a fast-living, fast-loving socialite.'),
(813, 284, 'The Apartment', 'Billy Wilder', 'Jack Lemmon, Shirley MacLaine, Fred MacMurray, Ray Walston, Jack Kruschen, David Lewis', 'Billy Wilder', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 1960, 'The Mirisch Company', '126', 4.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhSRt1KKfRT0yEhEtRW3qp31JFU.jpg', 'Bud Baxter is a minor clerk in a huge New York insurance company, until he discovers a quick way to climb the corporate ladder. He lends out his apartment to the executives as a place to take their mistresses. Although he often has to deal with the aftermath of their visits, one night he\'s left with a major problem to solve.'),
(814, 5925, 'The Great Escape', 'John Sturges', 'Steve McQueen, James Garner, Richard Attenborough, James Donald, Charles Bronson, Donald Pleasence', 'James Clavell, W.R. Burnett', 'Adventure, Drama, War', 1963, 'The Mirisch Company, United Artists', '173', 4.0, 'US', 'English, Deutsch, Français, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBH4H8UMFxl139HaLz6lRuvsel8.jpg', 'The Nazis, exasperated at the number of escapes from their prison camps by a relatively small number of Allied prisoners, relocate them to a high-security \'escape-proof\' camp to sit out the remainder of the war. Undaunted, the prisoners plan one of the most ambitious escape attempts of World War II. Based on a true story.'),
(815, 11423, 'Memories of Murder', 'Bong Joon Ho', 'Song Kang-ho, Kim Sang-kyung, Kim Roi-ha, Song Jae-ho, Byun Hee-bong, Go Seo-hee', 'Bong Joon Ho', 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 2003, 'CJ Entertainment, Muhan Investment, Sidus', '131', 4.0, 'KR', '한국어/조선말, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcgUjx1QcupGzjntTVlnQ15lHqy.jpg', 'A sadistic serial rapist and murderer of young women terrorizes a small province in 1980s South Korea. To prevent further crimes, three increasingly desperate detectives with conflicting methods race against time to unravel the violent mind of the killer in a futile effort to solve the case.'),
(816, 9340, 'The Goonies', 'Richard Donner', 'Sean Astin, Josh Brolin, Jeff Cohen, Corey Feldman, Kerri Green, Martha Plimpton', 'Chris Columbus', 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 1985, 'Amblin Entertainment, Warner Bros. Pictures', '114', 3.8, 'US', 'English, Italiano, Español, 广州话 / 廣州話', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBU7gCjTCj9n2LTxvCSIXXOvHkD.jpg', 'Young teen Mikey Walsh and his friends set off on a quest to find Pirate One-Eyed Willie\'s treasure in hopes of saving their homes from demolition. However, on their quest to find the treasure, they run into a family of recently escaped criminals, determined to capture the kids and reach the treasure first.'),
(817, 847, 'Willow', 'Ron Howard', 'Warwick Davis, Val Kilmer, Joanne Whalley, Patricia Hayes, Gavan O\'Herlihy, Phil Fondacaro', 'Bob Dolman', 'Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 1988, 'Lucasfilm Ltd., Imagine Entertainment', '126', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAIRGMIdN7ZdZhflazdV2ezuJ9f.jpg', 'The evil Queen Bavmorda hunts the newborn princess Elora Danan, a child prophesied to bring about her downfall. When the royal infant is found by Willow, a timid farmer and aspiring sorcerer, he\'s entrusted with delivering her from evil.'),
(818, 974950, 'Emilia Pérez', 'Jacques Audiard', 'Zoe Saldaña, Karla Sofía Gascón, Selena Gomez, Adriana Paz, Edgar Ramírez, Mark Ivanir', 'Jacques Audiard', 'Drama, Thriller', 2024, 'Why Not Productions, Pathé, France 2 Cinéma, Page 114, Saint Laurent Productions, Saint Laurent, Library Pictures International, Logical Content Ventures, Les Films du Fleuve, The Veterans, Vixens, Casa Kafka Pictures, Pimienta Films', '132', 3.2, 'FR', 'Español, Français, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7seqaCaaXDNUHOx4DqwpoOH8pPa.jpg', 'Rita, an underrated lawyer working for a large law firm more interested in getting criminals out of jail than bringing them to justice, is hired by the leader of a criminal organization.'),
(819, 1578, 'Raging Bull', 'Martin Scorsese', 'Robert De Niro, Cathy Moriarty, Joe Pesci, Frank Vincent, Nicholas Colasanto, Theresa Saldana', 'Paul Schrader, Mardik Martin', 'Drama, History', 1980, 'United Artists, Winkler Films', '129', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WV7WlTS8LI1L5NkCgjWT9GSW3O.jpg', 'The life of boxer Jake LaMotta, whose violence and temper that led him to the top in the ring destroyed his life outside of it.'),
(820, 793, 'Blue Velvet', 'David Lynch', 'Isabella Rossellini, Kyle MacLachlan, Dennis Hopper, Laura Dern, Hope Lange, Dean Stockwell', 'David Lynch', 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 1986, 'DEG', '120', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6v1zYh2FKOYVddY5pCQhd4PO9uX.jpg', 'The discovery of a severed human ear found in a field leads a young man on an investigation related to a beautiful, mysterious nightclub singer and a group of psychopathic criminals who have kidnapped her child.'),
(821, 21484, 'Possession', 'Andrzej Żuławski', 'Isabelle Adjani, Sam Neill, Margit Carstensen, Heinz Bennent, Johanna Hofer, Carl Duering', 'Andrzej Żuławski', 'Horror', 1981, 'Gaumont, Oliane Productions, Marianne Productions, Soma Film Produktion', '124', 3.7, 'FR', 'English, Français, Deutsch', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9bnRn05riOKWftvQlLKa2gl51n.jpg', 'A young woman left her family for an unspecified reason. The husband determines to find out the truth and starts following his wife. At first, he suspects that a man is involved. But gradually, he finds out more and more strange behaviors and bizarre incidents that indicate something more than a possessed love affair.'),
(822, 76826, 'Grave of the Fireflies', 'Tōya Satō', 'Hoshi Ishida, Mao Sasaki, Ikki Sawamura, Yui Natsukawa, Nanako Matsushima, Mao Inoue', 'Tōya Satō', 'Drama', 2005, 'Nippon Television Network Corporation', '148', 4.0, 'JP', '日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/im6u58cPa9HlH5DqSnZGy0O37l5.jpg', 'Hisako loses her home in Tokyo to Allied bombing. With her husband fighting somewhere in Asia, she and her two children evacuate to a suburb of Kobe, where they share a house with Hisako\'s cousin, Kyoko. Kobe is bombed and Kyoko is killed. Hisako is forced to take care of Kyoko\'s two children in addition to her own, but there is not enough food for everyone.'),
(823, 950396, 'The Gorge', 'Scott Derrickson', 'Miles Teller, Anya Taylor-Joy, Sigourney Weaver, Ṣọpẹ́ Dìrísù, William Houston, Kobna Holdbrook-Smith', 'Scott Derrickson', 'Romance, Science Fiction, Thriller', 2025, 'Skydance Media, Crooked Highway, Apple Studios', '128', 3.8, 'US', 'English, Lietuvių', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iMBZzVZtG0oBug4TfqDb9ZxAOa.jpg', 'Two highly trained operatives grow close from a distance after being sent to guard opposite sides of a mysterious gorge. When an evil below emerges, they must work together to survive what lies within.'),
(824, 111, 'Scarface', 'Brian De Palma', 'Al Pacino, Steven Bauer, Michelle Pfeiffer, Mary Elizabeth Mastrantonio, Robert Loggia, Miriam Colon', 'Oliver Stone', 'Action, Crime, Drama', 1983, 'Universal Pictures, Martin Bregman Productions', '170', 4.1, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQ5ztdjvteGeboxtmRdXEChJOHh.jpg', 'After getting a green card in exchange for assassinating a Cuban government official, Tony Montana stakes a claim on the drug trade in Miami. Viciously murdering anyone who stands in his way, Tony eventually becomes the biggest drug lord in the state, controlling nearly all the cocaine that comes through Miami. But increased pressure from the police, wars with Colombian drug cartels and his own drug-fueled paranoia serve to fuel the flames of his eventual downfall.'),
(825, 1084199, 'Companion', 'Drew Hancock', 'Sophie Thatcher, Jack Quaid, Lukas Gage, Megan Suri, Harvey Guillén, Rupert Friend', 'Drew Hancock', 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 2025, 'BoulderLight Pictures, New Line Cinema, Vertigo Entertainment, Subconscious, Domain Entertainment', '97', 3.5, 'US', 'Pусский, Deutsch, 普通话, English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCoTgC3UyWGfyQ9thE10ulWR7bn.jpg', 'During a weekend getaway at a secluded lakeside estate, a group of friends finds themselves entangled in a web of secrets, deception, and advanced technology. As tensions rise and loyalties are tested, they uncover unsettling truths about themselves and the world around them.'),
(826, 925, 'Do the Right Thing', 'Spike Lee', 'Danny Aiello, Ossie Davis, Ruby Dee, Richard Edson, Giancarlo Esposito, Spike Lee', 'Spike Lee', 'Drama', 1989, 'Universal Pictures, 40 Acres and a Mule Filmworks', '120', 3.9, 'US', 'Italiano, English, Español, 한국어/조선말', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63rmSDPahrH7C1gEFYzRuIBAN9W.jpg', 'Sal is the Italian owner of a pizzeria in Brooklyn. A neighborhood local, Buggin\' Out, becomes upset when he sees that the pizzeria\'s Wall of Fame exhibits only Italian actors. Buggin\' Out believes a pizzeria in a black neighborhood should showcase black actors, but Sal disagrees. The wall becomes a symbol of racism and hate to Buggin\' Out and to other people in the neighborhood, and tensions rise.'),
(827, 4011, 'Beetlejuice', 'Tim Burton', 'Alec Baldwin, Geena Davis, Winona Ryder, Catherine O\'Hara, Jeffrey Jones, Michael Keaton', 'Warren Skaaren, Michael McDowell', 'Fantasy, Comedy', 1988, 'Geffen Pictures, Warner Bros. Pictures', '92', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnl6OWkyPpuMm595hmAxNW3rZFn.jpg', 'A newly dead New England couple seeks help from a deranged demon exorcist to scare an affluent New York family out of their home.'),
(828, 655, 'Paris, Texas', 'Wim Wenders', 'Harry Dean Stanton, Nastassja Kinski, Dean Stockwell, Hunter Carson, Aurore Clément, Bernhard Wicki', 'Wim Wenders', 'Drama', 1984, 'Road Movies, Argos films, WDR, Channel Four Films, Pro-ject Filmproduktion', '145', 4.0, 'DE', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sP27Qm4THyRZyHjHYMfIDtJP6YE.jpg', 'A man wanders out of the desert not knowing who he is. His brother finds him, and helps to pull his memory back of the life he led before he walked out on his family and disappeared four years earlier.'),
(829, 1018, 'Mulholland Drive', 'David Lynch', 'Naomi Watts, Laura Harring, Justin Theroux, Ann Miller, Mark Pellegrino, Robert Forster', 'David Lynch', 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 2001, 'StudioCanal, Les Films Alain Sarde, Asymmetrical Productions, Babbo', '147', 3.9, 'US', 'Español, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7A59t6ySylr1L7aubOQEA480vM.jpg', 'Blonde Betty Elms has only just arrived in Hollywood to become a movie star when she meets an enigmatic brunette with amnesia. Meanwhile, as the two set off to solve the second woman\'s identity, filmmaker Adam Kesher runs into ominous trouble while casting his latest project.'),
(830, 917496, 'Beetlejuice Beetlejuice', 'Tim Burton', 'Michael Keaton, Winona Ryder, Catherine O\'Hara, Jenna Ortega, Justin Theroux, Willem Dafoe', 'Miles Millar, Alfred Gough', 'Comedy, Fantasy', 2024, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Geffen Pictures, Plan B Entertainment, Tim Burton Productions, Tommy Harper Productions, Domain Entertainment', '105', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKgQzkUCnQmeTPkyIwHly2t6ZFI.jpg', 'After a family tragedy, three generations of the Deetz family return home to Winter River. Still haunted by Betelgeuse, Lydia\'s life is turned upside down when her teenage daughter, Astrid, accidentally opens the portal to the Afterlife.'),
(831, 8392, 'My Neighbor Totoro', 'Hayao Miyazaki', 'Noriko Hidaka, Chika Sakamoto, Hitoshi Takagi, Shigesato Itoi, Sumi Shimamoto, Tanie Kitabayashi', 'Hayao Miyazaki', 'Fantasy, Animation, Family', 1988, 'Studio Ghibli, Nibariki, Tokuma Shoten', '86', 4.0, 'JP', '日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtGDOeG9LzoerkDGZF9dnVeLppL.jpg', 'Two sisters move to the country with their father in order to be closer to their hospitalized mother, and discover the surrounding trees are inhabited by Totoros, magical spirits of the forest. When the youngest runs away from home, the older sister seeks help from the spirits to find her.'),
(832, 279, 'Amadeus', 'Miloš Forman', 'F. Murray Abraham, Tom Hulce, Elizabeth Berridge, Simon Callow, Roy Dotrice, Christine Ebersole', 'Peter Shaffer', 'Drama, History, Music', 1984, 'The Saul Zaentz Company', '160', 4.0, 'US', 'English, Italiano, Latin, Deutsch', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQRfiyfGvr1az0quaYyMram3Aqt.jpg', 'Disciplined Italian composer Antonio Salieri becomes consumed by jealousy and resentment towards the hedonistic and remarkably talented young Salzburger composer Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart.'),
(833, 1955, 'The Elephant Man', 'David Lynch', 'Anthony Hopkins, John Hurt, Anne Bancroft, John Gielgud, Wendy Hiller, Freddie Jones', 'David Lynch, Christopher De Vore, Eric Bergren', 'Drama, History', 1980, 'Brooksfilms', '124', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u0wpPYjuSt8DIe1Y3Vapnh8jcKE.jpg', 'A Victorian surgeon rescues a heavily disfigured man being mistreated by his \"owner\" as a side-show freak. Behind his monstrous façade, there is revealed a person of great intelligence and sensitivity. Based on the true story of Joseph Merrick (called John Merrick in the film), a severely deformed man in 19th century London.'),
(834, 12761, 'Autumn Sonata', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Ingrid Bergman, Liv Ullmann, Lena Nyman, Halvar Björk, Marianne Aminoff, Arne Bang-Hansen', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Drama, Music', 1978, 'Suede Film, Personafilm, ITC Entertainment', '93', 4.0, 'SE', 'English, svenska', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6beNbtCXv3GkzHkxkGYf38ib7v8.jpg', 'After a seven-year absence, Charlotte Andergast travels to Sweden to reunite with her daughter Eva. The pair have a troubled relationship: Charlotte sacrificed the responsibilities of motherhood for a career as a classical pianist. Over an emotional night, the pair reopen the wounds of the past. Charlotte gets another shock when she finds out that her mentally impaired daughter, Helena, is out of the asylum and living with Eva.'),
(835, 1064098, 'I\'ve Gone Viral', 'Jorge Coira', 'Blanca Suárez, Enric Auquer, Nicolás Furtado, Miguel Rellán, Daniel Fez, Esperanza Guardado', 'Araceli Gonda', 'Comedy', 2023, 'Bowfinger, Pampa Films, Warner Bros. Entertainment España, Glow, Atresmedia Cine', '96', 2.9, 'ES', 'Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4cWgo3jvuhCYDOpKRaCM0EAloRk.jpg', 'Mabel has gone viral. And in the least desirable way possible. During her flight to Polynesia, she unlocks her sleeping husband\'s cell phone with innocent intent, but what she finds is proof of infidelity.'),
(836, 1028196, 'Nickel Boys', 'RaMell Ross', 'Ethan Herisse, Brandon Wilson, Aunjanue Ellis-Taylor, Hamish Linklater, Gralen Bryant Banks, Fred Hechinger', 'RaMell Ross, Joslyn Barnes', 'Drama, History', 2024, 'Plan B Entertainment, Louverture Films, Anonymous Content, Orion Pictures', '140', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lu2vmmtStmTNMmSZl2LgrrQpLZo.jpg', 'Chronicles the powerful friendship between two young Black teenagers navigating the harrowing trials of reform school together in Florida.'),
(837, 696506, 'Mickey 17', 'Bong Joon Ho', 'Robert Pattinson, Naomi Ackie, Steven Yeun, Mark Ruffalo, Toni Collette, Anamaria Vartolomei', 'Bong Joon Ho', 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Adventure', 2025, 'Plan B Entertainment, Offscreen, Kate Street Picture Company, Domain Entertainment, Warner Bros. Pictures', '137', 3.4, 'GB, US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edKpE9B5qN3e559OuMCLZdW1iBZ.jpg', 'Unlikely hero Mickey Barnes finds himself in the extraordinary circumstance of working for an employer who demands the ultimate commitment to the job… to die, for a living.'),
(838, 1398, 'Stalker', 'Andrei Tarkovsky', 'Alisa Freyndlikh, Aleksandr Kaydanovskiy, Anatoliy Solonitsyn, Mykola Hrynko, Natalya Abramova, Faime Jurno', 'Andrei Tarkovsky', 'Science Fiction, Drama', 1979, 'Mosfilm', '162', 4.0, 'SU', 'Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qhOyf5C4s9ZdvY8d5JDx9DFMeT.jpg', 'Near a gray and unnamed city is the Zone, a place guarded by barbed wire and soldiers, and where the normal laws of physics are victim to frequent anomalies. A stalker guides two men into the Zone, specifically to an area in which deep-seated desires are granted.'),
(839, 106646, 'The Wolf of Wall Street', 'Martin Scorsese', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Jonah Hill, Margot Robbie, Matthew McConaughey, Kyle Chandler, Rob Reiner', 'Terence Winter', 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 2013, 'Red Granite Pictures, Appian Way, Sikelia Productions, EMJAG Productions', '180', 4.0, 'US', 'English, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kW9LmvYHAaS9iA0tHmZVq8hQYoq.jpg', 'A New York stockbroker refuses to cooperate in a large securities fraud case involving corruption on Wall Street, corporate banking world and mob infiltration. Based on Jordan Belfort\'s autobiography.'),
(840, 16858, 'All That Jazz', 'Bob Fosse', 'Roy Scheider, Jessica Lange, Ann Reinking, Leland Palmer, Cliff Gorman, Ben Vereen', 'Bob Fosse', 'Drama', 1979, 'Columbia Pictures, 20th Century Fox', '123', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/culCEdj4srLljefgn4XKd6k3C5t.jpg', 'Joe Gideon is at the top of the heap, one of the most successful directors and choreographers in musical theater. But he can feel his world slowly collapsing around him - his obsession with work has almost destroyed his personal life, and only his bottles of pills keep him going.'),
(841, 968, 'Dog Day Afternoon', 'Sidney Lumet', 'Al Pacino, John Cazale, Charles Durning, Chris Sarandon, James Broderick, Penelope Allen', 'Frank Pierson', 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 1975, 'Artists Entertainment Complex', '125', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mavrhr0ig2aCRR8d48yaxtD5aMQ.jpg', 'Based on the true story of would-be Brooklyn bank robbers John Wojtowicz and Salvatore Naturile. Sonny and Sal attempt a bank heist which quickly turns sour and escalates into a hostage situation and stand-off with the police. As Sonny\'s motives for the robbery are slowly revealed and things become more complicated, the heist turns into a media circus.'),
(842, 1226406, 'Love Hurts', 'Jonathan Eusebio', 'Ke Huy Quan, Ariana DeBose, Daniel Wu, Mustafa Shakir, Lio Tipton, Cam Gigandet', 'Luke Passmore', 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 2025, '87North Productions, Universal Pictures', '83', 2.8, 'US', 'English, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/skPPVeHoTTVVSJlb0Ib5vrqiuA4.jpg', 'A realtor is pulled back into the life he left behind after his former partner-in-crime resurfaces with an ominous message. With his crime-lord brother also on his trail, he must confront his past and the history he never fully buried.'),
(843, 149, 'Akira', 'Katsuhiro Otomo', 'Mitsuo Iwata, Nozomu Sasaki, Mami Koyama, Taro Ishida, Mizuho Suzuki, Tessyo Genda', 'Izo Hashimoto, Katsuhiro Otomo', 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 1988, 'MBS, Sumitomo Corporation, TOHO, Kodansha, Tokyo Movie Shinsha, Bandai, Hakuhodo, LaserDisc Corporation', '124', 4.0, 'JP', '日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/neZ0ykEsPqxamsX6o5QNUFILQrz.jpg', 'A secret military project endangers Neo-Tokyo when it turns a biker gang member into a rampaging psychic psychopath that only two teenagers and a group of psychics can stop.'),
(844, 11778, 'The Deer Hunter', 'Michael Cimino', 'Robert De Niro, Christopher Walken, John Cazale, John Savage, Meryl Streep, George Dzundza', 'Deric Washburn', 'Drama, War', 1978, 'Universal Pictures, EMI Films', '183', 4.0, 'US', 'English, Français, Pусский, Tiếng Việt', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbGtogDZOg09bm42KIpCXUXICkh.jpg', 'Three steelworkers enlist in the army and are sent to Vietnam, one leaving behind a rushed marriage, the others a shared love. What they encounter during the war changes their lives forever.'),
(845, 592, 'The Conversation', 'Francis Ford Coppola', 'Gene Hackman, John Cazale, Allen Garfield, Frederic Forrest, Cindy Williams, Michael Higgins', 'Francis Ford Coppola', 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 1974, 'The Directors Company, The Coppola Company', '115', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHqVBwcv1SGymOpUueRoKzcmdes.jpg', 'A paranoid, secretive surveillance expert has a crisis of conscience when he suspects that the couple he is spying on will be murdered.'),
(846, 336, 'Duck, You Sucker', 'Sergio Leone', 'Rod Steiger, James Coburn, Romolo Valli, Maria Monti, Rik Battaglia, Franco Graziosi', 'Luciano Vincenzoni, Sergio Leone, Sergio Donati', 'Western', 1971, 'Rafran Cinematografica, San Marco, Euro International Films', '157', 3.8, 'ES, US, IT', 'Español, Italiano', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWmAtZf83qpOai0fzehf7Hn1S3R.jpg', 'At the beginning of the 1913 Mexican Revolution, greedy bandit Juan Miranda and idealist John H. Mallory, an Irish Republican Army explosives expert on the lam from the British, fall in with a band of revolutionaries plotting to strike a national bank. When it turns out that the government has been using the bank as a hiding place for illegally detained political prisoners -- who are freed by the blast -- Miranda becomes a revolutionary hero against his will.'),
(847, 10774, 'Network', 'Sidney Lumet', 'Faye Dunaway, William Holden, Peter Finch, Robert Duvall, Wesley Addy, Ned Beatty', 'Sidney Lumet', 'Drama', 1976, 'Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer', '122', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZomlHsaALUtkFeMDwdYmwS2Pbo.jpg', 'When veteran anchorman Howard Beale is forced to retire his 25-year post because of his age, he announces to viewers that he will kill himself during his farewell broadcast. Network executives rethink their decision when his fanatical tirade results in a spike in ratings.'),
(848, 203, 'Mean Streets', 'Martin Scorsese', 'Robert De Niro, Harvey Keitel, David Proval, Amy Robinson, Richard Romanus, Cesare Danova', 'Martin Scorsese, Mardik Martin', 'Drama, Crime', 1973, 'Taplin-Perry-Scorsese Productions', '112', 3.5, 'US', 'English, Italiano', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9msfwOeGc9uL1iRRTBdEf15XonC.jpg', 'A small-time hood must choose from among love, friendship and the chance to rise within the mob.'),
(849, 777443, 'The Electric State', 'Joe Russo', 'Millie Bobby Brown, Chris Pratt, Ke Huy Quan, Jason Alexander, Woody Norman, Giancarlo Esposito', 'Christopher Markus, Stephen McFeely', 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 2025, 'AGBO, Skybound Entertainment', '125', 3.2, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sI2NiMU8o65hmIMY0JI9CjJ0p7f.jpg', 'An orphaned teen hits the road with a mysterious robot to find her long-lost brother, teaming up with a smuggler and his wisecracking sidekick.'),
(850, 43939, 'I\'m Still Here', 'Casey Affleck', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Antony Langdon, Carey Perloff, Larry McHale, Casey Affleck, Jack Nicholson', 'Casey Affleck', 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 2010, 'They Are Going To Kill Us Productions', '107', 3.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8c53OPv2miF6vzpVXQZX8jw1pJ.jpg', 'I\'m Still Here is a portrayal of a tumultuous year in the life of actor Joaquin Phoenix. With remarkable access, the film follows the Oscar-nominee as he announces his retirement from a successful film career in the fall of 2008 and sets off to reinvent himself as a hip-hop musician. The film is a portrait of an artist at a crossroads and explores notions of courage and creative reinvention, as well as the ramifications of a life spent in the public eye.'),
(851, 985, 'Eraserhead', 'David Lynch', 'Jack Nance, Charlotte Stewart, Allen Joseph, Jeanne Bates, Judith Roberts, Laurel Near', 'David Lynch', 'Horror, Science Fiction', 1977, 'AFI', '89', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxveW3mGVc0DzLdOmtkZsgd7c3B.jpg', 'First-time father Henry Spencer tries to survive his industrial environment, his angry girlfriend, and the unbearable screams of his newly born mutant child.'),
(852, 8416, 'The Conformist', 'Bernardo Bertolucci', 'Jean-Louis Trintignant, Stefania Sandrelli, Gastone Moschin, Dominique Sanda, Enzo Tarascio, Fosco Giachetti', 'Bernardo Bertolucci', 'Drama', 1971, 'Marianne Productions, Maran Film, Mars Film Produzione', '108', 3.8, 'IT', '普通话, Français, Italiano, Latin', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLJjFRqIJAK8qz0OKYnpKCblZNK.jpg', 'A weak-willed Italian man becomes a fascist flunky who goes abroad to arrange the assassination of his old teacher, now a political dissident.'),
(853, 8265, 'Welcome to the Sticks', 'Dany Boon', 'Kad Merad, Dany Boon, Zoé Félix, Lorenzo Ausilia-Foret, Anne Marivin, Philippe Duquesne', 'Dany Boon, Alexandre Charlot, Franck Magnier', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 2008, 'Pathé Renn Productions, Hirsch, Pathé, TF1 Films Production, Les Productions du Ch\'timi, Pictanovo', '106', 3.4, 'FR', 'Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnUkc60SkI1PCY1SyfLFpZc0T7C.jpg', 'Although living a comfortable life in Salon-de-Provence, a charming town in the South of France, Julie has been feeling depressed for a while. To please her, Philippe Abrams, a post office administrator, her husband, tries to obtain a transfer to a seaside town, on the French Riviera, at any cost. The trouble is that he is caught red-handed while trying to scam an inspector. Philippe is immediately banished to the distant unheard of town of Bergues, in the Far North of France...'),
(854, 15383, 'Army of Shadows', 'Jean-Pierre Melville', 'Lino Ventura, Paul Meurisse, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Simone Signoret, Claude Mann, Paul Crauchet', 'Jean-Pierre Melville', 'War, Drama, Thriller, History', 1969, 'Fono Roma, Les Films Corona', '145', 3.9, 'FR', 'Deutsch, English, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqNZWM9bspt8zaDvVRIRiWxRVJ7.jpg', 'Betrayed by an informant, Philippe Gerbier finds himself trapped in a torturous Nazi prison camp. Though Gerbier escapes to rejoin the Resistance in occupied Marseilles, France, and exacts his revenge on the informant, he must continue a quiet, seemingly endless battle against the Nazis in an atmosphere of tension, paranoia and distrust.'),
(855, 235, 'Stand by Me', 'Rob Reiner', 'Wil Wheaton, River Phoenix, Corey Feldman, Jerry O\'Connell, Kiefer Sutherland, Casey Siemaszko', 'Raynold Gideon, Bruce A. Evans', 'Drama, Adventure', 1986, 'Act III Productions', '89', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vz0w9BSehcqjDcJOjRaCk7fgJe7.jpg', 'After learning that a boy their age has been accidentally killed near their rural homes, four boys decide to go see the body. Gordie, Vern, Chris, and Teddy encounter a mean junk man and a marsh full of leeches, but they also learn more about one another and their very different home lives. Just a lark at first, the boys\' adventure evolves into a defining event in their lives.'),
(856, 11878, 'Yojimbo', 'Akira Kurosawa', 'Toshirō Mifune, Tatsuya Nakadai, Yōko Tsukasa, Isuzu Yamada, Daisuke Katō, Seizaburō Kawazu', 'Ryuzo Kikushima, Akira Kurosawa', 'Drama, Thriller', 1961, 'TOHO', '110', 4.0, 'JP', '日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tN7kYPjRhDolpui9sc9Eq9n5b2O.jpg', 'A nameless ronin, or samurai with no master, enters a small village in feudal Japan where two rival businessmen are struggling for control of the local gambling trade. Taking the name Sanjuro Kuwabatake, the ronin convinces both silk merchant Tazaemon and sake merchant Tokuemon to hire him as a personal bodyguard, then artfully sets in motion a full-scale gang war between the two ambitious and unscrupulous men.'),
(857, 1075456, 'O\'Dessa', 'Geremy Jasper', 'Sadie Sink, Kelvin Harrison Jr., Murray Bartlett, Regina Hall, Pokey LaFarge, Mark Boone Junior', 'Geremy Jasper', 'Music, Drama, Science Fiction', 2025, 'Searchlight Pictures, RT Features, Department of Motion Pictures', '106', 2.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7EcAvzYaYfKv4JXKroJYfaTzSH.jpg', 'A farm girl is on an epic quest to recover a cherished family heirloom. Her journey leads her to a strange and dangerous city where she meets her one true love – but in order to save his soul, she must put the power of destiny and song to the ultimate test.'),
(858, 14537, 'Harakiri', 'Masaki Kobayashi', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Akira Ishihama, Shima Iwashita, Tetsuro Tamba, Masao Mishima, Ichirō Nakatani', 'Shinobu Hashimoto', 'Action, Drama, History', 1962, 'Shochiku', '135', 4.2, 'JP', '日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zK7HsOC7QxW1ldKIeFG8YJ5F2Eb.jpg', 'Down-on-his-luck veteran Tsugumo Hanshirō enters the courtyard of the prosperous House of Iyi. Unemployed, and with no family, he hopes to find a place to commit seppuku—and a worthy second to deliver the coup de grâce in his suicide ritual. The senior counselor for the Iyi clan questions the ronin’s resolve and integrity, suspecting Hanshirō of seeking charity rather than an honorable end. What follows is a pair of interlocking stories which lay bare the difference between honor and respect, and promises to examine the legendary foundations of the Samurai code.'),
(859, 10494, 'Perfect Blue', 'Satoshi Kon', 'Junko Iwao, Rica Matsumoto, Shiho Niiyama, Masaaki Okura, Shinpachi Tsuji, Emiko Furukawa', 'Sadayuki Murai', 'Animation, Thriller', 1998, 'Madhouse, Rex Entertainment, Kotobuki Seihan Printing, Asahi Broadcasting Corporation, Fangs, ONIRO', '81', 4.2, 'JP', '日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WTiOCfDPP8XV4jqfloiVWf7KHq.jpg', 'Rising pop star Mima Kirigoe quits singing to pursue a career as an actress. After she takes up a role on a popular detective show, her handlers and collaborators begin turning up murdered. Harboring feelings of guilt and haunted by visions of her former self, Mima\'s reality and fantasy meld into a frenzied paranoia.'),
(860, 11712, 'Sanjuro', 'Akira Kurosawa', 'Toshirō Mifune, Tatsuya Nakadai, Keiju Kobayashi, Yūzō Kayama, Reiko Dan, Takashi Shimura', 'Akira Kurosawa, Ryuzo Kikushima, Hideo Oguni', 'Drama, Action, Comedy', 1962, 'TOHO', '96', 4.0, 'JP', '日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zW47oIH3bc3ggmmmzTvKqM4Fqjk.jpg', 'In this companion piece and sequel to \"Yojimbo,\" jaded samurai Sanjuro helps an idealistic group of young warriors weed out their clan\'s evil influences, and in the process turns their image of a proper samurai on its ear.'),
(861, 15121, 'The Sound of Music', 'Robert Wise', 'Julie Andrews, Christopher Plummer, Eleanor Parker, Charmian Carr, Nicholas Hammond, Heather Menzies', 'Ernest Lehman', 'Drama, Family, Music, Romance', 1965, 'Robert Wise Productions, Argyle Enterprises, 20th Century Fox', '174', 3.9, 'US', 'English, Deutsch', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6CrUZypAsBCaRWX0M3RVRDbhNS.jpg', 'In the years before World War II, a tomboyish postulant at an Austrian abbey is hired as a governess in the home of a widowed naval captain with seven children and brings a new love of life and music into the home.'),
(862, 4951, '10 Things I Hate About You', 'Gil Junger', 'Heath Ledger, Julia Stiles, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Larisa Oleynik, David Krumholtz, Andrew Keegan', 'Gil Junger', 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 1999, 'Mad Chance, Jaret Entertainment', '97', 3.8, 'US', 'English, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujERk3aKABXU3NDXOAxEQYTHe9A.jpg', 'On the first day at his new school, Cameron instantly falls for Bianca, the gorgeous girl of his dreams. The only problem is that Bianca is forbidden to date until her ill-tempered, completely un-dateable older sister Kat goes out, too. In an attempt to solve his problem, Cameron singles out the only guy who could possibly be a match for Kat: a mysterious bad boy with a nasty reputation of his own.'),
(863, 821, 'Judgment at Nuremberg', 'Stanley Kramer', 'Spencer Tracy, Richard Widmark, Maximilian Schell, Burt Lancaster, Marlene Dietrich, Judy Garland', 'Abby Mann', 'Drama, History', 1961, 'Roxlom Films, Stanley Kramer Productions', '191', 4.0, 'US', 'English, Deutsch', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6vYatvui1EXeFYfpDX4rcbueuP.jpg', 'In 1947, four German judges who served on the bench during the Nazi regime face a military tribunal to answer charges of crimes against humanity. Chief Justice Haywood hears evidence and testimony not only from lead defendant Ernst Janning and his defense attorney Hans Rolfe, but also from the widow of a Nazi general, an idealistic U.S. Army captain and reluctant witness Irene Wallner.'),
(864, 805, 'Rosemary\'s Baby', 'Roman Polanski', 'Mia Farrow, John Cassavetes, Ruth Gordon, Sidney Blackmer, Maurice Evans, Ralph Bellamy', 'Roman Polanski', 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 1968, 'William Castle Productions', '138', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYgvlHceRFjAFbsNeMInYcLZLUb.jpg', 'A young couple, Rosemary and Guy, moves into an infamous New York apartment building, known by frightening legends and mysterious events, with the purpose of starting a family.'),
(865, 451915, 'Beautiful Boy', 'Felix van Groeningen', 'Steve Carell, Timothée Chalamet, Maura Tierney, Amy Ryan, Christian Convery, Oakley Bull', 'Luke Davies, Felix van Groeningen', 'Drama', 2018, 'Plan B Entertainment', '121', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2Gfv0mz3xePsgyCPHovrnFL1sB.jpg', 'After he and his first wife separate, journalist David Sheff struggles to help their teenage son, who goes from experimenting with drugs to becoming devastatingly addicted to methamphetamine.');
INSERT INTO `peliculas` (`idPelicula`, `idApi`, `nombrePelicula`, `directorPelicula`, `actorPelicula`, `guionistaPelicula`, `generoPelicula`, `anoPelicula`, `companiaPelicula`, `duracionPelicula`, `ratingAvgPelicula`, `paisPelicula`, `idiomaPelicula`, `posterPelicula`, `sinopsisPelicula`) VALUES
(866, 499, 'Cléo from 5 to 7', 'Agnès Varda', 'Corinne Marchand, Antoine Bourseiller, Dominique Davray, Dorothée Blanck, Michel Legrand, José Luis de Vilallonga', 'Agnès Varda', 'Drama', 1962, 'Rome-Paris Films, Ciné-Tamaris', '90', 3.8, 'FR', 'Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oelBStY4xpguaplRv15P3Za7Xsr.jpg', 'Agnès Varda eloquently captures Paris in the sixties with this real-time portrait of a singer set adrift in the city as she awaits test results of a biopsy. A chronicle of the minutes of one woman’s life, Cléo from 5 to 7 is a spirited mix of vivid vérité and melodrama, featuring a score by Michel Legrand and cameos by Jean-Luc Godard and Anna Karina.'),
(867, 12493, 'High and Low', 'Akira Kurosawa', 'Toshirō Mifune, Tatsuya Nakadai, Kyōko Kagawa, Tatsuya Mihashi, Isao Kimura, Kenjirō Ishiyama', 'Eijiro Hisaita, Ryuzo Kikushima, Hideo Oguni', 'Drama, Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 1963, 'TOHO, Kurosawa Production', '142', 4.2, 'JP', '日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tgNjemQPG96uIezpiUiXFcer5ga.jpg', 'A Yokohama shoe executive faces a wrenching choice when kidnappers mistakenly seize his chauffeur’s son but demand the ransom anyway.'),
(868, 4808, 'Charade', 'Stanley Donen', 'Cary Grant, Audrey Hepburn, Walter Matthau, James Coburn, George Kennedy, Dominique Minot', 'Peter Stone', 'Comedy, Mystery, Romance', 1963, 'Stanley Donen Films, Universal Pictures', '113', 3.9, 'US', 'English, Français, Deutsch, Italiano', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqaPjC5FQidtKY65jbAKZPiOTaS.jpg', 'After Regina Lampert falls for the dashing Peter Joshua on a skiing holiday in the French Alps, she discovers upon her return to Paris that her husband has been murdered. Soon, she and Peter are giving chase to three of her late husband\'s World War II cronies, Tex, Scobie and Gideon, who are after a quarter of a million dollars the quartet stole while behind enemy lines.'),
(869, 164, 'Breakfast at Tiffany\'s', 'Blake Edwards', 'Audrey Hepburn, George Peppard, Patricia Neal, Buddy Ebsen, Martin Balsam, José Luis de Vilallonga', 'George Axelrod', 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 1961, 'Paramount Pictures, Jurow-Shepherd', '115', 3.8, 'US', 'English, Português', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79xm4gXw4l7A5D0XukUOJRocFYQ.jpg', 'Holly Golightly is an eccentric New York City playgirl determined to marry a Brazilian millionaire. But when young writer Paul Varjak moves into her apartment building, her past threatens to get in their way.'),
(870, 913290, 'Barbarian', 'Zach Cregger', 'Georgina Campbell, Justin Long, Bill Skarsgård, Richard Brake, Matthew Patrick Davis, Jaymes Butler', 'Zach Cregger', 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 2022, 'BoulderLight Pictures, Vertigo Entertainment, Regency Enterprises, Hammerstone Studios, Almost Never Films', '103', 3.4, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idT5mnqPcJgSkvpDX7pJffBzdVH.jpg', 'In town for a job interview, a young woman arrives at her Airbnb late at night only to find that it has been mistakenly double-booked and a strange man is already staying there. Against her better judgement, she decides to stay the night anyway.'),
(871, 1083968, 'Locked', 'David Yarovesky', 'Bill Skarsgård, Anthony Hopkins, Ashley Cartwright, Michael Eklund, Navid Charkhi, Sofia Tesema', 'David Yarovesky', 'Horror, Thriller', 2025, 'north.five.six, ZQ Entertainment, R.U. Robot Studios, Arcana Studio, Sillen Productions, BondIt Media Capital, Exemplary Films, Magic Button Films, Longevity Pictures, Blue Rider Pictures, Raimi Productions, The Avenue Entertainment, A-A Productions', '95', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhkiqXpfpufwxVrdSftzeKIANl3.jpg', 'When Eddie breaks into a luxury SUV, he steps into a deadly trap set by William, a self-proclaimed vigilante delivering his own brand of twisted justice. With no means of escape, Eddie must fight to survive in a ride where escape is an illusion, survival is a nightmare, and justice shifts into high gear.'),
(872, 1233413, 'Sinners', 'Ryan Coogler', 'Michael B. Jordan, Hailee Steinfeld, Miles Caton, Jack O\'Connell, Wunmi Mosaku, Jayme Lawson', 'Ryan Coogler', 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 2025, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Proximity Media, Domain Entertainment', '138', 3.8, 'US', '普通话, English, Èdè Yorùbá', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWPgbnt2LSqkQ6cdQc0SZN9CpLm.jpg', 'Trying to leave their troubled lives behind, twin brothers return to their hometown to start again, only to discover that an even greater evil is waiting to welcome them back.'),
(873, 439, 'La Dolce Vita', 'Federico Fellini', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Anita Ekberg, Anouk Aimée, Yvonne Furneaux, Magali Noël, Alain Cuny', 'Brunello Rondi, Pier Paolo Pasolini, Federico Fellini', 'Comedy, Drama', 1960, 'Cinecittà Studios, Pathé Consortium Cinéma, Riama Film', '174', 4.0, 'IT', 'Deutsch, English, Français, Italiano', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZ2v0DAX4aCZartCzZdg4ZinSW2.jpg', 'Episodic journey of journalist Marcello who struggles to find his place in the world, torn between the allure of Rome\'s elite social scene and the stifling domesticity offered by his girlfriend, all the while searching for a way to become a serious writer.'),
(874, 881415, 'Love Me', 'Andrew Zuchero', 'Kristen Stewart, Steven Yeun', 'Andrew Zuchero, Sam Zuchero', 'Romance, Drama, Science Fiction', 2025, 'AgX, 2AM, Shivhans Pictures', '92', 3.0, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uX8Z3qWJ5OjV1uP7yT6yRlw9UL9.jpg', 'In a story that spans billions of years, a buoy and a satellite meet online long after humanity’s extinction. As they learn what life was like on Earth, they discover themselves and what it means to be alive and in love.'),
(875, 1153714, 'Death of a Unicorn', 'Alex Scharfman', 'Paul Rudd, Jenna Ortega, Will Poulter, Richard E. Grant, Téa Leoni, Sunita Mani', 'Alex Scharfman', 'Horror, Fantasy, Comedy', 2025, 'A24, Square Peg, Secret Engine, Ley Line Entertainment, Monoceros Media', '107', 3.2, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWlF2i51zUq7BUq4iJte1g9NyIM.jpg', 'A father and daughter accidentally hit and kill a unicorn while en route to a weekend retreat, where his billionaire boss seeks to exploit the creature’s miraculous curative properties.'),
(876, 986056, 'Thunderbolts*', 'Jake Schreier', 'Florence Pugh, Sebastian Stan, Julia Louis-Dreyfus, Lewis Pullman, David Harbour, Wyatt Russell', 'Eric Pearson, Joanna Calo', 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 2025, 'Marvel Studios, Kevin Feige Productions', '127', 3.6, 'US', 'English, Italiano, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqcexYHbiTBfDIdDWxrxPtVndBX.jpg', 'After finding themselves ensnared in a death trap, seven disillusioned castoffs must embark on a dangerous mission that will force them to confront the darkest corners of their pasts.'),
(877, 1195506, 'Novocaine', 'Dan Berk', 'Jack Quaid, Amber Midthunder, Ray Nicholson, Betty Gabriel, Matt Walsh, Jacob Batalon', 'Dan Berk, Robert Olsen', 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 2025, 'Safehouse Pictures, Paramount Pictures, Infrared Pictures, Domain Entertainment, Circle Management + Production', '110', 3.4, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmMHGz9dVRaMY6rRAlEX4W0Wdhm.jpg', 'When the girl of his dreams is kidnapped, everyman Nate turns his inability to feel pain into an unexpected strength in his fight to get her back.'),
(878, 958487, 'Plan 75', 'Chie Hayakawa', 'Chieko Baisho, Hayato Isomura, Stefanie Arianne, Yuumi Kawai, Taka Takao, Hisako Ôkata', 'Chie Hayakawa', 'Drama, Science Fiction', 2022, 'Loaded Films, Urban Factory, Happinet Phantom Studios, Dongyu Club, WOWOW, DFI, FUSEE', '113', 3.3, 'JP', '日本語, English, ', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWmmZayMOLC8zCz59TcwsiAjYmT.jpg', 'In a Japan of the near future, the government program Plan 75 encourages senior citizens to be voluntarily euthanized to remedy a super-aged society. An elderly woman whose means of survival are vanishing, a pragmatic Plan 75 salesman, and a young Filipino laborer face choices of life and death.'),
(879, 1241436, 'Warfare', 'Ray Mendoza', 'D\'Pharaoh Woon-A-Tai, Will Poulter, Cosmo Jarvis, Kit Connor, Finn Bennett, Taylor John Smith', 'Ray Mendoza, Alex Garland', 'War, Action', 2025, 'DNA Films, A24', '95', 3.5, 'US', 'العربية, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l39TlELomwysfsr37vrvCV6rmaQ.jpg', 'A platoon of Navy SEALs embarks on a dangerous mission in Ramadi, Iraq, with the chaos and brotherhood of war retold through their memories of the event.'),
(880, 496243, 'Parasite', 'Bong Joon Ho', 'Song Kang-ho, Lee Sun-kyun, Cho Yeo-jeong, Choi Woo-shik, Park So-dam, Lee Jung-eun', 'Han Jin-won, Bong Joon Ho', 'Comedy, Thriller, Drama', 2019, 'Barunson E&A', '133', 4.2, 'KR', 'English, Deutsch, 한국어/조선말', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IiTTgloJzvGI1TAYymCfbfl3vT.jpg', 'All unemployed, Ki-taek\'s family takes peculiar interest in the wealthy and glamorous Parks for their livelihood until they get entangled in an unexpected incident.'),
(881, 289, 'Casablanca', 'Michael Curtiz', 'Humphrey Bogart, Ingrid Bergman, Paul Henreid, Claude Rains, Conrad Veidt, Sydney Greenstreet', 'Philip G. Epstein, Julius J. Epstein, Howard E. Koch', 'Drama, Romance', 1943, 'Warner Bros. Pictures', '102', 4.1, 'US', 'Deutsch, Français, Italiano, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGCEKlJo2CnWydQj7aamY7s1S7Q.jpg', 'In Casablanca, Morocco in December 1941, a cynical American expatriate meets a former lover, with unforeseen complications.'),
(882, 947, 'Lawrence of Arabia', 'David Lean', 'Peter O\'Toole, Alec Guinness, Omar Sharif, Anthony Quinn, Jack Hawkins, José Ferrer', 'Michael Wilson, Robert Bolt', 'Adventure, History, War', 1962, 'Horizon Pictures', '228', 4.0, 'GB', 'العربية, English, Português, Türkçe', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiAm0EtDvyGqNpVoieRw4u65vD1.jpg', 'During World War I, English officer Thomas Edward \'T.E.\' Lawrence sets out to unite and lead the diverse, often warring, Arab tribes to fight the Turks.'),
(883, 1440171, 'The Portuguese House', 'Avelina Prat', 'Manolo Solo, Maria de Medeiros, Branka Katić, Rita Cabaço, Xavi Mira, Morgan Blasco', 'Avelina Prat', 'Drama', 2025, 'Distinto Films, O Som e a Fúria, Jaibo Films, RTP, RTVE, 3Cat, À Punt, Instituto de la Cinematografía y de las Artes Audiovisuales, Generalitat de Catalunya - Departament de Cultura, ICA, ICO, Crea SGR', '114', 3.3, 'ES', 'Português, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Xu3KumdXHDpUOR9inJoAMtIcrM.jpg', 'The disappearance of his wife leaves Fernando, a quiet geography teacher, completely devastated. Aimless, he assumes another man’s identity as a gardener on a Portuguese estate, where he forms an unexpected friendship with the owner, stepping into a new life that isn’t his own.'),
(884, 552524, 'Lilo & Stitch', 'Dean Fleischer Camp', 'Maia Kealoha, Sydney Agudong, Chris Sanders, Zach Galifianakis, Billy Magnussen, Courtney B. Vance', 'Chris Kekaniokalani Bright, Mike Van Waes', 'Family, Science Fiction, Comedy', 2025, 'Walt Disney Pictures, Rideback', '108', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckQzKpQJO4ZQDCN5evdpKcfm7Ys.jpg', 'The wildly funny and touching story of a lonely Hawaiian girl and the fugitive alien who helps to mend her broken family.'),
(885, 37257, 'Witness for the Prosecution', 'Billy Wilder', 'Tyrone Power, Marlene Dietrich, Charles Laughton, Elsa Lanchester, John Williams, Henry Daniell', 'Billy Wilder, Harry Kurnitz', 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 1957, 'Edward Small Productions', '116', 4.1, 'US', 'Deutsch, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCj4EfuehAlgBwVd3diyWyhuuau.jpg', 'An ailing barrister is thrust back into the courtroom in what becomes one of the most unusual and eventful murder cases of the lawyer\'s career when he finds himself defending a man being tried for the murder of a socialite.'),
(886, 1239655, 'Friendship', 'Andrew DeYoung', 'Tim Robinson, Paul Rudd, Kate Mara, Jack Dylan Grazer, Rick Worthy, Whitmer Thomas', 'Andrew DeYoung', 'Comedy, Drama', 2025, 'BoulderLight Pictures, Fifth Season, Friends Night', '100', 3.2, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eikAu9gPJTQQmwFwa1zX5Hfz96P.jpg', 'Suburban dad Craig falls hard for his charismatic new neighbor Austin, and his attempts to make an adult male friend threatens to ruin both of their lives.'),
(887, 1137350, 'The Phoenician Scheme', 'Wes Anderson', 'Benicio del Toro, Mia Threapleton, Michael Cera, Riz Ahmed, Tom Hanks, Bryan Cranston', 'Wes Anderson', 'Comedy, Adventure, Crime', 2025, 'American Empirical Pictures, Indian Paintbrush, Studio Babelsberg', '102', 3.3, 'US', 'English, Français, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2jxeYLXTYfu0bqJmnLGIgZswib.jpg', 'Wealthy businessman Zsa-zsa Korda appoints his only daughter, a nun, as sole heir to his estate. As Korda embarks on a new enterprise, they soon become the target of scheming tycoons, foreign terrorists, and determined assassins.'),
(888, 542178, 'The French Dispatch of the Liberty, Kansas Evening Sun', 'Wes Anderson', 'Benicio del Toro, Adrien Brody, Tilda Swinton, Léa Seydoux, Frances McDormand, Timothée Chalamet', 'Wes Anderson', 'Drama, Comedy', 2021, 'Indian Paintbrush, American Empirical Pictures, Studio Babelsberg', '108', 3.5, 'US', 'Français, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JXR3KJH5roiBCjWFt09xfgxHZc.jpg', 'The staff of an American magazine based in France puts out its last issue, with stories featuring an artist sentenced to life imprisonment, student riots, and a kidnapping resolved by a chef.'),
(889, 507086, 'Jurassic World Dominion', 'Colin Trevorrow', 'Chris Pratt, Bryce Dallas Howard, Laura Dern, Sam Neill, Jeff Goldblum, DeWanda Wise', 'Emily Carmichael, Colin Trevorrow', 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Thriller, Action', 2022, 'Amblin Entertainment, Universal Pictures', '147', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbAvCACjLf1ZG0unB2tdmx5HAf1.jpg', 'Four years after Isla Nublar was destroyed, dinosaurs now live—and hunt—alongside humans all over the world. This fragile balance will reshape the future and determine, once and for all, whether human beings are to remain the apex predators on a planet they now share with history\'s most fearsome creatures.'),
(890, 1151031, 'Bring Her Back', 'Michael Philippou', 'Billy Barratt, Sally Hawkins, Mischa Heywood, Jonah Wren Phillips, Stephen Phillips, Sally-Anne Upton', 'Danny Philippou, Michael Philippou', 'Horror', 2025, 'Causeway Films, Blue Bear, Salmira Productions, A24, South Australian Film Corporation', '104', 3.7, 'AU', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Q3GlCXGYWELifxANYZ5OVMRVZl.jpg', 'Following the death of their father, a brother and sister are sent to live with a foster mother, only to learn that she is hiding a terrifying secret.'),
(891, 1317088, 'The Assessment', 'Fleur Fortuné', 'Elizabeth Olsen, Alicia Vikander, Himesh Patel, Indira Varma, Minnie Driver, Nicholas Pinnock', 'Fleur Fortuné', 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 2025, 'Augenschein Filmproduktion, Number 9 Films, Project Infinity, Shivhans Pictures, Woolley/Karlsen Productions, Tiki Tāne Pictures', '114', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1K7be85FAauSbVPzCQ0GjOXUqu.jpg', 'In a climate change-ravaged world, a utopian society optimizes life, including parenthood assessments. A successful couple faces scrutiny by an evaluator over seven days to determine their fitness for childbearing.'),
(892, 541671, 'Ballerina', 'Len Wiseman', 'Ana de Armas, Keanu Reeves, Ian McShane, Anjelica Huston, Gabriel Byrne, Catalina Sandino Moreno', 'Len Wiseman', 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 2025, 'Thunder Road, 87Eleven, Lionsgate', '125', 3.6, 'US', 'English, Deutsch, Pусский, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VUmvqsHb6cEtdfscEA6fqqVzLg.jpg', 'Taking place during the events of John Wick: Chapter 3 – Parabellum, Eve Macarro begins her training in the assassin traditions of the Ruska Roma.'),
(893, 804, 'Roman Holiday', 'William Wyler', 'Gregory Peck, Audrey Hepburn, Eddie Albert, Hartley Power, Harcourt Williams, Margaret Rawlings', 'Ian McLellan Hunter, John Dighton, Dalton Trumbo', 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 1953, 'Paramount Pictures', '119', 3.9, 'US', 'English, Italiano', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lI9dmz1RH20FAqltkGelY1v4BE.jpg', 'Overwhelmed by her suffocating schedule, touring European princess Ann takes off for a night while in Rome. When a sedative she took from her doctor kicks in, however, she falls asleep on a park bench and is found by an American reporter, Joe Bradley, who takes her back to his apartment for safety. At work the next morning, Joe finds out Ann\'s regal identity and bets his editor he can get exclusive interview with her, but romance soon gets in the way.'),
(894, 331, 'Jurassic Park III', 'Joe Johnston', 'Sam Neill, William H. Macy, Téa Leoni, Alessandro Nivola, Trevor Morgan, Michael Jeter', 'Joe Johnston', 'Adventure, Thriller, Science Fiction, Action', 2001, 'Universal Pictures, Amblin Entertainment', '92', 3.1, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQXj4NUfS3r3gHXtDOzcJgj1lLc.jpg', 'In need of funds for research, Dr. Alan Grant accepts a large sum of money to accompany Paul and Amanda Kirby on an aerial tour of the infamous Isla Sorna. It isn\'t long before all hell breaks loose and the stranded wayfarers must fight for survival as a host of new -- and even more deadly -- dinosaurs try to make snacks of them.'),
(895, 896536, 'The Legend of Ochi', 'Isaiah Saxon', 'Helena Zengel, Willem Dafoe, Emily Watson, Finn Wolfhard, Carol Bors, Andrei Antoniu Anghel', 'Isaiah Saxon', 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 2025, 'A24, Encyclopedia Pictura, Neighborhood Watch, Year of the Rat, AGBO, Access Entertainment, IPR.VC', '95', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYyEelO4JfOwE0Ui5KsrCE0O8UA.jpg', 'In a remote village on the island of Carpathia, a shy farm girl named Yuri is raised to fear an elusive animal species known as ochi. But when Yuri discovers a wounded baby ochi has been left behind, she escapes on a quest to bring him home.'),
(896, 37247, 'The Graduate', 'Mike Nichols', 'Dustin Hoffman, Anne Bancroft, Katharine Ross, Murray Hamilton, William Daniels, Elizabeth Wilson', 'Calder Willingham, Buck Henry', 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 1967, 'AVCO Embassy Pictures, Mike Nichols Productions, Lawrence Turman Productions', '107', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XaDpF0COV1MLsDirJMnxmYc1Wp.jpg', 'A disillusioned college graduate finds himself torn between his older lover and her daughter.'),
(897, 81666, 'Sing Sing', 'Sergio Corbucci', 'Enrico Montesano, Adriano Celentano, Marina Suma, Franco Giacobini, Angela Goodwin, Désirée Nosbusch', 'Enrico Oldoini, Franco Ferrini, Sergio Corbucci', 'Comedy', 1983, 'Intercapital', '110', 2.7, 'IT', 'Italiano', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNyHcK1jypvWmHpI8ykZsyAeNlL.jpg', 'Eduardo accidentally discovers that he is adopted. His real father is dying, but before his death he said that his mother was the \"Queen of England\", failing to clarify that this is the nickname of Italian prostitute. But Eduardo is already rushing to the capital of England...'),
(898, 150540, 'Inside Out', 'Pete Docter', 'Amy Poehler, Phyllis Smith, Richard Kind, Bill Hader, Lewis Black, Mindy Kaling', 'Meg LeFauve, Josh Cooley, Pete Docter', 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Drama, Comedy', 2015, 'Pixar', '95', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2H1TmgdfNtsKlU9jKdeNyYL5y8T.jpg', 'When 11-year-old Riley moves to a new city, her Emotions team up to help her through the transition. Joy, Fear, Anger, Disgust and Sadness work together, but when Joy and Sadness get lost, they must journey through unfamiliar places to get back home.'),
(899, 428449, 'A Ghost Story', 'David Lowery', 'Casey Affleck, Rooney Mara, McColm Cephas Jr., Kenneisha Thompson, Grover Coulson, Liz Cardenas', 'David Lowery', 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 2017, 'Sailor Bear, Zero Trans Fat Productions, Ideaman Studios', '93', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rp5JPIyZi9sMob15l46zNQLe5cO.jpg', 'Recently deceased, a white-sheeted ghost returns to his suburban home to console his bereft wife, only to find that in his spectral state he has become unstuck in time, forced to watch passively as the life he knew and the woman he loves slowly slip away.'),
(900, 555285, 'Are You There God? It\'s Me, Margaret.', 'Kelly Fremon Craig', 'Abby Ryder Fortson, Rachel McAdams, Kathy Bates, Elle Graham, Benny Safdie, Amari Alexis Price', 'Kelly Fremon Craig', 'Comedy, Drama', 2023, 'Gracie Films, Lionsgate', '106', 3.6, 'US', 'עִבְרִית, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yb6UB4WC3znlwU0L4AqMnjR9G9S.jpg', 'When her family moves from New York City to New Jersey, an 11-year-old girl navigates new friends, feelings, and the beginning of adolescence.'),
(901, 901563, 'Close', 'Lukas Dhont', 'Eden Dambrine, Gustav De Waele, Émilie Dequenne, Léa Drucker, Igor van Dessel, Kevin Janssens', 'Lukas Dhont', 'Drama', 2022, 'Menuet, Diaphana Films, Topkapi Films, Versus Production, VTM, RTBF', '104', 3.9, 'BE, FR, NL', 'Français, Nederlands', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlMNnWs7Mz8Nk5AC447Ew1tD5pn.jpg', 'Two 13-year-old boys spend an idyllic summer together, but their connection is put to the test when they become the subject of speculation at school.'),
(902, 346, 'Seven Samurai', 'Akira Kurosawa', 'Toshirō Mifune, Takashi Shimura, Yoshio Inaba, Seiji Miyaguchi, Minoru Chiaki, Daisuke Katō', 'Hideo Oguni, Shinobu Hashimoto, Akira Kurosawa', 'Action, Drama', 1954, 'TOHO', '207', 4.2, 'JP', '日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOMGc8bnSwQhS4XyE1S99uH8NXf.jpg', 'A samurai answers a village\'s request for protection after he falls on hard times. The town needs protection from bandits, so the samurai gathers six others to help him teach the people how to defend themselves, and the villagers provide the soldiers with food.'),
(903, 1061474, 'Superman', 'James Gunn', 'David Corenswet, Rachel Brosnahan, Nicholas Hoult, Edi Gathegi, Nathan Fillion, Isabela Merced', 'James Gunn', 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 2025, 'Troll Court Entertainment, The Safran Company, DC Studios, Domain Entertainment', '130', 3.7, 'US', 'English, Español, Hrvatski', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldyfo0BKmz5rWtJJKCvwaNS4cJT.jpg', 'Superman, a journalist in Metropolis, embarks on a journey to reconcile his Kryptonian heritage with his human upbringing as Clark Kent.'),
(904, 621, 'Grease', 'Randal Kleiser', 'Olivia Newton-John, John Travolta, Stockard Channing, Jeff Conaway, Barry Pearl, Michael Tucci', 'Bronté Woodard', 'Romance, Comedy', 1978, 'Paramount Pictures, Robert Stigwood Organization, Fine Arts Films', '110', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rM7fQKpb7cs1Iq7IBqub9LFDzJ.jpg', 'Australian good girl Sandy and greaser Danny fell in love over the summer. But when they unexpectedly discover they\'re now in the same high school, will they be able to rekindle their romance despite their eccentric friends?'),
(905, 548, 'Rashomon', 'Akira Kurosawa', 'Toshirō Mifune, Machiko Kyō, Takashi Shimura, Masayuki Mori, Minoru Chiaki, Kichijirō Ueda', 'Shinobu Hashimoto, Akira Kurosawa', 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 1950, 'Daiei Film', '88', 4.0, 'JP', '日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijWibsAU1iBcCD8tuIZfTmDzMVE.jpg', 'Four people recount different versions of the story of a man\'s murder and the rape of his wife.'),
(906, 3782, 'Ikiru', 'Akira Kurosawa', 'Takashi Shimura, Haruo Tanaka, Nobuo Kaneko, Bokuzen Hidari, Miki Odagiri, Shinichi Himori', 'Shinobu Hashimoto, Akira Kurosawa, Hideo Oguni', 'Drama', 1952, 'TOHO', '143', 4.2, 'JP', '日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgNTS4EQDDVfkzJI5msKuHu2Ei3.jpg', 'Kanji Watanabe is a middle-aged man who has worked in the same monotonous bureaucratic position for decades. Learning he has cancer, he starts to look for the meaning of his life.'),
(907, 1022787, 'Elio', 'Domee Shi', 'Yonas Kibreab, Remy Edgerly, Zoe Saldaña, Brad Garrett, Brandon Moon, Jameela Jamil', 'Julia Cho, Mark Hammer, Mike Jones', 'Animation, Adventure, Science Fiction, Family, Comedy', 2025, 'Pixar', '98', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7z8jDiTZZco9moIKpTUImFtTy7o.jpg', 'Elio, a space fanatic with an active imagination, finds himself on a cosmic misadventure where he must form new bonds with eccentric alien lifeforms, navigate a crisis of intergalactic proportions and somehow discover who he is truly meant to be.'),
(908, 1376434, 'Predator: Killer of Killers', 'Dan Trachtenberg', 'Lindsay LaVanchy, Louis Ozawa, Rick Gonzalez, Michael Biehn, Doug Cockle, Damien C. Haas', 'Micho Rutare', 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 2025, '20th Century Studios, Davis Entertainment, Lawrence Gordon Productions, Toberoff Productions', '85', 3.9, 'US', 'English, 日本語, Norsk, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2XDQa6EmFHSA37j1t0w88vpWqj9.jpg', 'While three of the fiercest warriors in human history—a Viking raider, a ninja in feudal Japan, and a WWII pilot—are killers in their own right, they are merely prey for their new opponent: the ultimate killer of killers.'),
(909, 787, 'Mr. & Mrs. Smith', 'Doug Liman', 'Angelina Jolie, Brad Pitt, Vince Vaughn, Adam Brody, Kerry Washington, Keith David', 'Simon Kinberg', 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 2005, 'Regency Enterprises, New Regency Pictures, Summit Entertainment, Weed Road Pictures, Epsilon Motion Pictures', '120', 3.3, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjD700RtyhveN3ZbOnSvUSne0Qj.jpg', 'A husband and wife struggle to keep their marriage alive until they realize they are both secretly working as assassins. Now, their respective assignments require them to kill each other.'),
(910, 310131, 'The Witch', 'Robert Eggers', 'Anya Taylor-Joy, Ralph Ineson, Kate Dickie, Harvey Scrimshaw, Ellie Grainger, Lucas Dawson', 'Robert Eggers', 'Horror, Drama, Mystery, Fantasy, Thriller', 2016, 'Very Special Projects, Parts & Labor, RT Features, Rooks Nest Entertainment, Maiden Voyage Pictures, Pulse Films, Scythia Films, Code Red Productions, Mott Street Pictures', '92', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zap5hpFCWSvdWSuPGAQyjUv2wAC.jpg', 'In 1630, a farmer relocates his family to a remote plot of land on the edge of a forest where strange, unsettling things happen. With suspicion and paranoia mounting, each family member\'s faith, loyalty and love are tested in shocking ways.'),
(911, 170, '28 Days Later', 'Danny Boyle', 'Cillian Murphy, Naomie Harris, Brendan Gleeson, Megan Burns, Christopher Eccleston, Noah Huntley', 'Danny Boyle', 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 2002, 'DNA Films', '113', 3.6, 'GB', 'Español, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQckQRt17VaWbo39GIu0TMOiszq.jpg', 'Twenty-eight days after a killer virus was accidentally unleashed from a British research facility, a small group of London survivors are caught in a desperate struggle to protect themselves from the infected. Carried by animals and humans, the virus turns those it infects into homicidal maniacs -- and it\'s absolutely impossible to contain.'),
(912, 1100988, '28 Years Later', 'Danny Boyle', 'Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Alfie Williams, Ralph Fiennes, Jodie Comer, Jack O\'Connell, Chi Lewis-Parry', 'Danny Boyle', 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 2025, 'Columbia Pictures, DNA Films, Decibel Films, TSG Entertainment', '115', 3.3, 'GB', 'English, svenska', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5FygjEppOvac6yEaowi26nTyw3.jpg', 'Twenty-eight years after the Rage virus outbreak, a heavily-defended island survives connected to the mainland by a single causeway. When one of the group leaves the island into the dark heart of the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors as well.'),
(913, 1562, '28 Weeks Later', 'Juan Carlos Fresnadillo', 'Robert Carlyle, Rose Byrne, Jeremy Renner, Harold Perrineau, Catherine McCormack, Mackintosh Muggleton', 'Rowan Joffé, Juan Carlos Fresnadillo, Jesús Olmo', 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 2007, 'DNA Films, Figment Films, UK Film Council, Fox Atomic, Koan, Sogecine, Dune Entertainment', '99', 3.3, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oix0aNv1lvW3nUGspUyvSIBlpbs.jpg', 'Twenty-eight weeks after the spread of a deadly rage virus, the inhabitants of the British Isles have lost their battle against the onslaught, as the virus has killed everyone there. Six months later, a group of Americans dare to set foot on the Isles, convinced the danger has passed. But it soon becomes all too clear that the scourge continues to live, waiting to pounce on its next victims.'),
(914, 842924, 'The Life of Chuck', 'Mike Flanagan', 'Tom Hiddleston, Benjamin Pajak, Nick Offerman, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Karen Gillan, Mia Sara', 'Mike Flanagan', 'Fantasy, Drama', 2025, 'Intrepid Pictures, Red Room Pictures, QWGmire, FilmNation Entertainment', '111', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oumprkO9bThExP8NwxBIBnvBu2v.jpg', 'In this extraordinary story of an ordinary man, Charles \'Chuck\' Krantz experiences the wonder of love, the heartbreak of loss, and the multitudes contained in all of us.'),
(915, 269, 'Breathless', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Jean Seberg, Daniel Boulanger, Henri-Jacques Huet, Roger Hanin, Van Doude', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 1960, 'Les Films Impéria, Les Productions Georges de Beauregard, SNC', '90', 3.7, 'FR', 'Français, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Wx0Wdn2EOqeCZU4SP6tlS3LOml.jpg', 'A small-time thief steals a car and impulsively murders a motorcycle policeman. Wanted by the authorities, he attempts to persuade a girl to run away to Italy with him.'),
(916, 599, 'Sunset Boulevard', 'Billy Wilder', 'William Holden, Gloria Swanson, Erich von Stroheim, Nancy Olson, Fred Clark, Lloyd Gough', 'Billy Wilder, D.M. Marshman Jr., Charles Brackett', 'Drama', 1950, 'Paramount Pictures', '110', 4.2, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zt8aQ6ksqK6p1AopC5zVTDS9pKT.jpg', 'A hack screenwriter writes a screenplay for a former silent film star who has faded into Hollywood obscurity.'),
(917, 68721, 'Iron Man 3', 'Shane Black', 'Robert Downey Jr., Gwyneth Paltrow, Don Cheadle, Guy Pearce, Rebecca Hall, Jon Favreau', 'Shane Black, Drew Pearce', 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 2013, 'Marvel Studios', '130', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhPtAc1TKbMPqNvcdXSOn9Bn7hZ.jpg', 'When Tony Stark\'s world is torn apart by a formidable terrorist called the Mandarin, he starts an odyssey of rebuilding and retribution.'),
(918, 284053, 'Thor: Ragnarok', 'Taika Waititi', 'Chris Hemsworth, Mark Ruffalo, Tom Hiddleston, Cate Blanchett, Idris Elba, Jeff Goldblum', 'Taika Waititi', 'Action, Science Fiction, Comedy, Adventure', 2017, 'Marvel Studios', '131', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzRwTcFvttcN1ZpX2xv4j3tSdJu.jpg', 'Thor is imprisoned on the other side of the universe and finds himself in a race against time to get back to Asgard to stop Ragnarok, the destruction of his home-world and the end of Asgardian civilization, at the hands of a powerful new threat, the ruthless Hela.'),
(919, 617126, 'The Fantastic 4: First Steps', 'Matt Shakman', 'Pedro Pascal, Vanessa Kirby, Ebon Moss-Bachrach, Joseph Quinn, Ralph Ineson, Julia Garner', 'Josh Friedman, Eric Pearson, Jeff Kaplan', 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 2025, 'Marvel Studios, Kevin Feige Productions', '115', 3.5, 'US', 'Français, ozbek, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nf5qaSEvyYSNeFH0YhSs5EsBLX9.jpg', 'Against the vibrant backdrop of a 1960s-inspired, retro-futuristic world, Marvel\'s First Family is forced to balance their roles as heroes with the strength of their family bond, while defending Earth from a ravenous space god called Galactus and his enigmatic Herald, Silver Surfer.'),
(920, 1205515, 'Sorry, Baby', 'Eva Victor', 'Eva Victor, Naomi Ackie, Louis Cancelmi, Kelly McCormack, Lucas Hedges, John Carroll Lynch', 'Eva Victor', 'Drama, Comedy', 2025, 'PASTEL, Big Beach, Tango Entertainment, High Frequency Entertainment, Case Study Films, Charades, AF Films', '103', 3.4, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8wZEQen5hDNRGzm4fY4sxWe5xe.jpg', 'Agnes feels stuck. Unlike her best friend, Lydie, who’s moved to New York and is now expecting a baby, Agnes still lives in the New England house they once shared as graduate students, now working as a professor at her alma mater. A ‘bad thing’ happened to Agnes a few years ago and, since then, despite her best efforts, life hasn’t gotten back on track.'),
(921, 872, 'Singin\' in the Rain', 'Stanley Donen', 'Gene Kelly, Donald O\'Connor, Debbie Reynolds, Jean Hagen, Millard Mitchell, Cyd Charisse', 'Adolph Green, Betty Comden', 'Comedy, Romance', 1952, 'Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer', '103', 4.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w03EiJVHP8Un77boQeE7hg9DVdU.jpg', 'In 1927 Hollywood, a silent film star falls for a chorus girl just as he and his paranoid screen partner struggle to make the difficult transition to talking pictures.'),
(922, 83389, 'From Up on Poppy Hill', 'Goro Miyazaki', 'Masami Nagasawa, Junichi Okada, Keiko Takeshita, Yuriko Ishida, Rumi Hiiragi, Jun Fubuki', 'Keiko Niwa, Hayao Miyazaki', 'Animation, Drama', 2011, 'Studio Ghibli, Mitsubishi, Kodansha, KDDI, Hakuhodo DY Media Partners', '91', 3.8, 'JP', '日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRLYX4RZIyloHSJwvZKAhphAjiB.jpg', 'Yokohama, 1963. Japan is picking itself up from the devastation of World War II and preparing to host the 1964 Olympics—and the mood is one of both optimism and conflict as the young generation struggles to throw off the shackles of a troubled past. Against this backdrop of hope and change, a friendship begins to blossom between high school students Umi and Shun—but a buried secret from their past emerges to cast a shadow on the future and pull them apart.'),
(923, 648878, 'Eddington', 'Ari Aster', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Deirdre O\'Connell, Emma Stone, Micheal Ward, Pedro Pascal, Cameron Mann', 'Ari Aster', 'Western, Comedy, Crime', 2025, 'A24, Square Peg, 828 Productions, IPR.VC, Access Entertainment', '148', 3.2, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GIqZUgPZ146BhibsPHMHef2nXX.jpg', 'In May of 2020, a standoff between a small-town sheriff and mayor sparks a powder keg as neighbor is pitted against neighbor in Eddington, New Mexico.'),
(924, 822119, 'Captain America: Brave New World', 'Julius Onah', 'Anthony Mackie, Harrison Ford, Danny Ramirez, Shira Haas, Tim Blake Nelson, Carl Lumbly', 'Julius Onah, Peter Glanz, Rob Edwards', 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 2025, 'Marvel Studios, Kevin Feige Productions', '119', 3.0, 'US', 'English, 日本語, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzIddUEMWhWzfvLI3TwxUG2wGoi.jpg', 'After meeting with newly elected U.S. President Thaddeus Ross, Sam finds himself in the middle of an international incident. He must discover the reason behind a nefarious global plot before the true mastermind has the entire world seeing red.'),
(925, 1232546, 'Until Dawn', 'David F. Sandberg', 'Ella Rubin, Michael Cimino, Odessa A\'zion, Ji-young Yoo, Belmont Cameli, Maia Mitchell', 'David F. Sandberg', 'Horror, Mystery', 2025, 'PlayStation Productions, Coin Operated, Mångata, Vertigo Entertainment, Screen Gems, TSG Entertainment', '103', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLY5yN4MKVynZ2HMZWElTOGBgBe.jpg', 'One year after her sister Melanie mysteriously disappeared, Clover and her friends head into the remote valley where she vanished in search of answers. Exploring an abandoned visitor center, they find themselves stalked by a masked killer and horrifically murdered one by one...only to wake up and find themselves back at the beginning of the same evening.'),
(926, 239, 'Some Like It Hot', 'Billy Wilder', 'Tony Curtis, Jack Lemmon, Marilyn Monroe, George Raft, Pat O\'Brien, Joe E. Brown', 'Billy Wilder, I. A. L. Diamond', 'Comedy, Romance, Crime', 1959, 'The Mirisch Company', '123', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVIKyTK13AvOGv7ICmJjK44DTzp.jpg', 'In Prohibition-era Chicago, musicians Joe and Jerry witness a mob hit, and flee the state in an all-female band disguised as Josephine and Daphne, but further complications set in.'),
(927, 128, 'Princess Mononoke', 'Hayao Miyazaki', 'Yoji Matsuda, Yuriko Ishida, Yuko Tanaka, Kaoru Kobayashi, Masahiko Nishimura, Tsunehiko Kamijô', 'Hayao Miyazaki', 'Adventure, Fantasy, Animation', 1997, 'Studio Ghibli, dentsu, Tokuma Shoten, Nippon Television Network Corporation, Nibariki, TNDG', '134', 4.2, 'JP', '日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMYCDADoLKLbB83g4WnJegaZimC.jpg', 'Ashitaka, a prince of the disappearing Emishi people, is cursed by a demonized boar god and must journey to the west to find a cure. Along the way, he encounters San, a young human woman fighting to protect the forest, and Lady Eboshi, who is trying to destroy it. Ashitaka must find a way to bring balance to this conflict.'),
(928, 129, 'Spirited Away', 'Hayao Miyazaki', 'Rumi Hiiragi, Miyu Irino, Mari Natsuki, Takashi Naito, Yasuko Sawaguchi, Tatsuya Gashuin', 'Hayao Miyazaki', 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 2001, 'Studio Ghibli, Tokuma Shoten, Nippon Television Network Corporation, Mitsubishi, dentsu, TFC', '125', 4.3, 'JP', '日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39wmItIWsg5sZMyRUHLkWBcuVCM.jpg', 'A young girl, Chihiro, becomes trapped in a strange new world of spirits. When her parents undergo a mysterious transformation, she must call upon the courage she never knew she had to free her family.'),
(929, 996, 'Double Indemnity', 'Billy Wilder', 'Fred MacMurray, Barbara Stanwyck, Edward G. Robinson, Porter Hall, Jean Heather, Tom Powers', 'Raymond Chandler, Billy Wilder', 'Crime, Thriller', 1944, 'Paramount Pictures', '107', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVNYZZgfhwqVMMWlBmxOfWqnwCj.jpg', 'An insurance representative is seduced by a dissatisfied housewife into a scheme of insurance fraud and murder that arouses the suspicion of his colleague, a claims investigator.'),
(930, 1136867, 'Materialists', 'Celine Song', 'Dakota Johnson, Chris Evans, Pedro Pascal, Zoë Winters, Marin Ireland, Dasha Nekrasova', 'Celine Song', 'Romance, Drama', 2025, 'A24, Killer Films, 2AM, IPR.VC, Access Entertainment', '116', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDo0pNruy0Qgj6BdTyHIR4cxHY8.jpg', 'A young, ambitious New York City matchmaker finds herself torn between the perfect match and her imperfect ex.'),
(931, 25364, 'Ace in the Hole', 'Billy Wilder', 'Kirk Douglas, Jan Sterling, Robert Arthur, Porter Hall, Frank Cady, Richard Benedict', 'Billy Wilder', 'Drama', 1951, 'Paramount Pictures', '112', 3.9, 'US', 'Latin, Español, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPVPzHEsJBX02HtBtIQgYnfeqNQ.jpg', 'An arrogant reporter exploits a story about a man trapped in a cave to revitalize his career.'),
(932, 430, 'One, Two, Three', 'Billy Wilder', 'James Cagney, Horst Buchholz, Pamela Tiffin, Arlene Francis, Liselotte Pulver, Hanns Lothar', 'Billy Wilder, I. A. L. Diamond', 'Comedy', 1961, 'The Mirisch Company, Pyramid Productions', '109', 3.7, 'US', 'Deutsch, English, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWQE227ub1frfnjP5HZy0wLF0wu.jpg', 'In Cold War-era West Berlin, American Coca-Cola executive C.R. \'Mac\' MacNamara is tasked with playing babysitter to his boss\' spoiled 17-year-old daughter Scarlett, who proves more difficult than anticipated when she reveals that she is pregnant by a Communist.'),
(933, 11860, 'Sabrina', 'Sydney Pollack', 'Harrison Ford, Julia Ormond, Greg Kinnear, Nancy Marchand, John Wood, Richard Crenna', 'Barbara Benedek, David Rayfiel', 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 1995, 'Paramount Pictures, Constellation Films, Mirage Enterprises, Scott Rudin Productions, Sandollar Productions, Worldwide Productions, Mont Blanc Entertainment GmbH', '127', 3.1, 'US', 'English, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8PbLJDPU7vCwwscWD625oHbJy.jpg', 'After her return from school in Paris, a playboy finally takes notice of his family\'s chauffeur\'s daughter Sabrina, who\'s long had a crush on him, but he questions his more serious brother\'s motives when he warns against getting involved with her.'),
(934, 28580, 'The Lost Weekend', 'Billy Wilder', 'Ray Milland, Jane Wyman, Phillip Terry, Howard Da Silva, Doris Dowling, Frank Faylen', 'Charles Brackett, Billy Wilder', 'Drama', 1945, 'Paramount Pictures', '101', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yL6EJxPeYIcB9TChm56lHqXKzHC.jpg', 'Longtime alcoholic Don Birnam has been sober for ten days and appears to be over the worst... but his craving has just become more insidious. Evading a country weekend planned by his brother and girlfriend, he begins a four-day bender that just might be his last – one way or another.'),
(935, 632, 'Stalag 17', 'Billy Wilder', 'William Holden, Don Taylor, Otto Preminger, Robert Strauss, Harvey Lembeck, Richard Erdman', 'Billy Wilder', 'Comedy, Drama, War', 1953, 'Paramount Pictures', '120', 3.8, 'US', 'English, Deutsch, Pусский', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfve9FDKjT7JPbWI9NCs5340F79.jpg', 'After two American prisoners are killed by guards in the act of escaping from a German POW camp in World War II, barracks black marketeer J.J. Sefton is suspected of being an informer.'),
(936, 15244, 'A Man Escaped', 'Robert Bresson', 'François Leterrier, Charles Le Clainche, Maurice Beerblock, Roland Monod, Jacques Ertaud, Jean Paul Delhumeau', 'Robert Bresson', 'Drama, Thriller', 1956, 'Gaumont, Nouvelles Éditions de Films', '101', 4.0, 'FR', 'Deutsch, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkoZ8fFib24zhB2DKpjQ09SK9FU.jpg', 'A captured French Resistance fighter during World War II engineers a daunting escape from prison.'),
(937, 1585, 'It\'s a Wonderful Life', 'Frank Capra', 'James Stewart, Donna Reed, Lionel Barrymore, Thomas Mitchell, Henry Travers, Beulah Bondi', 'Frank Capra, Albert Hackett, Frances Goodrich', 'Drama, Family, Fantasy', 1946, 'Liberty Films', '131', 4.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSqt9rhDZx1Q7UZ86dBPKdNomp2.jpg', 'George Bailey has spent his entire life giving to the people of Bedford Falls.  All that prevents rich skinflint Mr. Potter from taking over the entire town is George\'s modest building and loan company.  But on Christmas Eve the business\'s $8,000 is lost and George\'s troubles begin.'),
(938, 1013855, 'Darkest Miriam', 'Naomi Jaye', 'Britt Lower, Tom Mercier, Sook-Yin Lee, Jean Yoon, Jaimara E. Beals, Clyde Whitham', 'Naomi Jaye', 'Drama, Romance, Mystery', 2025, 'Younger Daughter Films, Low End, Through the Lens Entertainment', '90', 3.0, 'CA', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AsHSnXpScognjQVkv7bXvEw9jVh.jpg', 'Miriam Gordon lives in a fog of grief while working in a downtown public library branch. When a burgeoning love affair coincides with her receiving a series of oddly threatening letters, Miriam\'s sheltered existence is cracked open.'),
(939, 22527, 'The Wrong Man', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'Henry Fonda, Vera Miles, Anthony Quayle, Harold J. Stone, Charles Cooper, John Heldabrand', 'Angus MacPhail, Maxwell Anderson', 'Crime, Drama', 1956, 'Warner Bros. Pictures', '105', 3.6, 'US', 'English, Italiano, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pO5XR2R56RAbVjdks9gGGn0fbOa.jpg', 'In 1953, an innocent man named Christopher Emmanuel \"Manny\" Balestrero is arrested after being mistaken for an armed robber.'),
(940, 288, 'High Noon', 'Fred Zinnemann', 'Gary Cooper, Thomas Mitchell, Lloyd Bridges, Katy Jurado, Grace Kelly, Otto Kruger', 'Carl Foreman', 'Western', 1952, 'Stanley Kramer Productions', '85', 3.9, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qETSMQ4IXBSAS409Z9OL0ppXWTW.jpg', 'Will Kane, the sheriff of a small town in New Mexico, learns a notorious outlaw he put in jail has been freed, and will be arriving on the noon train. Knowing the outlaw and his gang are coming to kill him, Kane is determined to stand his ground, so he attempts to gather a posse from among the local townspeople.'),
(941, 269149, 'Zootopia', 'Byron Howard', 'Ginnifer Goodwin, Jason Bateman, Idris Elba, Jenny Slate, Nate Torrence, Bonnie Hunt', 'Jared Bush, Phil Johnston', 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy', 2016, 'Walt Disney Animation Studios', '109', 3.9, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlK0e0wAQ3VLuJcsfIYPvb4JVud.jpg', 'Determined to prove herself, Officer Judy Hopps, the first bunny on Zootopia\'s police force, jumps at the chance to crack her first case - even if it means partnering with scam-artist fox Nick Wilde to solve the mystery.'),
(942, 1078605, 'Weapons', 'Zach Cregger', 'Julia Garner, Josh Brolin, Alden Ehrenreich, Austin Abrams, Benedict Wong, Amy Madigan', 'Zach Cregger', 'Horror, Mystery', 2025, 'Subconscious, Vertigo Entertainment, BoulderLight Pictures, New Line Cinema, Domain Entertainment', '129', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpf7vsRZ0MYRQcnLWteD5jK9ymT.jpg', 'When all but one child from the same class mysteriously vanish on the same night at exactly the same time, a community is left questioning who or what is behind their disappearance.'),
(943, 1149504, 'Honey Don\'t!', 'Ethan Coen', 'Margaret Qualley, Aubrey Plaza, Chris Evans, Lera Abova, Jacnier, Gabby Beans', 'Ethan Coen', 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 2025, 'Focus Features, Working Title Films', '89', 2.8, 'US', 'English, Français, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJm3kmd9NLZWypMas7g34oNFgbk.jpg', 'Honey O\'Donahue, a small-town private investigator, delves into a series of strange deaths tied to a mysterious church.'),
(944, 1007734, 'Nobody 2', 'Timo Tjahjanto', 'Bob Odenkirk, Connie Nielsen, John Ortiz, Colin Hanks, RZA, Colin Salmon', 'Aaron Rabin, Derek Kolstad', 'Action, Thriller, Comedy, Crime', 2025, 'Universal Pictures, 87North Productions, OPE Partners, Eighty Two Films', '89', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svXVRoRSu6zzFtCzkRsjZS7Lqpd.jpg', 'Former assassin Hutch Mansell takes his family on a nostalgic vacation to a small-town theme park, only to be pulled back into violence when they clash with a corrupt operator, a crooked sheriff, and a ruthless crime boss.'),
(945, 1242434, 'Highest 2 Lowest', 'Spike Lee', 'Denzel Washington, Jeffrey Wright, Ilfenesh Hadera, A$AP Rocky, John Douglas Thompson, Dean Winters', 'Alan Fox', 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 2025, 'A24, 40 Acres and a Mule Filmworks, Escape Artists, Mandalay Pictures, A/Vantage Pictures, Kurosawa Production', '133', 2.7, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RFQtinuiHhOnbmJaCn3uzegCYF.jpg', 'When a titan music mogul, widely known as having the \"best ears in the business\", is targeted with a ransom plot, he is jammed up in a life-or-death moral dilemma.'),
(946, 931349, 'Ash', 'Flying Lotus', 'Eiza González, Aaron Paul, Iko Uwais, Kate Elliott, Beulah Koale, Flying Lotus', 'Jonni Remmler', 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 2025, 'XYZ Films, Echo Lake Entertainment, GFC Films, IPR.VC, Brainfeeder Films', '95', 2.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRa8B3tQCUK6pVwjasIyQehbvpF.jpg', 'On the mysterious planet of Ash, Riya awakens to find her crew slaughtered. When a man named Brion arrives to rescue her, an ordeal of psychological and physical terror ensues while Riya and Brion must decide if they can trust one another to survive.'),
(947, 398978, 'The Irishman', 'Martin Scorsese', 'Robert De Niro, Al Pacino, Joe Pesci, Harvey Keitel, Ray Romano, Bobby Cannavale', 'Steven Zaillian', 'Crime, Drama, History', 2019, 'Tribeca Productions, Sikelia Productions, Winkler Films', '209', 3.8, 'US', 'English, Italiano, Latin, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbm8k3GFhXS0ROd9AD1gqYbIFbM.jpg', 'Pennsylvania, 1956. Frank Sheeran, a war veteran of Irish origin who works as a truck driver, accidentally meets mobster Russell Bufalino. Once Frank becomes his trusted man, Bufalino sends him to Chicago with the task of helping Jimmy Hoffa, a powerful union leader related to organized crime, with whom Frank will maintain a close friendship for nearly twenty years.'),
(948, 37165, 'The Truman Show', 'Peter Weir', 'Jim Carrey, Laura Linney, Noah Emmerich, Natascha McElhone, Holland Taylor, Ed Harris', 'Peter Weir', 'Comedy, Drama', 1998, 'Paramount Pictures, Scott Rudin Productions', '103', 4.1, 'US', 'English, Español, Italiano, 日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuza0WqY239yBXOadKlGwJsZJFE.jpg', 'In a picture-perfect seaside town, an insurance salesman begins to realize that his entire existence may be staged and observed by a vast unseen audience as part of a long-running real-time reality TV show.'),
(949, 15, 'Citizen Kane', 'Orson Welles', 'Orson Welles, Joseph Cotten, Dorothy Comingore, Ray Collins, George Coulouris, Agnes Moorehead', 'Orson Welles, Herman J. Mankiewicz', 'Mystery, Drama', 1941, 'Mercury Productions, RKO Radio Pictures', '119', 4.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sav0jxhqiH0bPr2vZFU0Kjt2nZL.jpg', 'Newspaper magnate Charles Foster Kane is taken from his mother as a boy and made the ward of a rich industrialist. As a result, every well-meaning, tyrannical or self-destructive move he makes for the rest of his life appears in some way to be a reaction to that deeply wounding event.');
INSERT INTO `peliculas` (`idPelicula`, `idApi`, `nombrePelicula`, `directorPelicula`, `actorPelicula`, `guionistaPelicula`, `generoPelicula`, `anoPelicula`, `companiaPelicula`, `duracionPelicula`, `ratingAvgPelicula`, `paisPelicula`, `idiomaPelicula`, `posterPelicula`, `sinopsisPelicula`) VALUES
(950, 1241921, 'A Big Bold Beautiful Journey', 'Kogonada', 'Colin Farrell, Margot Robbie, Kevin Kline, Phoebe Waller-Bridge, Lily Rabe, Hamish Linklater', 'Seth Reiss', 'Romance, Fantasy, Drama', 2025, 'Imperative Entertainment, 30WEST, Columbia Pictures, Chapel Place Productions, Tempo Basho, Original Films, TSG Entertainment', '109', 3.1, 'IE, US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMAkmQlKthQpTMiyPAKOYK3JnMs.jpg', 'Sarah and David are single strangers who meet at a mutual friend’s wedding and soon, through a surprising twist of fate, find themselves on a funny, fantastical, sweeping adventure together where they get to re-live important moments from their respective pasts, illuminating how they got to where they are in the present... and possibly getting a chance to alter their futures.'),
(951, 1151272, 'Sirāt', 'Oliver Laxe', 'Sergi López, Bruno Núñez, Stefania Gadda, Joshua Liam Henderson, Richard Bellamy, Tonin Janvier', 'Oliver Laxe', 'Drama, Thriller', 2025, 'Movistar Plus+, Los Desertores Films, Filmes da Ermida, El Deseo, Uri Films, 4 A 4 Productions', '115', 3.4, 'ES', 'English, العربية, Français, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzBtsLi17rK4G6kDvOXfUZfAhca.jpg', 'A man and his son arrive at a rave lost in the mountains of Morocco. They are looking for Marina, their daughter and sister, who disappeared months ago at another rave. Driven by fate, they decide to follow a group of ravers in search of one last party, in hopes Marina will be there.'),
(952, 1245993, 'Caught Stealing', 'Darren Aronofsky', 'Austin Butler, Regina King, Zoë Kravitz, Matt Smith, Liev Schreiber, Vincent D\'Onofrio', 'Charlie Huston', 'Crime, Thriller, Comedy', 2025, 'Protozoa Pictures, TSG Entertainment, Columbia Pictures', '107', 3.4, 'US', '普通话, English, Pусский, Español, ', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvda8s5J8YaHjTyEyXQpvD6f3iV.jpg', 'Burned-out ex-baseball player Hank Thompson unexpectedly finds himself embroiled in a dangerous struggle for survival amidst the criminal underbelly of late 1990s New York City, forced to navigate a treacherous underworld he never imagined.'),
(953, 1337562, 'Splitsville', 'Michael Angelo Covino', 'Kyle Marvin, Michael Angelo Covino, Dakota Johnson, Adria Arjona, Nicholas Braun, David Castañeda', 'Michael Angelo Covino', 'Comedy, Romance', 2025, 'NEON, Topic Studios, Watch This Ready, TeaTime Pictures, FirstGen Content', '105', 3.1, 'US', 'Español, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxCv6kUdywxYzIXX6xYcmX5APUV.jpg', 'After Ashley asks for a divorce, good-natured Carey runs to his friends, Julie and Paul, for support. He’s shocked to discover that the secret to their happiness is an open marriage, that is until Carey crosses the line and throws all of their relationships into chaos.'),
(954, 1054867, 'One Battle After Another', 'Paul Thomas Anderson', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Sean Penn, Chase Infiniti, Benicio del Toro, Regina Hall, Teyana Taylor', 'Paul Thomas Anderson', 'Thriller, Crime, Comedy', 2025, 'Warner Bros. Pictures, Ghoulardi Film Company, Domain Entertainment', '162', 3.7, 'US', 'English, Español, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbBWwxBht4JFP5PsuJ5onpMqugW.jpg', 'Washed-up revolutionary Bob exists in a state of stoned paranoia, surviving off-grid with his spirited, self-reliant daughter, Willa. When his evil nemesis resurfaces after 16 years and she goes missing, the former radical scrambles to find her, father and daughter both battling the consequences of his past.'),
(955, 1303613, 'Deaf', 'Eva Libertad', 'Miriam Garlo, Álvaro Cervantes, Elena Irureta, Joaquín Notario, Daniela Saura Pérez, Elaia Sánchez', 'Eva Libertad', 'Drama', 2025, 'Distinto Films, Nexus CreaFilms, A Contracorriente Films', '100', 3.6, 'ES', 'Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykB9bwUHT1AV04KjYPLhfgMwYdD.jpg', 'Angela\'s deafness raises concerns during her pregnancy regarding connecting with her daughter. Post-delivery, partner Héctor supports her as she learns to mother in a society lacking adequate accommodations for the hearing-impaired.'),
(956, 604079, 'The Long Walk', 'Francis Lawrence', 'Cooper Hoffman, David Jonsson, Ben Wang, Tut Nyuot, Charlie Plummer, Garrett Wareing', 'JT Mollner', 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 2025, 'Lionsgate, Media Capital Technologies, Vertigo Entertainment, about:blank', '108', 3.4, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wobVTa99eW0ht6c1rNNzLkazPtR.jpg', 'In a dystopian 1970s America, fifty teenage boys take part in a deadly annual walking contest, forced to maintain a minimum pace or be executed, until only one survivor remains.'),
(957, 1267905, 'The Roses', 'Jay Roach', 'Olivia Colman, Benedict Cumberbatch, Andy Samberg, Kate McKinnon, Belinda Bromilow, Ncuti Gatwa', 'Tony McNamara', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 2025, 'Searchlight Pictures, South of the River Pictures, SunnyMarch, Delirious Media, TSG Entertainment', '105', 3.3, 'GB, US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99O8HLHklXGzvF2TqiRqr7WddzT.jpg', 'Life seems easy for picture-perfect couple Ivy and Theo: successful careers, a loving marriage, great kids. But beneath the façade of their supposed ideal life, a storm is brewing – as Theo\'s career nosedives while Ivy\'s own ambitions take off, a tinderbox of fierce competition and hidden resentment ignites.'),
(958, 1245347, 'Twinless', 'James Sweeney', 'Dylan O\'Brien, James Sweeney, Aisling Franciosi, Lauren Graham, Chris Perfetti, François Arnaud', 'James Sweeney', 'Comedy, Drama', 2025, 'TPC, Permut Presentations, Backyard Plane', '100', 3.6, 'US', 'English, 日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vaw9Az5tPLMjNLj426KgKsp0k8.jpg', 'Two men who lost their respective twin brothers develop a growing friendship after meeting in a support group. However, both harbor long-hidden secrets that threaten to tear them apart.'),
(959, 1290159, 'A House of Dynamite', 'Kathryn Bigelow', 'Idris Elba, Rebecca Ferguson, Gabriel Basso, Jared Harris, Tracy Letts, Anthony Ramos', 'Kathryn Bigelow', 'Thriller, Drama', 2025, 'First Light, Prologue Entertainment, Kingsgate Films', '112', 3.2, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eB3Tl6xo9VNiN6YIi9XV44v6dab.jpg', 'When a single, unattributed missile is launched at the United States, a race begins to determine who is responsible and how to respond.'),
(960, 1381027, 'Good Boy', 'Jan Komasa', 'Stephen Graham, Andrea Riseborough, Anson Boon, Kit Rakusen, Monika Frajczyk, Savannah Steyn', 'Jan Komasa', 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 2026, 'Recorded Picture Company, Skopia Film, Wytwórnia Filmów Dokumentalnych i Fabularnych, Venatu Capital, CANAL+ Polska, TVN Warner Bros. Discovery', '110', 3.6, 'PL', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWb841fMkSNly5gfL9J1N0xzVYI.jpg', 'Tommy, a volatile 19-year-old, revels in drugs, parties and violence. After getting separated from his friends on a drunken bender, he is abducted by a shadowy figure. He wakes to find himself imprisoned in the basement of a remote Yorkshire house, inhabited by a very strange family. But what unfolds is not what he could possibly expect.'),
(961, 1212271, 'Eleanor the Great', 'Scarlett Johansson', 'June Squibb, Erin Kellyman, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Jessica Hecht, Rita Zohar, Will Price', 'Scarlett Johansson', 'Drama', 2025, 'Pinky Promise, Maven Screen Media, These Pictures, Wayfarer Studios, Content Engineers, MacPac Entertainment, Off Media', '98', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XTM42IJST6lwPxtK2iUwNaFvCT.jpg', '94-year-old Eleanor Morgenstein tries to rebuild her life after the death of her best friend. As a result, she moves back to New York City after living in Florida for decades.'),
(962, 718930, 'Bullet Train', 'David Leitch', 'Brad Pitt, Joey King, Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Brian Tyree Henry, Andrew Koji, Hiroyuki Sanada', 'Zak Olkewicz', 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 2022, '87North Productions, Columbia Pictures', '126', 3.7, 'US', '日本語, English, Pусский, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8szC8OgrejDQjjMKSVXyaAjw3V.jpg', 'Unlucky assassin Ladybug is determined to do his job peacefully after one too many gigs gone off the rails. Fate, however, may have other plans, as Ladybug\'s latest mission puts him on a collision course with lethal adversaries from around the globe—all with connected, yet conflicting, objectives—on the world\'s fastest train.'),
(963, 760329, 'The Smashing Machine', 'Benny Safdie', 'Dwayne Johnson, Emily Blunt, Ryan Bader, Bas Rutten, Oleksandr Usyk, Lyndsey Gavin', 'Benny Safdie', 'Drama, History, Action', 2025, 'A24, Seven Bucks Productions, Out for the Count, Magnetic Fields Entertainment', '123', 3.2, 'US', 'English, 日本語, Український', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwwvrdYeIrARXdiv09GIO6XWK5l.jpg', 'In the late 1990s, up-and-coming mixed martial artist Mark Kerr aspires to become the greatest fighter in the world. However, he must also battle his opioid dependence and a volatile relationship with his girlfriend Dawn.'),
(964, 1272166, 'Ballad of a Small Player', 'Edward Berger', 'Colin Farrell, Fala Chen, Tilda Swinton, Deanie Ip, Alex Jennings, Jason Tobin', 'Rowan Joffé', 'Crime, Drama', 2025, 'Good Chaos, Stigma Films, Nine Hours', '101', 2.9, 'DE', '广州话 / 廣州話, 普通话, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiXpXNiBWENaSJmdKfoT5DU0bL4.jpg', 'Amid the glittering casinos of Macau, a gambler running from his past—and his debts—becomes fascinated by an enigmatic woman at the baccarat table.'),
(965, 1042834, 'Eden', 'Ron Howard', 'Sydney Sweeney, Daniel Brühl, Jude Law, Ana de Armas, Vanessa Kirby, Felix Kammerer', 'Noah Pink', 'Thriller, Drama', 2025, 'Imagine Entertainment, AGC Studios, Library Pictures International', '129', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbFEESMVbpJU8IjZBjiWGJdEsxR.jpg', 'A group of disillusioned outsiders abandon modern society in search of a new beginning. Settling on a remote, uninhabited island, their utopian dream quickly unravels as they discover that the greatest threat isn’t the brutal climate or deadly wildlife, but each other.'),
(966, 11645, 'Ran', 'Akira Kurosawa', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Akira Terao, Jinpachi Nezu, Daisuke Ryū, Mieko Harada, Yoshiko Miyazaki', 'Akira Kurosawa, Hideo Oguni, Masato Ide', 'Action, Drama, History', 1985, 'Nippon Herald Films, Greenwich Film Production, Herald Ace', '160', 4.0, 'JP', '日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGgiXMWDcS5aJTBEFu7bmaQPNox.jpg', 'Shakespeare\'s King Lear is reimagined as a singular historical epic set in sixteenth-century Japan where an aging warlord divides his kingdom between his three sons.'),
(967, 701387, 'Bugonia', 'Yorgos Lanthimos', 'Emma Stone, Jesse Plemons, Aidan Delbis, Stavros Halkias, Alicia Silverstone, J. Carmen Galindez Barrera', 'Will Tracy', 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Comedy', 2025, 'Element Pictures, Square Peg, Fremantle, Pith Quest Films, Fruit Tree, CJ ENM', '119', 3.7, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSdOua3wKMEaFWDcKAYWRjXQWOt.jpg', 'Two conspiracy obsessed young men kidnap the high-powered CEO of a major company, convinced that she is an alien intent on destroying planet Earth.'),
(968, 1356670, 'Late Shift', 'Petra Biondina Volpe', 'Leonie Benesch, Alireza Bayram, Jürg Plüss, Jasmin Mattei, Lale Yavaş, Andreas Beutler', 'Petra Biondina Volpe', 'Drama', 2025, 'Zodiac Pictures, SRF, SRG SSR, MMC Zodiac', '92', 3.9, 'DE, CH', 'Deutsch', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2X2FZIYdXYNwDbStJhgeoVn0pWH.jpg', 'Dedicated nurse Floria navigates the relentless pace of her hospital’s understaffed surgical ward with humanity and warmth. As her overnight shift intensifies, she is pushed to the brink in a race against time.'),
(969, 1062722, 'Frankenstein', 'Guillermo del Toro', 'Oscar Isaac, Jacob Elordi, Christoph Waltz, Mia Goth, Felix Kammerer, Charles Dance', 'Guillermo del Toro', 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 2025, 'Double Dare You, Demilo Films, Bluegrass 7', '150', 3.8, 'US', 'Dansk, English, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4JtvGlQO7DByTI6frUobqvSL3R.jpg', 'Dr. Victor Frankenstein, a brilliant but egotistical scientist, brings a creature to life in a monstrous experiment that ultimately leads to the undoing of both the creator and his tragic creation.'),
(971, 1221061, 'Sound of Falling', 'Mascha Schilinski', 'Luise Heyer, Lena Urzendowsky, Claudia Geisler-Bading, Lea Drinda, Hanna Heckt, Laeni Geiseler', 'Mascha Schilinski', 'Drama, War', 2025, 'Studio Zentral, Das kleine Fernsehspiel', '148', 3.5, 'DE', 'Deutsch', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hLiXAqZ3xTHExOIsxYANIswBjZ.jpg', 'Four adolescent girls each spend their youth in the same farmhouse over the last century. Though separated by decades, resonances between their lives emerge: their desires and distress, secrets and truths, encounters with another’s gaze and defiant gaze in return.'),
(972, 1242419, 'Roofman', 'Derek Cianfrance', 'Channing Tatum, Kirsten Dunst, Ben Mendelsohn, LaKeith Stanfield, Juno Temple, Melonie Díaz', 'Derek Cianfrance, Kirt Gunn', 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 2025, 'Limelight, High Frequency Entertainment, 51 Entertainment, Miramax, Von Waaden Entertainment, FilmNation Entertainment, Hunting Lane Films', '126', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXDFtcnYtevleGzCmAD2ReQnJ4l.jpg', 'A former Army Ranger and struggling father turns to robbing McDonald’s restaurants by cutting holes in their roofs, earning him the nickname \"Roofman.\" After escaping prison, he secretly lives inside a Toys “R” Us for six months, surviving undetected while planning his next move. But when he falls for a divorced mom drawn to his undeniable charm, his double life begins to unravel, setting off a compelling and suspenseful game of cat and mouse as his past closes in.'),
(973, 3780, 'Red Beard', 'Akira Kurosawa', 'Toshirō Mifune, Yūzō Kayama, Tsutomu Yamazaki, Reiko Dan, Miyuki Kuwano, Kyōko Kagawa', 'Akira Kurosawa, Hideo Oguni, Masato Ide', 'Drama', 1965, 'TOHO, Kurosawa Production', '185', 4.1, 'JP', '日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYNH3Re0JSypoYaWvZtERUnNaJL.jpg', 'Aspiring to an easy job as personal physician to a wealthy family, Noboru Yasumoto is disappointed when his first post after medical school takes him to a small country clinic under the gruff doctor Red Beard. Yasumoto rebels in numerous ways, but Red Beard proves a wise and patient teacher. He gradually introduces his student to the unglamorous side of the profession, ultimately assigning him to care for a prostitute rescued from a local brothel.'),
(974, 4495, 'The Spirit of the Beehive', 'Víctor Erice', 'Ana Torrent, Fernando Fernán Gómez, Teresa Gimpera, Isabel Tellería, Laly Soldevila, Miguel Picazo', 'Ángel Fernández Santos', 'Drama, Fantasy', 1973, 'Elías Querejeta PC, Jacel Desposito', '98', 3.8, 'ES', 'Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6pUTkoCh4r6EA2dHNFKA40OmH2.jpg', 'In 1940, in the immediate aftermath of the Spanish Civil War, a young girl living on the Castilian plain is haunted after attending a screening of James Whale\'s 1931 film Frankenstein and hearing from her sister that the monster is not dead, instead existing as a spirit inhabiting a nearby barn.'),
(976, 1265063, 'After the Hunt', 'Luca Guadagnino', 'Julia Roberts, Ayo Edebiri, Andrew Garfield, Michael Stuhlbarg, Chloë Sevigny, Thaddea Graham', 'Luca Guadagnino', 'Drama', 2025, 'Frenesy Film, Imagine Entertainment, Big Indie Pictures, Amazon MGM Studios', '139', 2.8, 'US', 'English, Deutsch', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryF8QPGUGlo8gRB4OYKb4J0r3aJ.jpg', 'A college professor finds herself at a personal and professional crossroads when a star pupil levels an accusation against one of her colleagues, and a dark secret from her own past threatens to come to light.'),
(977, 1160360, 'If I Had Legs I\'d Kick You', 'Mary Bronstein', 'Rose Byrne, Conan O\'Brien, A$AP Rocky, Danielle Macdonald, Delaney Quinn, Mary Bronstein', 'Mary Bronstein', 'Drama', 2025, 'A24, Central Pictures, Fat City, Bronxburgh', '113', 3.2, 'US', 'English, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/va0TQ9WprMXRqQAzY56vyqY0Yd5.jpg', 'With her life crashing down around her, Linda attempts to navigate her child\'s mysterious illness, her absent husband, a missing person, and an increasingly hostile relationship with her therapist.'),
(978, 1241983, 'Train Dreams', 'Clint Bentley', 'Joel Edgerton, Felicity Jones, Nathaniel Arcand, Clifton Collins Jr., John Diehl, Paul Schneider', 'Clint Bentley, Greg Kwedar', 'Drama, Western', 2025, 'Kamala Films, Black Bear Pictures', '102', 3.7, 'US', '普通话, English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnaOmD9PmAkNjgVtCn17o7clOYe.jpg', 'A logger leads a life of quiet grace as he experiences love and loss during an era of monumental change in early 20th-century America.'),
(979, 1299655, 'Blue Moon', 'Richard Linklater', 'Ethan Hawke, Bobby Cannavale, Andrew Scott, Margaret Qualley, Patrick Kennedy, Jonah Lees', 'Richard Linklater', 'Music, History, Drama, Comedy', 2025, 'Detour Filmproduction, Sony Pictures Classics, Renovo Media Group, Wild Atlantic Pictures, Under the Influence Productions, Cinetic Media, Not to Be Seen Productions, Concord Originals', '101', 3.3, 'US', 'English, Deutsch, עִבְרִית', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVU7SNc6dgStTVdtbPLQncWxsyZ.jpg', 'On the evening of March 31, 1943, legendary lyricist Lorenz Hart confronts his shattered self-confidence in Sardi’s bar as his former collaborator, Richard Rodgers, celebrates the opening night of his ground-breaking hit musical, “Oklahoma!”'),
(980, 1092, 'The Third Man', 'Carol Reed', 'Joseph Cotten, Alida Valli, Trevor Howard, Orson Welles, Paul Hörbiger, Ernst Deutsch', 'Graham Greene', 'Thriller, Mystery', 1949, 'London Films Productions', '105', 3.9, 'GB', 'English, Pусский, Deutsch', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rO2Fq0AZZx9obs52KJdx4mRE8p5.jpg', 'In postwar Vienna, Austria, Holly Martins, a writer of pulp Westerns, arrives penniless as a guest of his childhood chum Harry Lime, only to learn he has died. Martins develops a conspiracy theory after learning of a \"third man\" present at the time of Harry\'s death, running into interference from British officer Major Calloway, and falling head-over-heels for Harry\'s grief-stricken lover, Anna.'),
(981, 1124620, 'The Monkey', 'Osgood Perkins', 'Theo James, Tatiana Maslany, Christian Convery, Colin O\'Brien, Adam Scott, Elijah Wood', 'Osgood Perkins', 'Horror, Comedy', 2025, 'Atomic Monster, C2 Motion Picture Group, Range Media Partners, Oddfellows Entertainment, The Safran Company, Stars Collective, NEON', '97', 3.0, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGDekyIb0yfmnuLZciCozRPk2TE.jpg', 'When twin brothers find a mysterious wind-up monkey, a series of outrageous deaths tear their family apart. Twenty-five years later, the monkey begins a new killing spree forcing the estranged brothers to confront the cursed toy.'),
(982, 967941, 'Wicked: For Good', 'Jon M. Chu', 'Cynthia Erivo, Ariana Grande, Jeff Goldblum, 楊紫瓊, Jonathan Bailey, Ethan Slater', 'Winnie Holzman, Dana Fox', 'Fantasy, Adventure, Romance', 2025, 'Universal Pictures, Marc Platt Productions', '137', 3.3, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/si9tolnefLSUKaqQEGz1bWArOaL.jpg', 'As an angry mob rises against the Wicked Witch, Glinda and Elphaba will need to come together one final time. With their singular friendship now the fulcrum of their futures, they will need to truly see each other, with honesty and empathy, if they are to change themselves, and all of Oz, for good.'),
(983, 1283320, 'Urchin', 'Harris Dickinson', 'Frank Dillane, Megan Northam, Karyna Khymchuk, Shonagh Marie, Amr Waked, Claudia Jones', 'Harris Dickinson', 'Drama', 2025, 'Devisio, BBC Film, Tricky Knot, Somesuch, BFI, Dream Space Films', '99', 3.3, 'GB', 'English, Український', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zc8n3hm3S2VxFxlNH1MNN28LVMa.jpg', 'Mike, a rough sleeper in London, is trapped in a cycle of self-destruction as he attempts to turn his life around. Along the way, he encounters unexpected chances for a fresh start.'),
(984, 803796, 'KPop Demon Hunters', 'Maggie Kang', 'Arden Cho, May Hong, Ji-young Yoo, Ahn Hyo-seop, Yunjin Kim, Ken Jeong', 'Maggie Kang, Danya Jimenez, Hannah McMechan', 'Fantasy, Music, Comedy, Animation', 2025, 'Sony Pictures Animation', '96', 4.0, 'US', 'English, 한국어/조선말', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zT7Lhw3BhJbMkRqm9Zlx2YGMsY0.jpg', 'When K-pop superstars Rumi, Mira and Zoey aren\'t selling out stadiums, they\'re using their secret powers to protect their fans from supernatural threats.'),
(985, 678, 'Out of the Past', 'Jacques Tourneur', 'Robert Mitchum, Jane Greer, Kirk Douglas, Paul Valentine, Virginia Huston, Rhonda Fleming', 'Daniel Mainwaring', 'Crime, Thriller', 1947, 'RKO Radio Pictures', '97', 3.8, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnUK6Cg5ARM0qaq0B5SG20VAM0h.jpg', 'The peaceful life of a gas station owner is disrupted when a man from his past arrives in town and forces him to return to the dark world he had tried to escape.'),
(986, 1069905, 'Jay Kelly', 'Noah Baumbach', 'George Clooney, Adam Sandler, Laura Dern, Billy Crudup, Riley Keough, Grace Edwards', 'Noah Baumbach', 'Drama, Comedy', 2025, 'Pascal Pictures, Heyday Films, NB/GG Pictures', '132', 3.1, 'GB, US', 'English, Français, Italiano', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEXYpY9X17pGC7xYYy17Guv0L3J.jpg', 'Famous movie actor Jay Kelly embarks on a journey of self-discovery, confronting both his past and present, accompanied by his devoted manager, Ron.'),
(987, 629, 'The Usual Suspects', 'Bryan Singer', 'Stephen Baldwin, Gabriel Byrne, Benicio del Toro, Kevin Pollak, Kevin Spacey, Chazz Palminteri', 'Bryan Singer', 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 1995, 'Bad Hat Harry Productions, Blue Parrot Productions', '106', 4.1, 'US', 'Español, English, Français, Magyar', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99X2SgyFunJFXGAYnDv3sb9pnUD.jpg', 'Held in an L.A. interrogation room, Verbal Kint attempts to convince the feds that a mythic crime lord, Keyser Soze, not only exists, but was also responsible for drawing him and his four partners into a multi-million dollar heist that ended with an explosion in San Pedro harbor – leaving few survivors. Verbal lures his interrogators with an incredible story of the crime lord\'s almost supernatural prowess.'),
(988, 1033148, 'Die My Love', 'Lynne Ramsay', 'Jennifer Lawrence, Robert Pattinson, Sissy Spacek, LaKeith Stanfield, Nick Nolte, Gabrielle Rose', 'Lynne Ramsay, Enda Walsh, Alice Birch', 'Drama', 2025, 'Excellent Cadaver, Sikelia Productions, Black Label Media', '119', 3.1, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kajpShbFhOdpl6yCrLezMrr9tB4.jpg', 'After inheriting a remote Montana house, Jackson moves there from New York with his partner Grace, and the couple soon welcome a child. As Jackson becomes increasingly absent and rural isolation sets in, Grace struggles with loneliness, creative frustration, and unresolved emotional wounds. What begins as an attempt at renewal gradually turns into an intense psychological descent, placing strain on their relationship and exposing the fragile balance between love, identity, and motherhood.'),
(989, 398818, 'Call Me by Your Name', 'Luca Guadagnino', 'Timothée Chalamet, Armie Hammer, Michael Stuhlbarg, Amira Casar, Esther Garrel, Victoire du Bois', 'James Ivory', 'Romance, Drama', 2017, 'La Cinéfacture, Frenesy Film, M.Y.R.A. Entertainment, RT Features, Water\'s End Productions', '132', 4.1, 'US', 'Français, English, Italiano', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZ4gBdfkhP9tvLH1DO4m4HYtiyi.jpg', 'In the summer of 1983, a 17-year-old Elio spends his days in his family\'s villa in Italy. One day Oliver, a graduate student, arrives to assist Elio\'s father, a professor of Greco-Roman culture. Soon, Elio and Oliver discover a summer that will alter their lives forever.'),
(990, 812583, 'Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery', 'Rian Johnson', 'Daniel Craig, Josh O\'Connor, Glenn Close, Josh Brolin, Mila Kunis, Jeremy Renner', 'Rian Johnson', 'Thriller, Mystery, Comedy', 2025, 'T-Street', '145', 3.6, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCOGGi8JBVEZMc3DVby8rUivyXz.jpg', 'When young priest Jud Duplenticy is sent to assist charismatic firebrand Monsignor Jefferson Wicks, it’s clear that all is not well in the pews. After a sudden and seemingly impossible murder rocks the town, the lack of an obvious suspect prompts local police chief Geraldine Scott to join forces with renowned detective Benoit Blanc to unravel a mystery that defies all logic.'),
(991, 1456349, 'It Was Just an Accident', 'Jafar Panahi', 'Vahid Mobasseri, Mariam Afshari, Ebrahim Azizi, Hadis Pakbaten, Majid Panahi, Mohamad Ali Elyasmehr', 'Jafar Panahi', 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 2025, 'Jafar Panahi Productions, Les Films Pelléas, Bidibul Productions, Pio & Co, ARTE France Cinéma', '104', 3.6, 'FR', '', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNYGj2DG3n8OrVPTfYunpPW9uas.jpg', 'An unassuming mechanic is reminded of his time in an Iranian prison when he encounters a man he suspects to be his sadistic jailhouse captor.'),
(992, 1122099, 'The Ballad of Wallis Island', 'James Griffiths', 'Tom Basden, Tim Key, Carey Mulligan, Sian Clifford, Akemnji Ndifornyen, Steve Marsh', 'Tom Basden, Tim Key', 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 2025, 'Baby Cow Productions, Moxie Pictures', '100', 3.6, 'GB', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haS6bnqDqZoi5sYcCPJWaj2yMbB.jpg', 'An eccentric lottery winner who lives alone on a remote island tries to make his fantasies come true by getting his favourite musicians to perform at his home.'),
(993, 1352624, 'The Mastermind', 'Kelly Reichardt', 'Josh O\'Connor, Alana Haim, Hope Davis, John Magaro, Gaby Hoffmann, Jasper Thompson', 'Kelly Reichardt', 'Drama, Crime', 2025, 'filmscience, MUBI', '110', 2.9, 'US', 'English, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPaEQ3m4zHOzIAstgXCZZtzcHTL.jpg', 'In a sedate Massachusetts suburb circa 1970, unemployed family man and amateur art thief J.B. Mooney sets out on his first heist. With the museum cased and accomplices recruited, he has an airtight plan. Or so he thinks.'),
(994, 1259102, 'Eternity', 'David Freyne', 'Elizabeth Olsen, Miles Teller, Callum Turner, Da\'Vine Joy Randolph, John Early, Barry Primus', 'David Freyne', 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 2025, 'A24, Star Thrower Entertainment', '114', 3.5, 'US', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiwGcjfDKXD5PqQnyKUU9kspWQQ.jpg', 'In an afterlife where souls have one week to decide where to spend eternity, Joan is faced with the impossible choice between the man she spent her life with and her first love, who died young and has waited decades for her to arrive.'),
(995, 1288072, 'Keeper', 'Osgood Perkins', 'Tatiana Maslany, Rossif Sutherland, Birkett Turton, Eden Weiss, Cassandra Ebner, Tess Degenstein', 'Osgood Perkins', 'Horror, Mystery', 2025, 'Oddfellows Entertainment, Phobos, Shadowless Horse Pictures', '99', 2.8, 'CA', 'English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbGHijUc0C3fcM12l6ro6FgxIvg.jpg', 'Liz and Malcolm escape for a romantic anniversary weekend at a secluded cabin. When Malcolm suddenly returns to the city, Liz finds herself isolated and in the presence of an unspeakable evil that reveals the cabin\'s horrifying secrets.'),
(996, 911430, 'F1', 'Joseph Kosinski', 'Brad Pitt, Damson Idris, Javier Bardem, Kerry Condon, Tobias Menzies, Kim Bodnia', 'Ehren Kruger', 'Action, Drama', 2025, 'Plan B Entertainment, Jerry Bruckheimer Films, Dawn Apollo Films, Apple Studios, Monolith Pictures', '156', 3.9, 'US', 'Dansk, English, Deutsch, Español', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PXZIUsSDh4alB80jheWX4fhZmy.jpg', 'Racing legend Sonny Hayes is coaxed out of retirement to lead a struggling Formula 1 team—and mentor a young hotshot driver—while chasing one more chance at glory.'),
(997, 1242898, 'Predator: Badlands', 'Dan Trachtenberg', 'Elle Fanning, Dimitrius Schuster-Koloamatangi, Ravi Narayan, Michael Homick, Stefan Grube, Reuben De Jong', 'Patrick Aison', 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 2025, '20th Century Studios, Lawrence Gordon Productions, Davis Entertainment, Toberoff Productions, TSG Entertainment', '107', 3.9, 'US', 'English, Français', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHpq9yNUIo6aDoCXEBzjSolywgz.jpg', 'Cast out from his clan, a young Predator finds an unlikely ally in a damaged android and embarks on a treacherous journey in search of the ultimate adversary.'),
(998, 639988, 'No Other Choice', 'Park Chan-wook', 'Lee Byung-hun, Son Ye-jin, Park Hee-soon, Lee Sung-min, Yeom Hye-ran, Cha Seung-won', 'Park Chan-wook, Lee Kyoung-mi, Don McKellar', 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 2025, 'CJ ENM Studios, Moho Film, KG Productions', '139', 3.8, 'KR', 'English, 한국어/조선말', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vc2S0dvgpsM0XfSiXZDMVkRCSSU.jpg', 'After being laid off and humiliated by a ruthless job market, a veteran paper mill manager descends into violence in a desperate bid to reclaim his dignity.'),
