(1000, 1208348, 'Rental Family', 'Hikari', 'Brendan Fraser, Takehiro Hira, Mari Yamamoto, Shannon Mahina Gorman, Akira Emoto, Paolo Andrea Di Pietro', 'Hikari', 'Comedy, Drama', 2025, 'Sight Unseen Pictures, Domo Arigato Productions', '110', 3.9, 'US', 'English, 日本語', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5lswNlytTUrnMWsuD0NFfhZlf3.jpg', 'An American actor in Tokyo struggles to find purpose until he lands an unusual gig: working for a Japanese \'rental family\' agency, playing stand-in roles for strangers. As he immerses himself in his clients\' worlds, he begins to form genuine bonds that blur the lines between performance and reality.'),
